return [==[
{"files":{"guide.json":{"description":"Secciones de la guía de principiantes de WoW Forever. Solo se usan las de estado 'verificado'; cada una cita sus fuentes.","sections":[{"id":"nivel-maximo","status":"verificado","chapter":1,"title_es":"Nivel máximo","title_en":"Maximum level","summary_es":"Cuál es el nivel máximo de WoW Forever.","summary_en":"What the level cap in WoW Forever is.","keywords_es":["nivel máximo","nivel maximo","tope de nivel","nivel 60"],"keywords_en":["max level","level cap","maximum level","level 60"],"text_es":"El nivel máximo de WoW Forever es 60.","text_en":"The maximum level in WoW Forever is 60.","sources":[{"type":"cliente","ref":"WowdataCollector probe: GetMaxPlayerLevel() = 60","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"blizzard","ref":"World of Warcraft: Forever Now Live! («an adventure to level 60»)","url":"https://news.blizzard.com/en-us/article/24315820/world-of-warcraft-forever-goes-live-globally-november-4","date":"2026-11-15"}],"updated":"2026-11-15"},{"id":"que-es-forever","status":"verificado","chapter":1,"title_es":"Qué es WoW Forever","title_en":"What WoW Forever is","summary_es":"Qué es Forever, en qué continentes transcurre y cuándo pasa su historia.","summary_en":"What Forever is, its continents and when its story takes place.","keywords_es":["qué es wow forever","que es wow forever","qué es forever","que es forever","diferencia con classic","diferencia entre forever y classic"],"keywords_en":["what is wow forever","what is forever","difference from classic","forever vs classic"],"text_es":"WoW Forever es un hogar permanente de World of Warcraft, junto al WoW moderno y Classic. Recorre los continentes originales (Reinos del Este y Kalimdor), ampliados con zonas nuevas y reimaginadas y más de 1000 misiones nuevas, del nivel 1 al 60. La historia transcurre después de Warcraft III Reforged: Forsaken Kingdom y antes del Núcleo de Magma.","text_en":"WoW Forever is a permanent home for World of Warcraft alongside modern WoW and Classic. It takes you across the original continents (Eastern Kingdoms and Kalimdor), expanded with new and reimagined zones and more than 1,000 new quests across the level 1-60 journey. It is set after Warcraft III Reforged: Forsaken Kingdom and before Molten Core.","sources":[{"type":"blizzard","ref":"World of Warcraft: Forever Now Live!","url":"https://news.blizzard.com/en-us/article/24315820/world-of-warcraft-forever-goes-live-globally-november-4","date":"2026-11-15"}],"updated":"2026-11-15"},{"id":"zonas-nuevas","status":"verificado","chapter":1,"title_es":"Zonas nuevas","title_en":"New zones","summary_es":"Qué zonas nuevas tiene Forever y para qué niveles.","summary_en":"Which new zones Forever has and for which levels.","keywords_es":["zonas nuevas","zona nueva","isla de zephras","riverglades","shen'dralas","monte hyjal"],"keywords_en":["new zones","new zone","zephras isle","riverglades","shen'dralas","mount hyjal"],"text_es":"Zonas nuevas de WoW Forever (nombres oficiales en inglés salvo la Isla de Zephras): Mount Hyjal, Shen'dralas, Riverglades e Isla de Zephras. La Isla de Zephras es una zona de inicio de nivel 1 a 12. Riverglades tiene más de 150 misiones nuevas para buena parte de los niveles de mediados de 30 a mediados de 40.","text_en":"New WoW Forever zones: Mount Hyjal, Shen'dralas, Riverglades and Zephras Isle. Zephras Isle is a level 1-12 starting experience. Riverglades has more than 150 new quests across much of the mid-30s to mid-40s experience.","sources":[{"type":"blizzard","ref":"World of Warcraft: Forever Now Live!","url":"https://news.blizzard.com/en-us/article/24315820/world-of-warcraft-forever-goes-live-globally-november-4","date":"2026-11-15"}],"updated":"2026-11-15"},{"id":"mazmorras-y-bandas","status":"verificado","chapter":7,"title_es":"Mazmorras nuevas y bandas","title_en":"New dungeons and raids","summary_es":"Cuántas mazmorras nuevas hay y qué bandas se abren y cuándo.","summary_en":"How many new dungeons there are and which raids open and when.","keywords_es":["mazmorras nuevas","bandas","banda","raids","onyxia","cumbre hyjal","barrow deeps"],"keywords_en":["new dungeons","raids","raid","onyxia","hyjal summit","barrow deeps"],"text_es":"WoW Forever añade nueve mazmorras nuevas de cinco jugadores, del nivel 13 al 60. El 9 de diciembre se abren para personajes de nivel 60 tres bandas: Barrow Deeps, Hyjal Summit y la Guarida de Onyxia (nombres oficiales en inglés salvo Onyxia).","text_en":"WoW Forever adds nine new five-player dungeons for levels 13 through 60. On December 9, level 60 players get three raids: Barrow Deeps, Hyjal Summit and Onyxia's Lair.","sources":[{"type":"blizzard","ref":"World of Warcraft: Forever Now Live!","url":"https://news.blizzard.com/en-us/article/24315820/world-of-warcraft-forever-goes-live-globally-november-4","date":"2026-11-15"}],"updated":"2026-11-15"},{"id":"razas-y-clases-nuevas","status":"verificado","chapter":3,"title_es":"Cielonatos y combinaciones nuevas","title_en":"Skyborne and new combinations","summary_es":"La raza nueva Cielonato y las combinaciones de raza y clase nuevas.","summary_en":"The new Skyborne race and the new race and class combinations.","keywords_es":["raza nueva","razas nuevas","cielonato","skyborne","combinaciones","orco mago","humano cazador","no muerto paladin","enano chaman"],"keywords_en":["new race","new races","skyborne","race combinations","orc mage","human hunter","undead paladin","dwarf shaman"],"text_es":"Los Cielonatos (Skyborne) son una raza jugable nueva: los Cielonatos Formavientos son de la Horda y pueden ser chamanes; los Cielonatos de la Orden Eminente son de la Alianza y pueden ser magos. Forever también abre combinaciones nuevas, como orcos magos, trols brujos, no-muertos paladines, humanos cazadores, gnomos sacerdotes y enanos chamanes.","text_en":"The Skyborne are a new playable race: Windshaper Skyborne are Horde-aligned and can become Shaman; High-Order Skyborne are Alliance-aligned and can become Mages. Forever also opens new combinations such as Orc Mages, Troll Warlocks, Undead Paladins, Human Hunters, Gnome Priests and Dwarf Shamans.","sources":[{"type":"blizzard","ref":"World of Warcraft: Forever Now Live!","url":"https://news.blizzard.com/en-us/article/24315820/world-of-warcraft-forever-goes-live-globally-november-4","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"cliente","ref":"ChrRaces 95 'Cielonato de la Orden Eminente' y 96 'Cielonato Formavientos' (PlayableRaceBit 32 y 33)","date":"2026-11-15"}],"updated":"2026-11-15"},{"id":"legacy","status":"verificado","chapter":1,"title_es":"Sistema Legacy","title_en":"Legacy system","summary_es":"Qué es el sistema Legacy, cómo se desbloquea y cómo se ganan puntos.","summary_en":"What the Legacy system is, how to unlock it and earn points.","keywords_es":["sistema legacy","legacy","puntos legacy","desafios legacy","legado"],"keywords_en":["legacy system","legacy","legacy points","legacy challenges"],"text_es":"El sistema Legacy es una progresión horizontal para toda la cuenta. Se desbloquea al ganar tu primer punto Legacy: para la mayoría, cuando su primer personaje llega a nivel 25 (también al llegar a 150 en una profesión principal que no sea de recolección o al explorar todo el mapa del mundo). Se abre con la tecla Y por defecto. Hay 65 desafíos Legacy en seis categorías (clases 27, profesiones 18, JcJ 12, aventura 2, mazmorras 3 y bandas 3); cada uno da un punto, compartido por todos tus personajes de la cuenta que no sean Hardcore. No hace falta crear personajes alternativos.","text_en":"The Legacy System is an account-wide horizontal progression system. You gain access when you earn your first Legacy Point: for most players, when their first character reaches level 25 (also by reaching 150 in a non-gathering primary tradeskill or by exploring the entire world map). Open it with the default hotkey Y. There are 65 Legacy Challenges in six categories (Classes 27, Tradeskills 18, PvP 12, Adventure 2, Dungeons 3, Raids 3); each one earns one point, shared by all your non-Hardcore characters on the Battle.net account. Creating alts is not required.","sources":[{"type":"blizzard","ref":"Get to Know the World of Warcraft: Forever Legacy System (Blue Tracker, 2026-09-23)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/blue-tracker/news/us/get-to-know-the-world-of-warcraft-forever-legacy-system-world-of-warcraft-24307383","date":"2026-11-15"}],"updated":"2026-11-15"},{"id":"legacy-ventajas-recompensas","status":"verificado","chapter":1,"title_es":"Ventajas y recompensas Legacy","title_en":"Legacy perks and rewards","summary_es":"En qué se gastan los puntos Legacy y qué recompensas hay.","summary_en":"What Legacy points are spent on and which rewards exist.","keywords_es":["ventajas legacy","recompensas legacy","arboles legacy","oso espectral","bien descansado"],"keywords_en":["legacy perks","legacy rewards","legacy trees","spectral bear","well rested"],"text_es":"Los puntos Legacy se gastan en tres árboles de ventajas: Profesiones, Aventura y Recursos (Resourcefulness). En el lanzamiento puedes gastar hasta 16 puntos en cada personaje. Ejemplos: «Talented» desbloquea puntos de talento hasta 5 niveles antes de lo normal y «Well Rested» sube el tope de experiencia descansada y hace que se acumule más rápido. Recompensas en el lanzamiento: Replica Ironforge Air Rifle, Spectral Bear Cub, Spectral Bear Tabard y la montura Reins of the Spectral Bear (nombres oficiales en inglés).","text_en":"Legacy Points are spent in three perk trees: Professions, Adventure and Resourcefulness. At launch you can spend up to 16 points on each character. Examples: Talented unlocks talent points up to 5 levels lower than normal, and Well Rested increases the rested experience cap and lets rested experience accumulate faster. Launch rewards: Replica Ironforge Air Rifle, Spectral Bear Cub, Spectral Bear Tabard and the mount Reins of the Spectral Bear.","sources":[{"type":"blizzard","ref":"Get to Know the World of Warcraft: Forever Legacy System (Blue Tracker, 2026-09-23)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/blue-tracker/news/us/get-to-know-the-world-of-warcraft-forever-legacy-system-world-of-warcraft-24307383","date":"2026-11-15"}],"updated":"2026-11-15"},{"id":"preajuste-experiencia","status":"verificado","chapter":1,"title_es":"Preajuste Clásico o Mejorado","title_en":"Classic or Enhanced preset","summary_es":"Qué preajuste de experiencia elegir al entrar por primera vez.","summary_en":"Which experience preset to choose on first login.","keywords_es":["preset","preajuste","clasico o mejorado","experiencia clasica","modo mejorado"],"keywords_en":["experience preset","preset","classic or enhanced","enhanced"],"text_es":"La primera vez que entras, el juego te pide elegir un preajuste de experiencia (Choose Your Experience Preset): Clásico o Mejorado. Si no sabes cuál elegir, Blizzard recomienda empezar con Mejorado.","text_en":"On your first login the game asks you to Choose Your Experience Preset: Classic or Enhanced. If you are not sure which to choose, Blizzard recommends starting with Enhanced.","sources":[{"type":"blizzard","ref":"World of Warcraft: Forever Now Live!","url":"https://news.blizzard.com/en-us/article/24315820/world-of-warcraft-forever-goes-live-globally-november-4","date":"2026-11-15"}],"updated":"2026-11-15"},{"id":"tipos-de-reino","status":"verificado","chapter":1,"title_es":"Tipos de reino y Hardcore","title_en":"Realm types and Hardcore","summary_es":"Qué tipos de reino hay y cuándo llega el modo Hardcore.","summary_en":"Which realm types exist and when Hardcore arrives.","keywords_es":["tipos de reino","tipo de reino","que reino elijo","hardcore","reino jcj","reino de rol"],"keywords_en":["realm types","realm type","which realm","hardcore","ruleset","pvp realm"],"text_es":"Tipos de reino de WoW Forever: Normal, JcJ, Rol y Rol JcJ. El modo Hardcore llegará en algún momento después del lanzamiento; los desafíos Legacy de los reinos que no son Hardcore no cuentan en Hardcore.","text_en":"WoW Forever rulesets: Normal, PvP, Roleplay and Roleplay PvP. The Hardcore ruleset will become available sometime after launch; Legacy Challenges completed in non-Hardcore rulesets will not show up in Hardcore.","sources":[{"type":"blizzard","ref":"World of Warcraft: Forever Now Live!","url":"https://news.blizzard.com/en-us/article/24315820/world-of-warcraft-forever-goes-live-globally-november-4","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"blizzard","ref":"Get to Know the World of Warcraft: Forever Legacy System (Blue Tracker, 2026-09-23)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/blue-tracker/news/us/get-to-know-the-world-of-warcraft-forever-legacy-system-world-of-warcraft-24307383","date":"2026-11-15"}],"updated":"2026-11-15"},{"id":"talentos-nivel","status":"verificado","chapter":4,"title_es":"Nivel de los talentos","title_en":"Talent levels","summary_es":"A qué nivel llega el primer punto de talento y cuántos se ganan.","summary_en":"When the first talent point arrives and how many you get.","keywords_es":["a qué nivel tengo talentos","a que nivel tengo talentos","puntos de talento","primer punto de talento","cuándo tengo talentos","cuando tengo talentos","nivel de talentos"],"keywords_en":["talent points","first talent point","when do i get talents","talent level","what level talents"],"text_es":"En WoW Forever el primer punto de talento llega a nivel 10 y después ganas uno por cada nivel: 11 puntos a nivel 20, 21 a nivel 30, 31 a nivel 40 y 51 a nivel 60. La ventaja Legacy «Talented» permite desbloquear los puntos hasta 5 niveles antes de lo normal.","text_en":"In WoW Forever you get your first talent point at level 10 and one more per level after that: 11 points at level 20, 21 at 30, 31 at 40 and 51 at level 60. The Legacy perk Talented unlocks talent points up to 5 levels earlier than normal.","sources":[{"type":"cliente","ref":"numtalentsatlevel (NumTalents por nivel: 1 a nivel 10, 51 a nivel 60)","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"blizzard","ref":"Get to Know the World of Warcraft: Forever Legacy System (perk Talented)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/blue-tracker/news/us/get-to-know-the-world-of-warcraft-forever-legacy-system-world-of-warcraft-24307383","date":"2026-11-15"}],"updated":"2026-11-15"}]},"01-primeros-pasos.json":{"description":"Capítulo 1: Primeros pasos. Secciones editoriales redactadas desde guías de terceros.","sections":[{"id":"general-suscripcion","chapter":1,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Qué necesitas para jugar a Forever","title_en":"What You Need to Play Forever","summary_es":"Una suscripción normal de WoW cubre Forever; no hace falta comprar el juego ni una prueba gratuita.","summary_en":"A normal WoW subscription covers Forever; no game purchase or free trial is required.","keywords_es":["suscripción para forever","hace falta comprar forever","cuenta de battle.net","prueba gratuita forever","cliente de forever"],"keywords_en":["forever subscription","do I need to buy forever","battle.net account","forever free trial","forever client"],"text_es":"Forever funciona con la suscripción habitual de World of Warcraft y no exige una compra aparte. Se juega desde un cliente propio de Forever dentro de Battle.net y hace falta una cuenta de Battle.net. No hay prueba gratuita ni edición de inicio, y con una misma cuenta solo puedes tener abierto un modo de juego a la vez.","text_en":"Forever runs on the usual World of Warcraft subscription and does not require a separate purchase. It uses its own Forever client inside Battle.net, and a Battle.net account is required. There is no free trial or starter edition, and one account can only have one game mode open at a time.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Warcraft Forever Subscription Explained › What do I Need to Play Forever?","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/wow-forever-subscription","date":"2026-09-13"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["general:wow-forever-subscription"],"source_hashes":["section:4d62ed83c01e17257e453255ccfdaf180f9273a7"]},{"id":"general-instalacion","chapter":1,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Instalar Forever y requisitos","title_en":"Installing Forever and Requirements","summary_es":"Se instala desde Battle.net; pide más que Classic, con Windows 10/11, 8-16 GB de RAM y SSD.","summary_en":"It installs through Battle.net; it asks for more than Classic, with Windows 10/11, 8-16 GB RAM and an SSD.","keywords_es":["instalar forever","requisitos de forever","battle.net forever","ram para forever","disco para forever"],"keywords_en":["install forever","forever requirements","battle.net forever","forever ram","forever storage"],"text_es":"Para instalar Forever, abre Battle.net, elige la entrada de Forever en el desplegable de versiones y pulsa Instalar. El juego pide más que Classic: como mínimo Windows 10 de 64 bits, 8 GB de RAM y 128 GB libres en un SSD; la configuración recomendada sube a Windows 11 y 16 GB de RAM. También necesita una tarjeta compatible con DirectX 12 y conexión de banda ancha.","text_en":"To install Forever, open Battle.net, pick the Forever entry in the version dropdown and press Install. The game asks for more than Classic: at least 64-bit Windows 10, 8 GB of RAM and 128 GB free on an SSD; the recommended setup rises to Windows 11 and 16 GB of RAM. It also needs a DirectX 12-capable card and a broadband connection.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Warcraft Forever Subscription Explained › How to Install and Launch Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/wow-forever-subscription","date":"2026-09-13"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["general:wow-forever-subscription"],"source_hashes":["section:caac0f68af6891c8f59369b4f6aadd4862626204"]},{"id":"general-cuentas","chapter":1,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Personajes, cuentas y transferencias","title_en":"Characters, Accounts and Transfers","summary_es":"Hasta 10 personajes por conjunto y 50 por licencia; no hay transferencias salvo la salida de Hardcore.","summary_en":"Up to 10 characters per ruleset and 50 per licence; there are no transfers except leaving Hardcore.","keywords_es":["cuántos personajes puedo crear","límite de personajes","transferir personaje forever","suscripción caducada","personajes por cuenta"],"keywords_en":["how many characters","character limit","transfer character forever","expired subscription","characters per account"],"text_es":"Puedes crear hasta 10 personajes por conjunto de reglas y 50 en total por licencia de Battle.net. En JcJ todos los personajes deben ser de la misma facción. No existen transferencias de personaje, salvo que un personaje de Hardcore muera: entonces puede pasar a Normal, JcJ o Rol. Si la suscripción caduca, no puedes entrar, pero tus personajes se conservan.","text_en":"Each ruleset allows up to 10 characters, and one Battle.net licence holds 50 in total. On the PvP ruleset every character must be on the same faction. There are no character transfers, except when a Hardcore character dies: it can then move to Normal, PvP or Roleplay. If the subscription lapses you cannot log in, but your characters are kept.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Warcraft Forever Subscription Explained › Assorted Questions","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/wow-forever-subscription","date":"2026-09-13"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["general:wow-forever-subscription"],"source_hashes":["section:c12ce78a04db2003939fb515967819a8b4a16cea"]},{"id":"general-ediciones","chapter":1,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Ediciones y recompensas de Forever","title_en":"Forever Editions and Rewards","summary_es":"La edición básica va con la suscripción; los packs de pago desbloquean Cielonatos y añaden recompensas.","summary_en":"The base edition comes with the subscription; paid packs unlock Skyborne and add rewards.","keywords_es":["ediciones de forever","skyborne heroic pack","skyborne epic pack","warcraft forever collection","recompensas de forever"],"keywords_en":["forever editions","skyborne heroic pack","skyborne epic pack","warcraft forever collection","forever rewards"],"text_es":"Forever está incluido en la suscripción de WoW; el Skyborne Heroic Pack desbloquea los Cielonatos y su zona inicial. El Skyborne Heroic Pack cuesta $29.99, el Skyborne Epic Pack $59.99 y la Warcraft Forever Collection $79.99. Las tres ediciones permiten reservar nombres e incluyen recompensas como monturas y apariencias para Retail y Forever; las dos superiores incluían acceso a una beta ya cerrada, y la más cara añade una campaña de Warcraft III: Reforged. Puedes mejorar de edición pagando la diferencia, pero no bajar a una inferior.","text_en":"Forever is included with a WoW subscription; the Skyborne Heroic Pack unlocks the Skyborne race and its starting area. The Heroic costs $29.99, the Skyborne Epic Pack $59.99, and the Warcraft Forever Collection $79.99. All three allow name reservations and include rewards such as mounts and appearances for Retail and Forever; Epic and Collection packs included access to a beta that has since closed, and the Collection adds a Warcraft III: Reforged campaign. You can upgrade by paying the difference, but cannot downgrade.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Forever Pre-Orders Guide:  All Editions and Rewards › Overview of Available Pre-Order Packs in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/pre-order-packs-rewards","date":"2026-10-31"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Forever Pre-Orders Guide:  All Editions and Rewards › Breakdown of Each Pre-Order Pack in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/pre-order-packs-rewards","date":"2026-10-31"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Forever Beta Overview:  How to Access, Level Caps and More › When will Beta Unlock","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/beta-content-unlock-overview","date":"2026-10-31"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: WoW Forever Pre-Order Editions and Rewards Explained › Forever Pre-Orders Comparison","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/wow-forever-pre-orders","date":"2026-09-13"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: WoW Forever Pre-Order Editions and Rewards Explained › Which Forever Pre-Order Edition Should I Buy?","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/wow-forever-pre-orders","date":"2026-09-13"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:beta-content-unlock-overview","general:wow-forever-pre-orders"],"source_hashes":["section:445d6912add7edc02cc15174623de4d34d3a0223","section:710f34db20b050cef6a4dfb80cbe94fbb0c5b690","section:7dbf82440e5cb36eff588ad493c127da1fbf49a3","section:a87a78ab96319aa8736862a6652e943ae9b98c1e","section:e45ef8ae817f4964533d907a4a5caeaabc70c208"]},{"id":"general-reserva-nombres","chapter":1,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Reservar el nombre antes del lanzamiento","title_en":"Reserving a Name Before Launch","summary_es":"Comprar cualquier edición permitió reservar hasta tres nombres entre el 27 de octubre y el 3 de noviembre.","summary_en":"Buying any edition allowed up to three names to be reserved between October 27 and November 3.","keywords_es":["reservar nombre forever","reserva de nombres","tres nombres","nombre antes del lanzamiento","nombre ocupado"],"keywords_en":["reserve forever name","name reservation","three names","name before launch","name taken"],"text_es":"Las reservas de nombre estuvieron disponibles para quien compró cualquier edición de Forever, del 27 de octubre al 3 de noviembre. Cada cuenta podía reservar hasta tres nombres entre todos los conjuntos de reglas, por orden de llegada. La reserva solo valía para la cuenta de WoW donde se compró Forever y no garantizaba un nombre si ya estaba ocupado.","text_en":"Name reservations were available to anyone who bought any Forever edition, from October 27 to November 3. Each account could reserve up to three names across all rulesets, on a first-come, first-served basis. The reservation only applied to the WoW account where Forever was bought and did not guarantee a name if it was already taken.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: How to Reserve Your Name in World of Warcraft: Forever › World of Warcraft: Forever Name Reservations","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/name-reservation","date":"2026-09-18"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["general:name-reservation"],"source_hashes":["section:a5e50d3b07d32b9f46331fae5978b3ae32483ec7"]},{"id":"general-apellidos","chapter":1,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Nombre y apellido del personaje","title_en":"Character First and Last Names","summary_es":"Todos los personajes llevan nombre y apellido; el nombre completo es único por conjunto de reglas y región.","summary_en":"Every character has a first and last name; the full name is unique per ruleset and region.","keywords_es":["apellidos en forever","nombre y apellido","apellido obligatorio","ocultar apellido","nombre único"],"keywords_en":["forever surnames","first and last name","mandatory surname","hide surname","unique name"],"text_es":"En Forever cada personaje se crea con un nombre y un apellido; el apellido no es opcional. El nombre completo es único por conjunto de reglas y región, pero varios personajes pueden compartir el mismo nombre de pila. Hay una opción en el menú de placas de nombre para ocultar tu apellido, aunque solo lo oculta para ti.","text_en":"In Forever each character is created with a first and a last name; the surname is not optional. The full name is unique per ruleset and region, but several characters can share the same first name. The nameplates menu has an option to hide your surname, although it only hides it for you.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: How Do Surnames Work in World of Warcraft: Forever? › Character Surnames in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/surnames","date":"2026-09-20"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["general:surnames"],"source_hashes":["section:6a3bc667117d20a5aa782ae2075c9f66922a3e20"]},{"id":"general-graficos","chapter":1,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Modelos gráficos SD y HD","title_en":"SD and HD Graphics Models","summary_es":"Al entrar eliges modelos SD o HD; puedes cambiarlos cuando quieras y previsualizarlos al crear el personaje.","summary_en":"On entry you choose SD or HD models; you can change them later and preview both during character creation.","keywords_es":["gráficos sd hd","modelos clásicos o hd","cambiar gráficos forever","animaciones clásicas","agua y niebla"],"keywords_en":["sd hd graphics","classic or hd models","change forever graphics","classic animations","water and fog"],"text_es":"Al entrar por primera vez, el juego pide elegir entre modelos de personaje SD (Classic) o HD (Retail). La opción cambia cómo ves a todos los personajes del mundo, incluidos PNJ y otros jugadores, y puedes alternarla cuando quieras. Durante la creación de personaje puedes previsualizar ambos estilos. Forever también añade niebla volumétrica, iluminación dinámica y agua mejorada, y conserva las animaciones clásicas en los dos modelos.","text_en":"On first entry the game asks you to choose between SD (Classic) or HD (Retail) character models. The option changes how you see every character in the world, including NPCs and other players, and you can switch it at any time. During character creation you can preview both styles. Forever also adds volumetric fog, dynamic lighting and improved water, and keeps the classic animations on both models.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: WoW Forever Graphics Modes and Updates › World of Warcraft: Forever Character Graphics Toggle","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/graphics-options-and-mode","date":"2026-09-21"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["general:graphics-options-and-mode"],"source_hashes":["section:31da9b771f06c5a20c8db6bfb2dda8e60b29cebe"]},{"id":"general-mando","chapter":1,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Jugar con mando","title_en":"Playing with a Controller","summary_es":"Forever admite mando de forma nativa: palancas para mover y cámara, barras de 8 habilidades y 32 comandos.","summary_en":"Forever natively supports controllers: sticks for movement and camera, eight-slot bars and 32 commands.","keywords_es":["jugar con mando","soporte de mando","gamepad forever","barras de mando","32 comandos"],"keywords_en":["play with controller","controller support","forever gamepad","controller bars","32 commands"],"text_es":"Forever es la primera versión de WoW con soporte nativo para mando. Al activarlo en Ajustes, las palancas izquierda y derecha controlan movimiento y cámara, y las barras de acción se sustituyen por una distribución para mando. Cada barra tiene 8 hechizos o habilidades, hasta 32 comandos, y se accede combinando botones o cruceta con los gatillos. El mando también enfoca objetivos cercanos y permite recorrer los menús con Start y la cruceta.","text_en":"Forever is the first WoW version with native controller support. When enabled in Settings, the left and right sticks control movement and camera, and the action bars become a controller layout. Each bar holds 8 spells or abilities, up to 32 commands, reached by combining buttons or the d-pad with the triggers. The controller also focuses nearby targets and lets you move through menus with Start and the d-pad.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: WoW Forever Controller Gameplay and Configurations › Controller Support in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/playing-with-controller","date":"2026-09-21"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["general:playing-with-controller"],"source_hashes":["section:0008fa5ca0c263903c2f1ccac77163ddcfc195b3"]},{"id":"general-reglas","chapter":1,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Conjuntos de reglas en lugar de reinos","title_en":"Rulesets Instead of Realms","summary_es":"Forever usa conjuntos de reglas regionales: Normal, JcJ, Rol y Rol JcJ; el PvP y el idioma cambian según el conjunto.","summary_en":"Forever uses regional rulesets: Normal, PvP, Roleplay and Roleplay PvP; forced PvP and language differ by ruleset.","keywords_es":["conjuntos de reglas","reinos de forever","servidor pve pvp rol","mega servidor","reglas de pvp"],"keywords_en":["forever rulesets","forever realms","pve pvp roleplay server","mega server","pvp rules"],"text_es":"Forever no usa una lista de reinos: eliges un conjunto de reglas y todos los jugadores de ese conjunto y región comparten un mega-servidor. Al lanzamiento hay Normal, JcJ, Rol y Rol JcJ; Hardcore llega después. En JcJ quedas marcado para PvP al entrar en zonas en disputa o enemigas y solo puedes crear personajes de una facción. Las capas agrupan jugadores y los compañeros de hermandad suelen compartir capa.","text_en":"Forever does not use a realm list: you pick a ruleset, and every player in that ruleset and region shares one mega-server. At launch there are Normal, PvP, Roleplay and Roleplay PvP; Hardcore arrives later. On PvP you are flagged when entering contested or enemy zones and can only create characters on one faction. Layers group players, and guildmates are usually placed in the same layer.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: WoW Forever: Everything You Need to Know About Realms › World of Warcraft: Forever Realm System Guide","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/realms","date":"2026-09-18"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Everything You Need to Know About PvP in World of Warcraft: Forever › PvP Ruleset Information in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/pvp-overview","date":"2026-09-19"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["general:pvp","general:realms"],"source_hashes":["section:2b928557a2f1139d5ec137ff0204a1126268b3c5","section:b4a91d0ad5d6c4b593c2d3da243cbe53b00515e6"]},{"id":"general-hardcore","chapter":1,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Modo Hardcore y sus reglas","title_en":"Hardcore Mode and Its Rules","summary_es":"Hardcore llega después del lanzamiento con una sola vida; al morir puedes pasar a Normal, JcJ o Rol.","summary_en":"Hardcore arrives after launch with one life; on death you can move to Normal, PvP or Roleplay.","keywords_es":["modo hardcore","una sola vida","morir en hardcore","transferir hardcore","legacy en hardcore"],"keywords_en":["hardcore mode","one life","die in hardcore","transfer hardcore","legacy in hardcore"],"text_es":"Hardcore llegará después del lanzamiento y se juega con una sola vida. Cuando un personaje muere, puede transferirse a Normal, JcJ o Rol. Los puntos Legacy y las colecciones ganados en Hardcore sí pasan a los demás conjuntos, pero nada de los otros conjuntos entra en Hardcore. Por eso un personaje Hardcore solo puede usar ventajas Legacy conseguidas dentro de Hardcore.","text_en":"Hardcore arrives after launch and is played with one life. When a character dies, it can transfer to Normal, PvP or Roleplay. Legacy Points and collections earned in Hardcore do pass to the other rulesets, but nothing from the other rulesets enters Hardcore. A Hardcore character can therefore only use Legacy perks earned inside Hardcore.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: WoW Forever: Everything You Need to Know About Realms › Hardcore","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/realms","date":"2026-09-18"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["general:realms"],"source_hashes":["section:631e9591b6e656ece035e73a4d4fc0f33736c9d2"]},{"id":"general-pvp-mundo","chapter":1,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Cómo funciona el JcJ en el mundo","title_en":"How World PvP Works","summary_es":"Puedes activar JcJ con /pvp o desde el retrato; en el conjunto JcJ se activa solo en zonas en disputa o enemigas.","summary_en":"You can enable PvP with /pvp or from the portrait; on the PvP ruleset it turns on in contested or enemy zones.","keywords_es":["activar pvp","jcj en el mundo","comando /pvp","zonas en disputa","marcarse para pvp"],"keywords_en":["enable pvp","world pvp","/pvp command","contested zones","flag for pvp"],"text_es":"El JcJ de mundo permite atacar o ser atacado por la facción contraria cuando tienes JcJ activado. En Normal, Rol y Hardcore hay que activarlo a mano escribiendo /pvp o desde el retrato; en el conjunto JcJ se activa automáticamente al entrar en una zona en disputa o enemiga. A partir del nivel 15, casi cualquier zona cuenta como en disputa. También puedes participar en JcJ instanciado desde cualquier conjunto mediante campos de batalla.","text_en":"World PvP lets you attack or be attacked by the opposite faction while PvP is enabled. On Normal, Roleplay and Hardcore you enable it manually with /pvp or from the portrait; on the PvP ruleset it turns on automatically when you enter a contested or enemy zone. From level 15, almost any zone counts as contested. You can also take part in instanced PvP from any ruleset through battlegrounds.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Everything You Need to Know About PvP in World of Warcraft: Forever › World PvP","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/pvp-overview","date":"2026-09-19"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["general:pvp"],"source_hashes":["section:765a5ee3b6901c3251038dec754a9e019e81b081"]},{"id":"general-campos-batalla","chapter":1,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Campos de batalla y niveles","title_en":"Battlegrounds and Levels","summary_es":"Garganta Grito de Guerra desde nivel 10; Cuenca de Arathi e Islas Lanza Negra después; Valle de Alterac desde 51.","summary_en":"Warsong Gulch from level 10; Arathi Basin and Darkspear Islands later; Alterac Valley from 51.","keywords_es":["campos de batalla","niveles de campos de batalla","garganta grito de guerra","islas lanza negra","valle de alterac"],"keywords_en":["battlegrounds","battleground levels","warsong gulch","darkspear islands","alterac valley"],"text_es":"Los campos de batalla tienen tramos de nivel: Garganta Grito de Guerra empieza a nivel 10 en grupos de 10 contra 10; Cuenca de Arathi abre a nivel 20 con 15 contra 15; Islas Lanza Negra, el campo nuevo de Forever, abre a nivel 30 con 15 contra 15; y Valle de Alterac es para nivel 51-60 en 40 contra 40. Ganar da 3 marcas del campo y perder da 1. Las colas mezclan jugadores de distintos conjuntos de reglas.","text_en":"Battlegrounds use level brackets: Warsong Gulch starts at level 10 with 10v10; Arathi Basin opens at level 20 with 15v15; Darkspear Islands, Forever's new battleground, opens at level 30 with 15v15; and Alterac Valley is for level 51-60 with 40v40. A win gives 3 marks for that battleground and a loss gives 1. Queues mix players from different rulesets.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Everything You Need to Know About PvP in World of Warcraft: Forever › Battlegrounds in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/pvp-overview","date":"2026-09-19"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["general:pvp"],"source_hashes":["section:250e3b8babb410e16eace92d1ce7998e5ca26fce"]},{"id":"general-roadmap","chapter":1,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Calendario de contenido de Forever","title_en":"Forever Content Schedule","summary_es":"Lanzamiento el 4 de noviembre de 2026; bandas el 9 de diciembre; Hardcore en invierno y más contenido en 2027.","summary_en":"Launch on November 4, 2026; raids on December 9; Hardcore in winter and more content in 2027.","keywords_es":["calendario de forever","cuándo salen las bandas","roadmap de forever","hardcore forever fecha","contenido 2027"],"keywords_en":["forever roadmap","when do raids open","forever content schedule","hardcore forever date","2027 content"],"text_es":"Forever se lanzó el 4 de noviembre de 2026. El 9 de diciembre se abren tres bandas para 10, 20 y 40 jugadores. Hardcore está previsto para el invierno de 2026. En primavera de 2027 llegarán dos bandas, dos mazmorras, misiones, una zona nueva, una cadena legendaria y una renovación de temporada JcJ; en verano, una banda clásica renovada, otra banda, más contenido de mundo, dos mazmorras y actualizaciones de profesiones y Legacy.","text_en":"Forever launched on November 4, 2026. Three raids for 10, 20, and 40 players open on December 9. Hardcore is planned for winter 2026. Spring 2027 is set to bring two raids, two dungeons, quests, a new area, a legendary questline, and a PvP season refresh; summer adds a revamped classic raid, another raid, more world content, two dungeons, and profession and Legacy updates.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: World of Warcraft: Forever Roadmap - Release Date, New Content › Content Releases for World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/content-release-roadmap","date":"2026-11-05"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: WoW Forever Release Date, Roadmap and Content Schedule › Forever Roadmap and Content Schedule","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/roadmap","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:roadmap"],"source_hashes":["section:b11cab3674e1a8255bcb4181471933e375eb8cb2","section:e766e4adbc3a089c6ef33752043e5c0af4a391fe"]},{"id":"general-campamento","chapter":1,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Campamentos: qué son y cómo empiezan","title_en":"Campsites: What They Are and How to Start","summary_es":"Camping crea un campamento compartido con hoguera, buffs y servicios; se presenta con una misión alrededor del nivel 5.","summary_en":"Camping creates a shared camp with a fire, buffs and services; a quest introduces it around level 5.","keywords_es":["campamento en forever","camping","hoguera compartida","características de campamento","misión de campamento"],"keywords_en":["forever camping","campsite","shared campfire","campsite features","camping quest"],"text_es":"El sistema de campamentos es una actividad de creación paralela a las profesiones y permite levantar campamentos compartidos; otros jugadores pueden aportar características con beneficios, vendedores o espacios de fabricación. Una misión disponible alrededor del nivel 5 te introduce al sistema y te envía a aprender Cocina para crear una Hoguera básica. La hoguera sola no concede efectos: añade características y siéntate o fabrica junto a ella durante 1 minuto para recibirlos. Se coloca al aire libre, no en ciudades principales.","text_en":"Camping is a crafting system alongside the professions that lets players set up shared camps; visitors can add features that provide benefits, vendors, or crafting stations. A quest available around level 5 introduces the system and sends you to learn Cooking to make a Basic Campfire. The fire alone grants no effects: add features, then sit or craft beside it for 1 minute to receive them. Campsites are placed outdoors, not in major cities.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Camping Overview in Forever - Buffs, Vendors and Rewards › Camping Overview in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/camping-overview-unlock-rewards","date":"2026-11-13"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Camping Overview in Forever - Buffs, Vendors and Rewards › Unlocking Campsite Perks in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/camping-overview-unlock-rewards","date":"2026-11-13"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Camping Overview in Forever - Buffs, Vendors and Rewards › Secondary Profession Camping Items","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/camping-overview-unlock-rewards","date":"2026-11-13"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Warcraft Forever Camping System Guide › Campfire Basics in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/camping","date":"2026-11-13"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Warcraft Forever Camping System Guide › Assorted Camping Questions","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/camping","date":"2026-11-13"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:camping"],"source_hashes":["section:4d078478dbd4a2619094acb3dcd4f8ec2d6c7793","section:95e8d64f8d769205eebb9eae0382425734ae6b8b","section:9642575d6654ee0b542615c0007dc5de6b9630ec","section:9e206053daa8a9c865ee6953e2fb8e9673f025ae","section:c9e921fa9128343e5d3099c5ded02abc1c4c8d9b"]},{"id":"general-hogueras","chapter":1,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Tamaños de hoguera y características","title_en":"Campfire Sizes and Features","summary_es":"Cocina determina el tamaño de la hoguera; las características de profesión se aprenden a 20, 140 y 300.","summary_en":"Cooking determines campfire size; profession features are learned at 20, 140, and 300.","keywords_es":["tamaño de hoguera","hoguera básica","hoguera oficial","hoguera experta","características de profesión"],"keywords_en":["campfire size","basic campfire","journeyman campfire","expert campfire","profession features"],"text_es":"Cocina determina la capacidad: la Hoguera básica se aprende a habilidad 1 y admite 3 características; la Hoguera de oficial requiere 90 y admite 5; la Hoguera de experto requiere 200 y admite 10. Cada hoguera tiene 5 minutos de reutilización. Las características de profesión se desbloquean con 20, 140 y 300 de habilidad, y las versiones superiores conservan los beneficios anteriores. Cada jugador solo puede aportar una característica.","text_en":"Campfire capacity is set by Cooking: Basic Campfire is learned at skill 1 and holds 3 features; a Journeyman campfire requires 90 and holds 5; an Expert campfire requires 200 and holds 10. Each campfire has a 5-minute cooldown. Profession features unlock at 20, 140, and 300 skill, and higher tiers keep earlier benefits. Each player can contribute only one feature.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Camping Overview in Forever - Buffs, Vendors and Rewards › Unlocking Campsite Perks in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/camping-overview-unlock-rewards","date":"2026-11-13"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Camping Overview in Forever - Buffs, Vendors and Rewards › Primary Profession Camping Items","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/camping-overview-unlock-rewards","date":"2026-11-13"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Camping Overview in Forever - Buffs, Vendors and Rewards › Secondary Profession Camping Items","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/camping-overview-unlock-rewards","date":"2026-11-13"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:camping"],"source_hashes":["section:95e8d64f8d769205eebb9eae0382425734ae6b8b","section:9642575d6654ee0b542615c0007dc5de6b9630ec","section:ef6eafa990feacdd7b9f645f7e9dba4575d9f19a"]},{"id":"general-saco-dormir","chapter":1,"status":"editorial","title_es":"El saco de dormir y la experiencia extra","title_en":"The Sleeping Bag and Bonus Experience","summary_es":"El bonus del Saco de dormir acogedor aumenta un 1% por minuto hasta el 3% y dura 1 hora.","summary_en":"The Cozy Sleeping Bag bonus rises by 1% per minute up to 3% and lasts 1 hour.","keywords_es":["saco de dormir acogedor","bien descansado","experiencia extra","buff de experiencia","saco de dormir forever"],"keywords_en":["cozy sleeping bag","well rested","bonus experience","experience buff","forever sleeping bag"],"text_es":"El Saco de dormir acogedor se consigue en una cadena por zonas de nivel bajo. Al tumbarte dentro al menos 1 minuto, recibes Bien descansado: cada minuto aumenta un 1% la experiencia de todas las fuentes, hasta un máximo del 3%; dura 1 hora. Mientras estás dentro también acumulas descanso. El objeto tiene 1 hora de reutilización, el bonus persiste tras morir y los miembros del grupo también pueden usarlo.","text_en":"The Cozy Sleeping Bag comes from a questline through low-level zones. After lying inside for at least 1 minute, you gain Well Rested: each minute increases experience from all sources by 1%, up to 3%; it lasts 1 hour. You also accumulate rested experience while inside. The item has a 1-hour cooldown, the bonus persists through death, and party members can use it too.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Cozy Sleeping Bag:  Quests, Locations and Rewards in Forever › What is a Cozy Sleeping Bag?","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/cozy-sleeping-bag-locations-rewards","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: How to Get The Sleeping Bag in World of Warcraft Forever › What is the Cozy Sleeping Bag","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/sleeping-bag","date":"2026-10-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: How to Get The Sleeping Bag in World of Warcraft Forever › How to Obtain the Cozy Sleeping Bag","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/sleeping-bag","date":"2026-10-10"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:sleeping-bag"],"source_hashes":["section:9e8a84e4baf38dd6baa0bbc6ae3b1be325db86eb","section:d96ae6b595357afa5b297825485d033a19e359bf","section:f00299740226cde99fcafb72e408041631900f8d"]},{"id":"general-saco-dormir-inicio","chapter":1,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Saco de dormir: cómo empezar la cadena","title_en":"Sleeping bag: how to start the questline","summary_es":"La cadena empieza a nivel 14; Alianza y Horda recorren en orden inverso los dos puntos iniciales.","summary_en":"The questline starts at level 14; Alliance and Horde visit the two opening locations in reverse order.","keywords_es":["mision del saco de dormir","cadena del saco de dormir","saco de dormir acogedor","empezar saco de dormir","y la nota que has encontrado"],"keywords_en":["sleeping bag quest","sleeping bag questline","cozy sleeping bag","start sleeping bag","and that note you found"],"text_es":"La cadena está disponible desde nivel 14. La Alianza recoge «y la nota que has encontrado...» en los restos carbonizados junto a la Hacienda de Alexston, en Páramos de Poniente (/way 37, 50), y la entrega en una torre en ruinas al sur del Campamento Taurajo, en Los Baldíos (/way 46, 74), donde acepta «Peldaños». La Horda visita los mismos dos puntos en orden inverso. Antes conviene preparar transporte o rutas de vuelo cerca de Los Baldíos, Sierra Espolón, Loch Modan, Los Humedales y Laderas de Trabalomas.","text_en":"The questline is available from level 14. Alliance characters pick up '... and that note you found' at the Burned-Out Remains by Alexston Farmstead in Westfall (/way 37, 50), then turn it in at a ruined tower south of Camp Taurajo in The Barrens (/way 46, 74) and accept Stepping Stones. Horde characters visit the same two locations in reverse order. Before setting out, have transport or flight paths near The Barrens, Stonetalon Mountains, Loch Modan, Wetlands, and Hillsbrad Foothills.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Cozy Sleeping Bag:  Quests, Locations and Rewards in Forever › (intro)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/cozy-sleeping-bag-locations-rewards","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Cozy Sleeping Bag:  Quests, Locations and Rewards in Forever › Westfall","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/cozy-sleeping-bag-locations-rewards","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Cozy Sleeping Bag:  Quests, Locations and Rewards in Forever › The Barrens","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/cozy-sleeping-bag-locations-rewards","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: How to Get The Sleeping Bag in World of Warcraft Forever › How to Obtain the Cozy Sleeping Bag","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/sleeping-bag","date":"2026-10-10"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:sleeping-bag"],"source_hashes":["guide:cfea77bbd9cb56dc7be6cd289b4e78ea59786d73","section:0f5410d7f70b6e382248705ac7bc6ac9658457f1","section:9e8a84e4baf38dd6baa0bbc6ae3b1be325db86eb","section:a35106c03bbc2e25e21380ae90bed2b1734e6c6e"]},{"id":"general-saco-dormir-pasos","chapter":1,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Saco de dormir: pasos intermedios","title_en":"Sleeping bag: middle steps","summary_es":"Desde Sierra Espolón hasta Loch Modan, la cadena avanza por Revolver, Un trabajo sucio y El puño del águila.","summary_en":"The route runs from Stepping Stones through Scramble and Wet Job to Eagle's Fist.","keywords_es":["mision del saco de dormir","cadena del saco de dormir","saco de dormir acogedor","peldaños","revolver","un trabajo sucio"],"keywords_en":["sleeping bag quest","sleeping bag questline","cozy sleeping bag","stepping stones","scramble","wet job"],"text_es":"Toma el camino al noreste del Refugio Roca del Sol, en Sierra Espolón, y sube al campamento abandonado (/way 40.6, 52.4): entrega «Peldaños» y acepta «Revolver». Sigue al norte hasta el montículo de tierra (/way 39.6, 49.8) y salta para completar «Revolver» y recoger «Un trabajo sucio»; si fallas, tendrás que rodear la montaña. En la presa de Loch Modan, salta desde la cabeza de enano más al este hasta la figura del águila (/way 49.4, 12.9), entrega «Un trabajo sucio» y acepta «El puño del águila». Si fallas este último salto, caerás hasta Los Humedales.","text_en":"Take the path northeast of Sun Rock Retreat in Stonetalon Mountains and climb to the abandoned camp (/way 40.6, 52.4): turn in Stepping Stones and accept Scramble. Head north to the mound of dirt (/way 39.6, 49.8) and jump over to complete Scramble and pick up Wet Job; if you miss, you must go around the mountain. At the dam in Loch Modan, jump from the easternmost dwarf head to the eagle figurine (/way 49.4, 12.9), turn in Wet Job, and accept Eagle's Fist. Missing this last jump drops you into the Wetlands.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Cozy Sleeping Bag:  Quests, Locations and Rewards in Forever › Stonetalon Mountains","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/cozy-sleeping-bag-locations-rewards","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Cozy Sleeping Bag:  Quests, Locations and Rewards in Forever › Loch Modan","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/cozy-sleeping-bag-locations-rewards","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: How to Get The Sleeping Bag in World of Warcraft Forever › Step 3: Loch Modan","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/sleeping-bag","date":"2026-10-10"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:sleeping-bag"],"source_hashes":["section:43a2d603ecc68ec57edd817d85e42086f37ad364","section:9f44f7f755ffd2282f9f3c26469bac5fbac5cd87","section:a2b074be6bb3c5cd7f916ded22490c499c9a32aa"]},{"id":"general-saco-dormir-final","chapter":1,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Saco de dormir: paso final","title_en":"Sleeping bag: the final step","summary_es":"En la Muralla de Thoradin, entrega El puño del águila y Este debe de ser el lugar para obtener el saco.","summary_en":"The final step is at Thoradin Wall; complete the last two quests to receive the sleeping bag.","keywords_es":["mision del saco de dormir","cadena del saco de dormir","saco de dormir acogedor","el puño del águila","este debe de ser el lugar","muralla de thoradin"],"keywords_en":["sleeping bag quest","sleeping bag questline","cozy sleeping bag","eagle's fist","this must be the place","thoradin's wall"],"text_es":"El paso final está en la Muralla de Thoradin, entre Laderas de Trabalomas y Tierras Altas de Arathi. Usa el carro destrozado del lado de Trabalomas (/way 87.3, 49.6); sus restos forman un recorrido de saltos que sube por el muro. En la sala de arriba, llena de objetos, entrega «El puño del águila» en la bolsa colgada, acepta «Este debe de ser el lugar» y entrégala en el pergamino de debajo para recibir el Saco de dormir acogedor.","text_en":"The final step is at Thoradin Wall, between Hillsbrad Foothills and the Arathi Highlands. Use the broken cart on the Hillsbrad side (/way 87.3, 49.6); its debris forms a jumping path up the wall. In the room above, filled with objects, turn in Eagle's Fist at the hanging bag, accept This Must Be The Place, then turn it in at the scroll below to receive the Cozy Sleeping Bag.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Cozy Sleeping Bag:  Quests, Locations and Rewards in Forever › Hillsbrad Foothills","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/cozy-sleeping-bag-locations-rewards","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: How to Get The Sleeping Bag in World of Warcraft Forever › Final Step: Hillsbrad Foothills","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/sleeping-bag","date":"2026-10-10"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:sleeping-bag"],"source_hashes":["section:7328077eade208ca2d73bebbed7c035f69230ed0","section:808f2a132bf3a7166648d14425c9d86470410e68"]},{"id":"general-transmog","chapter":1,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Transfiguración: cómo funciona","title_en":"Transmogrification: How It Works","summary_es":"La transfiguración es opcional, cambia el aspecto sin tocar estadísticas y comparte las apariencias en la cuenta.","summary_en":"Transmog is optional and changes looks without touching stats; appearances are shared account-wide.","keywords_es":["transfiguración","cambiar aspecto del equipo","apariencias account wide","transmog opcional","pnj de transfiguración"],"keywords_en":["transmogrification","change gear appearance","account-wide appearances","optional transmog","transmog npc"],"text_es":"La transfiguración cambia el aspecto del equipo sin modificar sus estadísticas. Está desactivada al empezar y se activa hablando con un PNJ de transfiguración en una ciudad principal; si la dejas apagada, ves el equipo original. Cada pieza que recoges aprende su apariencia, y las apariencias son de toda la cuenta. En mazmorras, todos los miembros del grupo aprenden la apariencia de un objeto raro aunque pierdan la tirada. Puedes consultar las apariencias con Mayús+P.","text_en":"Transmogrification changes gear looks without changing its stats. It is off at the start and is enabled by talking to a transmog NPC in a major city; with it off, you see the original gear. Each piece you loot teaches its appearance, and appearances are account-wide. In dungeons every group member learns the appearance of a rare drop even if they lose the roll. You can check appearances with Shift+P.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Transmog in World of Warcraft: Forever › Opting Into the Transmog System","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/transmog-system","date":"2026-09-19"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["general:transmog-system"],"source_hashes":["section:8e28dc3da32f6d39ea43c18d16cb8299387a047d"]},{"id":"general-transmog-trajes","chapter":1,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Trajes y situaciones de transfiguración","title_en":"Transmog Outfits and Situations","summary_es":"Puedes guardar trajes desde 2 espacios hasta 50 y cambiarlos según lugar, movimiento, especialización, clima u hora.","summary_en":"You can save outfits from 2 free slots up to 50 and change them by location, movement, specialization, weather or time.","keywords_es":["trajes de transfiguración","situaciones de transmog","espacios de traje","outfits forever","transmog automático"],"keywords_en":["transmog outfits","transmog situations","outfit slots","forever outfits","automatic transmog"],"text_es":"El menú de transfiguración permite guardar conjuntos de apariencias llamados trajes. Empiezas con dos espacios gratis y puedes comprar hasta 50, con un coste creciente. También puedes usar situaciones para que un traje cambie automáticamente según el lugar, si estás montado o nadando, la especialización, el clima o la hora del día. Puedes elegir varias situaciones para un mismo traje.","text_en":"The transmog menu lets you save appearance sets called outfits. You start with two free slots and can buy up to 50, at an increasing cost. Situations can also make an outfit change automatically by location, whether you are mounted or swimming, specialization, weather or time of day. You can pick several situations for the same outfit.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Transmog in World of Warcraft: Forever › Transmogrification Outfits","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/transmog-system","date":"2026-09-19"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["general:transmog-system"],"source_hashes":["section:bac3a2162b3f8d377367785aac7442aa72059016"]},{"id":"general-colecciones","chapter":1,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Colecciones: monturas, mascotas y aspecto","title_en":"Collections: Mounts, Pets and Looks","summary_es":"Forever tiene colecciones permanentes de monturas, mascotas de compañía y equipo para transfiguración.","summary_en":"Forever has permanent collections of mounts, companion pets and gear for transmogrification.","keywords_es":["colecciones de forever","monturas coleccionables","mascotas de compañía","transmog colección","completar colecciones"],"keywords_en":["forever collections","collectible mounts","companion pets","transmog collection","complete collections"],"text_es":"Forever incluye colecciones de monturas, mascotas de compañía y equipo para transfiguración. Son añadidos permanentes y una de las actividades principales para quien quiere completar el juego. Las monturas sirven para desplazarse por el exterior a más velocidad, y las mascotas pueden acompañarte e incluso tener efectos especiales. Las apariencias de transfiguración también se guardan en la colección de la cuenta.","text_en":"Forever includes collections of mounts, companion pets and gear for transmogrification. They are permanent additions and one of the main activities for players who want to complete the game. Mounts provide faster outdoor travel, and pets can accompany you and even have special effects. Transmog appearances are also stored in the account collection.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: WoW Forever Collections Overview › Collections in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/collectible-items","date":"2026-09-21"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["general:collectible-items"],"source_hashes":["section:4c1437c0f0ba9951f9c724a8f0b0a05007677b88"]},{"id":"general-elegir-clase","chapter":1,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Elegir clase y rol","title_en":"Choosing a Class and Role","summary_es":"Elige por rol y estilo; el Druida cubre todos los roles y todas las especializaciones buscan ser competitivas.","summary_en":"Choose by role and style; Druid covers every role and all specializations aim to be competitive.","keywords_es":["qué clase elegir","clase para tanque","clase para sanador","clase más fácil","roles de las clases"],"keywords_en":["which class to choose","tank class","healer class","easiest class","class roles"],"text_es":"Las nueve clases de Classic vuelven con talentos y habilidades nuevos, y todas las especializaciones buscan ser competitivas. Antes de mirar el daño, conviene decidir si quieres tanquear, sanar o hacer daño, y si prefieres cuerpo a cuerpo o distancia. El Druida es la opción más flexible porque cubre los cuatro roles; el Paladín combina tanque, sanador y daño cuerpo a cuerpo, y el Chamán reparte sanación, daño cuerpo a cuerpo y a distancia. El equilibrio cambia con los ajustes, así que la clase debe gustarte por su estilo.","text_en":"All nine Classic classes return with new talents and abilities, and every specialization aims to be competitive. Before looking at damage, decide whether you want to tank, heal or deal damage, and whether you prefer melee or ranged. Druid is the most flexible option because it covers all four roles; Paladin combines tanking, healing and melee damage, and Shaman spreads healing, melee and ranged damage. Balance changes with tuning, so pick a class whose style you enjoy.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever - Choosing Your Class › How to Choose Your Class in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/choosing-your-main","date":"2026-10-15"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["general:choosing-your-main"],"source_hashes":["section:bc12ddbcba31b0b04092b80a51e7a5e1808b5451"]},{"id":"general-zonas-niveles","chapter":1,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Zonas nuevas y sus niveles","title_en":"New Zones and Their Levels","summary_es":"Monte Hyjal es nivel 60; Riverglades 35-45; Shen'Dralas une Desolace y Feralas; Zephras es el inicio 1-12.","summary_en":"Mount Hyjal is level 60; Riverglades 35-45; Shen'Dralas links Desolace and Feralas; Zephras is the 1-12 start.","keywords_es":["zonas nuevas y niveles","monte hyjal","riverglades","shen'dralas","isla de zephras"],"keywords_en":["new zones and levels","mount hyjal","riverglades","shen'dralas","zephras isle"],"text_es":"Monte Hyjal es una zona de nivel máximo con la banda Hyjal Summit. Riverglades cubre los niveles 35-45 y se encuentra entre Montañas Crestagrana y las Estepas Ardientes. Shen'Dralas está entre Desolace y Feralas y amplía la historia de los Shen'dorei. La Isla de Zephras es la zona de inicio de los Cielonatos, para niveles 1-12.","text_en":"Mount Hyjal is an endgame zone with the Hyjal Summit raid. Riverglades covers levels 35-45 and sits between Redridge Mountains and the Burning Steppes. Shen'Dralas lies between Desolace and Feralas and expands the Shen'dorei story. Zephras Isle is the Skyborne starting zone, for levels 1-12.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: WoW Forever: All Zones and Maps › Mount Hyjal in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/zones-and-maps","date":"2026-09-21"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["general:zones-and-maps"],"source_hashes":["section:796b92621cd12232458105789c7d935365146709"]},{"id":"general-legacy-progresion","chapter":1,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Cómo funciona Legacy","title_en":"How Legacy Works","summary_es":"Los desafíos dan puntos Legacy para ventajas por personaje y recompensas cosméticas de cuenta.","summary_en":"Challenges grant Legacy Points for character perks and account-wide cosmetic rewards.","keywords_es":["sistema Legacy","puntos Legacy","ventajas Legacy","progreso de cuenta","cómo funciona Legacy"],"keywords_en":["Legacy system","Legacy Points","Legacy perks","account progression","how Legacy works"],"text_es":"Legacy es una progresión de cuenta: completar desafíos, como subir clases o profesiones, concede puntos. Estos puntos se gastan en ventajas del árbol y cada personaje puede elegir su propia distribución; las ventajas desbloqueadas están disponibles para los personajes de la cuenta. Al alcanzar ciertos totales de puntos ganados también se obtienen recompensas cosméticas.","text_en":"Legacy is account progression: completing challenges, such as leveling classes or professions, grants points. These points are spent on tree perks, and each character can choose its own allocation; unlocked perks are available to the account's characters. Reaching certain totals of points earned also grants cosmetic rewards.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Legacy System Overview for Forever - Earning, Rewards, and Trees › What is the Legacy System in Forever?","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/legacy-system-overview-rewards","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Legacy System Overview for Forever - Earning, Rewards, and Trees › All Legacy Tree Perks in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/legacy-system-overview-rewards","date":"2026-11-15"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:legacy-system"],"source_hashes":["section:4f11330c0fa5a04c47408d720ccd8cd6ea2c2956","section:895276667f45e52e0670aca380e44d261630012e"]},{"id":"general-legacy-puntos","chapter":1,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Cómo ganar puntos Legacy","title_en":"How to Earn Legacy Points","summary_es":"Se gana un punto al alcanzar por primera vez hitos de clase, profesión y otros desafíos.","summary_en":"You earn a point by reaching class, profession, and other challenge milestones for the first time.","keywords_es":["ganar puntos Legacy","desafíos Legacy","puntos por subir de nivel","puntos por profesiones","desafíos de clase"],"keywords_en":["earn Legacy Points","Legacy challenges","leveling points","profession points","class challenges"],"text_es":"Los desafíos Legacy abarcan clases, profesiones, JcJ y aventuras. La primera vez que una clase alcanza los niveles 25, 45 y 60, cada hito concede un punto; las profesiones principales también dan puntos al llegar a 150, 225 y 300. Si buscas puntos rápidos, subir profesiones hasta 225 suele ser una opción relativamente barata y ágil, aunque depende del mercado.","text_en":"Legacy challenges cover classes, professions, PvP, and adventure. The first time a class reaches levels 25, 45, and 60, each milestone grants a point; primary professions also award points at 150, 225, and 300 skill. If you want points quickly, leveling professions to 225 is often a relatively cheap and fast option, though it depends on the market.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Legacy System Overview for Forever - Earning, Rewards, and Trees › All Legacy Challenges in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/legacy-system-overview-rewards","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Legacy System Overview for Forever - Earning, Rewards, and Trees › Fastest way to earn Legacy Points While Leveling in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/legacy-system-overview-rewards","date":"2026-11-15"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:legacy-system"],"source_hashes":["section:92566f8cece664f9add84bcbbe33660236e95ada","section:e936c695e09e795d1a6379b15294fffecd456c67"]},{"id":"general-legacy-limite","chapter":1,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Límite de puntos Legacy para gastar","title_en":"Legacy Point Spending Limit","summary_es":"Al lanzamiento, cada personaje puede gastar como máximo 16 puntos en su árbol Legacy.","summary_en":"At launch, each character can spend at most 16 points in its Legacy tree.","keywords_es":["límite de puntos Legacy","cuántos puntos Legacy gastar","tope del árbol Legacy","puntos Legacy por personaje"],"keywords_en":["Legacy Point limit","how many Legacy Points to spend","Legacy tree cap","Legacy Points per character"],"text_es":"Al lanzamiento, el árbol Legacy permite gastar hasta 16 puntos por personaje. Los puntos se desbloquean para la cuenta, pero cada personaje decide por separado en qué ventajas invertir los que tiene disponibles.","text_en":"At launch, the Legacy tree allows up to 16 points to be spent per character. Points unlock for the account, but each character separately chooses which perks to invest its available points in.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Legacy System Overview for Forever - Earning, Rewards, and Trees › All Legacy Tree Perks in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/legacy-system-overview-rewards","date":"2026-11-15"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:legacy-system"],"source_hashes":["section:895276667f45e52e0670aca380e44d261630012e"]},{"id":"general-legacy-recompensas","chapter":1,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Recompensas del progreso Legacy","title_en":"Legacy Progress Rewards","summary_es":"Los hitos de 15, 25, 40 y 55 puntos ganados otorgan cosméticos, desde una mascota hasta una montura.","summary_en":"Milestones at 15, 25, 40, and 55 points earned grant cosmetics, including a pet and a mount.","keywords_es":["recompensas Legacy","premios por puntos Legacy","mascota oso espectral","montura oso espectral","pista de progreso Legacy"],"keywords_en":["Legacy rewards","Legacy Point rewards","Spectral Bear Cub","Spectral Bear mount","Legacy progress track"],"text_es":"La pista de progreso da recompensas cosméticas al acumular puntos Legacy: una recompensa al llegar a 15, una mascota al llegar a 25, un tabardo a 40 y una montura a 55. Se reclaman ante Tabernero Wiley.","text_en":"The progress track grants cosmetic rewards as you earn Legacy Points: a reward at 15, a pet at 25, a tabard at 40, and a mount at 55. Claim them from Innkeeper Wiley.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Legacy System Overview for Forever - Earning, Rewards, and Trees › All Legacy Progress Track Rewards in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/legacy-system-overview-rewards","date":"2026-11-15"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:legacy-system"],"source_hashes":["section:3845b40e10fcc3b1d2d2efddb0b4f94432e7ed68"]},{"id":"general-legacy-reasignar","chapter":1,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Reasignar puntos Legacy","title_en":"Respec Legacy Points","summary_es":"Puedes reasignar los puntos Legacy en el instructor de clase; por ahora cuesta 10 de oro.","summary_en":"You can respec Legacy Points at a class trainer; for now, it costs 10 gold.","keywords_es":["reasignar puntos Legacy","reiniciar árbol Legacy","coste de reasignar Legacy","instructor de clase Legacy"],"keywords_en":["respec Legacy Points","reset Legacy tree","Legacy respec cost","Legacy class trainer"],"text_es":"Puedes reasignar los puntos Legacy hablando con un instructor de clase; actualmente cuesta 10 de oro. No se sabe si se podrá repetir ni si el coste aumentará.","text_en":"You can respec Legacy Points by speaking to a class trainer; it currently costs 10 gold. It is not yet known whether this can be repeated or whether the cost will increase.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Legacy System Overview for Forever - Earning, Rewards, and Trees › Unlearning your Legacy Points","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/legacy-system-overview-rewards","date":"2026-11-15"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:legacy-system"],"source_hashes":["section:162409ee6aa0882819f9fe1dea78c265eab043d1"]},{"id":"general-bolsas-inventario","chapter":1,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Huecos de bolsas e inventario","title_en":"Bag Slots and Inventory","summary_es":"Empiezas con una mochila fija de 16 huecos y cuatro espacios más para bolsas.","summary_en":"You start with a fixed 16-slot backpack and four more spaces for bags.","keywords_es":["huecos de bolsas","espacio de inventario","mochila inicial","cuántas bolsas puedo equipar","guardar bolsas dentro de bolsas"],"keywords_en":["bag slots","inventory space","starting backpack","how many bags can I equip","bags inside bags"],"text_es":"Cada personaje empieza con una mochila fija de 16 huecos y tiene otros cuatro espacios para equipar bolsas. Puedes obtenerlas como botín, recompensa de misión o mediante Costura; muchas también se pueden intercambiar. Una bolsa guardada dentro de otra debe estar vacía y no se permite anidarlas a más de dos niveles.","text_en":"Each character starts with a fixed 16-slot backpack and has four more spaces for equipped bags. You can obtain bags as loot, quest rewards, or through Tailoring; many can also be traded. A bag stored inside another must be empty, and bags cannot be nested more than two levels deep.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Bags & Storage Overview Guide:  Locations, Quests and Costs - WoW: Forever › What are Bags in WoW Forever?","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/bags-storage-bank","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:bags-storage-bank"],"source_hashes":["section:eec642f0ac44bf873050f983ab8a2ac202989f1c"]},{"id":"general-bolsa-componentes","chapter":1,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Espacio adicional para componentes","title_en":"Extra Reagent Storage","summary_es":"Una ranura exclusiva admite una bolsa de componentes; algunas se compran al aprender profesión.","summary_en":"An extra slot holds a reagent bag; some are sold when you learn a profession.","keywords_es":["bolsa de componentes","ranura de componentes","guardar materiales de profesión","faltriquera de minería","bolsa de botánica"],"keywords_en":["reagent bag","reagent bag slot","store profession materials","mining pack","herb pouch"],"text_es":"Hay una ranura adicional reservada para bolsas de componentes, que permite guardar materiales de profesión sin ocupar los huecos normales. Al aprender Minería, Desuello o Botánica, puedes comprar la bolsa inicial correspondiente al instructor desde nivel 1; después, los sastres pueden fabricar bolsas de 6 a 32 huecos.","text_en":"There is an extra slot reserved for reagent bags, letting you store profession materials without using regular bag slots. When you learn Mining, Skinning, or Herbalism, you can buy the corresponding starter bag from the trainer at level 1; Tailors can later craft bags ranging from 6 to 32 slots.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Bags & Storage Overview Guide:  Locations, Quests and Costs - WoW: Forever › Reagent Bags in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/bags-storage-bank","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:bags-storage-bank"],"source_hashes":["section:1b7434a8ea954117d68338b414dd98a51e4abcac"]},{"id":"general-banco-personal","chapter":1,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Huecos y coste del banco personal","title_en":"Personal Bank Slots and Costs","summary_es":"El banco empieza con 48 huecos; puedes comprar seis espacios adicionales por un coste creciente.","summary_en":"The bank starts with 48 slots; you can buy six more at increasing costs.","keywords_es":["espacio del banco","huecos del banco","precio de bolsas del banco","comprar espacio de banco","almacenamiento personal"],"keywords_en":["bank space","bank slots","bank bag slot cost","buy bank space","personal storage"],"text_es":"El banco de cada personaje incluye 48 huecos gratis. Se pueden comprar seis espacios adicionales para bolsas: cuestan, en orden, 10 de plata, 1, 10, 25, 50 y 100 de oro. Si guardas un objeto de misión en el banco, tendrás que recuperarlo y llevarlo en el inventario para completar la misión.","text_en":"Each character's bank includes 48 free slots. You can buy six additional bag slots, costing 10 silver, then 1, 10, 25, 50, and 100 gold. If you store a quest item in the bank, you must retrieve it and carry it in your inventory to complete the quest.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Bags & Storage Overview Guide:  Locations, Quests and Costs - WoW: Forever › Bank Storage in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/bags-storage-bank","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:bags-storage-bank"],"source_hashes":["section:03a13ed4dfac2f896d0fee7294dc380143b96c58"]},{"id":"general-banco-gremio","chapter":1,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Almacenamiento del banco de hermandad","title_en":"Guild Bank Storage","summary_es":"El banco de hermandad guarda recursos compartidos y permite ampliar pestañas y consultar movimientos.","summary_en":"The guild bank stores shared resources, allows extra tabs, and tracks transactions.","keywords_es":["banco de hermandad","almacenamiento de hermandad","materiales compartidos","pestañas del banco de hermandad","registro del banco de hermandad"],"keywords_en":["guild bank","guild storage","shared materials","guild bank tabs","guild bank log"],"text_es":"Las hermandades disponen de un banco compartido para guardar materiales de fabricación, consumibles y oro. Se pueden comprar pestañas para ampliar el espacio, y el banco permite consultar quién depositó o retiró objetos y dinero.","text_en":"Guilds have a shared bank for storing crafting materials, consumables, and gold. Additional tabs can be purchased to expand storage, and the bank lets members see who deposited or withdrew items and money.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Bags & Storage Overview Guide:  Locations, Quests and Costs - WoW: Forever › Guild Bank Storage in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/bags-storage-bank","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:bags-storage-bank"],"source_hashes":["section:6b2e40df20827bd1de3931a7e1f8e1ab7e129485"]},{"id":"general-almacen-personaje-alterno","chapter":1,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Usar otro personaje como almacén","title_en":"Using an Alt as Storage","summary_es":"Otro personaje puede equipar bolsas sin requisito de nivel y ampliar su banco con seis huecos.","summary_en":"Another character can equip bags without a level requirement and add six bank slots.","keywords_es":["personaje almacén","personaje alternativo para guardar objetos","banco de personaje alternativo","enviar objetos a otro personaje","bolsas sin nivel"],"keywords_en":["storage character","alt character storage","alt bank slots","send items to another character","bags without level requirements"],"text_es":"Puedes dedicar un personaje alternativo a guardar objetos: las bolsas no tienen requisito de nivel y puede equiparlas desde el principio. También puede comprar los seis huecos adicionales del banco. El correo entre personajes de la misma cuenta es instantáneo, lo que facilita trasladar objetos.","text_en":"You can use an alternate character to store items: bags have no level requirement, so it can equip them from the start. It can also buy all six additional bank slots. Messages sent between your own characters arrive immediately, making transfers convenient.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Bags & Storage Overview Guide:  Locations, Quests and Costs - WoW: Forever › Alt Character Storage in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/bags-storage-bank","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:bags-storage-bank"],"source_hashes":["section:c6536b6f3fcb138ee1628966fa2a54d407398581"]},{"id":"general-almacen-correo","chapter":1,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Guardar objetos en el correo","title_en":"Storing Items in Mail","summary_es":"El correo puede guardar muchos objetos, pero solo muestra 50 mensajes y los elimina tras 60 días.","summary_en":"Mail can hold many items, but shows only 50 messages and deletes them after 60 days.","keywords_es":["guardar objetos en el correo","almacenamiento en buzón","cuántos mensajes muestra el buzón","cuánto dura el correo","devolución de correo"],"keywords_en":["store items in mail","mailbox storage","how many messages mailbox shows","mail expiration","returned mail"],"text_es":"El buzón puede servir como almacén, pero es una opción arriesgada: solo muestra los 50 mensajes más recientes y enviar correo tarda una hora, incluso entre personajes de la misma cuenta. A los 30 días el mensaje vuelve al remitente; tras otros 30 días se elimina definitivamente.","text_en":"A mailbox can be used for storage, but it is risky: it shows only the 50 newest messages, and sending mail takes an hour, even between characters on the same account. After 30 days a message returns to its sender; after another 30 days it is permanently deleted.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Bags & Storage Overview Guide:  Locations, Quests and Costs - WoW: Forever › Mailbox Storage in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/bags-storage-bank","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:bags-storage-bank"],"source_hashes":["section:b83a02d90ae9091610cb48d3aeee31c2ceccd35f"]},{"id":"general-saco-dormir-picoteo","chapter":1,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Picoteo de estudiante de la cadena","title_en":"Student Fodder from the Questline","summary_es":"La cadena del saco de dormir también da cinco Picoteos de estudiante, que restauran salud.","summary_en":"The sleeping bag questline also grants five Student Fodder, which restores health.","keywords_es":["picoteo de estudiante","recompensas del saco de dormir","curación de picoteo de estudiante","cadena del saco de dormir","comida para recuperar salud"],"keywords_en":["Student Fodder","sleeping bag quest rewards","Student Fodder healing","sleeping bag questline","food that restores health"],"text_es":"Además del Saco de dormir acogedor, la cadena entrega cinco unidades de Picoteo de estudiante en total, que restauran salud.","text_en":"Along with the Cozy Sleeping Bag, the questline awards five Student Fodder in total, which restore health.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Cozy Sleeping Bag:  Quests, Locations and Rewards in Forever › What is a Cozy Sleeping Bag?","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/cozy-sleeping-bag-locations-rewards","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:sleeping-bag"],"source_hashes":["section:d96ae6b595357afa5b297825485d033a19e359bf"]},{"id":"general-recetas-lanzamiento","chapter":1,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Recetas nuevas de profesiones","title_en":"New Profession Recipes","summary_es":"El lanzamiento añadió más de 600 recetas y renovó muchas recetas existentes.","summary_en":"Launch added over 600 recipes and revamped many existing ones.","keywords_es":["recetas nuevas de Forever","cambios de profesiones","más de 600 recetas","recetas de profesión nuevas","profesiones en el lanzamiento"],"keywords_en":["new Forever recipes","profession changes","over 600 recipes","new profession recipes","launch professions"],"text_es":"Con el lanzamiento llegaron más de 600 recetas nuevas repartidas entre las profesiones y distintos niveles. También se modificaron muchas recetas existentes para que las profesiones tengan más relevancia durante la progresión hasta nivel 60.","text_en":"Launch brought over 600 new recipes across the professions and different level ranges. Many existing recipes were also changed to make professions more relevant throughout progression to level 60.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Phase 1 Overview:  New Features, Dungeons, Zones, Raids - WoW: Forever › Professions in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/phase-one-overview-features-rewards","date":"2026-11-05"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:phase-one-overview-features-rewards"],"source_hashes":["section:f8e649856b00d8d026b689a1366036047c849832"]}]},"03-razas.json":{"description":"Capítulo 3: Razas. Secciones editoriales redactadas desde guías de terceros.","sections":[{"id":"raza-razas-por-faccion","chapter":3,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Razas por facción en Forever","title_en":"Races by Faction in Forever","summary_es":"Alianza: Humano, Enano, Elfo de la noche y Gnomo; Horda: Orco, No-muerto, Tauren y Trol; Cielonato elige bando.","summary_en":"Alliance: Human, Dwarf, Night Elf and Gnome; Horde: Orc, Undead, Tauren and Troll; Skyborne choose a side.","keywords_es":["razas por facción","razas de la alianza","razas de la horda","qué razas puedo elegir","razas jugables"],"keywords_en":["races by faction","alliance races","horde races","which races can I choose","playable races"],"text_es":"La Alianza cuenta con Humano, Enano, Elfo de la noche y Gnomo. La Horda reúne a Orco, No-muerto, Tauren y Trol. Los Cielonatos son neutrales y escogen Alianza u Horda al crear el personaje, de modo que se suman a los dos bandos. Forever ofrece así diez razas jugables.","text_en":"The Alliance has Human, Dwarf, Night Elf and Gnome. The Horde brings together Orc, Undead, Tauren and Troll. Skyborne are neutral and pick Alliance or Horde when the character is created, so they join both sides. Forever thus offers ten playable races.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: WoW Forever Racial Guide › Race/Class Combinations in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/race-guide","date":"2026-10-27"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["race:race-guide"],"source_hashes":["section:5da04ca614262d7cda3f620791c0523a30522390"]},{"id":"raza-cuatro-raciales","chapter":3,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Cuatro raciales por raza","title_en":"Four Racials per Race","summary_es":"Forever rediseña las raciales: dos activas y dos pasivas por raza, con una identidad propia.","summary_en":"Forever redesigns racials: two active and two passive per race, each with its own identity.","keywords_es":["cuántas raciales tiene cada raza","raciales activas","raciales pasivas","rediseño de raciales","habilidades raciales"],"keywords_en":["how many racials per race","active racials","passive racials","racial redesign","racial abilities"],"text_es":"Cada raza de Forever tiene cuatro raciales: dos habilidades activas y dos efectos pasivos. Una activa suele ser una habilidad de combate con reutilización y la otra está más orientada a rol o utilidad. Las pasivas completan el estilo de la raza. El rediseño busca que las razas tengan un nivel de potencia más parecido y que la elección dependa del gusto, no de una diferencia enorme.","text_en":"Every Forever race has four racials: two active abilities and two passive effects. One active is usually a combat ability with a cooldown, while the other leans toward roleplay or utility. The passives complete the race's style. The redesign aims for a more even power level between races, so the choice depends on taste rather than a huge gap.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: WoW Forever Racial Guide › New Racial Abilities in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/race-guide","date":"2026-10-27"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["race:race-guide"],"source_hashes":["section:f2da73fac16cad75ab3660922e4d5bf6220abd3f"]},{"id":"raza-tier-list","chapter":3,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Razas mejor valoradas en PvE y JcJ","title_en":"Top Races for PvE and PvP","summary_es":"Elfo de la noche, Humano y Gnomo destacan en PvE; Gnomo, Orco y Humano en JcJ; los Cielonatos quedan en A.","summary_en":"Night Elf, Human and Gnome lead PvE; Gnome, Orc and Human lead PvP; Skyborne sit in A.","keywords_es":["mejores razas pve","mejores razas pvp","tier list de razas","razas s tier","qué raza elegir"],"keywords_en":["best pve races","best pvp races","race tier list","s tier races","which race to choose"],"text_es":"Para JcE se consideran entre las mejores razas Elfo de la noche, Humano y Gnomo; después aparecen Orco, Trol y los dos Cielonatos, y por último Enano, No-muerto y Tauren. En JcJ las mejores son Gnomo, Orco y Humano; les siguen No-muerto, Elfo de la noche, Trol y los Cielonatos, mientras Enano y Tauren quedan por detrás.","text_en":"For PvE, Night Elf, Human and Gnome are considered among the best races; Orc, Troll and both Skyborne follow, with Dwarf, Undead and Tauren last. In PvP the best are Gnome, Orc and Human; Undead, Night Elf, Troll and Skyborne come next, while Dwarf and Tauren trail.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Racial Rankings: A Tier List for WoW Forever Racial Skills › Racial Rankings","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/racial-tier-list","date":"2026-11-02"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["tierlist:racial-tier-list"],"source_hashes":["section:52cba943dd96342be7218d4ca0e5701d53364733"]},{"id":"raza-humano-clases","chapter":3,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Clases de Humano en Forever","title_en":"Human Classes in Forever","summary_es":"Humano puede ser Cazador, Mago, Paladín, Sacerdote, Pícaro, Brujo y Guerrero.","summary_en":"Human can be Hunter, Mage, Paladin, Priest, Rogue, Warlock and Warrior.","keywords_es":["clases de humano","humano cazador","humano paladín","humano mago","qué clases puede ser humano"],"keywords_en":["human classes","human hunter","human paladin","human mage","what classes can human be"],"text_es":"El Humano de Forever puede elegir entre Cazador, Mago, Paladín, Sacerdote, Pícaro, Brujo y Guerrero. Su conjunto racial sirve tanto para PvE como para JcJ: Crueldad y El espíritu humano aportan daño y recursos, mientras Voluntad de supervivencia y Percepción ayudan a controlar y detectar enemigos.","text_en":"The Forever Human can choose Hunter, Mage, Paladin, Priest, Rogue, Warlock or Warrior. Its racial kit works for both PvE and PvP: Ruthless and The Human Spirit add damage and resources, while Will to Survive and Perception help control and detect enemies.","tags":["HUMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Human Race Guide for WoW Forever › Human Playable Classes","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/human-race-guide","date":"2026-10-27"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["race:human"],"source_hashes":["section:8524b7bb77638cd2258001d168152fafb6885a1a"]},{"id":"raza-humano-raciales","chapter":3,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Raciales de Humano","title_en":"Human Racials","summary_es":"Voluntad de supervivencia, Percepción, Crueldad y El espíritu humano: control, detección, crítico y espíritu.","summary_en":"Will to Survive, Perception, Ruthless and The Human Spirit: control, detection, crit and Spirit.","keywords_es":["raciales de humano","voluntad de supervivencia","percepción","crueldad","el espíritu humano"],"keywords_en":["human racials","will to survive","perception","ruthless","the human spirit"],"text_es":"Voluntad de supervivencia elimina todos los aturdimientos y tiene 3 minutos de reutilización. Percepción aumenta mucho la detección de sigilo durante 20 segundos, también con 3 minutos. Crueldad da un 1% de golpe crítico a todos los ataques y hechizos, y El espíritu humano sube un 10% el espíritu. En Forever el crítico es una estadística única, así que Crueldad sirve a cualquier clase.","text_en":"Will to Survive removes every stun and has a 3-minute cooldown. Perception greatly increases stealth detection for 20 seconds, also on a 3-minute cooldown. Ruthless grants 1% critical strike to all attacks and spells, and The Human Spirit raises Spirit by 10%. In Forever critical strike is one unified stat, so Ruthless helps any class.","tags":["HUMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Human Race Guide for WoW Forever › Human Racials","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/human-race-guide","date":"2026-10-27"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["race:human"],"source_hashes":["section:3008fd7e02b785d2ffbc8b3e4f5358d6e69b4a6e"]},{"id":"raza-humano-historia","chapter":3,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Historia breve del Humano","title_en":"Human Background","summary_es":"Los humanos de Ventormenta reconstruyeron su reino y defienden la Alianza mientras sus ejércitos luchan lejos.","summary_en":"The humans of Stormwind rebuilt their kingdom and defend the Alliance while their armies fight far away.","keywords_es":["historia de los humanos","lore humano","ventormenta","anduin wrynn","reino humano"],"keywords_en":["human lore","human history","stormwind","anduin wrynn","human kingdom"],"text_es":"Ventormenta es uno de los últimos bastiones del poder humano. Su pueblo reconstruyó el reino tras las guerras contra la Horda y la Legión Ardiente, y ahora protege sus tierras mientras los ejércitos combaten en otros frentes. Los humanos son orgullosos y tenaces; los gobierna el rey niño Anduin Wrynn y la defensa de la ciudad queda en manos de sus ciudadanos.","text_en":"Stormwind remains one of humanity's final strongholds. Its people rebuilt the kingdom after the wars against the Horde and the Burning Legion, and now protect their lands while the armies fight elsewhere. Humans are proud and tenacious; the child king Anduin Wrynn rules them and the city's defence falls to its citizens.","tags":["HUMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Human Race Guide for WoW Forever › Lore Information for Human","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/human-race-guide","date":"2026-10-27"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["race:human"],"source_hashes":["section:f2c52e098846e062e64098d50d5621f93687f3b6"]},{"id":"raza-enano-clases","chapter":3,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Clases de Enano en Forever","title_en":"Dwarf Classes in Forever","summary_es":"Enano puede ser Cazador, Paladín, Sacerdote, Pícaro, Chamán y Guerrero.","summary_en":"Dwarf can be Hunter, Paladin, Priest, Rogue, Shaman and Warrior.","keywords_es":["clases de enano","enano chamán","enano paladín","enano cazador","qué clases puede ser enano"],"keywords_en":["dwarf classes","dwarf shaman","dwarf paladin","dwarf hunter","what classes can dwarf be"],"text_es":"El Enano puede ser Cazador, Paladín, Sacerdote, Pícaro, Chamán o Guerrero en Forever. Sus raciales mezclan ataque, defensa y utilidad: Precisión de artesano y Caza mayor mejoran el daño, Petraforma añade supervivencia y Buscar tesoro ayuda a encontrar cofres.","text_en":"The Forever Dwarf can be Hunter, Paladin, Priest, Rogue, Shaman or Warrior. Its racials mix offence, defence and utility: Artisan's Precision and Big Game Hunter improve damage, Stoneform adds survival and Find Treasure helps find chests.","tags":["DWARF"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Dwarf Race Guide for WoW Forever › Dwarf Playable Classes","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/dwarf-race-guide","date":"2026-10-27"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["race:dwarf"],"source_hashes":["section:5e158dccff9a94f229d6bb7dfc74675d6b4e52ee"]},{"id":"raza-enano-raciales","chapter":3,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Raciales de Enano","title_en":"Dwarf Racials","summary_es":"Petraforma, Buscar tesoro, Precisión de artesano y Caza mayor: defensa, botín, golpe y daño contra bestias.","summary_en":"Stoneform, Find Treasure, Artisan's Precision and Big Game Hunter: defence, loot, hit and beast damage.","keywords_es":["raciales de enano","petraforma","buscar tesoro","precisión de artesano","caza mayor"],"keywords_en":["dwarf racials","stoneform","find treasure","artisan's precision","big game hunter"],"text_es":"Petraforma elimina y vuelve inmune a sangrados, venenos y enfermedades durante 8 segundos, además de reducir un 10% el daño físico recibido; tiene 3 minutos de reutilización. Buscar tesoro rastrea cofres cercanos y puede dar objetos extra. Precisión de artesano sube un 1% la probabilidad de golpe con hechizos y ataques. Caza mayor aumenta un 5% el daño contra bestias.","text_en":"Stoneform removes and grants immunity to bleeds, poisons and diseases for 8 seconds, and also reduces Physical damage taken by 10%; it has a 3-minute cooldown. Find Treasure tracks nearby chests and can yield extra items. Artisan's Precision raises spell and attack hit chance by one percent. Big Game Hunter increases damage against Beasts by 5%.","tags":["DWARF"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Dwarf Race Guide for WoW Forever › Dwarf Racials","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/dwarf-race-guide","date":"2026-10-27"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["race:dwarf"],"source_hashes":["section:00c52f86316357289184e17a53e477b1cfc48b32"]},{"id":"raza-enano-historia","chapter":3,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Historia breve del Enano","title_en":"Dwarf Background","summary_es":"Los enanos de Forjaz investigaron ruinas sobre su origen y defienden su reino mientras sus ejércitos luchan fuera.","summary_en":"The dwarves of Ironforge studied ruins about their origin and defend their kingdom while their armies fight abroad.","keywords_es":["historia de los enanos","lore enano","forjaz","magni barbabronce","origen de los enanos"],"keywords_en":["dwarf lore","dwarf history","ironforge","magni bronzebeard","dwarf origin"],"text_es":"Los enanos son obra de los titanes y sufrieron la Maldición de la Carne. Durante generaciones extrajeron tesoros bajo Forjaz; al descubrir ruinas antiguas, el rey Magni Barbabronce impulsó la arqueología para conocer su origen. Con los ejércitos de la Alianza lejos, la defensa de la montaña queda en manos de los enanos que permanecen en Forjaz.","text_en":"Dwarves are titan creations who suffered the Curse of Flesh. For generations they mined treasures beneath Ironforge; after uncovering ancient ruins, King Magni Bronzebeard pushed archaeology to learn their origin. With the Alliance armies away, the defence of the mountain falls to the dwarves who remain in Ironforge.","tags":["DWARF"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Dwarf Race Guide for WoW Forever › Lore Information for Dwarf","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/dwarf-race-guide","date":"2026-10-27"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["race:dwarf"],"source_hashes":["section:c301631f15c61db4072741d41c89ab97f0de6641"]},{"id":"raza-elfo-noche-clases","chapter":3,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Clases de Elfo de la noche en Forever","title_en":"Night Elf Classes in Forever","summary_es":"Elfo de la noche puede ser Druida, Cazador, Sacerdote, Pícaro y Guerrero; es la única raza de la Alianza con Druida.","summary_en":"Night Elf can be Druid, Hunter, Priest, Rogue and Warrior; it is the only Alliance race with Druid.","keywords_es":["clases de elfo de la noche","elfo de la noche druida","elfo de la noche cazador","elfo de la noche sacerdote","qué clases puede ser elfo de la noche"],"keywords_en":["night elf classes","night elf druid","night elf hunter","night elf priest","what classes can night elf be"],"text_es":"El Elfo de la noche puede ser Druida, Cazador, Sacerdote, Pícaro o Guerrero en Forever. Es la única raza de la Alianza que puede ser Druida. Sus raciales se centran en crítico, movilidad, esquiva y sigilo, y son útiles para daño, JcJ y desplazamiento.","text_en":"The Forever Night Elf can be Druid, Hunter, Priest, Rogue or Warrior. It is the only Alliance race that can be a Druid. Its racials focus on crit, mobility, dodge and stealth, and are useful for damage, PvP and movement.","tags":["NIGHTELF"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Night Elf Race Guide for WoW Forever › Night Elf Playable Classes","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/night-elf-race-guide","date":"2026-10-18"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["race:night-elf"],"source_hashes":["section:452c5e3ceb282228f55cec1963e15c846d53a2ce"]},{"id":"raza-elfo-noche-raciales","chapter":3,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Raciales de Elfo de la noche","title_en":"Night Elf Racials","summary_es":"Luz de Elune, Fusión de las Sombras, Prontitud y Espíritu de fuego fatuo: crítico, sigilo, movimiento y muerte.","summary_en":"Elune's Light, Shadowmeld, Quickness and Wisp Spirit: crit, stealth, movement and death.","keywords_es":["raciales de elfo de la noche","luz de elune","fusión de las sombras","prontitud","espíritu de fuego fatuo"],"keywords_en":["night elf racials","elune's light","shadowmeld","quickness","wisp spirit"],"text_es":"Luz de Elune da un 10% de golpe crítico con hechizos y ataques durante 15 segundos, con 3 minutos de reutilización. Fusión de las Sombras da sigilo hasta que te mueves y puede usarse en combate, pero no permite abrir con Pícaro o Druida. Prontitud da un 1% de esquiva y un 2% de velocidad; la velocidad se acumula con otros aumentos. Espíritu de fuego fatuo sube un 75% la velocidad mientras estás muerto.","text_en":"Elune's Light grants 10% critical strike with spells and attacks for 15 seconds, on a 3-minute cooldown. Shadowmeld grants stealth until you move and can be used in combat, but it does not enable Rogue or Druid openers. Quickness gives 1% dodge and 2% movement speed; the speed stacks with other increases. Wisp Spirit raises movement speed by 75% while dead.","tags":["NIGHTELF"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Night Elf Race Guide for WoW Forever › Night Elf Racials","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/night-elf-race-guide","date":"2026-10-18"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["race:night-elf"],"source_hashes":["section:fab8129825996083246e05a2cef4e07f637e649f"]},{"id":"raza-elfo-noche-historia","chapter":3,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Historia breve del Elfo de la noche","title_en":"Night Elf Background","summary_es":"Los elfos de la noche perdieron la inmortalidad, plantaron Teldrassil y defienden Darnassus de la corrupción.","summary_en":"The night elves lost immortality, planted Teldrassil and defend Darnassus from corruption.","keywords_es":["historia de los elfos de la noche","lore elfo de la noche","teldrassil","darnassus","pozo de la eternidad"],"keywords_en":["night elf lore","night elf history","teldrassil","darnassus","well of eternity"],"text_es":"Tras la destrucción del Pozo de la Eternidad, los elfos de la noche se volcaron en el druidismo. La invasión de la Legión Ardiente les costó la inmortalidad y quemó parte de sus bosques. Para recuperarla, unos druidas plantaron Teldrassil y fundaron Darnassus, pero el árbol no recibió la bendición de la naturaleza y empezó a corromperse. Darnassus y la naturaleza están bajo amenaza.","text_en":"When the Well of Eternity was destroyed, the night elves turned to druidism. The Burning Legion's invasion cost them immortality and burned part of their forests. To regain it, some druids planted Teldrassil and founded Darnassus, but the tree lacked nature's blessing and began to corrupt. Darnassus and the wild are under threat.","tags":["NIGHTELF"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Night Elf Race Guide for WoW Forever › Lore Information for Night Elf","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/night-elf-race-guide","date":"2026-10-18"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["race:night-elf"],"source_hashes":["section:0614b5d69e0b2ad9e58768fb80817f3186f809eb"]},{"id":"raza-gnomo-clases","chapter":3,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Clases de Gnomo en Forever","title_en":"Gnome Classes in Forever","summary_es":"Gnomo puede ser Mago, Sacerdote, Pícaro, Brujo y Guerrero.","summary_en":"Gnome can be Mage, Priest, Rogue, Warlock and Warrior.","keywords_es":["clases de gnomo","gnomo sacerdote","gnomo mago","gnomo brujo","qué clases puede ser gnomo"],"keywords_en":["gnome classes","gnome priest","gnome mage","gnome warlock","what classes can gnome be"],"text_es":"El Gnomo puede ser Mago, Sacerdote, Pícaro, Brujo o Guerrero en Forever. Sus raciales se centran en recursos, ráfaga, movilidad e Ingeniería: Mente expansiva, ¡Eureka!, Artista del escape y Especialización de ingeniería.","text_en":"The Forever Gnome can be Mage, Priest, Rogue, Warlock or Warrior. Its racials focus on resources, burst, mobility and Engineering: Expansive Mind, Eureka!, Escape Artist and Engineering Specialization.","tags":["GNOME"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Gnome Race Guide for WoW Forever › Gnome Playable Classes","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/gnome-race-guide","date":"2026-10-18"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["race:gnome"],"source_hashes":["section:6e110282917cf7d9acad37ccbd3e4ede7870bde6"]},{"id":"raza-gnomo-raciales","chapter":3,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Raciales de Gnomo","title_en":"Gnome Racials","summary_es":"Artista del escape, ¡Eureka!, Especialización de ingeniería y Mente expansiva: movilidad, ráfaga, ingeniería y recursos.","summary_en":"Escape Artist, Eureka!, Engineering Specialization and Expansive Mind: mobility, burst, engineering and resources.","keywords_es":["raciales de gnomo","artista del escape","eureka","especialización de ingeniería","mente expansiva"],"keywords_en":["gnome racials","escape artist","eureka","engineering specialization","expansive mind"],"text_es":"Artista del escape rompe raíces y ralentizaciones y da una inmunidad breve a esos efectos. ¡Eureka! reduce un 10% el coste de habilidades no periódicas y aumenta un 10% su daño o curación durante 8 segundos, con 2 minutos de reutilización. Especialización de ingeniería reduce un 20% las probabilidades de que los aparatos de Ingeniería fallen o se vuelvan en contra. Mente expansiva sube un 5% el maná, la ira o la energía máximos.","text_en":"Escape Artist breaks roots and snares and grants brief immunity to them. Eureka! lowers the cost of non-periodic abilities by 10% and raises their damage or healing by 10% for 8 seconds, on a 2-minute cooldown. Engineering Specialization cuts the failure or backfire chance of Engineering gadgets by a fifth. Expansive Mind raises maximum Mana, Rage or Energy by 5%.","tags":["GNOME"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Gnome Race Guide for WoW Forever › Gnome Racials","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/gnome-race-guide","date":"2026-10-18"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: WoW Forever Racial Guide › Alliance Race Racial Abilities","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/race-guide","date":"2026-10-27"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["race:gnome","race:race-guide"],"source_hashes":["section:dbf8e47c4dd91013dbf90f5a2dd0fcec04dda184","section:e923fc85be62b80491a763389817c25f1652ee59"]},{"id":"raza-gnomo-historia","chapter":3,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Historia breve del Gnomo","title_en":"Gnome Background","summary_es":"Los gnomos perdieron Gnomeregan ante una amenaza subterránea y se refugiaron en Forjaz con los enanos.","summary_en":"The gnomes lost Gnomeregan to an underground threat and took refuge in Ironforge with the dwarves.","keywords_es":["historia de los gnomos","lore gnomo","gnomeregan","forjaz","refugiados gnomos"],"keywords_en":["gnome lore","gnome history","gnomeregan","ironforge","gnome refugees"],"text_es":"Los gnomos destacan por su ingenio técnico. Vivían en Gnomeregan y compartían Dun Morogh con sus primos enanos hasta que una amenaza surgida del subsuelo invadió la ciudad. Los supervivientes se refugiaron en Forjaz y desde allí planean recuperarla.","text_en":"Gnomes stand out for their technical ingenuity. They lived in Gnomeregan and shared Dun Morogh with their dwarf cousins until a threat from below invaded the city. The survivors took refuge in Ironforge and plan to retake it from there.","tags":["GNOME"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Gnome Race Guide for WoW Forever › Lore Information for Gnome","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/gnome-race-guide","date":"2026-10-18"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["race:gnome"],"source_hashes":["section:27289477c74268eb4cd40c5ef53ff64d8e9bc8da"]},{"id":"raza-orco-clases","chapter":3,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Clases de Orco en Forever","title_en":"Orc Classes in Forever","summary_es":"Orco puede ser Cazador, Mago, Pícaro, Chamán, Brujo y Guerrero.","summary_en":"Orc can be Hunter, Mage, Rogue, Shaman, Warlock and Warrior.","keywords_es":["clases de orco","orco mago","orco chamán","orco brujo","qué clases puede ser orco"],"keywords_en":["orc classes","orc mage","orc shaman","orc warlock","what classes can orc be"],"text_es":"El Orco puede ser Cazador, Mago, Pícaro, Chamán, Brujo o Guerrero en Forever. Sus raciales mezclan ataque y defensa: Furia sangrienta y Ordenar mejoran el daño, Trizar maldición añade protección y Firmeza reduce los aturdimientos.","text_en":"The Forever Orc can be Hunter, Mage, Rogue, Shaman, Warlock or Warrior. Its racials mix offence and defence: Blood Fury and Command improve damage, Shatter Curse adds protection and Hardiness shortens stuns.","tags":["ORC"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Orc Race Guide for WoW Forever › Orc Playable Classes","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/orc-race-guide","date":"2026-10-27"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["race:orc"],"source_hashes":["section:a6771904885b9fe3b452d35f7741188a87aa14e5"]},{"id":"raza-orco-raciales","chapter":3,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Raciales de Orco","title_en":"Orc Racials","summary_es":"Furia sangrienta, Trizar maldición, Ordenar y Firmeza: daño, defensa, mascotas y aturdimientos.","summary_en":"Blood Fury, Shatter Curse, Command and Hardiness: damage, defence, pets and stuns.","keywords_es":["raciales de orco","furia sangrienta","trizar maldición","ordenar","firmeza"],"keywords_en":["orc racials","blood fury","shatter curse","command","hardiness"],"text_es":"Furia sangrienta aumenta un 10% el poder de ataque y el poder con hechizos durante 15 segundos. Trizar maldición elimina maldiciones y azotes y reduce un 5% el daño mágico recibido durante 8 segundos. Ordenar aumenta un 5% el daño de las mascotas de Brujo y de las de cualquier otra clase con mascota. Firmeza reduce un 20% la duración de los aturdimientos.","text_en":"For 15 seconds, Blood Fury adds 10% to both Attack Power and Spell Power. Shatter Curse clears curses and banes, then cuts the Magic damage you take by 5% for eight seconds. Command increases pet damage for Warlocks and any other pet class by 5%. Hardiness reduces stun duration by 20%.","tags":["ORC"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Orc Race Guide for WoW Forever › Orc Racials","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/orc-race-guide","date":"2026-10-27"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["race:orc"],"source_hashes":["section:5177cf2497d9cb77a351833263ff4bb6446718e5"]},{"id":"raza-orco-historia","chapter":3,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Historia breve del Orco","title_en":"Orc Background","summary_es":"Los orcos llegaron a Azeroth corrompidos por la Legión; Thrall los liberó y fundó su reino en Durotar.","summary_en":"The orcs came to Azeroth corrupted by the Legion; Thrall freed them and founded their kingdom in Durotar.","keywords_es":["historia de los orcos","lore orco","thrall","durotar","orgrimmar"],"keywords_en":["orc lore","orc history","thrall","durotar","orgrimmar"],"text_es":"La Legión Ardiente corrompió a los orcos y los llevó a Azeroth, donde guerrearon contra los reinos humanos. Tras la derrota de la Horda, Thrall lideró a su pueblo para liberarse de la corrupción demoníaca y recuperar el chamanismo. Después de años de nomadismo fundaron Durotar, con Orgrimmar como ciudad principal. Los agentes de la Legión siguen en la tierra y amenazan el reino.","text_en":"The Burning Legion corrupted the orcs and brought them to Azeroth, where they warred on the human kingdoms. After the Horde's defeat, Thrall led his people to break free of demonic corruption and recover shamanism. After years of wandering they founded Durotar, with Orgrimmar as its main city. The Legion's agents still wander the land and threaten the kingdom.","tags":["ORC"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Orc Race Guide for WoW Forever › Lore Information for Orc","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/orc-race-guide","date":"2026-10-27"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["race:orc"],"source_hashes":["section:62297477f24fbb0a35aa94640fbe9e75e77610bd"]},{"id":"raza-no-muerto-clases","chapter":3,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Clases de No-muerto en Forever","title_en":"Undead Classes in Forever","summary_es":"No-muerto puede ser Mago, Paladín, Sacerdote, Pícaro, Brujo y Guerrero.","summary_en":"Undead can be Mage, Paladin, Priest, Rogue, Warlock and Warrior.","keywords_es":["clases de no-muerto","no-muerto paladín","no-muerto mago","no-muerto sacerdote","qué clases puede ser no-muerto"],"keywords_en":["undead classes","undead paladin","undead mage","undead priest","what classes can undead be"],"text_es":"El No-muerto puede ser Mago, Paladín, Sacerdote, Pícaro, Brujo o Guerrero en Forever. Es una raza centrada en JcJ por su mezcla de sustento, utilidad y resistencia al control; Voluntad de los Renegados, Canibalizar y Toque de la tumba son sus herramientas más características.","text_en":"The Forever Undead can be Mage, Paladin, Priest, Rogue, Warlock or Warrior. It is a PvP-focused race thanks to its blend of healing, utility and resistance to control; Will of the Forsaken, Cannibalize and Touch of the Grave are its signature tools.","tags":["SCOURGE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Undead Race Guide for WoW Forever › Undead Playable Classes","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/undead-race-guide","date":"2026-10-27"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["race:undead"],"source_hashes":["section:055ed1bfa42c3c5f124266e15c3c21448eb42070"]},{"id":"raza-no-muerto-raciales","chapter":3,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Raciales de No-muerto","title_en":"Undead Racials","summary_es":"Voluntad de los Renegados, Canibalizar, Respiración subacuática y Toque de la tumba: control, sustento y drenaje.","summary_en":"Will of the Forsaken, Cannibalize, Underwater Breathing and Touch of the Grave: control, sustain and drain.","keywords_es":["raciales de no-muerto","voluntad de los renegados","canibalizar","respiración subacuática","toque de la tumba"],"keywords_en":["undead racials","will of the forsaken","cannibalize","underwater breathing","touch of the grave"],"text_es":"Voluntad de los Renegados elimina encantamientos, miedo y sueño, pero ya no concede inmunidad. Canibalizar consume un cadáver humanoide o no-muerto cercano y restaura un 7% de salud y maná cada 2 segundos durante 10 segundos, hasta un 35%. Respiración subacuática permite aguantar bajo el agua un 300% más. Toque de la tumba da a hechizos y ataques una probabilidad de drenar salud, con 20% para cuerpo a cuerpo y 30% para lanzadores, y 15 segundos de reutilización.","text_en":"Will of the Forsaken removes charm, fear and sleep, but no longer grants immunity. Cannibalize consumes a nearby humanoid or undead corpse and restores 7% Health and Mana every 2 seconds for 10 seconds, up to 35%. Underwater Breathing lets you stay underwater 300% longer. Touch of the Grave lets spells and attacks sometimes steal health, with 20% for melee and 30% for casters, on a 15-second cooldown.","tags":["SCOURGE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Undead Race Guide for WoW Forever › Undead Racials","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/undead-race-guide","date":"2026-10-27"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["race:undead"],"source_hashes":["section:c1c84c696afda9794896eebfe6141f45560de686"]},{"id":"raza-no-muerto-historia","chapter":3,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Historia breve del No-muerto","title_en":"Undead Background","summary_es":"Los Renegados se liberaron del Rey Exánime y, bajo Sylvanas, construyeron Entrañas y se aliaron con la Horda.","summary_en":"The Forsaken broke free of the Lich King and, under Sylvanas, built the Undercity and joined the Horde.","keywords_es":["historia de los no-muertos","lore no-muerto","renegados","entrañas","sylvanas"],"keywords_en":["undead lore","undead history","forsaken","undercity","sylvanas"],"text_es":"Los no-muertos jugables son Renegados que rompieron el control del Rey Exánime. Bajo Sylvanas, se establecieron en una fortaleza subterránea bajo las ruinas de Lordaeron, la ciudad de Entrañas. Allí resisten tanto a la Plaga como a quienes los cazan, y se han aliado con la Horda por conveniencia. Sylvanas es su reina banshee.","text_en":"The playable Undead are Forsaken who broke the Lich King's control. Under Sylvanas, they settled in a subterranean stronghold beneath the ruins of Lordaeron, the Undercity. There they resist both the Scourge and those who hunt them, and they have joined the Horde out of convenience. Sylvanas is their banshee queen.","tags":["SCOURGE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Undead Race Guide for WoW Forever › Lore Information for Undead","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/undead-race-guide","date":"2026-10-27"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["race:undead"],"source_hashes":["section:6f29532a2377394250bb8bc5dd0d001a0e595b36"]},{"id":"raza-tauren-clases","chapter":3,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Clases de Tauren en Forever","title_en":"Tauren Classes in Forever","summary_es":"Tauren puede ser Druida, Cazador, Chamán y Guerrero.","summary_en":"Tauren can be Druid, Hunter, Shaman and Warrior.","keywords_es":["clases de tauren","tauren druida","tauren chamán","tauren cazador","qué clases puede ser tauren"],"keywords_en":["tauren classes","tauren druid","tauren shaman","tauren hunter","what classes can tauren be"],"text_es":"El Tauren puede ser Druida, Cazador, Chamán o Guerrero en Forever. Sus raciales encajan con tanques, JcJ y recolección: Pisotón de guerra aporta control, Robustez sube la salud, Correr planicies mejora el desplazamiento y Cultivo genera un nodo extra de Herboristería.","text_en":"The Forever Tauren can be Druid, Hunter, Shaman or Warrior. Its racials suit tanks, PvP and gathering: War Stomp adds control, Endurance raises health, Plainsrunning improves travel and Cultivation creates an extra Herbalism node.","tags":["TAUREN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Tauren Race Guide for WoW Forever › Tauren Playable Classes","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/tauren-race-guide","date":"2026-10-27"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["race:tauren"],"source_hashes":["section:deefbacf91065fb8774a23ff1ad88314cfec3e3d"]},{"id":"raza-tauren-raciales","chapter":3,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Raciales de Tauren","title_en":"Tauren Racials","summary_es":"Pisotón de guerra, Cultivo, Correr planicies y Robustez: aturdir, hierbas, velocidad y salud.","summary_en":"War Stomp, Cultivation, Plainsrunning and Endurance: stun, herbs, speed and health.","keywords_es":["raciales de tauren","pisotón de guerra","cultivo","correr planicies","robustez"],"keywords_en":["tauren racials","war stomp","cultivation","plainsrunning","endurance"],"text_es":"Pisotón de guerra aturde hasta 5 enemigos en 8 metros durante 2 segundos y tiene un lanzamiento de 0,5 segundos. Cultivo hace crecer un nodo extra de Herboristería que no exige la profesión y tiene 15 minutos de reutilización. Correr planicies acelera progresivamente hasta un 60% mientras sigues moviéndote, pero pierde las acumulaciones al parar o recibir daño. Robustez aumenta un 5% la salud total.","text_en":"War Stomp stuns as many as five enemies within eight yards for two seconds and has a 0.5-second cast. Cultivation grows an extra Herbalism node that does not require the profession and has a 15-minute cooldown. Plainsrunning builds up to 60% movement speed while you keep moving, but loses its stacks when you stop or take damage. Endurance increases total Health by 5%.","tags":["TAUREN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Tauren Race Guide for WoW Forever › Tauren Racials","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/tauren-race-guide","date":"2026-10-27"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["race:tauren"],"source_hashes":["section:79a28a8e9a7f0a3ec6582402647d7f64fb05b1dc"]},{"id":"raza-tauren-historia","chapter":3,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Historia breve del Tauren","title_en":"Tauren Background","summary_es":"Los tauren unieron sus tribus tras vencer a los centauros con ayuda de los orcos y fundaron Cima del Trueno.","summary_en":"The tauren united their tribes after beating the centaur with orc help and founded Thunder Bluff.","keywords_es":["historia de los tauren","lore tauren","cima del trueno","mulgore","cairne bloodhoof"],"keywords_en":["tauren lore","tauren history","thunder bluff","mulgore","cairne bloodhoof"],"text_es":"Los tauren eran nómadas que recorrían Los Baldíos y cazaban kodos. La amenaza de los centauros los mantenía divididos hasta que Cairne Pezuña de Sangre pidió ayuda a los orcos; juntos rechazaron a los centauros y tomaron Mulgore. Cairne construyó Cima del Trueno y las tribus se unieron bajo un mismo estandarte. La Gran Caza sigue siendo el centro de su cultura espiritual.","text_en":"The tauren were nomads who roamed the Barrens and hunted kodo. The centaur threat kept them divided until Cairne Bloodhoof asked the orcs for help; together they pushed the centaur back and claimed Mulgore. Cairne built Thunder Bluff and the tribes united under one banner. The Great Hunt remains the heart of their spiritual culture.","tags":["TAUREN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Tauren Race Guide for WoW Forever › Lore Information for Skyborne","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/tauren-race-guide","date":"2026-10-27"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["race:tauren"],"source_hashes":["section:7cd33755e39bbbbf55772a59fe3d061457cf135a"]},{"id":"raza-trol-clases","chapter":3,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Clases de Trol en Forever","title_en":"Troll Classes in Forever","summary_es":"Trol puede ser Cazador, Mago, Sacerdote, Pícaro, Chamán, Brujo y Guerrero.","summary_en":"Troll can be Hunter, Mage, Priest, Rogue, Shaman, Warlock and Warrior.","keywords_es":["clases de trol","trol brujo","trol mago","trol chamán","qué clases puede ser trol"],"keywords_en":["troll classes","troll warlock","troll mage","troll shaman","what classes can troll be"],"text_es":"El Trol puede ser Cazador, Mago, Sacerdote, Pícaro, Chamán, Brujo o Guerrero en Forever. Es una buena opción de lanzador por la celeridad de Iracundia y por su sustento con Regeneración rápida y Regeneración.","text_en":"The Forever Troll can be Hunter, Mage, Priest, Rogue, Shaman, Warlock or Warrior. It is a strong caster option thanks to Berserking's haste and solid sustain from Rapid Regeneration and Regeneration.","tags":["TROLL"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Troll Race Guide for WoW Forever › Troll Playable Classes","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/troll-race-guide","date":"2026-10-27"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["race:troll"],"source_hashes":["section:ca22870f2f31e67b44e57dd947c6efb44a00c16f"]},{"id":"raza-trol-raciales","chapter":3,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Raciales de Trol","title_en":"Troll Racials","summary_es":"Iracundia, Regeneración rápida, Matanza de bestias y Regeneración: celeridad, curación y daño contra bestias.","summary_en":"Berserking, Rapid Regeneration, Beast Slaying and Regeneration: haste, healing and beast damage.","keywords_es":["raciales de trol","iracundia","regeneración rápida","matanza de bestias","regeneración"],"keywords_en":["troll racials","berserking","rapid regeneration","beast slaying","regeneration"],"text_es":"Iracundia aumenta un 10% la velocidad de ataque y de lanzamiento durante 15 segundos. Regeneración rápida restaura un 50% de la salud máxima en 6 segundos; el canal se corta al moverse, actuar o recibir daño. Matanza de bestias aumenta un 5% el daño contra bestias. Regeneración sube un 20% la regeneración de salud y permite que un 20% siga activa en combate.","text_en":"For 15 seconds, Berserking adds 10% to attack and casting speed. Rapid Regeneration returns half your maximum Health across 6 seconds; the channel breaks if you move, act or take damage. Beast Slaying increases damage against Beasts by 5%. Regeneration raises Health regeneration by 20% and lets 20% of it continue in combat.","tags":["TROLL"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Troll Race Guide for WoW Forever › Troll Racials","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/troll-race-guide","date":"2026-10-27"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["race:troll"],"source_hashes":["section:42010b7c5fba7767524f53168b9f7d4b0915a688"]},{"id":"raza-trol-historia","chapter":3,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Historia breve del Trol","title_en":"Troll Background","summary_es":"Los Lanza Negra sobrevivieron a los murlocs gracias a Thrall y se unieron a la Horda en Durotar.","summary_en":"The Darkspear survived the murlocs thanks to Thrall and joined the Horde in Durotar.","keywords_es":["historia de los trols","lore trol","lanza negra","vol'jin","durotar"],"keywords_en":["troll lore","troll history","darkspear","vol'jin","durotar"],"text_es":"Los trols Lanza Negra pertenecen a una tribu exiliada de la Vega de Tuercespina. A punto de ser destruidos por los murlocs, fueron salvados por Thrall y sus guerreros, y juraron lealtad a la Horda. Bajo Vol'jin se establecieron en Durotar junto a los orcos. La tribu busca recuperar su gloria.","text_en":"The Darkspear trolls belong to a tribe exiled from Stranglethorn Vale. On the brink of destruction by murlocs, they were saved by Thrall and his warriors, and swore loyalty to the Horde. Under Vol'jin they settled in Durotar beside the orcs. The tribe seeks to restore its glory.","tags":["TROLL"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Troll Race Guide for WoW Forever › Lore Information for Troll","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/troll-race-guide","date":"2026-10-27"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["race:troll"],"source_hashes":["section:5a756e28edb67f3df8e3588341922e4295754f1e"]},{"id":"raza-cielonato-facciones-clases","chapter":3,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Cielonatos: facciones y clases","title_en":"Skyborne: Factions and Classes","summary_es":"Cada bando tiene cinco clases: cuatro compartidas; Mago es exclusivo de la Alianza y Chamán, de la Horda.","summary_en":"Each faction has five classes: four shared; Mage is Alliance-only and Shaman is Horde-only.","keywords_es":["cielonato alianza u horda","clases de cielonato","clases de cielonato alianza","cielonato mago","cielonato chamán","zona de inicio cielonato"],"keywords_en":["skyborne alliance or horde","skyborne classes","skyborne mage","skyborne shaman","skyborne starting area"],"text_es":"Al crear un Cielonato puedes elegir Alianza u Horda; cada bando dispone de cinco clases. Druida, Cazador, Pícaro y Guerrero están disponibles en ambos; Mago solo en la Alianza y Chamán solo en la Horda. La raza también cuenta con una zona de inicio propia.","text_en":"When creating a Skyborne, you can choose Alliance or Horde; each faction has five available classes. Druid, Hunter, Rogue and Warrior are available to both; Mage is Alliance-only and Shaman is Horde-only. The race also has its own starting area.","tags":["SKYBORNE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Skyborne Race Overview: Racials and Customization - WoW: Forever › (intro)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/skyborne-race-overview","date":"2026-10-27"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Skyborne Race Overview: Racials and Customization - WoW: Forever › Classes Available to Skyborne in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/skyborne-race-overview","date":"2026-10-27"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Everything You Need to Know About The Skyborne in World of Warcraft: Forever › How to Unlock the Skyborne","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/skyborne","date":"2026-10-27"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["race:skyborne"],"source_hashes":["guide:9bd0733156e5714f99eab93c856844ce9a4c0689","section:9a0beec5d4e7fba165f6173b2eddf4c25f3f1c00","section:abf72f5d99a981d89bdd948d05b8fcf2ea3f88e7"]},{"id":"raza-cielonato-raciales","chapter":3,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Raciales de Cielonato","title_en":"Skyborne Racials","summary_es":"Caminar sobre el aire, Bendición del viento y Perspicacia elemental; la cuarta racial cambia según el bando.","summary_en":"Walk on Air, Wind Blessed and Elemental Insight; the fourth racial changes with the faction.","keywords_es":["raciales de cielonato","caminar sobre el aire","bendición del viento","perspicacia elemental","visión cielonata"],"keywords_en":["skyborne racials","walk on air","wind blessed","elemental insight","skysight"],"text_es":"Caminar sobre el aire permite planear 10 s controlando la dirección (recarga: 1,5 min); Bendición del viento da +2% de celeridad y Perspicacia elemental, +5% de daño a elementales. Read Leyline (Alianza) aumenta un 50% la regeneración de salud y el efecto Regeneración de maná durante 15 s; en una línea ley, la bonificación llega al 100% durante 1 h. Visión cielonata (Horda) da +15% de velocidad durante 15 s, o +30% en una convergencia elemental. Las mejoras duran 1 h, persisten tras morir y se eliminan al entrar en banda; Read Leyline no funciona con Enervar activo.","text_en":"Three abilities are shared: Walk on Air gives a steerable 10-second glide (1.5-minute cooldown); Wind Blessed grants 2% Haste and Elemental Insight, 5% damage to Elementals. Read Leyline gives Alliance characters 15 seconds of 50%-stronger Health and Mana regeneration; at a ley line, it grants a 100% bonus for 1 hour. Skysight grants Horde characters 15% movement speed for 15 seconds, or 30% at an elemental convergence. The enhanced effects last 1 hour, persist through death, and end on entering a raid; Read Leyline cannot be used during Innervate.","tags":["SKYBORNE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: All Racials and Available Class-Race Combinations in World of Warcraft: Forever › Neutral Racials in WoW: Forever > Windshaper Skyborne ( Horde)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/new-race-class-combinations","date":"2026-11-05"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: All Racials and Available Class-Race Combinations in World of Warcraft: Forever › Neutral Racials in WoW: Forever > High Order Skyborne ( Alliance)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/new-race-class-combinations","date":"2026-11-05"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Skyborne Race Guide for WoW Forever › Skyborne Racials > High Order Skyborne (Alliance)","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/skyborne-race-guide","date":"2026-10-27"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:new-race-class-combinations","race:skyborne"],"source_hashes":["guide:0980c9a2fea7f3d4b14abfb5dd6eefc34f7be936","guide:1a364a0a3e7e8f3a5c1336cfc3e5e4ce6ce58767"]},{"id":"raza-cielonato-historia","chapter":3,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Historia breve del Cielonato","title_en":"Skyborne Background","summary_es":"Los rebeldes escaparon de su hogar con ayuda elemental; hoy tres corrientes disputan el futuro de su isla.","summary_en":"Rebels escaped their home with elemental aid; three factions now vie for their island's future.","keywords_es":["historia de los cielonatos","lore cielonato","shen'dralar","eldre'thalas","pozo de la eternidad","elementales primordiales","facciones de cielonatos"],"keywords_en":["skyborne lore","skyborne history","shen'dralar","eldre'thalas","well of eternity","primordial elementals","skyborne factions"],"text_es":"Los Shen'dralar de Eldre'Thalas perdieron la energía del Pozo de la Eternidad; el príncipe Tortheldrin planeó invocar un demonio. Sus opositores huyeron al oeste tras un asalto que desató la magia. Pactaron con elementales primordiales, que alzaron una isla y la anclaron en el plano del aire; tras miles de años cambiaron físicamente. Al desaparecer los elementales, el refugio empezó a fallar. Dos corrientes bajaron a Azeroth: una busca autonomía arcana y otra restaurar el vínculo con los espíritus del viento; una tercera venera a Al'Akir y disputa la isla.","text_en":"In Eldre'Thalas, Shen'dralar suffered after the Well of Eternity was destroyed. Prince Tortheldrin planned to summon a demon; opponents fled west after a raid unleashed uncontrolled magic. They bargained with primordial elementals, who raised an island and anchored it in the plane of air; after thousands of years, their bodies changed. When the elementals vanished, the haven began to falter. Two factions descended into Azeroth: one seeks arcane self-reliance, the other wants to restore its bond with the wind spirits; a third worships Al'Akir, the Windlord, and vies for the isle.","tags":["SKYBORNE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Everything You Need to Know About The Skyborne in World of Warcraft: Forever › Rebellion and Fleeing Eldre'Thalas","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/skyborne","date":"2026-10-27"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Everything You Need to Know About The Skyborne in World of Warcraft: Forever › The Discovery of Skywall and the Founding of Zephras Isle","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/skyborne","date":"2026-10-27"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Everything You Need to Know About The Skyborne in World of Warcraft: Forever › Reemergence into Azeroth","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/skyborne","date":"2026-10-27"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["race:skyborne"],"source_hashes":["section:2f6f440182d1c11d4d5be2fb0581745780845888","section:581b0672fd99e3d6ad4f14a8a164cadc230028cf","section:90343dfa50c713264226de7913dadb2034a757cf"]}]},"04-clase-druid.json":{"description":"Capítulo 4: Clases. Druida. Secciones editoriales redactadas desde guías de terceros.","sections":[{"id":"clase-druid-que-hace","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Qué hace un Druida","title_en":"What a Druid Does","summary_es":"Qué hace el Druida y por qué puede cubrir distintas funciones del grupo.","summary_en":"What Druids do and why they can fill different group roles.","keywords_es":["funciones del druida","magia natural druida","formas del druida","roles druida grupo"],"keywords_en":["druid roles","druid nature magic","druid forms","druid group roles"],"text_es":"El Druida combina magia de la naturaleza con formas que adaptan sus capacidades: puede atacar, curar, resistir o desplazarse. Equilibrio lucha a distancia, Combate feral puede tanquear o infligir daño cuerpo a cuerpo, y Recuperación sana. Sus formas incluyen Forma de oso, Forma felina, Forma de lechúcico lunar, Forma de viaje y Forma acuática; según la especialización, puede cubrir cualquiera de las cuatro funciones del grupo.","text_en":"Druid combines nature magic with forms that adapt its abilities: it can attack, heal, endure hits, or travel. Balance fights at range, Feral can tank or deal melee damage, and Restoration heals. Its forms include Bear Form, Cat Form, Moonkin Form, Travel Form, and Aquatic Form; depending on specialization, it can fill any of the group’s four roles.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Druid Class Guide › Comprehensive Guide to Druid in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/druid-class-overview","date":"2026-10-27"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Druid Shapeshift Forms Guide › Druid Shapeshifts","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/druid-shapeshift-forms","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Balance Druid Guide › Balance Druid Guide for World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/balance-druid-ranged-dps-pve-guide","date":"2026-11-09"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:balance:overview","class:druid:general:druid-class-overview","class:druid:general:druid-shapeshift-forms"],"source_hashes":["section:5c32918820f271ad14a658515fde08fc4278bc1b","section:cb74403afcf67f32f4f298306119266186983090","section:cdaf54ed3dcf2b9fb3a75bc2bb2a0ef7cbfbe262"]},{"id":"clase-druid-especializaciones","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Especializaciones del Druida","title_en":"Druid Specializations","summary_es":"Compara las funciones de Equilibrio, Combate feral y Recuperación.","summary_en":"Compare the roles of Balance, Feral, and Restoration.","keywords_es":["especializaciones druida","equilibrio feral restauración","feral tanque y dps","sanación en el tiempo druida"],"keywords_en":["druid specializations","balance feral restoration","feral tank and dps","druid healing over time"],"text_es":"Equilibrio inflige daño a distancia. Combate feral usa Forma de oso para tanquear y Forma felina para hacer DPS; es la única especialización que puede cumplir ambos papeles con una misma build. Recuperación sana principalmente mediante efectos de sanación en el tiempo.","text_en":"Balance deals ranged damage. Feral uses Bear Form to tank and Cat Form for melee DPS; it is the only specialization that can fill both roles with one build. Restoration mainly heals with heal-over-time effects.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Balance Druid DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Balance Druid Specific Systems in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/balance/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Feral Druid Guide › Feral Druid Guide for World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/feral-druid-melee-dps-and-tank-pve-guide","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Druid Healer Guide - WoW: Forever › Restoration Druid for New Players in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/restoration/overview-pve-healer","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:balance:overview","class:druid:feral:overview","class:druid:restoration:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:0de996b28e4b32f86663d40dc1948fa78977512b","section:86b0aca6fe1b57f09cddd4d2c66ddfe1f574d9ff","section:d41bf9758eed0209a6a373fd5802d60529e8cf15"]},{"id":"clase-druid-cambios-forever","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Qué cambia en Forever para el Druida","title_en":"What Changes for Druid in Forever","summary_es":"Cambios de formas, talentos y herramientas de las tres especializaciones.","summary_en":"Changes to forms, talents, and tools across all three specializations.","keywords_es":["cambios druida forever","poder cambiante druida","crecimiento salvaje forever","consumibles en forma"],"keywords_en":["druid changes forever","shifting power druid","wild growth forever","shapeshift consumables"],"text_es":"En Forever, dentro de Forma de oso o Forma felina puedes consumir objetos, abrir cofres, recoger objetos de misión y hablar con PNJ. Debes cambiar de forma para recolectar con Minería o Pesca, usar algunos pergaminos como Pergamino de Protección y ciertos objetos de Ingeniería. Los ataques de ambas formas escalan con el arma. Al volver a felino recuperas la Energía previa; Poder cambiante convierte el maná del cambio en 40 de Energía y se reutiliza cada 8 s. Enredaderas funciona en interiores.","text_en":"In Forever, you can consume items, open chests, collect quest objects, and talk to NPCs in Bear or Cat Form. You must shift out to gather with Mining or Fishing, use some scrolls such as Scroll of Protection, or use certain Engineering items. Attacks in both forms scale with your weapon. Re-entering Cat restores stored Energy; Shifting Power trades the form-change mana cost for 40 Energy on an 8-second cooldown. Entangling Roots works indoors.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Balance Druid DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Balance Druid in WoW Forever > Changes to Existing Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/balance/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Druid DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Feral Druid DPS in WoW Forever > Changes to Existing Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Druid Tank Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Feral Tank Druid in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/overview-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Druid Tank Guide - WoW: Forever › New Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/overview-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Druid Healer Guide - WoW: Forever › New Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/restoration/overview-pve-healer","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Feral Druid Leveling Guide › Leveling Tips","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/feral-druid-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:balance:overview","class:druid:feral:leveling","class:druid:feral:overview","class:druid:restoration:overview"],"source_hashes":["guide:63c72854eb0c3324ce77823f2c83ca18aa12d790","guide:c6169e7ede6df25549c8e90ea8331ae6258f8570","section:1687dd4bcafdb858c7ee9e665295d7d14f62fedc","section:65672a34d38f0a3807f1d6c313a7b55a6bd90d05","section:b3ffee03e3b6def94c8d2b958a10f0a73aa3bb29","section:bfc46f77fcb1bad803e63fe2312d391bd3c1da32"]},{"id":"clase-druid-armas-armadura","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Armas para subir de nivel","title_en":"Leveling Weapons","summary_es":"Mejora pronto el arma de lanzador; en formas ferales cuenta el DPS, no la velocidad.","summary_en":"Upgrade caster weapons early; in Feral forms, DPS matters, not weapon speed.","keywords_es":["armas del druida","armadura del druida","druida bastón","druida maza","dps del arma feral"],"keywords_en":["druid weapons","druid armor","druid staff","druid mace","feral weapon dps"],"text_es":"Para Equilibrio, mejora pronto el arma: las armas de lanzador aportan poder con hechizos desde el nivel 10 y una buena mejora aumenta mucho el daño. En Forma de oso y Forma felina, el daño base escala con el DPS del arma; su velocidad no importa, pero sí sus estadísticas y efectos.","text_en":"For Balance, upgrade your weapon early: caster weapons provide spell damage from level 10, and a good weapon is a major damage boost. In Bear Form and Cat Form, base damage scales with weapon DPS, not its speed; its stats and effects still matter.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Balance Druid Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Viability for Balance Druid DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/balance/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Feral Druid Leveling Guide › Stats","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/feral-druid-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:balance:leveling","class:druid:feral:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:5d3789b935bf3082ca9a6b4f88f37813fdbc7360","section:8feb19b0cd776899b4173e841646a400a9fd0187"]},{"id":"clase-druid-subir-espec","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Especialización para subir de nivel","title_en":"Leveling Specialization","summary_es":"Feral es versátil en solitario; Equilibrio rinde con pulls planificados y Recuperación encaja en grupos de mazmorra.","summary_en":"Feral is flexible solo; Balance rewards planned pulls, while Restoration suits dungeon groups.","keywords_es":["mejor especialización para subir druida","druida feral para levear","druida equilibrio para subir","druida recuperación para subir","qué spec de druida usar"],"keywords_en":["best druid leveling spec","feral druid leveling","balance druid leveling","restoration druid leveling","which druid spec to level"],"text_es":"Para mundo abierto, Combate feral permite hacer daño en felino, tanquear en oso y curarte entre combates; empieza despacio antes de las formas de nivel 10 y 20, y usar todo el repertorio presiona el maná. Equilibrio funciona mejor si planificas los pulls y repartes daño periódico, pero requiere beber. Recuperación es dura para las misiones en solitario; conviene sobre todo si subes en un grupo estable de mazmorra.","text_en":"For open-world leveling, Feral can deal damage in Cat, tank in Bear, and heal between fights; it starts slowly before the forms at levels 10 and 20, and using the full toolkit strains mana. Balance works best when you plan pulls and spread damage-over-time effects, but requires drinking. Restoration struggles with solo quests and is best suited to a steady dungeon group.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Druid DPS Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling as a Feral Druid DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Druid Tank Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling as a Feral Druid Tank in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-13"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Druid DPS Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Pros","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Balance Druid Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling as a Balance Druid DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/balance/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Druid Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling as a Restoration Druid DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/restoration/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-13"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Druid Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Viability for Restoration Druid DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/restoration/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-13"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:balance:leveling","class:druid:feral:leveling","class:druid:restoration:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:0ac527b04f3eb0f2a45a6c485d8788a196a61bb1","section:106e8b4f1c7186b410345f8c5c7aa72928dd3306","section:240964d8a0d9968e9057fe3b249f6a69ccba8bb8","section:36e21d4d949262b3b87757defcee873f66e0465a","section:689514092a1abbe3bef699ee6945f4444ceec310","section:aeb1a3bbb1e36bad5a8144f9c2245cf4ac98ed37"]},{"id":"clase-druid-talentos-feral","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Ruta de talentos felinos para subir","title_en":"Feral Cat Leveling Talent Path","summary_es":"Prioriza Ferocidad y Presteza feral; desde el nivel 20 toma talentos de daño y completa Recuperación al final.","summary_en":"Prioritize Ferocity and Feral Swiftness; take damage talents from level 20 and finish in Restoration.","keywords_es":["talentos para subir druida feral","ruta de combate feral","ferocidad druida","mordisco primigenio","poder cambiante"],"keywords_en":["feral druid leveling talents","feral talent path","ferocity druid","primal bite","shifting power"],"text_es":"Ruta felina: 10–14, Ferocidad 5/5; 15–16, Presteza feral 2/2; 17–19, Corazón de lo Salvaje 3/5; 20–22, Ataques trituradores 3/3; 23–24, Furia salvaje 2/2; 25, Poder cambiante 1/1. Luego completa Corazón 5/5 y toma Golpes depredadores 3/3, Garras afiladas 2/2, Frenesí sangriento 2/2, Líder de la manada 1/1, Instinto natural 2/2 y Desgarrar y rasgar 5/5. Del 46 al 50: 5/5 Furor; 51–55: 5/5 Naturalista; 56–58: 3/3 Metamorfosis natural; 59–60: 2/5 Enfoque de la naturaleza. Movilidad y daño felino guían la ruta; quedan 3 puntos libres por talentos retirados.","text_en":"Cat path: 10–14, Ferocity 5/5; 15–16, Feral Swiftness 2/2; 17–19, Heart of the Wild 3/5; 20–22, Shredding Attacks 3/3; 23–24, Savage Fury 2/2; 25, Shifting Power 1/1. Then finish Heart 5/5 and take Predatory Strikes 3/3, Sharpened Claws 2/2, Blood Frenzy 2/2, Leader of the Pack 1/1, Natural Instinct 2/2, and Rend and Tear 5/5. At 46–50, spend 5/5 in Furor; 51–55, 5/5 in Naturalist; 56–58, 3/3 in Natural Shapeshifter; 59–60, 2/5 in Nature’s Focus. The path favors mobility and Cat damage; 3 points remain free from retired talents.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Cat Druid Leveling Guide for WoW: Forever › The build: Feral Cat (0/36/15)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/feral-cat-druid-leveling-guide-for-wow-forever-35077","date":"2026-10-20"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Cat Druid Leveling Guide for WoW: Forever › The build: Feral Cat (0/36/15) > Feral Combat: levels 10–45 (36 points)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/feral-cat-druid-leveling-guide-for-wow-forever-35077","date":"2026-10-20"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Cat Druid Leveling Guide for WoW: Forever › The build: Feral Cat (0/36/15) > Restoration: levels 46–60 (15 points)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/feral-cat-druid-leveling-guide-for-wow-forever-35077","date":"2026-10-20"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:extra:feral-cat-druid-leveling-guide-for-wow-forever"],"source_hashes":["guide:cbf3ca52ae97a782179f117d61df65b4b167c5cc","section:0bc5cc481039700a7e7aecf887eff733bcfc5fd1"]},{"id":"clase-druid-hitos","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Hitos de habilidades y formas","title_en":"Form and Ability Milestones","summary_es":"Desbloqueos clave: oso 10, acuática 16, felina 20, viaje 30 y oso nefasto 40.","summary_en":"Key unlocks: Bear 10, Aquatic 16, Cat 20, Travel 30, and Dire Bear 40.","keywords_es":["cuándo aprendo habilidades de druida","nivel de las formas del druida","hitos del druida","forma de viaje nivel","huracán nivel"],"keywords_en":["when druid abilities","druid form levels","druid milestones","travel form level","hurricane level"],"text_es":"Forma de oso llega a 10; Forma acuática, a 16; Forma felina y Acechar, a 20; Forma de viaje, a 30; y Forma de oso nefasto, a 40. Fuego feérico se aprende desde 18; Poder cambiante 1/1 llega a 25 y Enjambre de insectos puede elegirse como talento. A 40 están disponibles Huracán, Forma de lechúcico lunar y Mordisco primigenio; Enervar se aprende a ese nivel. Crecimiento salvaje 1/1 se alcanza a 42 en la ruta de sanación estricta. Las formas de oso, acuática y felina se obtienen mediante misiones de clase.","text_en":"Bear Form arrives at 10; Aquatic Form at 16; Cat Form and Prowl at 20; Travel Form at 30; and Dire Bear Form at 40. Faerie Fire can be trained from 18; Shifting Power 1/1 comes at 25, and Insect Swarm can be selected as a talent. Hurricane, Moonkin Form, and Primal Bite are available at 40; Innervate is learned then. Wild Growth 1/1 is reached at 42 in the strict-healing path. Bear Form, Aquatic Form, and Cat Form come from class quests.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Druid Tank Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling as a Feral Druid Tank in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-13"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Druid Tank Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Abilities to Train for Feral Druid Tanks in WoW: Forever > Mandatory Abilities to Train for Feral Druids","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-13"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Druid Tank Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Abilities to Train for Feral Druid Tanks in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-13"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Druid Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Abilities to Train for Restoration Druid Healer in WoW: Forever > Mandatory Abilities to Train for Restoration Druid","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/restoration/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-13"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Balance Druid Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling as a Balance Druid DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/balance/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Balance Druid Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Abilities to Train for Balance Druid DPS in WoW: Forever > Mandatory Abilities to Train for Balance Druid","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/balance/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Cat Druid Leveling Guide for WoW: Forever › Leveling toolkit","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/feral-cat-druid-leveling-guide-for-wow-forever-35077","date":"2026-10-20"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Cat Druid Leveling Guide for WoW: Forever › The build: Feral Cat (0/36/15) > Feral Combat: levels 10–45 (36 points)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/feral-cat-druid-leveling-guide-for-wow-forever-35077","date":"2026-10-20"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Druid Healing Guide for WoW: Forever › Restoration: levels 10–42 (33 points)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/restoration-druid-healing-guide-for-wow-forever-35079","date":"2026-10-20"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:balance:leveling","class:druid:extra:feral-cat-druid-leveling-guide-for-wow-forever","class:druid:extra:restoration-druid-healing-guide-for-wow-forever","class:druid:feral:leveling","class:druid:restoration:leveling"],"source_hashes":["guide:4b15796a06b14544139d2faa3a64c5f2e09cf885","guide:8aaa12809c8f075df7235bcadb54c5559c85ec30","guide:c1f9b3c8796c9da85504e92d85f463d8285745e7","guide:cbf3ca52ae97a782179f117d61df65b4b167c5cc","section:106e8b4f1c7186b410345f8c5c7aa72928dd3306","section:140fcb3add1f5c53c4d97f2d63548c10ac3b35fb","section:36e21d4d949262b3b87757defcee873f66e0465a","section:44594d89fcbf7877991accd3594ef91382ff8b01","section:7c2ea6f78fb506ac6b4d10a1eba8feb98fd2665e"]},{"id":"clase-druid-misiones-formas","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Misiones de clase: las formas","title_en":"Class Quests: The Forms","summary_es":"Niveles y cadenas de clase que desbloquean las principales formas.","summary_en":"Levels and class quests that unlock the main forms.","keywords_es":["misión forma de oso","misión forma acuática","misión forma felina","desbloquear forma de viaje"],"keywords_en":["bear form quest","aquatic form quest","cat form quest","unlock travel form"],"text_es":"Forma de oso se inicia al 10: Alianza y Horda siguen Escucha la llamada, Claro de la Luna, Espíritu del gran oso y Cuerpo y corazón; los Cielonatos tienen Fuerza y misericordia. Forma acuática se desbloquea al 16 con Una lección que aprender y luego pide recuperar dos mitades de un colgante. Forma felina llega al 20 con El gran espíritu felino; Forma de viaje se aprende del instructor al 30, sin cadena.","text_en":"Bear Form quests start at 10: Alliance and Horde follow Heeding the Call, Moonglade, Great Bear Spirit, and Body and Heart; Skyborne use Strength and Mercy. Aquatic Form unlocks at 16 with A Lesson to Learn, followed by a task to recover two halves of a pendant. Cat Form comes at 20 with The Great Cat Spirit; Travel Form is learned from a trainer at 30, with no quest chain.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Druid Class Quests Guide › Bear Form - Level 10","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/druid-class-quests","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Druid Class Quests Guide › Aquatic Form - Level 16","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/druid-class-quests","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Druid Class Quests Guide › Cat Form - Level 20","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/druid-class-quests","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Druid Shapeshift Forms Guide › How to Unlock Travel Form","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/druid-shapeshift-forms","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:general:druid-class-quests","class:druid:general:druid-shapeshift-forms"],"source_hashes":["section:71128271061711762fe2ffae7e2641576f287fb8","section:7c36c0de100e0e12fe71cc7f7132a736cfcd77fe","section:9d2dd77a29c703898f5d32d7efcf109521f7d0b4","section:ef20f907d1d6cb2e67dcc20908af95fab625c8cf"]},{"id":"clase-druid-formas-recursos","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Formas y recursos","title_en":"Forms and Resources","summary_es":"Qué recurso usa cada forma y para qué sirven las principales formas.","summary_en":"Which resource each form uses and what the main forms do.","keywords_es":["rabia forma de oso","energía forma felina","puntos de combo druida","respirar bajo el agua druida"],"keywords_en":["bear form rage","cat form energy","druid combo points","druid underwater breathing"],"text_es":"Forma de oso usa Rabia, que se genera al atacar o recibir golpes; Enfurecer puede darte Rabia antes de iniciar. Forma felina usa Energía regenerable y puntos de combo para remates como Destripar o Mordedura feroz. Forma de lechúcico lunar es la de lanzador y aporta armadura y crítico con hechizos al grupo. Forma de viaje acelera en exteriores; Forma acuática permite nadar rápido y da Respiración subacuática.","text_en":"Bear Form uses Rage, generated by attacking or being attacked; Enrage can give you Rage before a pull. Cat Form uses regenerating Energy and Combo Points for finishers such as Rip or Ferocious Bite. Moonkin Form is the caster form and provides armor and spell-crit chance to the group. Travel Form speeds movement outdoors; Aquatic Form enables fast swimming and underwater breathing.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Druid Shapeshift Forms Guide › Bear Form","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/druid-shapeshift-forms","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Druid Shapeshift Forms Guide › Cat Form","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/druid-shapeshift-forms","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Druid Shapeshift Forms Guide › Moonkin Form","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/druid-shapeshift-forms","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Druid Shapeshift Forms Guide › Travel Form","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/druid-shapeshift-forms","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Druid Shapeshift Forms Guide › Aquatic Form","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/druid-shapeshift-forms","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Druid DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › All Feral Druid DPS Rotations in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Druid Tank Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Feral Druid Tank Opener in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/rotation-cooldowns-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-09"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:feral:rotation","class:druid:general:druid-shapeshift-forms"],"source_hashes":["section:163854a61426db155d9a7044ba63d8703816ab29","section:4bda08bdb99b192bf575864874b16da8dce7b538","section:a27c46559b67801ed7e50b47bc0accda47f85a0b","section:abdc4f6e93ee2f6e3c96c60fcc33df5d29abc3a5","section:bf7368cd5b7349bb6823a504314fd65375a63f20","section:c4049f76ec48ccf7e48a5e4794a2cc8f9f523647","section:ef261040c71cf417cbc7ae0a64d024a72f4bf2b1"]},{"id":"clase-druid-movilidad","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Movilidad y sigilo","title_en":"Mobility and Stealth","summary_es":"Presteza feral, Acechar y las formas de viaje mejoran la movilidad.","summary_en":"Feral Swiftness, Prowl, and travel forms improve mobility.","keywords_es":["movilidad druida","presteza feral 30%","acechar druida","forma de viaje en combate"],"keywords_en":["druid mobility","feral swiftness 30%","druid prowl","travel form in combat"],"text_es":"Combate feral se mueve rápido: Presteza feral aumenta un 30% la velocidad en Forma felina y Acechar permite avanzar en sigilo. Forma de viaje es instantánea, sirve en combate y solo funciona al aire libre; Diligencia da un sprint puntual. Forma acuática acelera la natación, y cambiar de forma rompe raíces y ralentizaciones.","text_en":"Feral moves quickly: Feral Swiftness increases speed by 30% in Cat Form, and Prowl enables stealth. Travel Form is instant, works in combat, and is limited to outdoors; Dash provides a short sprint. Aquatic Form speeds swimming, and shapeshifting breaks roots and slows.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Feral Druid Guide › Feral Druid Guide for World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/feral-druid-melee-dps-and-tank-pve-guide","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Balance Druid Guide › Balance Druid Guide for World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/balance-druid-ranged-dps-pve-guide","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Druid Shapeshift Forms Guide › Travel Form","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/druid-shapeshift-forms","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Druid Shapeshift Forms Guide › Aquatic Form","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/druid-shapeshift-forms","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:balance:overview","class:druid:feral:overview","class:druid:general:druid-shapeshift-forms"],"source_hashes":["section:86b0aca6fe1b57f09cddd4d2c66ddfe1f574d9ff","section:a27c46559b67801ed7e50b47bc0accda47f85a0b","section:bf7368cd5b7349bb6823a504314fd65375a63f20","section:cb74403afcf67f32f4f298306119266186983090"]},{"id":"clase-druid-equilibrio","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Equilibrio: daño a distancia","title_en":"Balance: Ranged Damage","summary_es":"Equilibrio alterna daño directo y periódicos, con utilidad para banda y control.","summary_en":"Balance alternates direct and damage-over-time spells, with raid utility and control.","keywords_es":["rotación equilibrio druida","eclipse cólera fuego estelar","maná equilibrio druida","crítico lechúcico lunar"],"keywords_en":["balance druid rotation","eclipse wrath starfire","balance druid mana","moonkin raid crit"],"text_es":"Equilibrio mantiene Enjambre de insectos y Fuegolunar; abre con Cólera y repite un ciclo de una Cólera acertada y dos lanzamientos de Fuego estelar: cada Cólera carga dos activaciones que aceleran los siguientes Fuegos estelares. Forma de lechúcico lunar aporta 3% de crítico con hechizos a la banda. Augurio de claridad es básico y Cólera no consume su activación. El maná limita el daño y carece de interrupciones, aunque puede sanar puntualmente y controlar varios enemigos.","text_en":"Balance keeps Insect Swarm and Moonfire active, opens with Wrath, then repeats one landed Wrath and two Starfire casts: each Wrath banks two charges that speed up the next two casts. Moonkin Form grants the raid 3% spell crit. Omen of Clarity is baseline and Wrath does not consume its proc. Mana limits damage and Balance has no interrupt, though it can spot-heal and control multiple enemies.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Balance Druid DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Balance Druid Specific Systems in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/balance/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Balance Druid DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Strengths and Weaknesses of Balance Druids in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/balance/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Balance Druid DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Best PvE Rotation for Balance Druid DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/balance/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-10-30"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Balance Druid DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Single Target DPS Rotation for Balance Druids in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/balance/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-10-30"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:balance:overview","class:druid:balance:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:09b17c346e7b65f92aea5009c1ccb2bee329d036","section:0da1e5787d5979adfd21639a6d99787226d363bd","section:0de996b28e4b32f86663d40dc1948fa78977512b","section:d64859588b9f4b5d5fc658fe8b90cebc9d471d9b"]},{"id":"clase-druid-feral","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Combate feral: oso y felino","title_en":"Feral: Bear and Cat","summary_es":"Combate feral combina tanque en oso, daño en felino y utilidad híbrida.","summary_en":"Feral combines Bear tanking, Cat damage, and hybrid utility.","keywords_es":["combate feral oso y felino","druida feral tanque y dps","rotación feral arañazo destripar","área feral druida"],"keywords_en":["feral bear and cat","feral druid tank and dps","feral rake rip rotation","feral druid aoe"],"text_es":"Combate feral puede tanquear en Forma de oso o hacer DPS en Forma felina con una misma build. En oso, Mordisco primigenio y Lacerar generan amenaza; Machaque consume Rabia sobrante y Flagelo daña varios objetivos. En felino, mantén Arañazo y Destripar y genera puntos con Triturar, o Zarpa si atacas de frente. Las habilidades felinas escalan con el arma. Como DPS carece de área real, pero aporta movilidad y Renacer en combate.","text_en":"Feral can tank in Bear Form or deal DPS in Cat Form with one build. Bear Form uses Primal Bite and Lacerate to generate threat. Maul spends excess Rage, while Swipe hits several targets. In Cat, maintain Rake and Rip and build points with Shred, or Claw if attacking from the front. Cat abilities scale with weapon damage. Feral DPS lacks true AoE but brings mobility and Rebirth in combat.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Feral Druid Guide › Feral Druid Guide for World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/feral-druid-melee-dps-and-tank-pve-guide","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Druid DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Feral Druid DPS Specific Systems in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Druid DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Strengths and Weaknesses of Feral Druid DPS in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Druid DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › All Feral Druid DPS Rotations in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Druid Tank Guide - WoW: Forever › New Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/overview-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Druid Tank Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › All Feral Druid Tank Rotations in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/rotation-cooldowns-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Druid Tank Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Single Target Priority","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/rotation-cooldowns-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Druid Tank Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › AoE Priority","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/rotation-cooldowns-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-09"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:feral:overview","class:druid:feral:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:190a3a5704e0f58d40e8daade90b9865fadbb122","section:61c43260fb82743ca2d5f0ec6a35fa18d3db2bb6","section:65672a34d38f0a3807f1d6c313a7b55a6bd90d05","section:76aa2ece390041fefc6a030ca861748fa703e46a","section:81d41d7268756c9caa01ff3d417c2a77bab8a502","section:86b0aca6fe1b57f09cddd4d2c66ddfe1f574d9ff","section:9633cbc4a52b40e71aa7069bdc8be5c5d90a33e8","section:c4049f76ec48ccf7e48a5e4794a2cc8f9f523647"]},{"id":"clase-druid-restauracion","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Recuperación: sanación","title_en":"Restoration: Healing","summary_es":"Recuperación anticipa el daño con HoTs y responde a picos y daño de grupo.","summary_en":"Restoration prepares with HoTs and responds to spikes and party damage.","keywords_es":["rotación recuperación druida","rejuvenecimiento y recrecimiento","crecimiento salvaje grupo","tranquilidad recuperación"],"keywords_en":["restoration druid healing rotation","rejuvenation regrowth","wild growth party","restoration tranquility"],"text_es":"Recuperación prepara Rejuvenecimiento antes del daño, usa Recrecimiento para picos y Arreglo rápido si hay un HoT activo; Crecimiento salvaje ayuda cuando 3 o más heridos comparten grupo, aunque tarda 3 s. En emergencias, combina Rapidez de la Naturaleza con Toque curativo. Aporta Renacer en combate, Revivir fuera y Enervar. Tranquilidad se considera débil y poco práctica frente al resto.","text_en":"Restoration prepares Rejuvenation before damage, uses Regrowth for spikes, and Swiftmend when a HoT is active; Wild Growth helps when 3 or more injured players share a party, though it takes 3 seconds to cast. In emergencies, combine Nature’s Swiftness with Healing Touch. It brings Rebirth in combat, Revive out of combat, and Innervate. Tranquility is considered weak and clunky compared with the rest of its kit.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Druid Healer Guide - WoW: Forever › Strengths and Weaknesses of Restoration Druids in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/restoration/overview-pve-healer","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Druid Healer Guide - WoW: Forever › New Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/restoration/overview-pve-healer","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Druid Healing Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Best PvE Rotation for Restoration Druid Healing in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/restoration/rotation-cooldowns-pve-healer","date":"2026-11-01"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Druid Healing Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › All Restoration Druid Healing Rotations in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/restoration/rotation-cooldowns-pve-healer","date":"2026-11-01"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:restoration:overview","class:druid:restoration:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:1687dd4bcafdb858c7ee9e665295d7d14f62fedc","section:3a57516c6f9be01c02e40229bcbc0762dfbd66cd","section:a36ad137ad7e1d4b0907d17f24661a2a48242647","section:ddf87fac7dd5ef5c82e65aabdee91c9d97fd589e"]},{"id":"clase-druid-control","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Control y utilidad","title_en":"Control and Utility","summary_es":"Enredaderas separa enemigos; Hibernar controla bestias y dracónidos, y Azote aturde en oso.","summary_en":"Entangling Roots splits enemies; Hibernate controls Beasts and Dragonkin, and Bash stuns in Bear.","keywords_es":["raíces enredadoras","gracia de la naturaleza","hibernar druida","azote druida","control druida"],"keywords_en":["entangling roots","nature's grasp","druid hibernate","druid bash","druid control"],"text_es":"Enredaderas inmoviliza al objetivo y se rompe al recibir daño; si queda fuera del alcance cuerpo a cuerpo, tampoco podrá atacarte así. Gracia de la naturaleza puede lanzarla cuando te golpean. Hibernar duerme bestias y dracónidos hasta que reciben daño, incluidas mascotas de Cazador y Druidas transformados. Azote aturde a un objetivo en Forma de oso; úsalo para interrumpir o ganar tiempo.","text_en":"Entangling Roots immobilizes a target and breaks when it takes damage; if it is outside melee range, it cannot attack you that way. Nature’s Grasp can cast it when you are hit. Hibernate sleeps Beasts and Dragonkin until they take damage, including Hunter pets and shapeshifted Druids. Bash stuns one target in Bear Form; use it to interrupt or buy time.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Balance Druid Leveling Guide › Crowd Control","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/balance-druid-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Feral Druid Leveling Guide › Utility and Crowd Control","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/feral-druid-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Druid Tank Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Abilities to Train for Feral Druid Tanks in WoW: Forever > Optional Abilities to Train","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-13"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Balance Druid Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Rotation for Balance Druid DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/balance/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:balance:leveling","class:druid:feral:leveling"],"source_hashes":["guide:4b15796a06b14544139d2faa3a64c5f2e09cf885","section:0c80298514862f7b1fce18e4e45eeac268da6de7","section:4fb483f54ce653e037c6a19516f3f36c4d4e3be6","section:75e5b9aa49514b3b649becce2948636459d27089"]},{"id":"clase-druid-buffs","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Mejoras, limpieza y resurrección","title_en":"Buffs, Cleansing, and Resurrection","summary_es":"Mantén Marca de lo salvaje y Espinas; reserva Enervar, resurrecciones y limpiezas para el grupo.","summary_en":"Keep Mark of the Wild and Thorns up; use Innervate, resurrections, and cleanses for the group.","keywords_es":["buffs del druida","marca de lo salvaje","espinas druida","renacer druida","deshacer maldición"],"keywords_en":["druid buffs","mark of the wild","druid thorns","druid rebirth","remove curse"],"text_es":"Marca de lo salvaje mejora estadísticas, resistencias y armadura. Espinas daña a quien golpea al objetivo y escala con poder con hechizos; úsala en ti al levear y en el tanque en mazmorra. Fuego feérico reduce armadura y beneficia al daño físico. Enervar acelera la recuperación de maná; Renacer resucita en combate y Revivir fuera. Deshacer maldición y Suprimir veneno eliminan maldiciones y venenos, no magia ni enfermedades.","text_en":"Mark of the Wild improves stats, resistances, and armor. Thorns damages attackers and scales with spell power; keep it on yourself while leveling and on the tank in dungeons. Faerie Fire reduces armor and benefits physical damage. Innervate speeds mana recovery; Rebirth resurrects in combat and Revive out of combat. Remove Curse and Abolish Poison remove curses and poisons, not magic or diseases.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Balance Druid Leveling Guide › Other Important Abilities > Other Utility","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/balance-druid-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Druid Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Abilities to Train for Restoration Druid Healer in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/restoration/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-13"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Balance Druid Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling as a Balance Druid DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/balance/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:balance:leveling","class:druid:restoration:leveling"],"source_hashes":["guide:a31bedad17a1c4722de76250b73f48fbad5dc044","section:355b295670c6e280b054c0efe9ac076f6027c992","section:36e21d4d949262b3b87757defcee873f66e0465a"]},{"id":"clase-druid-rotacion-equilibrio","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotación de Equilibrio al subir","title_en":"Balance Leveling Rotation","summary_es":"En solitario, controla con Enredaderas; contra grupos, reparte efectos y cambia de forma según el nivel.","summary_en":"Solo, control with Entangling Roots; against packs, spread DoTs and adapt forms by level.","keywords_es":["rotación de equilibrio","rotación del druida equilibrio","fuego lunar rotación","enjambre de insectos","eclipse druida"],"keywords_en":["balance rotation","balance druid rotation","moonfire rotation","insect swarm","druid eclipse"],"text_es":"Prelanza Rejuvenecimiento; Recrecimiento si hace falta. En objetivo único, abre lejos con Cólera y Enredaderas; reaplica si se rompen y sigue con Cólera. Con Eclipse 3/3, Fuego estelar mejorado 5/5 y Venganza 5/5, tras la raíz aplica Enjambre de insectos 1/1 y Fuegolunar; alterna Cólera acertada y dos lanzamientos de Fuego estelar. Renueva solo si el enemigo vivirá el efecto entero. En grupos, reparte efectos; antes de 40: Forma de oso, Clamor desmoralizador y Flagelo para regenerar; desde 40, Forma de lechúcico lunar y Huracán, con Pielcorteza si te interrumpen (rentable con 4–5 objetivos).","text_en":"Pre-cast Rejuvenation; Regrowth if needed. On one target, open with Wrath at long range and Entangling Roots; reapply if broken, then cast Wrath. With Eclipse 3/3, Improved Starfire 5/5, and Vengeance 5/5, after rooting apply Insect Swarm 1/1 and Moonfire; alternate one landed Wrath with two Starfire casts. Refresh only if the target will live for the full effect. On packs, spread DoTs; before 40 use Bear Form, Demoralizing Roar, and Swipe to regenerate; from 40, Moonkin Form and Hurricane, using Barkskin if interrupted (efficient on 4–5 enemies).","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Balance Druid Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Rotation for Balance Druid DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/balance/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Balance Druid Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Balance Druid DPS in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/balance/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Balance Druid Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling as a Balance Druid DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/balance/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Cat Druid Leveling Guide for WoW: Forever › Levels 10–19: Wrath and Bear Form","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/feral-cat-druid-leveling-guide-for-wow-forever-35077","date":"2026-10-20"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Balance Druid Leveling Guide › AoE Rotation","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/balance-druid-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:balance:leveling","class:druid:extra:feral-cat-druid-leveling-guide-for-wow-forever"],"source_hashes":["section:03bd266526dee91d2a4ffc5368d3575c175c83e5","section:0c80298514862f7b1fce18e4e45eeac268da6de7","section:36e21d4d949262b3b87757defcee873f66e0465a","section:a4d8643db1baafb49d8a46964a402d2237856d83","section:b1e66aee306df18255743146083f372e2e3ae2fc"]},{"id":"clase-druid-rotacion-oso","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotación de oso al subir","title_en":"Bear Leveling Rotation","summary_es":"Abre con Fuego feérico; prioriza Mordisco primigenio, Flagelo en grupos y Machaque contra un objetivo.","summary_en":"Open with Faerie Fire; prioritize Primal Bite, Swipe on packs, and Maul on one target.","keywords_es":["rotación de oso druida","rotación tanque druida","mordisco primigenio","lacerar druida","flagelo druida"],"keywords_en":["bear druid rotation","druid tank rotation","primal bite","lacerate druid","swipe druid"],"text_es":"Mantén Marca de lo salvaje y Espinas; usa Enfurecer antes del pull para empezar con Rabia. Abre con Fuego feérico para atraer al enemigo y reducir armadura. Mantén Clamor desmoralizador activo en objetivos que tanques y usa Mordisco primigenio 1/1 cuando esté listo. Contra varios, prioriza Flagelo para amenaza; contra uno, Machaque es el ataque principal y gastador de Rabia. Sáltate cualquier habilidad que aún no hayas desbloqueado.","text_en":"Keep Mark of the Wild and Thorns up; use Enrage before the pull to start with Rage. Open with Faerie Fire to pull the enemy and reduce its armor. Keep Demoralizing Roar active on targets you tank and use Primal Bite 1/1 when ready. Against several enemies, prioritize Swipe for threat; against one, Maul is your primary attack and Rage spender. Skip any ability you have not unlocked.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Druid Tank Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Rotation for Feral Druid Tanks in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-13"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Druid Tank Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as a Feral Druid Tank in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-13"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Druid Tank Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling as a Feral Druid Tank in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-13"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Cat Druid Leveling Guide for WoW: Forever › Leveling toolkit","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/feral-cat-druid-leveling-guide-for-wow-forever-35077","date":"2026-10-20"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Feral Druid Leveling Guide › Bear Form Single-Target Rotation","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/feral-druid-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:extra:feral-cat-druid-leveling-guide-for-wow-forever","class:druid:feral:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:106e8b4f1c7186b410345f8c5c7aa72928dd3306","section:140fcb3add1f5c53c4d97f2d63548c10ac3b35fb","section:1fcd085b883314811605a08ec64ef913cdd19176","section:2a5f71ddfebfcce143d28e624acdb44a715f03f1","section:70c0e613f0789982fba49e0db47650ea1bbc9c57"]},{"id":"clase-druid-rotacion-felino","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotación de felino al subir","title_en":"Cat Leveling Rotation","summary_es":"Mantén Arañazo y Destripar; usa Triturar con Conjuro libre y Mordedura feroz para rematar.","summary_en":"Maintain Rake and Rip; use Shred with Clearcasting and Ferocious Bite to finish.","keywords_es":["rotación de felino","rotación druida feral dps","devastar druida","destripar druida","triturar druida"],"keywords_en":["cat druid rotation","feral druid dps rotation","ravage druid","rip druid","shred druid"],"text_es":"Desde Acechar, abre con Devastar desde el nivel 32 o Lanzarse al 36; antes, usa Zarpa. Mantén Arañazo si el objetivo vivirá al menos 6 s y Destripar con 5 puntos si vivirá 6 s o más. Usa Triturar con Conjuro libre; si no, Zarpa. Si quedan 3 s o menos y tienes más de 3 puntos de combo, remata con Mordedura feroz. Usa Poder cambiante 1/1 por debajo de 50 de Energía si no la desperdicias y resérvala para renovar los sangrados.","text_en":"From Prowl, open with Ravage from level 32 or Pounce at 36; before then, use Claw. Maintain Rake if the target will live at least 6 seconds and a 5-point Rip if it will live 6 seconds or longer. Use Shred with Clearcasting; otherwise, use Claw. If the target has 3 seconds or less left and you have over 3 combo points, finish with Ferocious Bite. Use Shifting Power 1/1 below 50 Energy if it will not be wasted, and save Energy to refresh bleeds.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Druid DPS Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Rotation for Feral Druid DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-17"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Cat Druid Leveling Guide for WoW: Forever › Levels 20–39: Cat Form","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/feral-cat-druid-leveling-guide-for-wow-forever-35077","date":"2026-10-20"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Cat Druid Leveling Guide for WoW: Forever › Leveling toolkit","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/feral-cat-druid-leveling-guide-for-wow-forever-35077","date":"2026-10-20"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Cat Druid Leveling Guide for WoW: Forever › The build: Feral Cat (0/36/15)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/feral-cat-druid-leveling-guide-for-wow-forever-35077","date":"2026-10-20"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Feral Druid Leveling Guide › Feral Druid Leveling Rotation > Cat Form Single-Target Rotation","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/feral-druid-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["class:druid:extra:feral-cat-druid-leveling-guide-for-wow-forever","class:druid:feral:leveling"],"source_hashes":["guide:fcccc87ddfc8c52aee3d2139d839e80100e3f616","section:0bc5cc481039700a7e7aecf887eff733bcfc5fd1","section:140fcb3add1f5c53c4d97f2d63548c10ac3b35fb","section:8b26d61f560daf6a0fdc9876532e9eb6009c1830","section:d459b256f0ca6c9bb5ceee4e02bef132c672cf8b"]},{"id":"clase-druid-rotacion-restauracion","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Sanación de Recuperación al subir","title_en":"Restoration Leveling Healing","summary_es":"Mantén HoT en el tanque, responde a picos con curas directas y guarda las curas de grupo para emergencias.","summary_en":"Keep HoTs on the tank, answer spikes with direct heals, and save group heals for emergencies.","keywords_es":["rotación de recuperación druida","sanación druida mazmorra","rejuvenecimiento tanque","arreglo rápido","tranquilidad druida"],"keywords_en":["restoration druid rotation","druid dungeon healing","rejuvenation tank","swiftmend","druid tranquility"],"text_es":"En mazmorra, mantén Espinas en el tanque y Rejuvenecimiento y Recrecimiento en el objetivo que sanas; cubre picos con Recrecimiento o Toque curativo y emergencias con Arreglo rápido 1/1. Si está en reutilización o la cura no puede esperar, combina Rapidez de la Naturaleza 1/1 y Toque curativo. En daño grupal, reparte Rejuvenecimiento; usa Recrecimiento o Arreglo rápido en quien baje mucho, y Crecimiento salvaje 1/1 con Tranquilidad si todos sufren daño grave. Usa Enervar cuando necesites maná; si no hay curas urgentes, aporta daño con Enjambre de insectos, Enredaderas, Fuegolunar y Cólera.","text_en":"In dungeons, keep Thorns on the tank and Rejuvenation and Regrowth on your healing target; answer spikes with Regrowth or Healing Touch and emergencies with Swiftmend 1/1. If it is on cooldown or healing cannot wait, combine Nature’s Swiftness 1/1 with Healing Touch. For group damage, spread Rejuvenation; use Regrowth or Swiftmend on players dropping low, and Wild Growth 1/1 with Tranquility if everyone takes severe damage. Use Innervate when mana is needed; if no urgent heals are required, add damage with Insect Swarm, Entangling Roots, Moonfire, and Wrath.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Druid Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Rotation for Restoration Druid Healer in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/restoration/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-13"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Druid Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling as a Restoration Druid DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/restoration/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-13"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Druid Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as a Restoration Druid Healer in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/restoration/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-13"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Druid Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Abilities to Train for Restoration Druid Healer in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/restoration/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-13"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:restoration:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:0ac527b04f3eb0f2a45a6c485d8788a196a61bb1","section:355b295670c6e280b054c0efe9ac076f6027c992","section:6a855656df8c517bbedcb87cb12bd225a7811700","section:fcdd0783e2a5d34d8540642f6a6ac34c77bd476b"]},{"id":"clase-druid-consejos-subir","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Consejos para subir de nivel","title_en":"Leveling Tips","summary_es":"Planifica el maná y los pulls, prioriza las primeras mazmorras y aprovecha campamentos y descansos.","summary_en":"Manage mana and pulls, prioritize first dungeon runs, and use campfires and rested bonuses.","keywords_es":["consejos para subir druida","agua druida","saco de dormir","campamentos","experiencia de descanso"],"keywords_en":["druid leveling tips","druid water","sleeping bag","campfires","rested experience"],"text_es":"Lleva agua y bebe con regularidad: Equilibrio y Recuperación gastan mucho maná. Reúne las misiones de mazmorra antes de ir; la primera pasada aporta equipo y experiencia. Descansa en posadas y aprovecha los campamentos al encontrarlos; el Saco de dormir acogedor se obtiene desde nivel 14 y acumula experiencia extra. Mantén comida con el beneficio de experiencia. Al principio evita atraer varios enemigos; sepáralos con Enredaderas y reserva maná para curarte en grupo.","text_en":"Carry water and drink regularly: Balance and Restoration spend a lot of mana. Pick up dungeon quests before going; a first clear offers gear and experience. Rest in inns and use campfires when you find them; the Cozy Sleeping Bag is available from level 14 and stacks extra experience. Keep an experience-food buff active. Avoid pulling several enemies early; split them with Entangling Roots and save mana for group healing.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Balance Druid Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling as a Balance Druid DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/balance/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Druid Tank Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling as a Feral Druid Tank in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-13"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Druid Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Tips for Restoration Druid Healer in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/restoration/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-13"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Balance Druid Leveling Guide › Leveling Tips","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/balance-druid-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Druid DPS Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Consumables for Feral Druid DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:balance:leveling","class:druid:feral:leveling","class:druid:restoration:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:106e8b4f1c7186b410345f8c5c7aa72928dd3306","section:36e21d4d949262b3b87757defcee873f66e0465a","section:3b8dbf3e27815c46ac798e0e0b74fc5a78cca2dc","section:d19cee37e3111fcf52578f73ad0f442bd703e778","section:e5eccf2dc535398a36a2948127fda5ebea015d4e"]},{"id":"clase-druid-mazmorras","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"El Druida en mazmorras","title_en":"Druid in Dungeons","summary_es":"Cómo aportar control, amenaza, sanación y resurrecciones en mazmorras.","summary_en":"How to provide control, threat, healing, and resurrections in dungeons.","keywords_es":["druida mazmorras","control enredaderas interiores","feral recoger amenaza oso","renacer y revivir druida"],"keywords_en":["druid dungeons","entangling roots indoors","feral bear threat pickup","druid rebirth revive"],"text_es":"En mazmorras, Equilibrio controla enemigos con Enredaderas incluso en interiores. Si cae el tanque, Combate feral puede pasar a oso y recuperar la amenaza; también puede salir de forma para sanar. Recuperación cubre daño de grupo, y Revivir permite resucitar tras un combate mientras Renacer sirve durante el encuentro.","text_en":"In dungeons, Balance can control enemies with Entangling Roots even indoors. If the tank falls, Feral can shift to Bear and pick up threat, or leave form to help heal. Restoration handles party damage, and Revive resurrects after combat while Rebirth works during an encounter.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Balance Druid DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Balance Druid in WoW Forever > Changes to Existing Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/balance/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Druid DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Feral Druid DPS Specific Systems in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Druid DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Feral Druid DPS for New Players in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Druid Healer Guide - WoW: Forever › New Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/restoration/overview-pve-healer","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Druid Healer Guide - WoW: Forever › Strengths and Weaknesses of Restoration Druids in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/restoration/overview-pve-healer","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:balance:overview","class:druid:feral:overview","class:druid:restoration:overview"],"source_hashes":["guide:63c72854eb0c3324ce77823f2c83ca18aa12d790","section:1687dd4bcafdb858c7ee9e665295d7d14f62fedc","section:3e8bb4544f72b2581ba06731d8c0ea839417b938","section:61c43260fb82743ca2d5f0ec6a35fa18d3db2bb6","section:ddf87fac7dd5ef5c82e65aabdee91c9d97fd589e"]},{"id":"clase-druid-profesiones","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Profesiones y consumibles para subir","title_en":"Leveling Professions and Consumables","summary_es":"Combina recolección y fabricación: Peletería/Desollar, Ingeniería/Minería o Botánica/Alquimia.","summary_en":"Pair gathering and crafting: Leatherworking/Skinning, Engineering/Mining, or Herbalism/Alchemy.","keywords_es":["profesiones para druida","peletería druida","desuello druida","alquimia druida","primeros auxilios"],"keywords_en":["druid professions","druid leatherworking","druid skinning","druid alchemy","first aid"],"text_es":"Peletería con Desollar reduce costes y permite fabricar equipo; Ingeniería con Minería aporta artilugios y explosivos; Botánica con Alquimia facilita pociones y elixires. Cocina, Primeros auxilios y Pesca son complementos útiles que no ocupan las dos profesiones principales; la comida también puede aportar experiencia extra. Para Equilibrio, mejora el arma de lanzador y considera Elixir Arcano menor o Elixir Arcano inferior y Sabiola ahumada; como sanador, lleva pociones de salud y maná.","text_en":"Leatherworking with Skinning reduces costs and lets you craft gear; Engineering with Mining provides gadgets and explosives; Herbalism with Alchemy supplies potions and elixirs. Cooking, First Aid, and Fishing are useful additions that do not use the two primary profession slots; food can also grant bonus experience. For Balance, upgrade your caster weapon and consider Minor Arcane Elixir or Lesser Arcane Elixir and Smoked Sagefish; as a healer, carry potions for health and mana.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Druid Tank Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Professions for Feral Druid Tanks in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-13"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Druid DPS Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Professions for Feral Druid DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Druid Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Professions for Restoration Druid Healer in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/restoration/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-13"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Balance Druid Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Professions for Balance Druid DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/balance/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Balance Druid Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Consumables for Balance Druid DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/balance/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Druid Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Consumables for Restoration Druid Healer in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/restoration/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-13"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Druid DPS Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Consumables for Feral Druid DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:balance:leveling","class:druid:feral:leveling","class:druid:restoration:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:10fc63eee8fd390d318bcc9c5153fbccc5335d5b","section:1406e003576d168be80173fb1c7c1539da364a34","section:3a2ab797576f539e89aa63f40e298e14638967c6","section:45c6a2fa69612af22ae867055ff62cf968ff2f82","section:4b4fd928916bf963a74bcb13aebdb13c8dd50215","section:735d7118179c869b3df197bd9e8e35477cf5c322","section:d19cee37e3111fcf52578f73ad0f442bd703e778"]},{"id":"clase-druid-grupo","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Qué aporta el Druida al grupo","title_en":"What Druid Brings to a Group","summary_es":"Mejoras de banda, apoyo y resurrección que el Druida aporta al grupo.","summary_en":"Raid buffs, support, and resurrection that Druid brings to a group.","keywords_es":["buffs druida banda","aura lechúcico líder manada","marca de lo salvaje espinas","renacer druida en combate"],"keywords_en":["druid raid buffs","moonkin aura leader of the pack","mark of the wild thorns","druid combat resurrection"],"text_es":"El Druida aporta Marca de lo salvaje, Espinas, Fuego feérico, Enervar, Deshacer maldición y Suprimir veneno. En banda, Aura de lechúcico lunar da 3% de crítico con hechizos y Líder de la manada ofrece una mejora de crítico incompatible con ella; basta cubrir ese efecto con Equilibrio o Combate feral. Renacer permite resucitar durante el combate.","text_en":"Druid brings Mark of the Wild, Thorns, Faerie Fire, Innervate, Remove Curse, and Abolish Poison. In raids, Moonkin Aura grants 3% spell crit and Leader of the Pack provides an exclusive raid crit buff; Balance or Feral can supply that benefit. Rebirth allows an in-combat resurrection.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Druid Class Guide › Comprehensive Guide to Druid in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/druid-class-overview","date":"2026-10-27"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Balance Druid DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Best PvE Rotation for Balance Druid DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/balance/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-10-30"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Druid DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Existing Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Druid Healer Guide - WoW: Forever › Strengths and Weaknesses of Restoration Druids in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/restoration/overview-pve-healer","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Balance Druid Guide › Balance Druid Guide for World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/balance-druid-ranged-dps-pve-guide","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Druid Tank Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Existing Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/overview-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Druid Healer Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Existing Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/restoration/overview-pve-healer","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Restoration Druid Guide › Restoration Druid Guide for World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/restoration-druid-healer-pve-guide","date":"2026-11-09"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:balance:overview","class:druid:balance:rotation","class:druid:feral:overview","class:druid:general:druid-class-overview","class:druid:restoration:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:09b17c346e7b65f92aea5009c1ccb2bee329d036","section:5c32918820f271ad14a658515fde08fc4278bc1b","section:60e162e18a9a45fa09e270b4d75e0cec729cb74d","section:b153582525b63c9c9352975036c5517a51be2dbe","section:b70f4ec478ddf0a23d95abe846215a47f03cf436","section:cb74403afcf67f32f4f298306119266186983090","section:dd92549e3deed4432030445deb4101fe72e37c88","section:ddf87fac7dd5ef5c82e65aabdee91c9d97fd589e"]},{"id":"clase-druid-stats-equilibrio","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Estadísticas de Equilibrio a nivel 60","title_en":"Balance Level-60 Stats","summary_es":"Orden especulativo: golpe hasta 17%, después daño y penetración con hechizos.","summary_en":"Speculative order: hit to 17%, then spell damage and spell penetration.","keywords_es":["estadísticas equilibrio nivel 60","prioridad de golpe equilibrio","daño con hechizos druida","maná equilibrio estadísticas"],"keywords_en":["balance level 60 stats","balance hit priority","druid spell damage","balance mana stats"],"text_es":"Prioridad especulativa: golpe hasta 17% > daño con hechizos > Penetración de hechizo > Golpe crítico > celeridad > intelecto > espíritu > aguante. El golpe evita fallos y el daño con hechizos aumenta directamente el daño; conserva maná para sostener la rotación. Recomendación provisional hasta que se pruebe a nivel 60.","text_en":"Speculative priority: hit to 17% > spell damage > Spell Penetration > Critical Strike > haste > intellect > spirit > stamina. Hit prevents misses and spell damage directly boosts damage; preserve mana to sustain the rotation. Provisional recommendation until tested at level 60.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Balance Druid DPS Attribute and Stat Guide - WoW: Forever › Balance Druid Stat Priority in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/balance/stat-priority-pve-dps","date":"2026-10-30"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Balance Druid DPS Attribute and Stat Guide - WoW: Forever › Hit Chance","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/balance/stat-priority-pve-dps","date":"2026-10-30"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Balance Druid DPS Attribute and Stat Guide - WoW: Forever › Spell Power","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/balance/stat-priority-pve-dps","date":"2026-10-30"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:balance:stats"],"source_hashes":["section:52de31cb4bf74e245837d24ecac96c0e1188260e","section:e7504b2080b6f08bfd2427035aa1873caec61be7","section:ec16bdba7c32f33ad9c5d9d56ac65a9d3f16ae2e"]},{"id":"clase-druid-stats-feral-dps","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Estadísticas de Feral DPS a nivel 60","title_en":"Feral DPS Level-60 Stats","summary_es":"Prioriza crítico, golpe hasta 8% y reducción de esquiva/parada hasta 6.5%.","summary_en":"Prioritize crit, hit to 8%, and dodge/parry reduction to 6.5%.","keywords_es":["estadísticas feral dps 60","prioridad de golpe feral","cap esquiva parada feral","dps arma druida feral"],"keywords_en":["feral dps level 60 stats","feral hit priority","feral dodge parry cap","feral weapon dps"],"text_es":"Prioridad especulativa: Golpe crítico 1% > golpe 1% hasta 8% > reducción de esquiva/parada 1% hasta 6.5% > celeridad 1% > DPS del arma > agilidad = fuerza > poder de ataque > intelecto > espíritu > aguante. Asegura que los ataques conecten antes de apilar daño; intelecto, espíritu y aguante aportan recursos o supervivencia. Recomendación provisional hasta que se pruebe a nivel 60.","text_en":"Speculative priority: Critical Strike 1% > hit 1% to 8% > dodge/parry reduction 1% to 6.5% > haste 1% > weapon DPS > agility = strength > attack power > intellect > spirit > stamina. Make attacks land before stacking damage; intellect, spirit, and stamina mainly add resources or survivability. Provisional recommendation until tested at level 60.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Druid DPS Stat Priority & Attributes - WoW: Forever › Feral Druid Stat Priority in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/stat-priority-pve-dps","date":"2026-10-29"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Druid DPS Stat Priority & Attributes - WoW: Forever › Crit Chance","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/stat-priority-pve-dps","date":"2026-10-29"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Druid DPS Stat Priority & Attributes - WoW: Forever › Hit Chance","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/stat-priority-pve-dps","date":"2026-10-29"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:feral:stats"],"source_hashes":["section:1255ad04a2bb618346edfd8fc591782d69a29780","section:4f3ca9b46912b902ee2c2376b0eb2f295510ef50","section:bd7ad975ff797897106a50f86181a6b0a8bfb6be"]},{"id":"clase-druid-stats-feral-tank","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Estadísticas de Feral tanque a nivel 60","title_en":"Feral Tank Level-60 Stats","summary_es":"Prioriza aguante y defensa hasta 440; en ofensiva, golpe y reducción de esquiva/parada.","summary_en":"Prioritize stamina and defense to 440; offensively, hit and dodge/parry reduction.","keywords_es":["estadísticas oso tanque","defensa 440 druida","prioridad ofensiva feral tanque","aguante armadura oso"],"keywords_en":["bear tank stats","druid defense 440","feral tank offensive priority","bear stamina armor"],"text_es":"Prioridad defensiva especulativa: aguante > defensa hasta 440 > armadura > agilidad > evitación > defensa después de 440. Ofensiva: golpe > reducción de esquiva/parada > celeridad > crítico > DPS del arma > fuerza > agilidad > fuerza. Defensa 440 evita críticos de jefes; en ataque, busca que las habilidades conecten antes de apilar daño. Recomendación provisional hasta que se pruebe a nivel 60.","text_en":"Speculative defensive priority: stamina > defense to 440 > armor > agility > avoidance > defense after 440. Offensive: hit > dodge/parry reduction > haste > crit > weapon DPS > strength > agility > strength. Defense 440 prevents boss critical hits; offensively, make abilities land before stacking damage. Provisional recommendation until tested at level 60.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Druid Tank Attribute and Stat Guide - WoW: Forever › Feral Druid Tank Stat Priority in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/stat-priority-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-03"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Druid Tank Attribute and Stat Guide - WoW: Forever › Defensive Priority","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/stat-priority-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-03"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Druid Tank Attribute and Stat Guide - WoW: Forever › Offensive Priority","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/stat-priority-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-03"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:feral:stats"],"source_hashes":["section:011ef23da83937a1a78bc981b9bb4a7b902d451b","section:08197c0a079c80835aa30965d688b6c786ecc4bf","section:211854d235b4e9cf635662913690dc90f0bea247"]},{"id":"clase-druid-stats-restauracion","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Estadísticas de Recuperación a nivel 60","title_en":"Restoration Level-60 Stats","summary_es":"Prioridad especulativa: poder de sanación, crítico y celeridad; no descuides el maná.","summary_en":"Speculative order: spell healing, crit, and haste; do not neglect mana.","keywords_es":["estadísticas recuperación druida","prioridad poder de sanación","crítico y celeridad sanador","maná mp5 espíritu druida"],"keywords_en":["restoration druid stats","spell healing priority","healer crit haste","druid mana mp5 spirit"],"text_es":"Prioridad especulativa: poder de sanación > Golpe crítico > celeridad con hechizos > espíritu > intelecto > MP5 > aguante. El orden favorece la sanación, pero el maná sigue importando: equilibra potencia y regeneración para sostener los encuentros. Recomendación provisional hasta que se pruebe a nivel 60.","text_en":"Speculative priority: spell healing > Critical Strike > spell haste > spirit > intellect > MP5 > stamina. The order favors healing throughput, but mana still matters: balance power and regeneration to sustain encounters. Provisional recommendation until tested at level 60.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Druid Healer Attribute and Stat Guide - WoW: Forever › Restoration Druid Stat Priority in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/restoration/stat-priority-pve-healer","date":"2026-11-01"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Druid Healer Attribute and Stat Guide - WoW: Forever › Spell Healing","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/restoration/stat-priority-pve-healer","date":"2026-11-01"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:restoration:stats"],"source_hashes":["section:644caea9c1fe36fbbd25ab6421a11328dabd721c","section:ea48f95d5ac58f539870acc856cdb39c5ca584d0"]},{"id":"clase-druid-rotacion-equilibrio-60","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotación de Equilibrio a nivel 60","title_en":"Balance Level-60 Rotation","summary_es":"Abre con Cólera, aplica los dos efectos periódicos y alterna Cólera con Fuego estelar.","summary_en":"Open with Wrath, apply both damage-over-time effects, then cycle Wrath and Starfire.","keywords_es":["rotación equilibrio 60","rotación cólera fuego estelar","cargas eclipse druida","maná banda equilibrio"],"keywords_en":["balance rotation level 60","wrath starfire rotation","eclipse charges druid","balance raid mana"],"text_es":"Antes del pull, asigna Fuego feérico a un Druida. Prelanza Cólera, aplica Enjambre de insectos y Fuegolunar (14 y 15 s), y alterna una Cólera acertada con dos lanzamientos de Fuego estelar: Cólera carga dos marcas de Eclipse y los lanzamientos las consumen. Renueva los efectos al caer; Augurio de claridad no se consume con Cólera. Usa Enervar al llegar al 10% de maná.","text_en":"Before the pull, assign Faerie Fire to one Druid and cast Wrath. Apply Insect Swarm and Moonfire (14 and 15 seconds), then cycle one landed Wrath with two Starfire casts: Wrath banks two Eclipse charges and the casts spend them. Refresh effects as they expire; Omen of Clarity is not consumed by Wrath. Use Innervate at 10% mana.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Balance Druid DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Single Target DPS Rotation for Balance Druids in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/balance/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-10-30"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Balance Druid DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Best PvE Rotation for Balance Druid DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/balance/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-10-30"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Balance Druid DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Best Balance Druid Cooldown Usage in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/balance/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-10-30"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:balance:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:09b17c346e7b65f92aea5009c1ccb2bee329d036","section:d64859588b9f4b5d5fc658fe8b90cebc9d471d9b","section:dec900afdb559e63a19ee470665cb695cefe1b39"]},{"id":"clase-druid-rotacion-equilibrio-area-60","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Equilibrio: rotación de área a nivel 60","title_en":"Balance Level-60 AoE Rotation","summary_es":"Con 2–4 objetivos, reparte los efectos; con 5 o más, canaliza Huracán.","summary_en":"With 2–4 targets, spread the effects; at 5 or more, channel Hurricane.","keywords_es":["equilibrio área 60","huracán con cinco enemigos","multidot equilibrio banda","rotación aoe druida"],"keywords_en":["balance aoe level 60","hurricane five enemies","balance multidot raid","druid aoe rotation"],"text_es":"Elige un objetivo principal para Cólera y Fuego estelar. Con dos a cuatro enemigos, aplica primero Enjambre de insectos y luego Fuegolunar a cada uno, y vuelve al ciclo del principal; renueva efectos si el objetivo seguirá vivo. Con cinco o más, distribúyelos y canaliza Huracán; detén el canal si tienes que moverte. Si falta maná, retira Fuegolunar de objetivos secundarios.","text_en":"Choose a main target for Wrath and Starfire. With two to four enemies, apply Insect Swarm then Moonfire to each, return to the main-target cycle, and refresh effects on targets that will live long enough. At five or more, spread them and channel Hurricane; stop the channel if you must move. If mana is low, drop Moonfire from secondary targets.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Balance Druid DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › AoE DPS Rotation for Balance Druids in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/balance/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-10-30"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:balance:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:234b080fc11f78b1d942cf88557658478dbab12c"]},{"id":"clase-druid-rotacion-feral-dps-60","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotación de Feral DPS a nivel 60","title_en":"Feral DPS Level-60 Rotation","summary_es":"Mantén Arañazo y Destripar en objetivos duraderos; reserva Mordedura feroz para remates.","summary_en":"Maintain Rake and Rip on durable targets; save Ferocious Bite for finishing.","keywords_es":["rotación feral gato 60","arañazo y destripar","mordedura feroz feral","poder cambiante energía"],"keywords_en":["feral cat rotation level 60","rake and rip","ferocious bite feral","shifting power energy"],"text_es":"Si el objetivo vivirá 6 s o más, mantén Arañazo y Destripar de 5 puntos. Usa Triturar con Conjuro libre; si no puedes colocarte detrás, Zarpa. Si morirá en 3 s o menos y tienes más de 3 puntos, remata con Mordedura feroz. Activa Poder cambiante solo si no desperdicias Energía y reserva energía para renovar sangrados; rellena con Triturar o Zarpa.","text_en":"If the target will live 6 seconds or longer, maintain Rake and a 5-point Rip. Use Shred with Clearcasting; if you cannot attack from behind, use Claw. If the target will die in 3 seconds or less and you have over 3 points, finish with Ferocious Bite. Use Shifting Power only if no Energy is wasted; pool Energy for bleeds and fill with Shred or Claw.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Druid DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › All Feral Druid DPS Rotations in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-11"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:feral:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:c4049f76ec48ccf7e48a5e4794a2cc8f9f523647"]},{"id":"clase-druid-rotacion-feral-dps-area-60","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Feral DPS: rotación de área a nivel 60","title_en":"Feral DPS Level-60 AoE Rotation","summary_es":"Reparte Arañazo, reserva Destripar para objetivos prioritarios y controla la Energía.","summary_en":"Spread Rake, reserve Rip for priority targets, and manage Energy.","keywords_es":["feral dps área 60","arañazo varios objetivos","destripar objetivo prioritario","energía feral área"],"keywords_en":["feral dps aoe level 60","rake multiple targets","rip priority target","feral aoe energy"],"text_es":"Con menos de 50 de Energía, usa Poder cambiante. Mantén Destripar de 5 puntos en objetivos prioritarios y aplica Arañazo a todos, sin renovarlo antes de que caiga. Cuando todos sangren, rellena con Triturar o Zarpa si estás delante; si llegas a 5 puntos mientras esperas, gástalos en Destripar.","text_en":"Below 50 Energy, use Shifting Power. Maintain a 5-point Rip on priority targets and spread Rake without refreshing it early. Once every target is bleeding, fill with Shred or Claw from the front; if you reach 5 points while waiting, spend them on Rip.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Druid DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › All Feral Druid DPS Rotations in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-11"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:feral:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:c4049f76ec48ccf7e48a5e4794a2cc8f9f523647"]},{"id":"clase-druid-rotacion-feral-tanque-60","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotación de Feral tanque a nivel 60","title_en":"Feral Tank Level-60 Rotation","summary_es":"Mantén cinco acumulaciones de Lacerar y reserva Rabia para Mordisco primigenio.","summary_en":"Maintain five Lacerate stacks and reserve Rage for Primal Bite.","keywords_es":["rotación oso tanque 60","mordisco primigenio prioridad","lacerar cinco acumulaciones","machaque rabia oso"],"keywords_en":["bear tank rotation level 60","primal bite priority","five lacerate stacks","maul rage bear"],"text_es":"Antes del pull, mantén Marca de lo salvaje y Espinas; conserva Clamor desmoralizador y Fuego feérico si nadie los aporta. Prioriza Mordisco primigenio cuando esté disponible y mantén cinco acumulaciones de Lacerar; rellena con Lacerar. Usa Machaque para gastar Rabia por encima de 35 solo si no retrasa las habilidades prioritarias. Recomendación provisional hasta que se pruebe a nivel 60.","text_en":"Before the pull, keep Mark of the Wild and Thorns up; maintain Demoralizing Roar and Faerie Fire if nobody else provides them. Use Primal Bite when available and maintain five Lacerate stacks, filling with Lacerate. Use Maul to dump Rage above 35 only if it does not delay higher-priority abilities. Provisional recommendation until tested at level 60.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Druid Tank Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › All Feral Druid Tank Rotations in WoW: Forever > Single Target Priority","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/rotation-cooldowns-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Druid Tank Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › All Feral Druid Tank Rotations in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/rotation-cooldowns-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Druid Tank Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Feral Druid Tank Opener in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/rotation-cooldowns-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Druid Tank Attribute and Stat Guide - WoW: Forever › Feral Druid Tank Stat Priority in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/stat-priority-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-03"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:feral:rotation","class:druid:feral:stats"],"source_hashes":["guide:d12518213ad7377235eeafa92e4f595e19c15932","section:211854d235b4e9cf635662913690dc90f0bea247","section:81d41d7268756c9caa01ff3d417c2a77bab8a502","section:ef261040c71cf417cbc7ae0a64d024a72f4bf2b1"]},{"id":"clase-druid-rotacion-feral-tanque-area-60","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Feral tanque: rotación de área a nivel 60","title_en":"Feral Tank Level-60 AoE Rotation","summary_es":"Mantén Lacerar en objetivos prioritarios, usa Flagelo para amenaza de área y gasta Rabia sobrante.","summary_en":"Keep Lacerate on priority targets, use Swipe for AoE threat, and spend excess Rage.","keywords_es":["feral tanque área","flagelo amenaza área oso","clamor desafiante oso","machaque rabia sobrante"],"keywords_en":["feral tank aoe","bear swipe aoe threat","challenging roar bear","maul excess rage"],"text_es":"Con varios enemigos, mantén Lacerar en los objetivos importantes y usa Mordisco primigenio en los que necesiten amenaza. Lanza Flagelo para daño y amenaza de área; Machaque gasta Rabia por encima de 50, priorizando a quien necesite amenaza. Si los enemigos persiguen a un aliado, recurre a Bramido o Clamor desafiante. Recomendación provisional hasta que se pruebe a nivel 60.","text_en":"Against several enemies, maintain Lacerate on important targets and use Primal Bite on those needing threat. Cast Swipe for AoE damage and threat; use Maul to spend Rage above 50 on targets that need threat. If enemies turn to an ally, use Growl or Challenging Roar. Provisional recommendation until tested at level 60.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Druid Tank Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › All Feral Druid Tank Rotations in WoW: Forever > AoE Priority","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/rotation-cooldowns-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Druid Tank Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › All Feral Druid Tank Rotations in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/rotation-cooldowns-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Druid Tank Attribute and Stat Guide - WoW: Forever › Feral Druid Tank Stat Priority in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/stat-priority-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-03"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:feral:rotation","class:druid:feral:stats"],"source_hashes":["guide:d12518213ad7377235eeafa92e4f595e19c15932","section:211854d235b4e9cf635662913690dc90f0bea247","section:81d41d7268756c9caa01ff3d417c2a77bab8a502"]},{"id":"clase-druid-rotacion-restauracion-single-60","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Recuperación: sanación a un objetivo","title_en":"Restoration Single-Target Healing","summary_es":"Ajusta la respuesta a la gravedad: Rejuvenecimiento, Recrecimiento o Arreglo rápido.","summary_en":"Match the response to severity: Rejuvenation, Regrowth, or Swiftmend.","keywords_es":["sanación a un objetivo recuperación","rejuvenecimiento daño leve","recrecimiento picos de daño","arreglo rápido emergencia"],"keywords_en":["restoration single target healing","rejuvenation light damage","regrowth damage spikes","swiftmend emergency"],"text_es":"Con daño leve, usa Rejuvenecimiento y añade Recrecimiento si no basta. Ante un pico, lanza Recrecimiento; si el daño es letal, usa Arreglo rápido si hay un HoT activo. Sin HoT, aplica Rejuvenecimiento y luego Arreglo rápido. Si Arreglo rápido está en reutilización o un segundo es demasiado, combina Rapidez de la Naturaleza con Toque curativo.","text_en":"For light damage, use Rejuvenation and add Regrowth if needed. For a spike, cast Regrowth; if damage is lethal, use Swiftmend when a HoT is active. Without a HoT, apply Rejuvenation then Swiftmend. If it is on cooldown or waiting a second is too long, combine Nature’s Swiftness with Healing Touch.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Druid Healing Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › All Restoration Druid Healing Rotations in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/restoration/rotation-cooldowns-pve-healer","date":"2026-11-01"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Druid Healing Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Best PvE Rotation for Restoration Druid Healing in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/restoration/rotation-cooldowns-pve-healer","date":"2026-11-01"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:restoration:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:3a57516c6f9be01c02e40229bcbc0762dfbd66cd","section:a36ad137ad7e1d4b0907d17f24661a2a48242647"]},{"id":"clase-druid-rotacion-restauracion-grupo-60","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Recuperación: varios objetivos y grupo","title_en":"Restoration Multi-Target and Party Healing","summary_es":"Distribuye Rejuvenecimiento y reserva Crecimiento salvaje para daño a tres o más del grupo.","summary_en":"Spread Rejuvenation and save Wild Growth for damage to three or more party members.","keywords_es":["sanar varios objetivos druida","crecimiento salvaje tres jugadores","curación grupo recuperación","rejuvenecimiento recrecimiento área"],"keywords_en":["restoration multi target healing","wild growth three party members","restoration party healing","rejuvenation regrowth group"],"text_es":"Con daño leve en varios, aplica Rejuvenecimiento a cada objetivo y Recrecimiento a los picos. Ante daño intenso, prepara Rejuvenecimiento; con tres o más heridos del mismo grupo, lanza Crecimiento salvaje y sigue con Recrecimiento y Arreglo rápido en los más bajos que tengan HoT. Si el daño es letal, combina Rapidez de la Naturaleza y Toque curativo en el más bajo, Arreglo rápido en el siguiente y Recrecimiento para rematar.","text_en":"For light damage on several targets, apply Rejuvenation to each and Regrowth to spikes. Before heavy damage, pre-apply Rejuvenation; with three or more injured players in one party, cast Wild Growth, then Regrowth and Swiftmend on the lowest targets with a HoT. For lethal damage, use Nature’s Swiftness and Healing Touch on the lowest, Swiftmend on the next, and Regrowth to finish.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Druid Healing Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › All Restoration Druid Healing Rotations in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/restoration/rotation-cooldowns-pve-healer","date":"2026-11-01"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:restoration:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:a36ad137ad7e1d4b0907d17f24661a2a48242647"]},{"id":"clase-druid-rotacion-restauracion-banda-60","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Recuperación: sanación de banda","title_en":"Restoration Raid Healing","summary_es":"Prioriza tu grupo asignado, extiende Rejuvenecimiento y alterna Crecimiento salvaje con curas de pico.","summary_en":"Prioritize your assigned party, spread Rejuvenation, and alternate Wild Growth with spike heals.","keywords_es":["sanación banda druida","grupo asignado recuperación raid","rejuvenecimiento en banda","crecimiento salvaje banda"],"keywords_en":["restoration raid healing","assigned party raid druid","raid rejuvenation","wild growth raid healing"],"text_es":"Si te asignan un grupo, céntrate en él; sin asignación, mantén a salvo a tu grupo y luego ayuda a otros. Con daño leve, extiende Rejuvenecimiento por la banda. Ante daño fuerte, prioriza tu grupo y alterna Crecimiento salvaje con Rejuvenecimiento. En crisis, usa Rapidez de la Naturaleza y Toque curativo, Arreglo rápido y Recrecimiento en ese orden; después vuelve a extender Rejuvenecimiento.","text_en":"If assigned a party, focus on it; without an assignment, keep your own party safe before helping others. For light damage, spread Rejuvenation across the raid. During heavy damage, prioritize your party and alternate Wild Growth with Rejuvenation. In a crisis, use Nature’s Swiftness and Healing Touch, Swiftmend, and Regrowth in that order; then spread Rejuvenation again.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Druid Healing Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › All Restoration Druid Healing Rotations in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/restoration/rotation-cooldowns-pve-healer","date":"2026-11-01"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:restoration:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:a36ad137ad7e1d4b0907d17f24661a2a48242647"]},{"id":"clase-druid-build-equilibrio-pve","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build de Equilibrio JcE para banda/mazmorra","title_en":"Balance PvE Raid/Dungeon Build","summary_es":"Ruta inicial de multidot; mueve Refracción a Génesis si el maná alcanza.","summary_en":"Early multidot path; move Reflection to Genesis if mana allows.","keywords_es":["build druida equilibrio pve","talentos druida equilibrio pve","puntos talentos druida equilibrio pve"],"keywords_en":["druid build equilibrio pve","druid talents equilibrio pve","druid talent points equilibrio pve"],"text_es":"Rama de Equilibrio: Cólera mejorada 5/5, Génesis 2/5, Brillo lunar 3/3, Fuegolunar mejorado 2/2, Majestuosidad de la naturaleza 2/2, Alcance de la naturaleza 2/2, Esplendor de la naturaleza 1/1, Enjambre de insectos 1/1, Venganza 5/5, Fuego estelar mejorado 5/5, Gracia de la naturaleza 1/1, Eclipse 3/3, Furia de luna 5/5 y Forma de lechúcico lunar 1/1. En Recuperación: Enfoque de la naturaleza 5/5, Naturalista 5/5 y Refracción 3/3.","text_en":"Balance: Improved Wrath 5/5, Genesis 2/5, Moonglow 3/3, Improved Moonfire 2/2, Nature's Majesty 2/2, Nature's Reach 2/2, Nature's Splendor 1/1, Insect Swarm 1/1, Vengeance 5/5, Improved Starfire 5/5, Nature's Grace 1/1, Eclipse 3/3, Moonfury 5/5, and Moonkin Form 1/1. Restoration: Nature's Focus 5/5, Naturalist 5/5, and Reflection 3/3.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Balance Druid Talent Tree Builds - Forever › Best Balance Druid PvE Raid and Dungeon Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/balance/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["class:druid:balance:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:e03c13c86b67a2edbcfba6692fe83dc5e521928f"]},{"id":"clase-druid-build-equilibrio-pvp","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build JcJ de Equilibrio","title_en":"Balance PvP Build","summary_es":"Prioriza daño periódico, supervivencia y control para mantener la distancia.","summary_en":"Prioritizes damage-over-time, survivability, and control to maintain distance.","keywords_es":["build druida equilibrio pvp","talentos druida equilibrio pvp","puntos talentos druida equilibrio pvp"],"keywords_en":["druid build equilibrio pvp","druid talents equilibrio pvp","druid talent points equilibrio pvp"],"text_es":"Rama de Equilibrio: Cólera mejorada 5/5, Génesis 5/5, Brillo lunar 3/3, Fuegolunar mejorado 2/2, Majestuosidad de la naturaleza 2/2, Alcance de la naturaleza 2/2, Enredaderas 3/3, Esplendor de la naturaleza 1/1, Enjambre de insectos 1/1, Venganza 5/5, Sobrecrecimiento 2/2, Gracia de la naturaleza 1/1, Furia de luna 5/5 y Forma de lechúcico lunar 1/1. En Recuperación: Enfoque de la naturaleza 5/5, Naturalista 5/5 y Refracción 3/3.","text_en":"Balance: Improved Wrath 5/5, Genesis 5/5, Moonglow 3/3, Improved Moonfire 2/2, Nature's Majesty 2/2, Nature's Reach 2/2, Improved Entangling Roots 3/3, Nature's Splendor 1/1, Insect Swarm 1/1, Vengeance 5/5, Overgrowth 2/2, Nature's Grace 1/1, Moonfury 5/5, and Moonkin Form 1/1. Restoration: Nature's Focus 5/5, Naturalist 5/5, and Reflection 3/3.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Balance Druid Talent Tree Builds - Forever › Best Balance Druid PvP Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/balance/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["class:druid:balance:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:13e20a0883fc31848aaece498e04d7db5e42d649"]},{"id":"clase-druid-build-feral-dps-mana","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build feral de maná para mundo abierto","title_en":"Feral Open-World Mana Build (open world)","summary_es":"Aumenta la regeneración para reducir las pausas para beber al levear.","summary_en":"Improves mana regenerati