xt_es":"Rama de Combate feral: Frenesí sangriento 2/2, Impacto brutal 2/2, Carga feral 1/1, Presteza feral 2/2, Ferocidad 5/5, Furor 5/5, Lacerar 1/1, Líder de la manada 1/1, Instinto natural 2/2, Disciplina depredadora 1/1, Golpes depredadores 3/3, Mordisco primigenio 1/1, Desgarrar y rasgar 4/5, Furia salvaje 2/2, Garras afiladas 2/2, Poder cambiante 1/1. Rama de Recuperación: Corazón de lo Salvaje 5/5, Metamorfosis natural 3/3, Naturalista 4/5, Refracción 3/3, Arreglo rápido 1/1.","text_en":"Feral: Blood Frenzy 2/2, Brutal Impact 2/2, Feral Charge 1/1, Feral Swiftness 2/2, Ferocity 5/5, Furor 5/5, Lacerate 1/1, Leader of the Pack 1/1, Natural Instinct 2/2, Predatory Discipline 1/1, Predatory Strikes 3/3, Primal Bite 1/1, Rend and Tear 4/5, Savage Fury 2/2, Sharpened Claws 2/2, Shifting Power 1/1. Restoration: Heart of the Wild 5/5, Natural Shapeshifter 3/3, Naturalist 4/5, Reflection 3/3, Swiftmend 1/1.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Feral Druid DPS Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Feral Druid PvP Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:feral:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:2b09a319c907a916cc1353403858640f6774ad2a"]},{"id":"clase-druid-build-feral-tanque-reflection","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build de oso de recuperación de maná (mundo abierto)","title_en":"Feral Reflection Open-World Tank Build (open world)","summary_es":"Invierte en Recuperación para reducir pausas sin curas externas; Floración es experimental.","summary_en":"Invests in Restoration to reduce downtime without outside healing; Bloom is experimental.","keywords_es":["build druida feral tanque reflection","talentos druida feral tanque reflection","puntos talentos druida feral tanque reflection"],"keywords_en":["druid build feral tanque reflection","druid talents feral tanque reflection","druid talent points fe