l","title_es":"Build Recuperación para subir · Recuperación","title_en":"Leveling Restoration Build · Recuperación","summary_es":"Reparto completo de Recuperación para subir, agrupado por rama.","summary_en":"Complete Leveling Restoration allocation, grouped by tree.","keywords_es":["talentos recuperación para subir chamán","build recuperación para subir completa","puntos talentos chamán"],"keywords_en":["recuperación para subir shaman talents","complete recuperación para subir build","shaman talent points"],"text_es":"Recuperación: Onda de curación mejorada 1/5, Enfoque de las mareas 5/5, Conciencia 3/3, Reencarnación mejorada 2/2, Curación ancestral 3/3, Enfoque curativo 3/3, Escudo de agua 1/1, Maestría de las mareas 5/5, Tótem de marea de maná 1/1, Forma curativa 3/3, Rapidez de la Naturaleza 1/1, Purificación 5/5, Mareas vivas 1/1.","text_en":"Restoration: Improved Healing Wave 1/5, Tidal Focus 5/5, Mindfulness 3/3, Improved Reincarnation 2/2, Ancestral Healing 3/3, Healing Focus 3/3, Water Shield 1/1, Tidal Mastery 5/5, Mana Tide Totem 1/1, Healing Way 3/3, Nature's Swiftness 1/1, Purification 5/5, Riptide 1/1.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Shaman Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Restoration Shaman Healer in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/restoration/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:restoration:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:ba4ecbe5b079aa61b083a6da96b16b03fab0eeef"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-build-recuperacion-subir-mejora","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build Recuperación para subir · Mejora","title_en":"Leveling Restoration Build · Mejora","summary_es":"Reparto completo de Recuperación para subir, agrupado por rama.","summary_en":"Complete Leveling Restoration allocation, grouped by tree.","keywords_es":["talentos recuperación para subir chamán","build recuperación para subir completa","puntos talentos chamán"],"keywords_en":["recuperación para subir shaman talents","complete recuperación para subir build","shaman talent points"],"text_es":"Mejora: Golpes de trueno 5/5, Conocimiento ancestral 5/5, Maña mental 3/3, Armas elementales 1/3, Enfoque chamanístico 1/1, Lobo fantasmal mejorado 2/2.","text_en":"Enhancement: Thundering Strikes 5/5, Ancestral Knowledge 5/5, Mental Dexterity 3/3, Elemental Weapons 1/3, Shamanistic Focus 1/1, Improved Ghost Wolf 2/2.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Shaman Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Restoration Shaman Healer in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/restoration/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:restoration:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:ba4ecbe5b079aa61b083a6da96b16b03fab0eeef"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-build-wavebreaker-mejora","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build Wavebreaker · Mejora","title_en":"Wavebreaker Build · Mejora","summary_es":"Reparto completo de Wavebreaker, agrupado por rama.","summary_en":"Complete Wavebreaker allocation, grouped by tree.","keywords_es":["talentos wavebreaker chamán","build wavebreaker completa","puntos talentos chamán"],"keywords_en":["wavebreaker shaman talents","complete wavebreaker build","shaman talent points"],"text_es":"Mejora: Golpes de trueno 5/5, Conocimiento ancestral 5/5, Lobo fantasmal mejorado 2/2, Armas elementales 2/3, Enfoque chamanístico 1/1, Dureza 4/5, Golpe de tormenta 1/1.","text_en":"Enhancement: Thundering Strikes 5/5, Ancestral Knowledge 5/5, Improved Ghost Wolf 2/2, Elemental Weapons 2/3, Shamanistic Focus 1/1, Toughness 4/5, Stormstrike 1/1.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Wavebreaker Shaman Hybrid Guide for WoW: Forever › The build: Wavebreaker (0/20/31)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/wavebreaker-shaman-hybrid-guide-for-wow-forever-35074","date":"2026-10-20"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:extra:wavebreaker-shaman-hybrid-guide-for-wow-forever"],"source_hashes":["section:c4fd4b369f62079754a9a9153256c5694c9fdb5b"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-build-wavebreaker-recuperacion","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build Wavebreaker · Recuperación","title_en":"Wavebreaker Build · Recuperación","summary_es":"Reparto completo de Wavebreaker, agrupado por rama.","summary_en":"Complete Wavebreaker allocation, grouped by tree.","keywords_es":["talentos wavebreaker chamán","build wavebreaker completa","puntos talentos chamán"],"keywords_en":["wavebreaker shaman talents","complete wavebreaker build","shaman talent points"],"text_es":"Recuperación: Onda de curación mejorada 5/5, Conciencia 3/3, Enfoque totémico 5/5, Enfoque curativo 1/3, Escudo de agua 1/1, Maestría de las mareas 5/5, Tótem de marea de maná 1/1, Forma curativa 3/3, Rapidez de la Naturaleza 1/1, Purificación 5/5, Mareas vivas 1/1.","text_en":"Restoration: Improved Healing Wave 5/5, Mindfulness 3/3, Totemic Focus 5/5, Healing Focus 1/3, Water Shield 1/1, Tidal Mastery 5/5, Mana Tide Totem 1/1, Healing Way 3/3, Nature's Swiftness 1/1, Purification 5/5, Riptide 1/1.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Wavebreaker Shaman Hybrid Guide for WoW: Forever › The build: Wavebreaker (0/20/31)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/wavebreaker-shaman-hybrid-guide-for-wow-forever-35074","date":"2026-10-20"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:extra:wavebreaker-shaman-hybrid-guide-for-wow-forever"],"source_hashes":["section:c4fd4b369f62079754a9a9153256c5694c9fdb5b"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-ruta-spellhance","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Ruta de talentos Spellhance","title_en":"Spellhance Talent Path","summary_es":"Spellhance prioriza maná y movilidad antes de reinvertir en Mejora.","summary_en":"Spellhance prioritizes mana and mobility before respeccing into Enhancement.","keywords_es":["ruta talentos spellhance","subir con spellhance","talentos chamán híbrido"],"keywords_en":["spellhance talent path","leveling spellhance","hybrid shaman talents"],"text_es":"Del 10 al 31 prioriza Golpes de trueno 5/5, Conocimiento ancestral 2/5, Maña mental 3/3 y Enfoque chamanístico 1/1; invierte también en Enfoque de las mareas 5/5, Conciencia 3/3, Enfoque totémico 2/5 y Escudo de agua 1/1 para el maná. Al 31 (26 con puntos de Legado), cambia de talentos y acelera Golpe de tormenta mejorado 2/2; después toma Presura mental 2/2 y Armas de espíritu 1/1, vuelve a Recuperación y termina Elemental.","text_en":"From levels 10–31, prioritize Thundering Strikes 5/5, Ancestral Knowledge 2/5, Mental Dexterity 3/3, and Shamanistic Focus 1/1; also invest in Tidal Focus 5/5, Mindfulness 3/3, Totemic Focus 2/5, and Water Shield 1/1 for mana. At 31 (26 with Legacy Points), respec and rush Improved Stormstrike 2/2; then take Mental Quickness 2/2 and Spirit Weapons 1/1, return to Restoration, and finish Elemental.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Elemental Shaman Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Elemental Shaman DPS in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/elemental/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:elemental:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:84702d1e106cbfa4c71f55027da7e4f66b3ecb24"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-ruta-elemental-subir","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Ruta Elemental para subir","title_en":"Elemental Leveling Path","summary_es":"Elemental a distancia obtiene primero daño y luego movilidad y aguante.","summary_en":"Ranged Elemental takes damage talents first, then mobility and survival.","keywords_es":["ruta talentos elemental subir","talentos elemental niveles","elemental en solitario chamán"],"keywords_en":["elemental leveling talent path","elemental talents by level","solo elemental shaman"],"text_es":"Para subir solo, toma Concusión 5/5 (10–14), Llamada de la llama 3/3 (15–17), Reverberación 2/5 (18–19), Enfoque elemental (20), Prontitud elemental 3/3 (21–23), Convección 5/5 (24–28), Ojo de la tormenta 1/3 (29); al 30, deja libre el punto de Ráfaga de lava, talento retirado. Después, Sobrecarga de relámpagos 3/3 (31–33), Alcance elemental 1/2 (34), Furia elemental 5/5 (35–39) y Maestría de Relámpago (40); después invierte 20 puntos en Mejora.","text_en":"For solo leveling, take Concussion 5/5 (10–14), Call of Flame 3/3 (15–17), Reverberation 2/5 (18–19), Elemental Focus (20), Elemental Alacrity 3/3 (21–23), Convection 5/5 (24–28), Eye of the Storm 1/3 (29); at 30, leave the retired Lava Burst point free. Then take Lightning Overload 3/3 (31–33), Elemental Reach 1/2 (34), Elemental Fury 5/5 (35–39), and Lightning Mastery (40); then spend 20 points in Enhancement.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Elemental Shaman Leveling Guide for WoW: Forever › Branch A: Elemental Leveling (31/20/0)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/elemental-shaman-leveling-guide-for-wow-forever-35069","date":"2026-10-20"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Elemental Shaman Leveling Guide for WoW: Forever › Elemental: levels 10–40 (31 points)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/elemental-shaman-leveling-guide-for-wow-forever-35069","date":"2026-10-20"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:extra:elemental-shaman-leveling-guide-for-wow-forever"],"source_hashes":["section:225561441426488627cfe3a666cecec8bf9cae1c","section:67e2d069a5028829448c129e17e24744a2954d81"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-ruta-elemental-grupo","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Ruta Elemental para grupos","title_en":"Elemental Group Talent Path","summary_es":"La variante de grupo añade control, alcance y resistencia al retroceso.","summary_en":"The group variant adds control, range, and pushback resistance.","keywords_es":["ruta talentos elemental grupo","build elemental mazmorra","vinculado a la tierra talentos"],"keywords_en":["elemental group talent path","elemental dungeon build","earthbound talents"],"text_es":"La variante de grupo toma Convección 5/5 (10–14), Concusión 5/5 (15–19), Reverberación 5/5 (20–24), Llamada de la llama 3/3 (25–27), Enfoque elemental (28), Prontitud elemental 3/3 (29–31), Ojo de la tormenta 3/3 (32–34), Vinculado a la tierra (35), Alcance elemental 2/2 (36–37), Sobrecarga de relámpagos 3/3 (38–40); el punto de Ráfaga de lava, talento retirado, queda libre. Sigue Furia elemental 5/5 (42–46) y Maestría de Relámpago (47); luego invierte 13 puntos en Mejora.","text_en":"The group variant takes Convection 5/5 (10–14), Concussion 5/5 (15–19), Reverberation 5/5 (20–24), Call of Flame 3/3 (25–27), Elemental Focus (28), Elemental Alacrity 3/3 (29–31), Eye of the Storm 3/3 (32–34), Earthbound (35), Elemental Reach 2/2 (36–37), Lightning Overload 3/3 (38–40); leave the retired Lava Burst point free. Then take Elemental Fury 5/5 (42–46), and Lightning Mastery (47); then spend 13 points in Enhancement.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Elemental Shaman Leveling Guide for WoW: Forever › Branch B: Community Elemental (38/13/0)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/elemental-shaman-leveling-guide-for-wow-forever-35069","date":"2026-10-20"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Elemental Shaman Leveling Guide for WoW: Forever › Elemental: levels 10–47 (38 points)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/elemental-shaman-leveling-guide-for-wow-forever-35069","date":"2026-10-20"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:extra:elemental-shaman-leveling-guide-for-wow-forever"],"source_hashes":["section:596c858853686fb0561dcebeb56de4ac51e0bb98","section:a5763c73e49add292dbb65e0640348eb399d3da4"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-habilidades-elemental","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Habilidades para entrenar: Elemental","title_en":"Elemental Abilities to Train","summary_es":"Prioriza hechizos eficientes y tótems; algunos rangos opcionales ahorran oro.","summary_en":"Prioritize efficient spells and totems; selected optional ranks save gold.","keywords_es":["habilidades elemental entrenar","rangos chamán elemental","hechizos elemental por nivel"],"keywords_en":["elemental abilities to train","elemental shaman spell ranks","elemental spells by level"],"text_es":"Entrena Descarga de relámpagos para atraer enemigos, Choque de tierra para interrumpir, Tótem Fuerza de la tierra, Tótem Nexo Terrestre, Escudo de relámpagos, Choque de llamas, Tótem abrasador y Arma lengua de Fuego. Añade Nova de Fuego, Lobo fantasmal y Choque de Escarcha al 20, Tótem de magma al 26 y Cadena de relámpagos al 32. Si falta oro, puedes dejar Descarga por encima del rango 4 para más adelante; los tótems de resistencia son poco útiles al subir.","text_en":"Train Lightning Bolt for pulling, Earth Shock to interrupt, Strength of Earth Totem, Earthbind Totem, Lightning Shield, Flame Shock, Searing Totem, and Flametongue Weapon. Learn Fire Nova, Ghost Wolf and Frost Shock at 20, Magma Totem at 26, and Chain Lightning at 32. If short on gold, defer Lightning Bolt ranks above Rank 4; resistance totems are rarely useful while leveling.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Elemental Shaman Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Mandatory Abilities to Train for Elemental Shaman","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/elemental/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:elemental:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:d3a29cfa972b6a9b0ec4f3c3c61fe08d738eff57"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-habilidades-mejora","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Habilidades para entrenar: Mejora","title_en":"Enhancement Abilities to Train","summary_es":"Mejora prioriza choques, escudos, imbuyentes y tótems de grupo.","summary_en":"Enhancement prioritizes Shocks, shields, imbues, and group totems.","keywords_es":["habilidades mejora entrenar","rangos mejora chamán","tótems mejora obligatorios"],"keywords_en":["enhancement abilities to train","enhancement shaman spell ranks","mandatory enhancement totems"],"text_es":"Entrena Choque de tierra rango 7, Choque de llamas rango 6, Arma tótem Viento Furioso rango 4, Escudo de relámpagos rango 7, Nova de Fuego rango 5 y Tótem Fuerza de la tierra rango 5. Aprende también Tótem de purificación de veneno, Tótem purgador de enfermedades y Tótem Viento Furioso rango 1. Llamada de los elementos, Llamada de los ancestros, Llamada de los espíritus y Llamada totémica son opcionales.","text_en":"Train Earth Shock rank 7, Flame Shock rank 6, Windfury Weapon rank 4, Lightning Shield rank 7, Fire Nova rank 5, and Strength of Earth Totem rank 5. Also learn Poison Cleansing Totem, Disease Cleansing Totem, and Windfury Totem rank 1. Optional totem tools include Totemic Call and the Ancestors and Spirits calls; Call of the Elements can summon a full set.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Enhancement Shaman Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Mandatory Abilities to Train for Enhancement Shaman","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/enhancement/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Enhancement Shaman Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Optional Abilities to Train for Enhancement Shaman","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/enhancement/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:enhancement:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:7227eb6ea429859184ccd320a0dd63e51db35ca1","section:972655c2252ae550ee03bed42176294c46798500"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-habilidades-recuperacion","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Habilidades para entrenar: Recuperación","title_en":"Restoration Abilities to Train","summary_es":"Recuperación prioriza curas, tótems y limpieza de veneno y enfermedad.","summary_en":"Restoration prioritizes heals, totems, and poison and disease removal.","keywords_es":["habilidades recuperación entrenar","hechizos sanador chamán","curar veneno enfermedad chamán"],"keywords_en":["restoration abilities to train","shaman healer spells","shaman cure poison disease"],"text_es":"Entrena Onda de curación, Descarga de relámpagos, Choque de tierra, Tótem Fuerza de la tierra, Tótem Nexo Terrestre y Escudo de relámpagos. Aprende Curar veneno y Curar enfermedad para limpiar esas aflicciones. Añade Tótem abrasador, Arma lengua de Fuego, Tótem de tremor, Lobo fantasmal, Onda inferior de curación, Tótem Corriente de sanación y Tótem Fuente de maná al 26; al 40, Curación en cadena es la cura de área. Descarga de relámpagos por encima del rango 4 puede esperar.","text_en":"Train Healing Wave, Lightning Bolt, Earth Shock, Strength of Earth Totem, Earthbind Totem, and Lightning Shield. Learn Cure Poison and Cure Disease to remove those afflictions. Learn Searing Totem, Flametongue Weapon, Tremor Totem, Ghost Wolf, Lesser Healing Wave, Healing Stream Totem, and Mana Spring Totem at 26; at 40, Chain Heal is the area heal. Lightning Bolt ranks above Rank 4 can wait.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Shaman Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Mandatory Abilities to Train for Restoration Shaman","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/restoration/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Shaman Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Optional Abilities to Train for Restoration Shaman","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/restoration/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Shaman Healing Guide for WoW: Forever › Healing toolkit","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/restoration-shaman-healing-guide-for-wow-forever-35071","date":"2026-10-20"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:extra:restoration-shaman-healing-guide-for-wow-forever","class:shaman:restoration:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:76ff15a95d17c1cccc55cc99ad44c19594898bc4","section:a0f4eec7f5f82319baf397ae3b974fff3afed5cb","section:bd0a7038c7ca9f7efc5e6dd3528d0d3224a04549"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-profesiones-elemental","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Profesiones para subir: Elemental","title_en":"Elemental Leveling Professions","summary_es":"Peletería ofrece equipo y kits; otras profesiones aportan comida y consumibles.","summary_en":"Leatherworking provides gear and kits; other professions add food and consumables.","keywords_es":["profesiones elemental subir","peletería chamán elemental","cocina pesca chamán"],"keywords_en":["elemental leveling professions","elemental shaman leatherworking","shaman cooking fishing"],"text_es":"Peletería y Desuello combinan bien: Peletería fabrica equipo de cuero y malla con poder con hechizos y complementos de armadura. Cocina da comida con un 5% más de experiencia por muertes, y Pesca facilita subir Cocina. Encantamiento crea aceites y reliquias, aunque cuesta oro; Alquimia con Herboristería ayuda a producir pociones de maná. Ingeniería aporta explosivos y Minería sus materiales.","text_en":"Leatherworking and Skinning pair well: Leatherworking crafts leather and mail gear with spell power and armor kits. Cooking provides food granting 5% more experience from kills, and Fishing speeds up Cooking. Enchanting makes oils and relics but costs gold; Alchemy with Herbalism helps supply mana potions. Engineering offers explosives, and Mining supplies its materials.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Elemental Shaman Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Professions for Elemental Shaman DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/elemental/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:elemental:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:9b40d5c7f5d3dc44d6f297beb0437a160f58e03d"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-profesiones-mejora","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Profesiones para subir: Mejora","title_en":"Enhancement Leveling Professions","summary_es":"Peletería fabrica equipo; Desuello y Minería generan materiales vendibles.","summary_en":"Leatherworking crafts gear; Skinning and Mining provide sellable materials.","keywords_es":["profesiones mejora subir","peletería desuello chamán","encantamiento maná chamán"],"keywords_en":["enhancement leveling professions","shaman leatherworking skinning","shaman enchanting mana"],"text_es":"Peletería fabrica equipo útil para cubrir huecos entre botines; combínala con Desollar o compra cuero. Encantamiento puede crear el Icono de madera a la deriva pulido, que ayuda con el maná. Minería genera materiales para Herrería e Ingeniería, mientras Desuello abastece Peletería. Botánica con Alquimia también puede servir si se necesitan consumibles.","text_en":"Leatherworking crafts useful gear to fill gaps between drops; pair it with Skinning or buy leather. Enchanting can make the Polished Driftwood Icon, which helps with mana. Mining supplies materials for Blacksmithing and Engineering, while Skinning supplies Leatherworking. Herbalism with Alchemy can also help if consumables are needed.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Enhancement Shaman Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Professions for Enhancement Shaman DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/enhancement/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:enhancement:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:3b9172f5b3c9f31b87d01d4f9230ae7227743596"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-consumibles-subir","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Consumibles para subir","title_en":"Leveling Consumables","summary_es":"Comida, aceites, kits, pociones y elixires mejoran experiencia o atributos.","summary_en":"Food, oils, kits, potions, and elixirs improve experience or stats.","keywords_es":["consumibles chamán subir","comida experiencia 5%","aceite zahorí complemento armadura"],"keywords_en":["shaman leveling consumables","5% experience food","wizard oil armor kit"],"text_es":"Mantén comida activa: incluso la más sencilla aumenta un 5% la experiencia de enemigos derrotados. El Aceite de zahorí menor añade poder con hechizos y se acumula con las imbuyiciones; dura varias horas. Los kits de armadura de Peletería añaden poder con hechizos y armadura en pecho, piernas, manos o pies. Pociones y elixires de Alquimia aportan atributos, aunque comprarlos puede ser caro.","text_en":"Keep food active: even basic food increases experience from kills by 5%. Minor Wizard Oil adds spell power and stacks with weapon imbues; it lasts for hours. Leatherworker-made armor kits add spell power and armor to chest, legs, hands, or feet. Alchemy potions and elixirs add stats, though buying them can be costly.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Elemental Shaman Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Consumables for Elemental Shaman DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/elemental/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:elemental:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:fe7a5492abf841706c41ec240e08643af945c19d"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-campamento-subir","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Mejoras de campamento para subir","title_en":"Leveling Camp Buffs","summary_es":"La tienda aporta experiencia descansada; el cuenco aumenta atributos.","summary_en":"The tent adds rested experience; the fish bowl increases stats.","keywords_es":["mejoras campamento chamán","tienda campamento experiencia","cuenco con pescado atributos"],"keywords_en":["shaman camping buffs","camp tent experience","fish bowl stats"],"text_es":"La Tienda de campamento de Peletería da hasta un 5% de experiencia descansada. La Silla de campamento de Desuello otorga golpe crítico y la Vela de incienso otorga intelecto para ampliar el maná y potenciar Presura mental. El Cuenco con pescado aumenta un 8% los atributos principales y no se acumula con Bendición de los Reyes.","text_en":"Camp Tent made by Leatherworking grants up to 5% rested experience. Camp Chair linked to Skinning gives critical strike, while Incense Candle grants Intellect to expand mana and benefit Mental Quickness. Fish Bowl from Fishing increases primary stats by 8% and does not stack with Blessing of Kings.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Elemental Shaman Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Camping Buffs for Elemental Shaman DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/elemental/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:elemental:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:48f74c4b00facfb3c9822e6d40a05ff049a16907"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-rotacion-subir-elemental","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotación Elemental para subir","title_en":"Elemental Leveling Rotation","summary_es":"Choque de llamas prepara Ráfaga de lava; Descarga de relámpagos rellena.","summary_en":"Flame Shock sets up Lava Burst; Lightning Bolt fills.","keywords_es":["rotación elemental subir","ráfaga de lava choque llamas","descarga relámpagos elemental"],"keywords_en":["elemental leveling rotation","lava burst flame shock","elemental lightning bolt"],"text_es":"Antes de combatir, mantén Escudo de relámpagos o Escudo de agua, imbuye el arma y coloca tótems. Abre a distancia con Descarga de relámpagos; aplica Choque de llamas antes de Ráfaga de lava para que esta inflija un 20% más. Sigue con Descarga de relámpagos; usa Choque de tierra para rematar o interrumpir. Con Enfoque elemental gasta el lanzamiento gratuito en un hechizo caro. Contra varios enemigos, Nova de Fuego y Cadena de relámpagos consumen mucho maná.","text_en":"Before combat, maintain Lightning Shield or Water Shield, imbue your weapon, and place totems. Open at range with Lightning Bolt; apply Flame Shock before Lava Burst so it deals 20% more damage. Continue with Lightning Bolt; use Earth Shock to finish or interrupt. Spend the free cast from Elemental Focus on an expensive spell. Against several enemies, Fire Nova and Chain Lightning use substantial mana.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Elemental Shaman Leveling Guide for WoW: Forever › Leveling playstyle > Levels 30–39: Lava Burst and Lightning Overload","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/elemental-shaman-leveling-guide-for-wow-forever-35069","date":"2026-10-20"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Elemental Shaman Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Rotation for Elemental Shaman DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/elemental/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:elemental:leveling","class:shaman:extra:elemental-shaman-leveling-guide-for-wow-forever"],"source_hashes":["guide:caf0104f2905d0760d58f53077e8af84b116680c","section:4298e9a6b9f493543c1a290cb540b1e0313bc66d"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-rotacion-subir-mejora","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotación Mejora para subir","title_en":"Enhancement Leveling Rotation","summary_es":"Los ataques automáticos hacen gran parte del daño; ahorra maná.","summary_en":"Auto-attacks deal much of the damage; conserve mana.","keywords_es":["rotación mejora subir","arma vorágine cinco cargas","ataques automáticos chamán"],"keywords_en":["enhancement leveling rotation","five maelstrom stacks","shaman auto attacks"],"text_es":"Mantén Escudo de relámpagos y una imbuición; usa Arma lengua de Fuego desde el nivel 10. Coloca tótems de fuerza y fuego, aplica Choque de llamas y deja que los ataques automáticos hagan daño; usa Choque de tierra si el enemigo lanza. Desde 30, Arma tótem Viento Furioso funciona con un arma lenta a dos manos. Al llegar a 5 cargas de Arma vorágine, lanza Descarga de relámpagos. Desde 40, usa Golpe de tormenta y después un choque o Descarga de relámpagos potenciado.","text_en":"Keep Lightning Shield active and an imbue; use Flametongue Weapon from level 10. Place the strength totem and a fire-damage totem, apply Flame Shock, and let auto-attacks deal damage; use Earth Shock when the enemy casts. From 30, Windfury Weapon works with a slow two-hander. At 5 Maelstrom Weapon stacks, cast Lightning Bolt. From 40, use Stormstrike, then an empowered Shock or Lightning Bolt.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Enhancement Shaman Leveling Guide for WoW: Forever › Leveling playstyle > Levels 20–39: Flurry and Maelstrom Weapon","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/enhancement-shaman-leveling-guide-for-wow-forever-35070","date":"2026-10-20"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:extra:enhancement-shaman-leveling-guide-for-wow-forever"],"source_hashes":["guide:07a352d85df768c9964fecc3e859e13237476e22"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-ventajas-desventajas-subir","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Ventajas y límites al subir","title_en":"Leveling Strengths and Weaknesses","summary_es":"Elemental aporta área y tótems; Mejora es flexible, pero consume maná.","summary_en":"Elemental brings AoE and totems; Enhancement is flexible but mana-hungry.","keywords_es":["ventajas chamán subir","desventajas elemental mejora","mejor clase chamán solo"],"keywords_en":["shaman leveling strengths","elemental enhancement weaknesses","best solo shaman spec"],"text_es":"Elemental combina daño de área y utilidad de grupo, aunque sufre contra un objetivo y por el coste de maná. Spellhance ofrece una subida más rápida y eficiente en maná. Mejora aprovecha muchos atributos y puede dañar, sanar, tanquear y apoyar; sus límites son el maná, la amenaza y manejar más de uno o dos enemigos. Recuperación cura bien en grupo, pero su daño bajo hace lenta la subida en solitario.","text_en":"Elemental combines AoE damage with group utility, but struggles against one target and with mana costs. Spellhance offers faster, more mana-efficient leveling. Enhancement benefits from many stats and can damage, heal, tank, and support; its limits are mana, threat, and handling more than one or two enemies. Restoration heals well in groups, but its low damage makes solo leveling slow.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Elemental Shaman Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Pros","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/elemental/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Elemental Shaman Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Viability for Elemental Shaman DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/elemental/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Enhancement Shaman Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Pros","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/enhancement/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Enhancement Shaman Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Cons","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/enhancement/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Shaman Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Viability for Restoration Shaman Healer in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/restoration/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:elemental:leveling","class:shaman:enhancement:leveling","class:shaman:restoration:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:02edca8cefc6a8955b596cb9dc24d17c8c3bb8d8","section:1f55aa0f10d791edc1307c8beba6736badcac940","section:20d0146f2c49a66f4e08ec437aa53046a8a91074","section:394499396437b37cce434672c721334cb1a5577b","section:46f798a58b64565a4b8008794494ae84739c49d2"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-build-recuperacion-sanador-uso","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build Recuperación sanadora de grupo","title_en":"Restoration Group-Healing Build","summary_es":"La distribución 5/10/36 está pensada para sanar grupos.","summary_en":"The 5/10/36 allocation is designed for group healing.","keywords_es":["build recuperación sanador de grupo","build chamán 5 10 36","para qué sirve build recuperación"],"keywords_en":["restoration group healer build","shaman 5 10 36 build","restoration build purpose"],"text_es":"La distribución 5/10/36 está pensada para sanar grupos.","text_en":"The 5/10/36 allocation is designed for group healing.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Shaman Healing Guide for WoW: Forever › (intro)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/restoration-shaman-healing-guide-for-wow-forever-35071","date":"2026-10-20"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:extra:restoration-shaman-healing-guide-for-wow-forever"],"source_hashes":["guide:20e08b00d69c5db09623617fdc422bee13485ce9"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-build-recuperacion-sanador-elemental","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build sanadora 5/10/36 · Elemental","title_en":"5/10/36 Healing Build · Elemental","summary_es":"Talentos de la rama Elemental para la build sanadora de grupo.","summary_en":"Elemental talents for the group-healing build.","keywords_es":["build sanadora elemental chamán","talentos elemental 5 10 36","convección chamán sanador"],"keywords_en":["shaman healer elemental build","5 10 36 elemental talents","restoration healer convection"],"text_es":"Elemental: Convección 5/5.","text_en":"Elemental: Convection 5/5.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Shaman Healing Guide for WoW: Forever › The build: Restoration Healer (5/10/36)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/restoration-shaman-healing-guide-for-wow-forever-35071","date":"2026-10-20"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:extra:restoration-shaman-healing-guide-for-wow-forever"],"source_hashes":["section:cc8464af6fa2f613426aa168627782258f685061"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-build-recuperacion-sanador-mejora","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build sanadora 5/10/36 · Mejora","title_en":"5/10/36 Healing Build · Enhancement","summary_es":"Talentos de la rama Mejora para la build sanadora de grupo.","summary_en":"Enhancement talents for the group-healing build.","keywords_es":["build sanadora mejora chamán","talentos mejora 5 10 36","golpes de trueno sanador chamán"],"keywords_en":["shaman healer enhancement build","5 10 36 enhancement talents","thundering strikes healer"],"text_es":"Mejora: Golpes de trueno 5/5, Conocimiento ancestral 5/5.","text_en":"Enhancement: Thundering Strikes 5/5, Ancestral Knowledge 5/5.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Shaman Healing Guide for WoW: Forever › The build: Restoration Healer (5/10/36)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/restoration-shaman-healing-guide-for-wow-forever-35071","date":"2026-10-20"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:extra:restoration-shaman-healing-guide-for-wow-forever"],"source_hashes":["section:cc8464af6fa2f613426aa168627782258f685061"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-build-recuperacion-sanador-recuperacion","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build sanadora 5/10/36 · Recuperación","title_en":"5/10/36 Healing Build · Restoration","summary_es":"Talentos de Recuperación para la build sanadora de grupo.","summary_en":"Restoration talents for the group-healing build.","keywords_es":["build sanadora recuperación chamán","talentos recuperación 5 10 36","build de sanador grupo chamán"],"keywords_en":["shaman restoration healer build","5 10 36 restoration talents","group healer shaman build"],"text_es":"Recuperación: Onda de curación mejorada 5/5, Conciencia 3/3, Enfoque totémico 5/5, Enfoque curativo 1/3, Escudo de agua 1/1, Maestría de las mareas 5/5, Tótens restauradores 5/5, Tótem de marea de maná 1/1, Forma curativa 3/3, Rapidez de la Naturaleza 1/1, Purificación 5/5, Mareas vivas 1/1.","text_en":"Restoration: Improved Healing Wave 5/5, Mindfulness 3/3, Totemic Focus 5/5, Healing Focus 1/3, Water Shield 1/1, Tidal Mastery 5/5, Restorative Totems 5/5, Mana Tide Totem 1/1, Healing Way 3/3, Nature's Swiftness 1/1, Purification 5/5, Riptide 1/1.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Shaman Healing Guide for WoW: Forever › The build: Restoration Healer (5/10/36)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/restoration-shaman-healing-guide-for-wow-forever-35071","date":"2026-10-20"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:extra:restoration-shaman-healing-guide-for-wow-forever"],"source_hashes":["section:cc8464af6fa2f613426aa168627782258f685061"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-tanque-mazmorras","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Tanquear mazmorras con Chamán","title_en":"Shaman Dungeon Tanking","summary_es":"Hay una build para nuevos jugadores y otra que requiere equipo BiS.","summary_en":"One build is for new players; the other requires BiS gear.","keywords_es":["chamán tanque mazmorra","tanquear mazmorras con chamán","build tanque chamán Forever"],"keywords_en":["shaman dungeon tank","tank dungeons as shaman","Forever shaman tank build"],"text_es":"En WoW: Forever, un Chamán puede tanquear mazmorras. Hay una configuración para jugadores nuevos (17/23/11) y otra para jugadores expertos con equipo BiS (0/20/31).","text_en":"In WoW: Forever, a Shaman can tank dungeons. One build is for new players (17/23/11); the other is for experienced players with BiS gear (0/20/31).","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Shaman Tank Dungeon guide - WoW: Forever › (intro)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/shaman-tank-dungeon-guide-wow-forever-34915","date":"2026-11-10"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:extra:shaman-tank-dungeon-guide-wow-forever"],"source_hashes":["guide:6360ff7576bcd5403ae15a17987c08cf98dddb33"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-build-tanque-nuevos-elemental","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build tanque para nuevos jugadores · Elemental","title_en":"New-Player Tank Build · Elemental","summary_es":"Talentos Elementales de la build tanque 17/23/11.","summary_en":"Elemental talents for the 17/23/11 tank build.","keywords_es":["build tanque chamán nuevos jugadores","talentos elemental tanque chamán","build chamán 17 23 11"],"keywords_en":["new player shaman tank build","elemental tank talents shaman","shaman 17 23 11 build"],"text_es":"Elemental: Convección 5/5, Concusión 5/5, Llamada de la llama 3/3, Enfoque elemental 1/1, Custodia elemental 1/3, Prueba de fuego 2/2.","text_en":"Elemental: Convection 5/5, Concussion 5/5, Call of Flame 3/3, Elemental Focus 1/1, Elemental Warding 1/3, Trial by Fire 2/2.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Shaman Tank Dungeon guide - WoW: Forever › (intro)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/shaman-tank-dungeon-guide-wow-forever-34915","date":"2026-11-10"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:extra:shaman-tank-dungeon-guide-wow-forever"],"source_hashes":["guide:6360ff7576bcd5403ae15a17987c08cf98dddb33"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-build-tanque-nuevos-mejora","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build tanque para nuevos jugadores · Mejora","title_en":"New-Player Tank Build · Enhancement","summary_es":"Talentos de Mejora de la build tanque 17/23/11.","summary_en":"Enhancement talents for the 17/23/11 tank build.","keywords_es":["build tanque mejora chamán","talentos mejora tanque nuevos jugadores","build chamán 17 23 11"],"keywords_en":["shaman enhancement tank build","new player tank enhancement talents","shaman 17 23 11 build"],"text_es":"Mejora: Golpes de trueno 5/5, Conocimiento ancestral 5/5, Armas elementales 1/3, Enfoque chamanístico 1/1, Anticipación 3/3, Dureza 5/5, Golpe de tormenta 1/1, Armas de espíritu 1/1, Golpe de tormenta mejorado 1/2.","text_en":"Enhancement: Thundering Strikes 5/5, Ancestral Knowledge 5/5, Elemental Weapons 1/3, Shamanistic Focus 1/1, Anticipation 3/3, Toughness 5/5, Stormstrike 1/1, Spirit Weapons 1/1, Improved Stormstrike 1/2.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Shaman Tank Dungeon guide - WoW: Forever › (intro)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/shaman-tank-dungeon-guide-wow-forever-34915","date":"2026-11-10"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:extra:shaman-tank-dungeon-guide-wow-forever"],"source_hashes":["guide:6360ff7576bcd5403ae15a17987c08cf98dddb33"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-build-tanque-nuevos-recuperacion","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build tanque para nuevos jugadores · Recuperación","title_en":"New-Player Tank Build · Restoration","summary_es":"Talentos de Recuperación de la build tanque 17/23/11.","summary_en":"Restoration talents for the 17/23/11 tank build.","keywords_es":["build tanque recuperación chamán","talentos recuperación tanque nuevos jugadores","build chamán 17 23 11"],"keywords_en":["shaman restoration tank build","new player tank restoration talents","shaman 17 23 11 build"],"text_es":"Recuperación: Enfoque de las mareas 5/5, Conciencia 3/3, Reencarnación mejorada 2/2, Escudo de agua 1/1.","text_en":"Restoration: Tidal Focus 5/5, Mindfulness 3/3, Improved Reincarnation 2/2, Water Shield 1/1.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Shaman Tank Dungeon guide - WoW: Forever › (intro)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/shaman-tank-dungeon-guide-wow-forever-34915","date":"2026-11-10"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:extra:shaman-tank-dungeon-guide-wow-forever"],"source_hashes":["guide:6360ff7576bcd5403ae15a17987c08cf98dddb33"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-build-tanque-pro-mejora","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build tanque experta · Mejora","title_en":"Pro Tank Build · Enhancement","summary_es":"Talentos de Mejora de la build tanque 0/20/31 para equipo BiS.","summary_en":"Enhancement talents for the 0/20/31 BiS tank build.","keywords_es":["build tanque chamán equipo BiS","talentos mejora tanque experto","build chamán 0 20 31"],"keywords_en":["shaman BiS tank build","pro enhancement tank talents","shaman 0 20 31 build"],"text_es":"Mejora: Golpes de trueno 5/5, Conocimiento ancestral 5/5, Armas elementales 1/3, Enfoque chamanístico 1/1, Anticipación 3/3, Dureza 4/5, Golpe de tormenta 1/1.","text_en":"Enhancement: Thundering Strikes 5/5, Ancestral Knowledge 5/5, Elemental Weapons 1/3, Shamanistic Focus 1/1, Anticipation 3/3, Toughness 4/5, Stormstrike 1/1.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Shaman Tank Dungeon guide - WoW: Forever › (intro)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/shaman-tank-dungeon-guide-wow-forever-34915","date":"2026-11-10"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:extra:shaman-tank-dungeon-guide-wow-forever"],"source_hashes":["guide:6360ff7576bcd5403ae15a17987c08cf98dddb33"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-build-tanque-pro-recuperacion","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build tanque experta · Recuperación","title_en":"Pro Tank Build · Restoration","summary_es":"Talentos de Recuperación de la build tanque 0/20/31 para equipo BiS.","summary_en":"Restoration talents for the 0/20/31 BiS tank build.","keywords_es":["build tanque recuperación equipo BiS","talentos recuperación tanque experto","build chamán 0 20 31"],"keywords_en":["shaman BiS restoration tank build","pro restoration tank talents","shaman 0 20 31 build"],"text_es":"Recuperación: Enfoque de las mareas 5/5, Conciencia 3/3, Enfoque totémico 1/5, Reencarnación mejorada 2/2, Curación ancestral 3/3, Escudo de agua 1/1, Maestría de las mareas 1/5, Tótens restauradores 4/5, Tótem de marea de maná 1/1, Forma curativa 3/3, Rapidez de la Naturaleza 1/1, Purificación 5/5, Mareas vivas 1/1.","text_en":"Restoration: Tidal Focus 5/5, Mindfulness 3/3, Totemic Focus 1/5, Improved Reincarnation 2/2, Ancestral Healing 3/3, Water Shield 1/1, Tidal Mastery 1/5, Restorative Totems 4/5, Mana Tide Totem 1/1, Healing Way 3/3, Nature's Swiftness 1/1, Purification 5/5, Riptide 1/1.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Shaman Tank Dungeon guide - WoW: Forever › (intro)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/shaman-tank-dungeon-guide-wow-forever-34915","date":"2026-11-10"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:extra:shaman-tank-dungeon-guide-wow-forever"],"source_hashes":["guide:6360ff7576bcd5403ae15a17987c08cf98dddb33"]}]},"04-clase-warlock.json":{"description":"Capítulo 4: Clases. Brujo. Secciones editoriales redactadas desde guías de terceros.","sections":[{"id":"clase-warlock-que-hace","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Qué hace un Brujo","title_en":"What a Warlock Does","summary_es":"Inflige daño de Fuego y Sombras y apoya al grupo con demonios, maldiciones y piedras.","summary_en":"Deals Fire and Shadow damage and supports the group with demons, curses, and stones.","keywords_es":["qué hace un brujo","daño de brujo","utilidad del brujo","demonios del brujo","maldiciones del brujo"],"keywords_en":["what does a warlock do","warlock damage","warlock utility","warlock demons","warlock curses"],"text_es":"El Brujo inflige daño de Fuego y Sombras con efectos periódicos, hechizos directos y demonios. Transfusión de vida convierte salud en maná; Crear piedra de salud, Ritual de invocación y las maldiciones aportan apoyo al grupo. Aflicción, Demonología y Destrucción ofrecen distintos estilos: gestionar varios efectos, luchar con un demonio o centrar el daño en lanzamientos.","text_en":"Warlocks deal Fire and Shadow damage with damage-over-time effects, direct spells, and demons. Life Tap trades health for mana; Create Healthstone, Ritual of Summoning, and curses provide group support. Affliction, Demonology, and Destruction offer different playstyles: managing several effects, fighting with a demon, or focusing damage on casts.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Warlock Class Guide › Comprehensive Guide to Warlock in World of Warcraft Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/warlock-class-overview","date":"2026-10-29"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:general:warlock-class-overview"],"source_hashes":["section:68d4afc3e198df667cbca5caa503b1b201ba63a2"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-especializaciones","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Especializaciones del Brujo","title_en":"Warlock Specializations","summary_es":"Aflicción gestiona efectos periódicos; Demonología se centra en el demonio y Destrucción enlaza Fuego y Sombras.","summary_en":"Affliction manages damage-over-time effects; Demonology centers on its demon, and Destruction links Fire and Shadow.","keywords_es":["especializaciones del brujo","brujo aflicción","brujo demonología","brujo destrucción","estilos del brujo"],"keywords_en":["warlock specializations","affliction warlock","demonology warlock","destruction warlock","warlock playstyles"],"text_es":"Aflicción mantiene efectos de daño en el tiempo y usa drenajes; Arruinar acelera los efectos periódicos del objetivo mientras se canaliza. Demonología gira en torno al demonio: Pacto demoníaco permite mantener uno mientras se aprovecha Sacrificio demoníaco. Destrucción combina Fuego y Sombras; Incinerar es su nuevo hechizo de relleno y Sombras y llamas enlaza ambas escuelas. Las tres comparten demonios, maldiciones y herramientas de apoyo, pero ofrecen estilos de daño distintos.","text_en":"Affliction maintains damage-over-time effects and uses drains; channeling Wrack speeds up the target's periodic effects. Demonology revolves around its demon: Demonic Pact lets you keep one summoned while benefiting from Demonic Sacrifice. Destruction combines Fire and Shadow; Incinerate is its new filler, and Shadow and Flame links both schools. All three share demons, curses, and group tools, but offer different damage styles.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Affliction Warlock Specific Systems in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Demonology Warlock DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Demonology Warlock in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/demonology/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Destruction Warlock DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Destruction Warlock in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Warlock Class Guide › Comprehensive Guide to Warlock in World of Warcraft Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/warlock-class-overview","date":"2026-10-29"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:overview","class:warlock:demonology:overview","class:warlock:destruction:overview","class:warlock:general:warlock-class-overview"],"source_hashes":["section:0139ca37032359782a7de7e3dc75a8f3e46a8d63","section:68d4afc3e198df667cbca5caa503b1b201ba63a2","section:cef868b49045ced15dae7827f315484f5c42190e","section:d3a5b6ab1fd735b5fb8e1fcd7aec8e6b231de92e"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-cambios-forever","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Qué cambia en Forever para el Brujo","title_en":"What Changes for Warlock in Forever","summary_es":"El Brujo equilibra salud, maná y fragmentos; los grimorios enseñan habilidades a los demonios.","summary_en":"Warlocks balance health, mana, and soul shards; grimoires teach abilities to their demons.","keywords_es":["cambios del brujo en forever","recursos del brujo","fragmentos de alma","demonios escalan","grimorios del brujo"],"keywords_en":["warlock forever changes","warlock resources","soul shards","demons scale","warlock grimoires"],"text_es":"El Brujo administra salud, maná y fragmentos de alma. Transfusión de vida, disponible a 6, convierte salud en maná; el Espíritu aumenta la cantidad transferida. Drenar alma se aprende a 10 y puede generar fragmentos; Drenar vida recupera salud. Los fragmentos no se apilan y una bolsa de fragmentos ocupa el hueco de reactivos. Las habilidades del demonio se compran en grimorios y se entrenan por separado.","text_en":"Warlocks manage health, mana, and soul shards. Life Tap, learned at 6, converts health into mana; Spirit increases the amount transferred. Drain Soul is learned at 10 and can generate shards, while Drain Life restores health. Shards do not stack, and a shard bag uses the reagent-bag slot. Demon abilities come from grimoires and are trained separately.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide › Warlock Resources","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/affliction-warlock-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide › Demons and Pet Control","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/affliction-warlock-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:ac2ef2af02b12a4ea71eb4aba3d6c68a4dbebb96","section:e0deaae2fa6142988aac9593911b5690ef71fb91"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-armas-armadura","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Armas y armadura del Brujo","title_en":"Warlock Weapons and Armor","summary_es":"La varita hace daño sin maná y sirve de relleno; busca bastones, orbes y varitas al mejorar equipo.","summary_en":"A wand deals damage without mana and works as filler; look for staves, orbs, and wands as upgrades.","keywords_es":["armas del brujo","armadura del brujo","brujo bastón","brujo varita","brujo orbe"],"keywords_en":["warlock weapons","warlock armor","warlock staff","warlock wand","warlock orb"],"text_es":"La varita inflige daño sin gastar maná, por lo que sirve de relleno durante la subida; hay que quedarse quieto brevemente antes de dispararla y el Poder con hechizos no aumenta su daño. Consigue una Varita mágica inferior para nivel 5 y una Varita mágica superior para nivel 13 mediante comercio o con un encantador; mantenla actualizada hasta 30. Entre el equipo de subida también hay bastones, orbes y otras armas.","text_en":"A wand deals damage without spending mana, making it useful as leveling filler; you must stand still briefly before firing, and Spell Power does not increase its damage. An enchanter can make the Lesser Magic Wand for level 5; at 13, the Greater Magic Wand is another inexpensive option through trade, and keep one current until 30. Leveling gear also includes staves, orbs, and other weapons.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide › Gear and Where to Level","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/affliction-warlock-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide › Leveling Tips","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/affliction-warlock-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Solo Leveling Tips","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:99fbf29026d32be5654d9ec808e0c7e2c53cb7f0","section:e38116b280415566ac9e5c92db357e0ead03492a","section:fdb152ff765284c28444da661d480884e3562ca7"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-subir-espec","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Mejor especialización para subir","title_en":"Best Specialization for Leveling","summary_es":"Aflicción minimiza descansos; Demonología gana fuerza con Marca demoníaca y Destrucción rinde más en mazmorras.","summary_en":"Affliction limits downtime; Demonology improves with Demonic Brand, while Destruction suits dungeons better.","keywords_es":["mejor especialización para subir brujo","brujo aflicción para levear","brujo demonología para subir","brujo destrucción para subir","qué spec de brujo usar"],"keywords_en":["best warlock leveling spec","affliction warlock leveling","demonology warlock leveling","destruction warlock leveling","which warlock spec to level"],"text_es":"Para subir en solitario, Aflicción es eficiente: mata algo más despacio, pero descansa poco y puede llevar dos o tres enemigos a la vez. Demonología empieza más floja, pero el abisario ayuda contra élites y misiones de grupo; Marca demoníaca potencia al demonio al obtener el talento. Destrucción es la más lenta en solitario porque sus talentos dan estallido, no aguante; ese daño explosivo resulta más útil en mazmorras, donde importa menos conservar maná.","text_en":"For solo leveling, Affliction is efficient: kills take a little longer, but downtime is low and it can handle two or three enemies at once. Demonology starts weaker, but the Voidwalker helps against elites and group quests; Demonic Brand empowers the demon when it unlocks. Destruction is the slowest solo option because its talents provide burst rather than sustain; that burst is more useful in dungeons, where mana conservation matters less.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Viability for Affliction Warlock DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Pros","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Demonology Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Viability for Demonology Warlock DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/demonology/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Destruction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Viability for Destruction Warlock DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Destruction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Pros","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Demonology Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Demonology Warlock DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/demonology/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Demonology Warlock Leveling Guide › Strengths","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/demonology-warlock-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:leveling","class:warlock:demonology:leveling","class:warlock:destruction:leveling"],"source_hashes":["guide:2d3090210a1699a629e9d89b14935a1c9285fc6e","section:1fd813698db91b3c574e8c0e2a23e65200da4f29","section:7121d4606aded21f57d20e9078f95d32b2e69553","section:78fcf26e7bd6166d52aca9c362d101229fdad4ba","section:9ca8551261493de0fe9d2f6c74a01b954136b8d4","section:b0e0d83b6d4968bfaf969f058061c04cf8db7164","section:eb898b3d29358f0af7e4320583d8af78d3fcffc3"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-talentos-afliccion","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Ruta de talentos de Aflicción (subida)","title_en":"Affliction Leveling Talent Path","summary_es":"La ruta de Aflicción prioriza daño periódico instantáneo, drenajes y Arruinar a nivel 47.","summary_en":"The Affliction path prioritizes instant damage-over-time effects, drains, and Wrack at level 47.","keywords_es":["talentos para subir brujo aflicción","ruta de aflicción","supresión brujo","ocaso brujo","arruinar brujo"],"keywords_en":["affliction warlock leveling talents","affliction talent path","suppression warlock","nightfall warlock","wrack warlock"],"text_es":"Para subir sin reasignar talentos, prioriza Corrupción mejorado 5/5 para lanzar Corrupción al instante, Supresión 5/5 para reducir resistencias y Poder profano 5/5 para potenciar al demonio. Después toma Drenajes mejorados 3/3, Pandemia 3/3, Succionar vida 1/1 y Succión de alma 3/3; reserva Arruinar 1/1 para el nivel 47, cuando ya tienes 30 puntos en Aflicción. Las razones son movilidad, fiabilidad de los efectos, daño y autocuración.","text_en":"For leveling without respeccing, prioritize Improved Corruption 5/5 for instant Corruption, Suppression 5/5 to reduce resists, and Unholy Power 5/5 to strengthen your demon. Then take Improved Drains 3/3, Pandemic 3/3, Siphon Life 1/1, and Soul Siphon 3/3; take Wrack 1/1 at level 47, when you have 30 points in Affliction. These choices support mobility, reliable effects, damage, and self-healing.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Affliction Warlock DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Core Talents","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:ace72ab599c1d2952f57c6a945d66879bf8f831f","section:b2f4f5642588f6bbe171264068b0c28987b2c99c"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-hitos","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Hitos de habilidad por nivel","title_en":"Ability Milestones by Level","summary_es":"Hitos de subida: Transfusión de vida 6, abisario 10, súcubo/íncubo 20 y manáfago 30.","summary_en":"Leveling milestones: Life Tap at 6, Voidwalker at 10, Succubus/Incubus at 20, and Felhunter at 30.","keywords_es":["cuándo aprendo habilidades de brujo","nivel de las habilidades del brujo","hitos del brujo","transfusión de vida nivel","manáfago nivel"],"keywords_en":["when warlock abilities","warlock ability levels","warlock milestones","life tap level","felhunter level"],"text_es":"Aprendes Corrupción a 4, Transfusión de vida a 6, y Miedo y Terror de agonía a 8. A 10 llegan Drenar alma, Crear piedra de salud y la misión del abisario; Drenar vida se aprende a 14, igual que Maldición de Temeridad. A 18 obtienes Dolor abrasador y Crear piedra de alma; a 20, Ritual de invocación, Maldición de los Elementos, Lluvia de Fuego, Armadura demoníaca y la súcubo o el íncubo. A 30 llegan Piroinferno y la misión del manáfago; el corcel nefasto se aprende a 40.","text_en":"Learn Corruption at 4, Life Tap at 6, and Fear and Bane of Agony at 8. At 10, you get Drain Soul, Create Healthstone, and the Voidwalker quest; Drain Life and Curse of Recklessness are learned at 14. At 18, you get Searing Pain and Create Soulstone; at 20, Ritual of Summoning, Curse of the Elements, Rain of Fire, Demon Armor, and the Succubus or Incubus. Hellfire and the Felhunter quest come at 30; Felsteed is learned at 40.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Must-Have Abilities to Train for Affliction Warlock","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Demonology Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Must-Have Abilities to Train for Demonology Warlock","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/demonology/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Optional Abilities to Train for Affliction Warlock","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Abilities to Skip While Leveling","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:leveling","class:warlock:demonology:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:021e27e37591bfc474fad3dbe184a9c4732ada4c","section:7ab3a96fb19d9dcc2eec555cbbf8424f8578099a","section:befc3dbf03db585c712bb92be35cb7b52070c5a7","section:fa1446d859c0451265edfcc0b23e257610eb68c5"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-misiones-clase","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Misiones de clase del Brujo","title_en":"Warlock Class Quests","summary_es":"Las cadenas de clase desbloquean los demonios por nivel y una misión ofrece elegir entre un bastón y un orbe.","summary_en":"Class quest chains unlock demons by level, and one quest offers a choice between a staff and an orb.","keywords_es":["misiones de clase brujo","misión del diablillo","misión del abisario","misión del manáfago","orbe de Soran'ruk"],"keywords_en":["warlock class quests","imp quest","voidwalker quest","felhunter quest","The Orb of Soran'ruk"],"text_es":"Las misiones iniciales de cada raza dan el diablillo: El libro robado, Novato, Familiares viles o Descubrir el misterio. A nivel 10 se desbloquea el abisario; a 20, cadenas distintas dan súcubo o íncubo, como Corazones puros, El amor duele, ¿Qué es el amor? y Los corazones de los amantes. Buscando a Strahad, a 30, desbloquea al manáfago. El orbe de Soran'ruk, desde 20, permite elegir entre un bastón y un orbe.","text_en":"Each race’s starting quests grant the Imp: The Stolen Tome, Beginnings, Vile Familiars, or Piercing the Veil. The level 10 quest unlocks the Voidwalker; at 20, separate chains grant the Succubus or Incubus, such as Hearts of the Pure, Love Hurts, What Is Love?, and Hearts of the Lovers. Seeking Strahad unlocks the Felhunter at 30. The Orb of Soran'ruk quest is available from 20 and lets you choose a staff or an orb.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Warlock Class Quests Guide › Human Warlock Class Quests","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/warlock-class-quests","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Warlock Class Quests Guide › Gnome Warlock Class Quests","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/warlock-class-quests","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Warlock Class Quests Guide › Orc and Troll Warlock Class Quests","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/warlock-class-quests","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Warlock Class Quests Guide › Undead Warlock Class Quests","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/warlock-class-quests","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Warlock Class Quests Guide › Shared Warlock Class Quests","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/warlock-class-quests","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:general:warlock-class-quests"],"source_hashes":["section:13ddaaef2385ef8948507b9d4dbb4067227fb335","section:2938b9e105042a5c31b0a4b4abc8677df21a6e8b","section:593b77a3081bf9c5b31ab3406fab66dcafd6a5ea","section:a1a1f97b6285f9693879ed668ab41b4bebd5e648","section:acf75ef1abfcd7345c2fe0167471109ecccf9570"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-demonios","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Demonios y sus roles","title_en":"Demons and Their Roles","summary_es":"El abisario aguanta, súcubo e íncubo atacan cuerpo a cuerpo y el diablillo apoya a grupos.","summary_en":"The Voidwalker tanks, Succubus and Incubus deal melee damage, and the Imp supports groups.","keywords_es":["demonios del brujo","diablillo brujo","abisario brujo","súcubo íncubo brujo","manáfago brujo"],"keywords_en":["warlock demons","warlock imp","warlock voidwalker","warlock succubus incubus","warlock felhunter"],"text_es":"El abisario puede tanquear mientras lanzas; mantén Tormento actualizado, usa Sacrificio como escudo y Consumir sombras para curarlo entre combates. La súcubo y el íncubo aportan daño cuerpo a cuerpo y Seducción para controlar humanoides. El diablillo ataca a distancia y aporta Pacto de sangre y Escudo de Fuego al grupo. La misión del manáfago se desbloquea a 30; puede quitar efectos mágicos con Devorar magia y, desde 36, interrumpir con Bloqueo de hechizo.","text_en":"The Voidwalker can tank while you cast; keep Torment current, use Sacrifice as a shield, and heal it with Consume Shadows to heal it between fights. Succubus and Incubus deal melee damage and have Seduction to control humanoids. The Imp attacks at range and provides Blood Pact and Fire Shield to the group. The Felhunter quest unlocks at 30; it can remove Magic effects with Devour Magic and, from 36, interrupt with Spell Lock.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Demon Abilities to Train for Affliction Warlock","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Destruction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Demon Abilities to Train for Destruction Warlock","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide › Demons and Pet Control","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/affliction-warlock-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Demonology Warlock Leveling Guide › Demons and Pet Control","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/demonology-warlock-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:leveling","class:warlock:demonology:leveling","class:warlock:destruction:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:1076390133b9b95d185f78ec00fdcd3ef3f3cd6e","section:3cfcc1595573710aae60f86110eecfdf64f9f581","section:cf1926e01a84ce174e96633ede8a8deac9216ae1","section:e0deaae2fa6142988aac9593911b5690ef71fb91"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-control-mascota","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Control del demonio","title_en":"Demon Control","summary_es":"Entrena grimorios, posiciona al demonio con Move To y usa manualmente sus habilidades de control.","summary_en":"Train grimoires, position your demon with Move To, and manually control its utility abilities.","keywords_es":["control del demonio brujo","grimorios del brujo","move to mascota","seducción brujo","bloqueo de hechizo"],"keywords_en":["warlock demon control","warlock grimoires","pet move to","warlock seduction","spell lock"],"text_es":"Compra grimorios al entrenador de demonios y enseña las habilidades con el demonio correspondiente invocado; se entrenan aparte de tus hechizos. Move To permite enviarlo hasta 100 yardas, y conviene tener a mano las órdenes Atacar y Seguir. Asigna Seducción y Bloqueo de hechizo a teclas para usarlos manualmente; en mazmorras, desactiva Tormento automático si el tanque ya tiene al enemigo y usa modo pasivo para elegir cuándo atacar. Cambiar de demonio lo aturde durante la invocación: hazlo antes de luchar.","text_en":"Buy grimoires from the Demon Trainer and teach abilities with the matching demon summoned; they are trained separately from your spells. Move To can send it up to 100 yards away, and Attack and Follow commands should be easy to reach. Put Seduction and Spell Lock on manual keybinds; in dungeons, turn off Torment autocast if the tank already has the enemy, and use passive mode to choose when to attack. Changing demons stuns it during the summon cast, so switch before a fight.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide › Demons and Pet Control","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/affliction-warlock-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:e0deaae2fa6142988aac9593911b5690ef71fb91"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-maldiciones","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Maldiciones y terrores","title_en":"Curses and Banes","summary_es":"Combina Terror de agonía con una maldición útil y elige esta según el enemigo o el grupo.","summary_en":"Pair Bane of Agony with a utility Curse, choosing the Curse for the enemy or group.","keywords_es":["maldiciones del brujo","terror de agonía","maldición de los elementos","maldición de debilidad","maldición de las lenguas"],"keywords_en":["warlock curses","bane of agony","curse of the elements","curse of weakness","curse of tongues"],"text_es":"Puedes mantener un terror de daño y una maldición sobre el mismo enemigo. Terror de agonía aumenta su daño hacia el final, así que deja que termine antes de renovarlo; a nivel 40, Maldición de los Elementos añade un 10% de daño mágico recibido. Maldición de la lengua ralentiza lanzamientos; Maldición de Temeridad impide que un enemigo huya y también evita Miedo y Horror. No aprendas Maldición de debilidad para subir: no ayuda a llegar a 60.","text_en":"You can keep one damage Bane and one Curse on the same enemy. Bane of Agony deals more damage toward the end, so let it finish before refreshing; at level 40, Curse of the Elements adds 10% Magic damage taken. Curse of Tongues slows casts; Curse of Recklessness stops an enemy from fleeing and also prevents Fear and Horror. Do not train Curse of Weakness for leveling; it does not help you reach 60.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Must-Have Abilities to Train for Affliction Warlock","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Optional Abilities to Train for Affliction Warlock","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Abilities to Skip While Leveling","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Single-Target Rotation","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide › Single Target Rotation","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/affliction-warlock-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide › Utility and Crowd Control","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/affliction-warlock-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:leveling"],"source_hashes":["guide:6314b58a862f872163d7aa23f0152d902f6418ca","section:021e27e37591bfc474fad3dbe184a9c4732ada4c","section:7ab3a96fb19d9dcc2eec555cbbf8424f8578099a","section:befc3dbf03db585c712bb92be35cb7b52070c5a7","section:c5051c21bf40a8f33983ccb5fc1278a140e60058","section:c5a9693436796cb0859b87ef7b5e258f7fe80e4c"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-salud-mana","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Salud, maná y Transfusión de vida","title_en":"Health, Mana, and Life Tap","summary_es":"Equilibra Transfusión de vida con Drenar vida, comida, bebida y vendas para reducir descansos.","summary_en":"Balance Life Tap with Drain Life, food, drink, and bandages to reduce downtime.","keywords_es":["maná del brujo","transfusión de vida","drenar vida brujo","piedra de salud","recuperar salud brujo"],"keywords_en":["warlock mana","life tap","warlock drain life","healthstone","warlock health recovery"],"text_es":"Transfusión de vida convierte salud en maná y el Espíritu aumenta ambas cantidades. Úsala cuando tengas salud disponible, sin esperar a vaciar la barra de maná; Drenar vida te cura durante el combate y Succionar vida añade daño periódico y curación cuando tienes ese talento. Si ambas barras están bajas, come y bebe a la vez entre combates; una venda también ayuda tras Transfusión de vida.","text_en":"Life Tap converts health into mana, and Spirit increases both amounts. Use it when you have health to spare instead of waiting for an empty mana bar; Drain Life heals you during combat, and Siphon Life adds damage over time and healing once you have the talent. If both bars are low, eat and drink together between fights; a bandage also helps after Life Tap.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide › Warlock Resources","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/affliction-warlock-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide › Leveling Tips","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/affliction-warlock-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling as an Affliction Warlock DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:6d38eb11ef46ac120cdffe9092bfc5184d7611f4","section:99fbf29026d32be5654d9ec808e0c7e2c53cb7f0","section:ac2ef2af02b12a4ea71eb4aba3d6c68a4dbebb96"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-fragmentos","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Fragmentos de alma","title_en":"Soul Shards","summary_es":"Drenar alma genera fragmentos de alma; guarda una reserva para invocaciones y piedras.","summary_en":"Drain Soul generates soul shards; keep a supply for summons and stones.","keywords_es":["fragmentos de alma brujo","drenar alma","bolsa de fragmentos de alma","ritual de invocación","invocar demonio brujo"],"keywords_en":["warlock soul shards","drain soul","soul shard bag","ritual of summoning","summon warlock demon"],"text_es":"Drenar alma, disponible a nivel 10, puede generar un fragmento con sus ticks y también cuando muere un enemigo apto mientras lo canalizas. Los fragmentos no se apilan y la bolsa de fragmentos ocupa el hueco de reactivos. Se gastan al invocar demonios, crear piedras y lanzar Ritual de invocación; guarda algunos antes de ir a una mazmorra para poder ofrecer una invocación.","text_en":"Drain Soul, available at level 10, can generate a shard from its ticks and when an eligible enemy dies while you channel it. Shards do not stack, and a shard bag uses the reagent-bag slot. They are spent to summon demons, create stones, and cast Ritual of Summoning; keep some before a dungeon so you can offer a summon.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide › Warlock Resources","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/affliction-warlock-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Dungeon Tips","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:7b381e7e500e3d782e9e3a2974a8bf78019162e0","section:ac2ef2af02b12a4ea71eb4aba3d6c68a4dbebb96"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-piedras-apoyo","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Piedras, invocaciones y apoyo","title_en":"Stones, Summons, and Support","summary_es":"Crea piedras de salud y de alma; elixires, comida y pociones de maná ayudan en combates largos.","summary_en":"Create healthstones and soulstones; elixirs, food, and mana potions help in long fights.","keywords_es":["piedra de salud brujo","piedra de alma brujo","ritual de invocación brujo","fuerza inmortal","detectar invisibilidad"],"keywords_en":["warlock healthstone","warlock soulstone","ritual of summoning","unending breath","detect invisibility"],"text_es":"Crear piedra de salud (10) ofrece curación gratuita; Crear piedra de alma (18) permite resucitar con el efecto activo. Cauce de salud (12) cura al demonio, aunque entre combates suele rendir más una venda o volver a invocarlo. Fuerza inmortal (16) otorga Respiración subacuática durante 10 min; Ritual de invocación (20) requiere un fragmento y dos ayudantes. Detectar invisibilidad (26) no revela enemigos en sigilo. Los elixires de Poder con hechizos y la comida aceleran las bajas; Bien alimentado da +5% de experiencia por enemigo y las pociones de maná convienen en peleas largas.","text_en":"Create Healthstone (10) provides free healing; Create Soulstone (18) lets its bearer resurrect while the effect is active. Health Funnel (12) heals your demon, though bandaging or resummoning is usually better between fights. Unending Breath (16) grants 10 minutes of underwater breathing; Ritual of Summoning (20) requires a shard and two helpers. Detect Invisibility (26) does not reveal stealthed enemies. Spell Power elixirs and food speed up kills; Well Fed gives +5% experience per kill, and mana potions are useful in long fights.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Must-Have Abilities to Train for Affliction Warlock","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Consumables for Affliction Warlock DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide › Utility and Crowd Control","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/affliction-warlock-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Optional Abilities to Train for Affliction Warlock","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:021e27e37591bfc474fad3dbe184a9c4732ada4c","section:070cae6be37ea31385f07629d002d8ec591b3fe2","section:7ab3a96fb19d9dcc2eec555cbbf8424f8578099a","section:c5051c21bf40a8f33983ccb5fc1278a140e60058"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-control","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Miedo, control y emergencias","title_en":"Fear, Control, and Emergencies","summary_es":"Miedo controla un enemigo con riesgo de atraer otros; reserva Aullido de terror y Desterrar para emergencias.","summary_en":"Fear controls one enemy but may pull others; save Howl of Terror and Banish for emergencies.","keywords_es":["miedo brujo","aullido de terror","espiral de la muerte","desterrar brujo","subyugar demonio"],"keywords_en":["warlock fear","howl of terror","death coil","warlock banish","subjugate demon"],"text_es":"Miedo, disponible a 8, hace huir a un enemigo; vigila su recorrido porque puede atraer otro grupo, y los no-muertos y las máquinas son inmunes. Aullido de terror (40) afecta hasta cinco enemigos cercanos y puede abrir espacio si te rodean. Espiral mortal (42) daña, te cura y causa tres segundos de Horror. Desterrar (28) aparta temporalmente a un demonio o elemental. Subyugar demonio (30) controla un demonio hasta cinco minutos, pero no lo aprendas al subir.","text_en":"Fear, available at 8, makes one enemy flee; watch its path because it may pull another group, and Undead and Machines are immune. Howl of Terror (40) affects up to five nearby enemies and can create space if surrounded. Death Coil (42) damages, heals you, and causes three seconds of Horror. Banish (28) temporarily removes a demon or elemental from the fight. Subjugate Demon (30) controls a demon for up to five minutes, but skip it while leveling.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Must-Have Abilities to Train for Affliction Warlock","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Optional Abilities to Train for Affliction Warlock","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide › Utility and Crowd Control","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/affliction-warlock-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Abilities to Skip While Leveling","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:021e27e37591bfc474fad3dbe184a9c4732ada4c","section:7ab3a96fb19d9dcc2eec555cbbf8424f8578099a","section:befc3dbf03db585c712bb92be35cb7b52070c5a7","section:c5051c21bf40a8f33983ccb5fc1278a140e60058"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-piedras-arma","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Piedras de fuego y de hechizo","title_en":"Firestones and Spellstones","summary_es":"Aflicción suele usar piedra de hechizo; elige piedra de fuego o hechizo según la rama y su daño.","summary_en":"Affliction generally uses Spellstone; choose Firestone or Spellstone to match your spec and damage.","keywords_es":["piedra de fuego brujo","piedra de hechizo brujo","aceite de zahorí","imbuido de arma brujo","crear piedra de fuego"],"keywords_en":["warlock firestone","warlock spellstone","wizard oil","warlock weapon imbue","create firestone"],"text_es":"Crear piedra de fuego se aprende a 28; Crear piedra de hechizos, a 36. La piedra de fuego aumenta el daño de Fuego y Golpe crítico con hechizos; la Piedra de hechizos aumenta el daño de Sombras y un poco la celeridad. Aflicción obtiene más de la piedra de hechizo porque la mayoría de su daño es de Sombras. En Demonología de subida también es más fuerte desde 36; vuelve a la piedra de fuego al subir en mazmorras con Destrucción desde 40, cuando predomina el daño de Fuego. Puedes combinarlas con Aceite zahorí; reaplícalas al cambiar de arma o cuando expiren.","text_en":"Create Firestone is learned at 28; Create Spellstone at 36. Firestone increases Fire damage and spell critical strike, while Spellstone increases Shadow damage and a little Haste. Affliction benefits more from Spellstone because most of its damage is Shadow. It is also stronger for leveling Demonology from 36; switch back to Firestone for dungeon-leveling Destruction from 40, when Fire damage dominates. They can be combined with Wizard Oil; reapply them when changing weapons or when they expire.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Must-Have Abilities to Train for Affliction Warlock","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Affliction Warlock DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Demonology Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Must-Have Abilities to Train for Demonology Warlock","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/demonology/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Destruction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Must-Have Abilities to Train for Destruction Warlock","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide › Firestones and Spellstones","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/affliction-warlock-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:leveling","class:warlock:demonology:leveling","class:warlock:destruction:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:021e27e37591bfc474fad3dbe184a9c4732ada4c","section:1652e6032b90619b9225273ebb5d8068986cd71a","section:a415ff3fff19a2f2e7fd929962dad8649a6fc3eb","section:ace72ab599c1d2952f57c6a945d66879bf8f831f","section:fa1446d859c0451265edfcc0b23e257610eb68c5"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-area","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Daño en área y varios enemigos","title_en":"Area Damage and Multiple Enemies","summary_es":"Aflicción reparte efectos periódicos y Miedo entre dos enemigos; en mazmorra, el grupo puede usar Piroinferno.","summary_en":"Affliction spreads damage-over-time effects and Fear across two enemies; use Hellfire in dungeon packs.","keywords_es":["brujo daño en área","lluvia de fuego","piroinferno","brujo varios enemigos","repartir dots brujo"],"keywords_en":["warlock aoe","rain of fire","hellfire","warlock multiple enemies","spread dots warlock"],"text_es":"En solitario, Aflicción puede aplicar Corrupción y Terror de agonía a un enemigo y luego usar Miedo, mientras el abisario o el diablillo distraen a otro; los efectos siguen dañando al cambiar de objetivo. Terror de agonía solo merece la pena si el enemigo vivirá hasta sus últimos ticks. Lluvia de Fuego se aprende a 20, pero no ayuda a subir; en mazmorra, con el tanque sujetando el grupo, canaliza Piroinferno desde 30 y renueva efectos solo en enemigos duraderos. Avisa al sanador: Piroinferno también te daña.","text_en":"While solo, Affliction can apply Corruption and Agony damage over time to one enemy and then Fear it while the Voidwalker or Imp distracts another; the effects keep ticking as you switch targets. Use the damage curse only if the enemy will live through its final ticks. Rain of Fire is learned at 20 but does not help with leveling; in dungeons, with the tank holding the pack, channel Hellfire from 30 and refresh effects only on durable enemies. Tell the healer first: Hellfire also damages you.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Fear Juggle (Two Mobs)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › AoE Rotation","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Demonology Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Fear Juggle (Two Mobs)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/demonology/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Demonology Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › AoE Rotation","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/demonology/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Destruction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › AoE Rotation","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Abilities to Skip While Leveling","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide › Utility and Crowd Control","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/affliction-warlock-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Demonology Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Demon Abilities to Train for Demonology Warlock","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/demonology/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Destruction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Demon Abilities to Train for Destruction Warlock","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:leveling","class:warlock:demonology:leveling","class:warlock:destruction:leveling"],"source_hashes":["guide:06caefe3eaeafd39ddc3b82943318222c7b6f978","guide:6314b58a862f872163d7aa23f0152d902f6418ca","guide:af1e73748ba8b481d20982b7af36cc91d6ad18da","section:1686715485aadbbd1f53233844e262533ad65e6b","section:befc3dbf03db585c712bb92be35cb7b52070c5a7","section:c5051c21bf40a8f33983ccb5fc1278a140e60058","section:cf1926e01a84ce174e96633ede8a8deac9216ae1"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-rotacion-afliccion","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotación de Aflicción","title_en":"Affliction Rotation","summary_es":"Envía al demonio, aplica los efectos que duren y rellena con Drenar vida desde 30 o varita.","summary_en":"Send in your demon, apply effects that will last, and fill with Drain Life from 30 or your wand.","keywords_es":["rotación de aflicción","rotación del brujo aflicción","terror de agonía rotación","drenar vida rotación","varita brujo"],"keywords_en":["affliction rotation","affliction warlock rotation","bane of agony rotation","drain life rotation","warlock wand"],"text_es":"Envía al demonio y aplica Maldición de los Elementos primero desde 40 contra un enemigo duradero, luego Corrupción; añade Terror de agonía si vivirá hasta sus últimos ticks, Inmolar si tiene mucha salud y Succionar vida cuando aprendas ese talento. No renueves Terror de agonía antes de que termine. Antes de 30, rellena con varita o Drenar vida; desde 30, usa Drenar vida de rango 3 o superior. Con Ocaso, aprovecha Trance de las Sombras para lanzar Descarga de las Sombras instantáneamente; Arruinar sirve para dañar cuando empiezas con salud y maná altos.","text_en":"Send in your demon and apply Curse of the Elements first from 40 against a durable enemy, then Corruption; add Bane of Agony if it will live through the final ticks, Immolate if it has high health, and Siphon Life after you learn that talent. Do not refresh Bane of Agony early. Before 30, fill with your wand or Drain Life; from 30, use rank 3 or higher Drain Life. With Nightfall, use Shadow Trance for an instant Shadow Bolt; Wrack is for damage on a pull started with high health and mana.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Single-Target Rotation","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Affliction Warlock DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:leveling"],"source_hashes":["guide:6314b58a862f872163d7aa23f0152d902f6418ca","section:ace72ab599c1d2952f57c6a945d66879bf8f831f"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-rotacion-demonologia","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotación de Demonología","title_en":"Demonology Rotation","summary_es":"Marca al objetivo con Dolor abrasador, aplica efectos duraderos y rellena con drenaje o varita.","summary_en":"Brand the target with Searing Pain, apply long-lasting effects, and fill with a drain or wand.","keywords_es":["rotación de demonología","rotación del brujo demonología","marca demoníaca","dolor abrasador rotación","cauce de salud"],"keywords_en":["demonology rotation","demonology warlock rotation","demonic brand","searing pain rotation","health funnel"],"text_es":"En Demonología, envía al demonio y, al obtener Marca demoníaca, usa Dolor abrasador contra su objetivo; renueva el efecto tras seis ataques. A 40, ofrece un diablillo a Sacrificio demoníaco y después llama a la súcubo o al íncubo: Pacto demoníaco conserva Sombra ardiente. Contra enemigos duraderos, aplica Maldición de los Elementos desde 40, Corrupción y Terror de agonía; añade Inmolar si tienen mucha salud. Rellena con varita antes de 30 y Drenar vida desde 30.","text_en":"As Demonology, send in your demon; once Demonic Brand is available, use Searing Pain on its target and renew it after six hits. At 40, use an Imp for Demonic Sacrifice, then summon a Succubus or Incubus: Demonic Pact preserves Burning Shadow. Against durable enemies, apply Curse of the Elements from 40, Corruption, and Bane of Agony; add Immolate if they have high health. Fill with your wand before 30 and Drain Life from 30.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Demonology Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Single-Target Rotation","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/demonology/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Demonology Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Demonology Warlock DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/demonology/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:demonology:leveling"],"source_hashes":["guide:af1e73748ba8b481d20982b7af36cc91d6ad18da","section:78fcf26e7bd6166d52aca9c362d101229fdad4ba"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-rotacion-destruccion","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotación de Destrucción","title_en":"Destruction Rotation","summary_es":"Inmolar prepara Conflagrar; termina con Quemadura de las Sombras y elige relleno según la configuración.","summary_en":"Immolate sets up Conflagrate; finish with Shadowburn and choose filler for your build.","keywords_es":["rotación de destrucción","rotación del brujo destrucción","conflagrar","quemadura de las sombras","incinerar"],"keywords_en":["destruction rotation","destruction warlock rotation","conflagrate","shadowburn","incinerate"],"text_es":"En Destrucción, deja que el demonio gane amenaza y aplica Inmolar; desde 25, usa Conflagrar cerca del final. En solitario, Conflagrar consume Inmolar; con Sombras y llamas 5/5 en mazmorra, no. Aplica Terror de agonía y Corrupción a enemigos duraderos; Aterrar 5/5 acelera Inmolar y Descarga de las Sombras. Remata con Quemadura de las Sombras. Antes de 30, rellena con varita o Drenar vida; desde 30, usa Drenar vida de rango 3. En mazmorras, Descarga de las Sombras hasta 40 y luego Incinerar; deja que el tanque genere amenaza primero.","text_en":"As Destruction, send in the demon, let it build threat, then cast Immolate. From 25, use Conflagrate near the end. It consumes Immolate in the solo build but not with 5/5 Shadow and Flame in the dungeon build. Use Bane of Agony and Corruption on durable enemies; 5/5 Bane shortens Immolate and Shadow Bolt casts. Finish with Shadowburn. Before 30, fill with wand or Drain Life; from 30, use rank 3 Drain Life. For dungeons, Shadow Bolt until 40, then Incinerate; let the tank build threat first.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Destruction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Single-Target Rotation","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Destruction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Destruction Warlock DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:destruction:leveling"],"source_hashes":["guide:06caefe3eaeafd39ddc3b82943318222c7b6f978","section:a41d84a98887df06285a814d449ad60b10a4cc3e"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-consejos-subir","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Consejos para subir de nivel","title_en":"Leveling Tips","summary_es":"Compra una varita pronto, mantén vivo al demonio y evita gastar maná en enemigos casi muertos.","summary_en":"Get a wand early, keep your demon alive, and avoid spending mana on nearly dead enemies.","keywords_es":["consejos para subir brujo","varita brujo","comida y agua brujo","grimorios del demonio","experiencia de descanso"],"keywords_en":["warlock leveling tips","warlock wand","warlock food water","demon grimoires","rested experience"],"text_es":"Vende equipo y comida inicial para pagar Inmolar de rango 1 a nivel 1. Usa la Varita mágica inferior (5) y la Varita mágica superior (13), y mantenla al día hasta 30. Entre combates, suele ser mejor vendar al demonio o volver a invocarlo que usar Cauce de salud. Enlaza efectos periódicos y Miedo a un objetivo de foco, no renueves efectos en enemigos casi muertos y termina con la varita. Drenar alma puede darte un fragmento al matar: canalízalo al final, no contra un enemigo con toda la salud. Programa visitas al entrenador y cierra sesión en una posada para acumular experiencia de descanso.","text_en":"Sell your starting gear and food to pay for rank 1 Immolate, which is useful from level 1; get a Lesser Magic Wand at 5 and a Greater Magic Wand at 13, and keep it current until 30. Between fights, bandaging or resummoning your demon is usually better than using Health Funnel. Bind damage-over-time effects and Fear to a focus target, do not refresh them on nearly dead enemies, and finish with your wand. Drain Soul can grant a shard on a killing blow: channel it near the end, not on a full-health enemy. Plan trainer visits and log out at an inn to build rested experience.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Solo Leveling Tips","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Demonology Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Solo Leveling Tips","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/demonology/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Destruction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Solo Leveling Tips","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide › Leveling Tips","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/affliction-warlock-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:leveling","class:warlock:demonology:leveling","class:warlock:destruction:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:2492e114a2cda3a0ca0136a08df444178c07eccd","section:99fbf29026d32be5654d9ec808e0c7e2c53cb7f0","section:e6f5f6f4350062c34277eff5d1b70ce059bce69c","section:fdb152ff765284c28444da661d480884e3562ca7"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-grupo","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"El Brujo en grupo y mazmorras","title_en":"Warlock in Groups and Dungeons","summary_es":"Aporta piedras, invocaciones y maldiciones; coordina el Terror y la maldición y protege al demonio.","summary_en":"Brings stones, summons, and curses; coordinate the Bane and Curse and protect the demon.","keywords_es":["brujo en grupo","brujo en mazmorras","utilidad del brujo","maldiciones en banda","demonio en combate"],"keywords_en":["warlock in groups","warlock in dungeons","warlock utility","raid curses","demon in combat"],"text_es":"En grupos, el Brujo aporta piedras de salud y de alma, Ritual de invocación, maldiciones y Desterrar, que aparta a un demonio o elemental de un pull difícil. Coordina tu maldición: usa la asignada o, si no hay una, Maldición de los Elementos cuando haya más lanzadores; puede coexistir con Terror de agonía. En Demonología, mantén vivo y fuera de las áreas peligrosas al demonio, porque buena parte del daño depende de él.","text_en":"In groups, Warlocks bring health stones and soul stones, Ritual of Summoning, curses, and Banish, which removes a Demon or Elemental from a difficult pull. Coordinate your Curse: use the assigned one or, if none is assigned, Curse of the Elements when the raid has more casters; it can coexist with Bane of Agony. As Demonology, keep your demon alive and out of dangerous areas, because much of your damage depends on it.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Warlock Class Guide › Comprehensive Guide to Warlock in World of Warcraft Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/warlock-class-overview","date":"2026-10-29"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Affliction Warlock Guide › Affliction Warlock Guide for World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/affliction-warlock-ranged-dps-pve-guide","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Affliction Warlock in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Demonology Warlock DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Strengths and Weaknesses of Demonology Warlocks in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/demonology/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Best PvE Rotation for Affliction Warlock DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-11"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:overview","class:warlock:affliction:rotation","class:warlock:demonology:overview","class:warlock:general:warlock-class-overview"],"source_hashes":["section:613b699a225e90853da48de95c6282bc2ac79d16","section:68a86ca3337957eb0595d58bfb592787f30dd9b6","section:68d4afc3e198df667cbca5caa503b1b201ba63a2","section:aaa309fb5c340fcb1a5dd7dd3f8a8ab2c193bd3c","section:e204be83f9bac6cb4a1f4336722a0ceea4f473af"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-roles","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rol de cada especialización en grupo","title_en":"Each Specialization’s Group Role","summary_es":"Aflicción rinde en peleas largas, Demonología depende de su demonio y Destrucción destaca por daño directo y área.","summary_en":"Affliction excels in long fights, Demonology relies on its demon, and Destruction brings direct and area damage.","keywords_es":["rol de aflicción en grupo","rol de demonología en grupo","rol de destrucción en grupo","daño sostenido del brujo","daño en área del brujo"],"keywords_en":["affliction group role","demonology group role","destruction group role","warlock sustained damage","warlock area damage"],"text_es":"Aflicción destaca en combates largos y contra varios objetivos; sus efectos periódicos tardan en rendir, pero siguen dañando mientras se mueve. Demonología ofrece buen daño a un objetivo con su demonio, aunque depende de mantenerlo vivo y bien colocado; el abisario puede aguantar enemigos mientras lanzas. Destrucción combina buen daño a un objetivo y en área; Conflagrar y Quemadura de las Sombras dan estallidos instantáneos, y Terror de caos transfiere parte del daño a un segundo objetivo. Su área más potente, Piroinferno, exige acercarse y también te daña.","text_en":"Affliction excels in long fights and against multiple targets; its periodic effects take time to pay off but keep dealing damage while you move. Demonology deals strong single-target damage with its demon, but depends on keeping it alive and well positioned; the Voidwalker can hold enemies while you cast. Destruction combines strong single-target and area damage; Conflagrate and Shadowburn provide instant burst, and Bane of Havoc transfers some damage to a second target. Its strongest area spell, Hellfire, requires close range and also damages you.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Strengths and Weaknesses of Affliction Warlocks in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Demonology Warlock DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Strengths and Weaknesses of Demonology Warlocks in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/demonology/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Destruction Warlock DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Strengths and Weaknesses of Destruction Warlocks in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Destruction Warlock DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Destruction Warlock Specific Systems in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Warlock Class Quests Guide › Human Warlock Class Quests","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/warlock-class-quests","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Affliction Warlock Guide › Affliction Warlock Guide for World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/affliction-warlock-ranged-dps-pve-guide","date":"2026-11-09"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:overview","class:warlock:demonology:overview","class:warlock:destruction:overview","class:warlock:general:warlock-class-quests"],"source_hashes":["section:204cd5a2aa40c9a9e31a1c21d73a3e8f06489cf4","section:593b77a3081bf9c5b31ab3406fab66dcafd6a5ea","section:613b699a225e90853da48de95c6282bc2ac79d16","section:aaa309fb5c340fcb1a5dd7dd3f8a8ab2c193bd3c","section:bdc468605d13da4eb3f4f6fec521e8fbf7864e3e","section:f3424175a486b8c8eff6a0771032e6a6130d77e2"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-profesiones","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Profesiones para el Brujo","title_en":"Professions for Warlock","summary_es":"Costura combina con Encantamiento; recolección da oro y las profesiones aportan mejoras al campamento.","summary_en":"Tailoring pairs with Enchanting; gathering earns gold, and professions add camp benefits.","keywords_es":["profesiones para brujo","sastrería brujo","encantamiento brujo","primeros auxilios brujo","cocina y pesca"],"keywords_en":["warlock professions","warlock tailoring","warlock enchanting","warlock first aid","cooking and fishing"],"text_es":"Costura y Encantamiento combinan porque puedes desencantar tus propias creaciones; Costura también da armadura de tela y bolsas, y Encantamiento permite fabricar varitas tempranas. Botánica, Minería y Desollar dan materiales vendibles al subir. Cada profesión añade una función y una mejora al campamento: Botánica da Intelecto, Primeros auxilios Aguante e Ingeniería permite comprar componentes y reparar equipo. Botánica aporta ingredientes para pociones de sanación de Primeros auxilios; las vendas ayudan tras Transfusión de vida. Cocina y Pesca se suben juntas, aunque requieren tiempo.","text_en":"Tailoring and Enchanting pair well because you can disenchant your own crafts; Tailoring also provides cloth armor and bags, and Enchanting can make early wands. For gathering, Herbalism, Mining, and Skinning provide materials to sell while questing. Each profession adds a camp feature and buff: Herbalism grants Intellect, First Aid grants Stamina, and Engineering lets you buy reagents and repair gear. Herbalism provides ingredients that First Aid uses to make Healing Potions; bandages help after Life Tap. Cooking and Fishing level together, though they take time.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Professions for Affliction Warlock in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide › Professions","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/affliction-warlock-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:11fdf0f2821f8d9bc6a32e723958dc711660befd","section:2871904a139b125189e2e3a5bef11b168dc9a207"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-stats-afliccion","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Estadísticas de Aflicción a nivel 60","title_en":"Level 60 Affliction Stats","summary_es":"Prioriza Poder con hechizos, crítico y golpe; el límite de golpe de banda es 12% con Supresión 5/5.","summary_en":"Prioritize spell power, crit, and hit; the raid hit cap is 12% with 5/5 Suppression.","keywords_es":["estadísticas aflicción brujo","prioridad de Aflicción","golpe de brujo","crítico de brujo"],"keywords_en":["affliction warlock stats","affliction priority","warlock hit cap","warlock crit"],"text_es":"Prioridad: Poder con hechizos o daño de Sombras, golpe crítico, índice de golpe hasta 12% de equipo con Supresión 5/5, celeridad, penetración con hechizos, intelecto y espíritu. El poder de Sombras casi iguala al poder con hechizos; 1% de crítico vale cerca de 9 de poder con hechizos en Arruinar y 11 en SM Ruina, mientras 1% de golpe vale 7,5 y 9 respectivamente. Tras el límite, cambia golpe por poder con hechizos o crítico.","text_en":"Priority: Spell Power or Shadow Damage, Crit, Hit up to 12% from gear with 5/5 Suppression, Haste, Spell Pierce, Intellect, then Spirit. Shadow Damage is nearly equal to Spell Power; 1% Crit is worth about 9 Spell Power for Wrack and 11 for SM Ruin, while 1% Hit is worth 7.5 and 9 respectively. Past the cap, trade Hit for Spell Power or Crit.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock DPS Attribute and Stat Guide - WoW: Forever › Affliction Warlock Stat Priority in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/stat-priority-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-11"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:stats"],"source_hashes":["section:4f9046e3d0ec8374207f93f245ee192e9e38353d"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-stats-demonologia","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Estadísticas de Demonología a nivel 60","title_en":"Level 60 Demonology Stats","summary_es":"Poder con hechizos, golpe, crítico, celeridad, penetración, intelecto y espíritu; prioridad provisional.","summary_en":"Spell power, hit, crit, haste, spell pierce, intellect, and spirit; provisional priority.","keywords_es":["estadísticas demonología brujo","prioridad de Demonología","golpe de Demonología","poder con hechizos brujo"],"keywords_en":["demonology warlock stats","demonology priority","demonology hit","warlock spell power"],"text_es":"Prioridad provisional: Poder con hechizos o daño de Fuego/Sombras según la rama, golpe hasta 17% (resta 1% por cada punto de Supresión), crítico, celeridad, penetración con hechizos, intelecto y espíritu. El golpe ayuda también al demonio y cada 1% se estima en unos 10 puntos de poder con hechizos. En Sombras, 1% de crítico aporta alrededor de 10 puntos de poder con hechizos; en Fuego, unos 7. Por cada 1% de celeridad, las estimaciones son 7 y 6 respectivamente. Recomendación provisional hasta que se pruebe a nivel 60.","text_en":"Provisional priority: Spell Power or Fire/Shadow Damage to match the build, Hit to 17% (subtract 1% per Suppression point), Crit, Haste, Spell Pierce, Intellect, then Spirit. Hit benefits your demon too, with each 1% estimated at about 10 Spell Power. The shadow setup estimates 1% Crit at roughly 10 Spell Power, while the fire setup puts it near 7. Each 1% Haste is valued at 7 and 6 respectively. Provisional recommendation until tested at level 60.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Demonology Warlock DPS Attribute and Stat Guide - WoW: Forever › Demonology Warlock Stat Priority in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/demonology/stat-priority-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-03"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:demonology:stats"],"source_hashes":["section:8b0cd7bebb1a51df49ed8877c540f2e19e574792"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-stats-destruccion","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Estadísticas de Destrucción a nivel 60","title_en":"Level 60 Destruction Stats","summary_es":"Poder con hechizos, crítico, golpe hasta 12%, celeridad, penetración, intelecto y espíritu; prioridad provisional.","summary_en":"Spell power, crit, hit to 12%, haste, spell pierce, intellect, and spirit; provisional priority.","keywords_es":["estadísticas destrucción brujo","prioridad de Destrucción","golpe de Destrucción","daño de Fuego brujo"],"keywords_en":["destruction warlock stats","destruction priority","destruction hit cap","warlock fire damage"],"text_es":"Prioridad provisional: Poder con hechizos o daño de Fuego, crítico, golpe hasta 12% de equipo con Supresión 5/5, celeridad, penetración con hechizos, intelecto y espíritu. Como referencia, el daño de Fuego aporta aproximadamente dos tercios del valor del poder con hechizos. Crítico y golpe están casi empatados, alrededor de 9 puntos de poder con hechizos por cada 1%, con el crítico ligeramente por delante. Tras el límite, cambia golpe por poder con hechizos o crítico. Recomendación provisional hasta que se pruebe a nivel 60.","text_en":"Provisional priority: Spell Power or Fire Damage, Crit, Hit to 12% from gear with 5/5 Suppression, Haste, Spell Pierce, Intellect, then Spirit. As a rough comparison, Fire Damage provides about two-thirds of the value of Spell Power. Crit and Hit are close, at around 9 Spell Power for each 1%, with Crit slightly ahead. Past the cap, trade Hit for Spell Power or Crit. Provisional recommendation until tested at level 60.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Destruction Warlock DPS Attribute and Stat Guide - WoW: Forever › Destruction Warlock Stat Priority in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/stat-priority-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-03"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:destruction:stats"],"source_hashes":["section:fb5448c7d927aad8112336a122be0e61e790fa71"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-rotacion-afliccion-arruinar-60","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotación de Aflicción con Arruinar","title_en":"Affliction Wrack Rotation","summary_es":"Mantén los tres efectos periódicos, aplica la maldición asignada y canaliza Arruinar como relleno.","summary_en":"Maintain three damage-over-time effects, apply your assigned Curse, and channel Wrack as filler.","keywords_es":["rotación Aflicción Arruinar","rotación de banda brujo","Trance de las Sombras","Succión de alma"],"keywords_en":["affliction Wrack rotation","warlock raid rotation","Shadow Trance","Soul Siphon"],"text_es":"Prioridad de banda: Terror de agonía, maldición asignada, Corrupción, Succionar vida; usa Descarga de las Sombras solo con Trance de las Sombras y Transfusión de vida tras un Arruinar completo si necesitas maná; rellena con Arruinar. Amplificar maldición potencia Terror de agonía cuando esté disponible; no renueves el efecto con menos de 12 s de combate. Mantén los tres efectos periódicos para que Arruinar y Succión de alma los aprovechen; no uses Terror de fatalidad en esta configuración.","text_en":"Raid priority: Bane of Agony, assigned Curse, Corruption, Siphon Life; use Shadow Bolt only on a Shadow Trance proc and Life Tap after a full Wrack if mana is needed; fill with Wrack. Amplify Curse boosts Bane of Agony when ready; do not refresh the Bane with under 12 seconds left. Keep all three DoTs active for Wrack and Soul Siphon; do not use Bane of Doom with this build.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Single Target Wrack Rotation for Affliction Warlocks in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-11"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:fb1469b7e573a2b2271824d8e33ac81ea1d58c45"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-rotacion-afliccion-sm-ruin-60","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotación de Aflicción SM Ruina","title_en":"Affliction SM Ruin Rotation","summary_es":"Alterna los efectos periódicos con Descarga de las Sombras; reserva Terror de fatalidad para peleas largas.","summary_en":"Maintain damage-over-time effects and fill with Shadow Bolt; use Bane of Doom in long fights.","keywords_es":["rotación Aflicción SM Ruina","Descarga de las Sombras Aflicción","Terror de fatalidad brujo","rotación Aflicción raid"],"keywords_en":["SM Ruin Affliction rotation","Affliction Shadow Bolt","warlock Bane of Doom","Affliction raid rotation"],"text_es":"Prioridad: Terror de fatalidad si queda al menos un minuto; si no, Amplificar maldición con Terror de agonía; después, maldición asignada, Corrupción, Succionar vida e Inmolar. Lanza primero Descarga de las Sombras si falta el efecto de Descarga de Sombras mejorada y luego úsala como relleno; con Trance de las Sombras, es instantánea y se lanza enseguida. Usa Transfusión de vida entre renovaciones o al moverte; cerca del final, solo si no puedes pagar el siguiente hechizo.","text_en":"Priority: Bane of Doom if a minute or more remains; otherwise Amplify Curse with Bane of Agony; then your assigned Curse, Corruption, Siphon Life, and Immolate. Cast Shadow Bolt first if Improved Shadow Bolt is down, then use it as filler; a Shadow Trance proc makes it instant, so cast it at once. Life Tap between refreshes or while moving; near the end, use it only if you cannot pay for the next spell.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Single Target SM Ruin Rotation for Affliction Warlocks in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-11"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:fe00ce1abd33f551894a5ccf35fd4dba83b2aec5"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-rotacion-demonologia-fuego-60","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotación de Demonología de Fuego","title_en":"Demonology Fire Rotation","summary_es":"Mantén Marca demoníaca y los efectos periódicos; usa Fuego de alma durante Exterminio.","summary_en":"Maintain Demonic Brand and damage-over-time effects; cast Soul Fire during Decimation.","keywords_es":["rotación Demonología Fuego","Exterminio brujo","Marca demoníaca rotación","Fuego de alma brujo"],"keywords_en":["Demonology Fire rotation","warlock Decimation","Demonic Brand rotation","warlock Soul Fire"],"text_es":"Prioridad: Dolor abrasador si falta Marca demoníaca; Terror de fatalidad si queda al menos un minuto (si no, Terror de agonía); maldición asignada, Inmolar y Corrupción. Lanza Fuego de alma mientras Exterminio esté activo. Usa Transfusión de vida antes de quedarte sin maná y para reponer el del diablillo con Energías demoníacas; rellena con Dolor abrasador.","text_en":"Priority: Searing Pain if Demonic Brand is missing; Bane of Doom with at least a minute left (otherwise Bane of Agony); assigned Curse, Immolate, and Corruption. Cast Soul Fire while Decimation is active. Life Tap before you run out of mana and to refill the Imp through Demonic Energies; fill with Searing Pain.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Demonology Warlock DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Single Target Fire Rotation for Demonology Warlocks in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/demonology/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-10-26"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:demonology:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:3fb546c88bdac6b48500c01acae0cc8aa85e3e74"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-rotacion-demonologia-sombras-60","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotación de Demonología de Sombras","title_en":"Demonology Shadow Rotation","summary_es":"Mantén Marca demoníaca y efectos periódicos; rellena con Descarga de las Sombras.","summary_en":"Maintain Demonic Brand and damage-over-time effects; fill with Shadow Bolt.","keywords_es":["rotación Demonología Sombras","Descarga de las Sombras Demonología","Marca demoníaca","Terror de fatalidad brujo"],"keywords_en":["Demonology Shadow rotation","Demonology Shadow Bolt","Demonic Brand","warlock Bane of Doom"],"text_es":"Prioridad: Terror de fatalidad si queda al menos un minuto; si no, Terror de agonía; maldición asignada; Dolor abrasador si falta Marca demoníaca; Inmolar y Corrupción; luego Transfusión de vida entre renovaciones o al moverte y Descarga de las Sombras como relleno. Marca demoníaca dura 10 s o 6 ataques de la súcubo/íncubo, lo que ocurra primero: renueva Dolor abrasador al caer. Fuego de alma no forma parte de esta rotación, ni siquiera durante Exterminio.","text_en":"Priority: Bane of Doom with a minute or more remaining; otherwise Bane of Agony; assigned Curse; Searing Pain if Demonic Brand is missing; Immolate and Corruption; then Life Tap between refreshes or while moving and Shadow Bolt as filler. Demonic Brand lasts 10 seconds or 6 Sayaad attacks, whichever comes first: refresh Searing Pain when it drops. Soul Fire is not part of this rotation, even during Decimation.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Demonology Warlock DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Single Target Shadow Rotation for Demonology Warlocks in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/demonology/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-10-26"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:demonology:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:8baa576d03192b6e7414ab683140aa57ba67e3de"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-rotacion-destruccion-60","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotación de Destrucción a nivel 60","title_en":"Level 60 Destruction Rotation","summary_es":"Mantén Inmolar y Corrupción, lanza Conflagrar y Quemadura de las Sombras al recargar y rellena con Incinerar.","summary_en":"Maintain Immolate and Corruption, cast Conflagrate and Shadowburn on cooldown, and fill with Incinerate.","keywords_es":["rotación Destrucción nivel 60","Incinerar rotación","Conflagrar al recargar","Quemadura de las Sombras banda"],"keywords_en":["level 60 Destruction rotation","Incinerate rotation","Conflagrate cooldown","raid Shadowburn"],"text_es":"Prioridad: Terror de fatalidad si queda al menos un minuto; si no, Amplificar maldición y Terror de agonía; maldición asignada, Inmolar, Corrupción, Conflagrar, Quemadura de las Sombras, Transfusión de vida entre renovaciones o al moverte e Incinerar como relleno. Con 5/5 Sombras y llamas, Conflagrar no consume Inmolar y Quemadura de las Sombras devuelve su fragmento; lanza ambas al estar disponibles. En enemigos que mueren en segundos, no gastes tiempo en Corrupción ni en el terror.","text_en":"Priority: Bane of Doom with a minute or more left; otherwise Amplify Curse and Bane of Agony; assigned Curse, Immolate, Corruption, Conflagrate, Shadowburn, Life Tap between refreshes or while moving, then Incinerate as filler. With 5/5 Shadow and Flame, Conflagrate does not consume Immolate and Shadowburn refunds its shard; cast both when ready. For enemies that fall quickly, save casts by leaving Corruption and the Bane out.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Destruction Warlock DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Single Target DPS Rotation for Destruction Warlocks in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-03"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Destruction Warlock DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Destruction Warlock in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:destruction:overview","class:warlock:destruction:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:0139ca37032359782a7de7e3dc75a8f3e46a8d63","section:0150cc1b0cad035c038be93a57fd2d6aaf9f30ee"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-area-afliccion-60","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Área de Aflicción a nivel 60","title_en":"Level 60 Affliction AoE","summary_es":"Reparte efectos en peleas largas; canaliza Piroinferno en grupos de tres o más si puedes acercarte.","summary_en":"Spread damage-over-time effects in long fights; channel Hellfire on 3+ targets when safe to approach.","keywords_es":["área Aflicción nivel 60","Piroinferno brujo","Lluvia de Fuego brujo","Aflicción varios objetivos"],"keywords_en":["level 60 Affliction AoE","warlock Hellfire","warlock Rain of Fire","Affliction multiple targets"],"text_es":"Contra 2 objetivos, mantén la rotación de un solo objetivo en el principal; pon Corrupción, Terror de agonía y Succionar vida en el segundo si vivirá al menos medio minuto. Piroinferno no compensa contra dos. Con 3 o más, canalízalo en cuanto el grupo esté cerca si morirá en unos 20 s; si durará más, reparte antes los tres efectos periódicos. Si no puedes estar junto al grupo, usa Lluvia de Fuego desde lejos.","text_en":"Against 2 targets, keep your single-target rotation on the main one; apply Corruption, Bane of Agony, and Siphon Life to the second if it will live at least half a minute. Hellfire is not worth using on two. With 3 or more, channel it as soon as the pack is close if it will die in about 20 seconds; if it will live longer, spread the three DoTs first. Use Rain of Fire from range when you cannot safely stand in the pack.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › AoE DPS Rotation for Affliction Warlocks in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-11"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:38d07754537b9afb8193289da56f2f9e8d48efae"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-area-demonologia-60","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Área de Demonología a nivel 60","title_en":"Level 60 Demonology AoE","summary_es":"Piroinferno golpea más con Fuego; usa Lluvia de Fuego desde lejos y cambia de demonio para área larga en Sombras.","summary_en":"Hellfire hits harder with the Fire build; use Rain of Fire at range and swap demons for long Shadow-build AoE.","keywords_es":["área Demonología nivel 60","Piroinferno Demonología","Lluvia de Fuego Demonología","demonio Demonología área"],"keywords_en":["level 60 Demonology AoE","Demonology Hellfire","Demonology Rain of Fire","Demonology demon AoE"],"text_es":"Con 2 objetivos, mantén la rotación principal y pon Corrupción e Inmolar en el segundo; añade Terror de agonía si vivirá al menos medio minuto. Contra 3 o más, canaliza Piroinferno cuando estén a tu lado; mientras se acercan, reparte Terror de agonía y, si da tiempo, Maldición de los Elementos. Si no puedes acercarte, usa Lluvia de Fuego. En área larga con la rama de Sombras, sacrifica a la súcubo/íncubo y saca al diablillo para potenciar el daño de Fuego.","text_en":"Against 2 targets, keep your main rotation and apply Corruption and Immolate to the second; add Bane of Agony if it will live at least half a minute. Against 3 or more, channel Hellfire once they are next to you; while they run in, spread Bane of Agony and, if time allows, Curse of the Elements. Use Rain of Fire if you cannot get close. For sustained AoE with the Shadow build, sacrifice the Sayaad and summon the Imp to boost Fire damage.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Demonology Warlock DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › AoE DPS Rotation for Demonology Warlocks in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/demonology/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-10-26"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:demonology:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:40762d07d25d5e60449986d4866e2f8d148853e7"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-area-destruccion-60","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Área de Destrucción a nivel 60","title_en":"Level 60 Destruction AoE","summary_es":"Usa Terror de caos contra un objetivo secundario y Piroinferno en grupos de tres o más.","summary_en":"Use Bane of Havoc on a secondary target and Hellfire against packs of 3 or more.","keywords_es":["área Destrucción nivel 60","Terror de caos","Piroinferno Destrucción","Destrucción varios objetivos"],"keywords_en":["level 60 Destruction AoE","Bane of Havoc","Destruction Hellfire","Destruction multiple targets"],"text_es":"Contra 2 objetivos, aplica Terror de caos al secundario y usa la rotación normal en el principal; el marcado recibe 15% del daño que infliges al principal. Si vivirá al menos un minuto, añade maldición, Corrupción e Inmolar al secundario. Contra 3 o más, coloca Terror de caos y canaliza Piroinferno cuando el grupo esté junto; mientras se acerca, aplica Terror de agonía al resto y Maldición de los Elementos si da tiempo. Usa Lluvia de Fuego si no puedes acercarte.","text_en":"Against 2 targets, put Bane of Havoc on the secondary and use your normal rotation on the main target; 15% of damage to the main target is also dealt to the marked one. Add your Curse, Corruption, and Immolate there too if the marked enemy is expected to survive for a minute or longer. Against 3 or more, apply Bane of Havoc and channel Hellfire once the pack is together; while it runs in, apply Bane of Agony to the others and Curse of the Elements if time allows. Use Rain of Fire if you cannot get close.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Destruction Warlock DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › AoE DPS Rotation for Destruction Warlocks in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-03"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:destruction:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:29cd8c54a8c86337d11b7b247201e0032b7acaab"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-build-afliccion-arruinar-raid","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build de banda de Aflicción con Arruinar","title_en":"Affliction Wrack Raid Build","summary_es":"Distribución exacta de talentos para la build de banda de Arruinar, que sacrifica al diablillo por daño de Sombras.","summary_en":"Exact Wrack raid talent setup, sacrificing the Imp for Shadow damage.","keywords_es":["build Arruinar Aflicción","talentos Aflicción banda","talentos Brujo nivel 60","sacrificio demoníaco Aflicción"],"keywords_en":["Affliction Wrack build","Affliction raid talents","level 60 Warlock talents","Affliction Demonic Sacrifice"],"text_es":"Aflicción: Transfusión de  vida mejorada 2/2, Supresión 5/5, Corrupción mejorado 5/5, Terror de agonía mejorado 2/2, Amplificar maldición 1/1, Pandemia 3/3, Malevolencia 5/5, Ocaso 2/2, Succionar vida 1/1, Succión de alma 3/3, Maestría de las Sombras 5/5, Arruinar 1/1; Demonología: Abrazo demoníaco 5/5, Égida demoníaca 2/2, Vitalidad vil 3/3, Sacrificio demoníaco 1/1; Destrucción: Descarga de Sombras mejorada 5/5. Sacrifica al diablillo: +15% de daño de Sombras. Arruinar potencia DoTs. Transfusión de vida mejorada ayuda al maná. SM Ruina usa Aterrar 5/5 para acelerar Descarga de las Sombras.","text_en":"Affliction: Improved Life Tap 2/2, Suppression 5/5, Improved Corruption 5/5, Improved Bane of Agony 2/2, Amplify Curse 1/1, Pandemic 3/3, Malevolence 5/5, Nightfall 2/2, Siphon Life 1/1, Soul Siphon 3/3, Shadow Mastery 5/5, Wrack 1/1; Demonology: Demonic Embrace 5/5, Demonic Aegis 2/2, Fel Vitality 3/3, Demonic Sacrifice 1/1; Destruction: Improved Shadow Bolt 5/5. Sacrifice the Imp for +15% Shadow damage. Wrack boosts DoTs. Improved Life Tap supports mana. SM Ruin uses Bane 5/5 to speed Shadow Bolt.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Affliction Warlock Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Affliction Warlock PvE Raid Build > Which Build Should You Pick?","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-11"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:talents"],"source_hashes":["guide:d81ab77a5526144ee1ed26b2be4f0ecf34111ff8"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-build-afliccion-sm-ruina-raid","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build de banda de Aflicción SM Ruina","title_en":"Affliction SM Ruin Raid Build","summary_es":"Build con Descarga de las Sombras como relleno y demonio activo; pierde daño frente a Arruinar.","summary_en":"Shadow Bolt filler with a demon active; lower damage than Wrack.","keywords_es":["build SM Ruina Aflicción","talentos Descarga de las Sombras","build Aflicción demonio","talentos banda Brujo"],"keywords_en":["Affliction SM Ruin build","Shadow Bolt talents","Affliction demon build","Warlock raid talents"],"text_es":"Aflicción: Transfusión de  vida mejorada 2/2, Supresión 5/5, Corrupción mejorado 5/5, Terror de agonía mejorado 1/2, Amplificar maldición 1/1, Pandemia 3/3, Malevolencia 5/5, Ocaso 2/2, Succionar vida 1/1, Maestría de las Sombras 5/5; Destrucción: Descarga de Sombras mejorada 5/5, Aterrar 5/5, Cataclismo 3/3, Ruina 5/5, Llamas agonizantes 3/3. Mantén a la súcubo/íncubo y rellena con Descarga de las Sombras; Transfusión de vida mejorada ayuda a gestionar el maná. Elige esta build si prefieres lanzar en vez de canalizar Arruinar.","text_en":"Affliction: Improved Life Tap 2/2, Suppression 5/5, Improved Corruption 5/5, Improved Bane of Agony 1/2, Amplify Curse 1/1, Pandemic 3/3, Malevolence 5/5, Nightfall 2/2, Siphon Life 1/1, Shadow Mastery 5/5; Destruction: Improved Shadow Bolt 5/5, Bane 5/5, Cataclysm 3/3, Ruin 5/5, Agonizing Flames 3/3. Keep the Sayaad and fill with Shadow Bolt; Improved Life Tap helps manage mana. Choose this build if you prefer casts to channeling Wrack.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Affliction Warlock Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Affliction Warlock PvE Raid Build > Which Build Should You Pick?","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-11"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:talents"],"source_hashes":["guide:d81ab77a5526144ee1ed26b2be4f0ecf34111ff8"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-build-afliccion-mazmorra","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build de mazmorra de Aflicción","title_en":"Affliction Dungeon Build","summary_es":"Build SM Ruina con Quemadura de las Sombras para moverse y rematar objetivos.","summary_en":"SM Ruin setup with Shadowburn for movement and finishing targets.","keywords_es":["build mazmorra Aflicción","talentos Aflicción mazmorra","Quemadura de las Sombras brujo","build de movilidad Brujo"],"keywords_en":["Affliction dungeon build","Affliction dungeon talents","Warlock Shadowburn","Warlock mobility build"],"text_es":"Aflicción: Transfusión de  vida mejorada 2/2, Supresión 5/5, Corrupción mejorado 5/5, Terror de agonía mejorado 1/2, Amplificar maldición 1/1, Pandemia 3/3, Malevolencia 5/5, Ocaso 2/2, Succionar vida 1/1, Maestría de las Sombras 5/5; Destrucción: Descarga de Sombras mejorada 5/5, Aterrar 5/5, Cataclismo 2/3, Ruina 5/5, Quemadura de las Sombras 1/1, Llamas agonizantes 3/3. Cambia un punto de Cataclismo por Quemadura de las Sombras: el lanzamiento instantáneo ayuda a recolocarse y rematar enemigos huidizos.","text_en":"Affliction: Improved Life Tap 2/2, Suppression 5/5, Improved Corruption 5/5, Improved Bane of Agony 1/2, Amplify Curse 1/1, Pandemic 3/3, Malevolence 5/5, Nightfall 2/2, Siphon Life 1/1, Shadow Mastery 5/5; Destruction: Improved Shadow Bolt 5/5, Bane 5/5, Cataclysm 2/3, Ruin 5/5, Shadowburn 1/1, Agonizing Flames 3/3. Trade one Cataclysm point for Shadowburn: its instant cast helps reposition and finish fleeing enemies.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Affliction Warlock Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Affliction Warlock PvE Dungeon Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-11"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:37a5c2a2bed831ffd339a408d567d41f0dc71cf0"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-build-afliccion-pvp-sm-sl-1","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build JcJ SM/SL de Aflicción (1/2)","title_en":"Affliction SM/SL PvP Build (1/2)","summary_es":"Primera parte de los talentos de Aflicción de la build SM/SL para campos de batalla.","summary_en":"First part of the Affliction talents in the SM/SL Battleground build.","keywords_es":["build JcJ Aflicción SM SL","talentos Vínculo de alma","build brujo campos de batalla","talentos Brujo PvP"],"keywords_en":["Affliction SM SL PvP build","Soul Link talents","Warlock Battleground build","Warlock PvP talents"],"text_es":"Parte 1/2, talentos de Aflicción: Transfusión de  vida mejorada 2/2, Supresión 2/5, Corrupción mejorado 5/5, Alcance macabro 2/2, Terror de agonía mejorado 2/2, Amplificar maldición 1/1, Pandemia 3/3, Malevolencia 4/5, Ocaso 2/2, Maldición de agotamiento 1/1, Succionar vida 1/1, Maestría de las Sombras 5/5. Esta parte contiene los talentos de Aflicción.","text_en":"Part 1/2, Affliction talents: Improved Life Tap 2/2, Suppression 2/5, Improved Corruption 5/5, Grim Reach 2/2, Improved Bane of Agony 2/2, Amplify Curse 1/1, Pandemic 3/3, Malevolence 4/5, Nightfall 2/2, Curse of Exhaustion 1/1, Siphon Life 1/1, Shadow Mastery 5/5. This part lists the Affliction talents.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Affliction Warlock Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Affliction Warlock PvP Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-11"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:30d1baf6851822e1831ff020125427a5d165f3c4"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-build-afliccion-pvp-sm-sl-2","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build JcJ SM/SL de Aflicción (2/2)","title_en":"Affliction SM/SL PvP Build (2/2)","summary_es":"Talentos de Demonología y propósito de la build SM/SL para campos de batalla en solitario.","summary_en":"Demonology talents and purpose of the SM/SL solo Battleground build.","keywords_es":["build JcJ Aflicción SM SL","talentos Vínculo de alma","build brujo campos de batalla","talentos Brujo PvP"],"keywords_en":["Affliction SM SL PvP build","Soul Link talents","Warlock Battleground build","Warlock PvP talents"],"text_es":"Parte 2/2, Demonología: Abrazo demoníaco 5/5, Égida demoníaca 2/2, Abisario mejorado 3/3, Vitalidad vil 3/3, Energías demoníacas 2/2, Sacrificio demoníaco 1/1, Maestro invocador 2/2, Dominio de lo maldito 1/1, Marca demoníaca 1/3, Vínculo de alma 1/1. Mantén vivo al demonio y aguanta el foco con Vínculo de alma; está pensada para campos de batalla en solitario y requiere poca microgestión de la mascota.","text_en":"Part 2/2, demonology branch: Demonic Embrace 5/5, Demonic Aegis 2/2, Improved Voidwalker 3/3, Fel Vitality 3/3, Demonic Energies 2/2, Demonic Sacrifice 1/1, Master Summoner 2/2, Fel Domination 1/1, Demonic Brand 1/3, Soul Link 1/1. Keep the demon alive and withstand focus with Soul Link; this build is aimed at solo Battlegrounds and needs little pet micromanagement.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Affliction Warlock Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Affliction Warlock PvP Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-11"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:30d1baf6851822e1831ff020125427a5d165f3c4"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-build-afliccion-pvp-sm-ruina","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build JcJ de Aflicción SM Ruina","title_en":"Affliction SM Ruin PvP Build","summary_es":"Build JcJ de estallido para grupos que te quiten presión, con Ruina y Conflagrar.","summary_en":"Burst PvP build for groups that keep pressure off you, with Ruin and Conflagrate.","keywords_es":["build JcJ Aflicción Ruina","build Conflagrar Brujo PvP","talentos Ruina brujo","estallido brujo JcJ"],"keywords_en":["Affliction Ruin PvP build","Warlock Conflagrate build","Warlock Ruin talents","Warlock PvP burst"],"text_es":"Aflicción: Transfusión de  vida mejorada 2/2, Supresión 1/5, Corrupción mejorado 5/5, Alcance macabro 2/2, Terror de agonía mejorado 2/2, Amplificar maldición 1/1, Pandemia 3/3, Malevolencia 5/5, Ocaso 2/2, Maldición de agotamiento 1/1, Succionar vida 1/1, Maestría de las Sombras 4/5; Destrucción: Alcance destructivo 2/2, Aterrar 5/5, Secuelas 5/5, Ruina 5/5, Quemadura de las Sombras 1/1, Llamas agonizantes 3/3, Conflagrar 1/1. Se orienta al estallido de Descarga de las Sombras y Conflagrar; el equipo debe protegerte porque renuncia a la defensa del demonio.","text_en":"Affliction: Improved Life Tap 2/2, Suppression 1/5, Improved Corruption 5/5, Grim Reach 2/2, Improved Bane of Agony 2/2, Amplify Curse 1/1, Pandemic 3/3, Malevolence 5/5, Nightfall 2/2, Curse of Exhaustion 1/1, Siphon Life 1/1, Shadow Mastery 4/5; Destruction: Destructive Reach 2/2, Bane 5/5, Aftermath 5/5, Ruin 5/5, Shadowburn 1/1, Agonizing Flames 3/3, Conflagrate 1/1. It emphasizes Shadow Bolt and Conflagrate burst; teammates should protect you because it gives up the pet-based defense.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Affliction Warlock Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Affliction Warlock PvP Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-11"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:30d1baf6851822e1831ff020125427a5d165f3c4"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-build-afliccion-pvp-arruinar","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build JcJ de Aflicción con Arruinar","title_en":"Affliction Wrack PvP Build","summary_es":"Build JcJ de drenajes para equipo fuerte; concentración vil evita interrupciones al canalizar.","summary_en":"Drain-focused PvP build for geared characters; Fel Concentration prevents channel pushback.","keywords_es":["build JcJ Arruinar brujo","drenajes Aflicción PvP","Concentración vil brujo","talentos brujo drenaje"],"keywords_en":["Warlock Wrack PvP build","Affliction PvP drains","Warlock Fel Concentration","Warlock drain talents"],"text_es":"Aflicción: Corrupción mejorado 5/5, Alcance macabro 2/2, Drenajes mejorados 3/3, Concentración vil 3/3, Amplificar maldición 1/1, Pandemia 3/3, Malevolencia 1/5, Ocaso 2/2, Maldición de agotamiento 1/1, Succionar vida 1/1, Succión de alma 3/3, Maestría de las Sombras 5/5, Arruinar 1/1; Demonología: Abrazo demoníaco 5/5, Égida demoníaca 2/2; Destrucción: Alcance destructivo 2/2, Descarga de Sombras mejorada 5/5, Piel de arrabio 5/5, Quemadura de las Sombras 1/1. Potencia drenajes y evita su retroceso; se recomienda si disfrutas ese estilo y ya tienes equipo fuerte.","text_en":"Affliction: Improved Corruption 5/5, Grim Reach 2/2, Improved Drains 3/3, Fel Concentration 3/3, Amplify Curse 1/1, Pandemic 3/3, Malevolence 1/5, Nightfall 2/2, Curse of Exhaustion 1/1, Siphon Life 1/1, Soul Siphon 3/3, Shadow Mastery 5/5, Wrack 1/1; Demonology: Demonic Embrace 5/5, Demonic Aegis 2/2; Destruction: Destructive Reach 2/2, Improved Shadow Bolt 5/5, Molten Skin 5/5, Shadowburn 1/1. This option suits geared characters who want to center their play on drains; Fel Concentration reduces channel interruption.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Affliction Warlock Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Affliction Warlock PvP Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-11"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:30d1baf6851822e1831ff020125427a5d165f3c4"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-build-demonologia-fuego-raid","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build de banda de Demonología de Fuego","title_en":"Demonology Fire Raid Build","summary_es":"Build de Fuego: diablillo activo, súcubo sacrificada y Dolor abrasador como relleno.","summary_en":"Fire setup: Imp active, Sayaad sacrificed, with Searing Pain as filler.","keywords_es":["build Demonología Fuego","talentos Demonología banda","build diablillo brujo","Pacto demoníaco Fuego"],"keywords_en":["Demonology Fire build","Demonology raid talents","Warlock Imp build","Fire Demonic Pact"],"text_es":"Aflicción: Supresión 1/5, Corrupción mejorado 1/5; Demonología: Diablillo mejorado 3/3, Poder profano 5/5, Vitalidad vil 3/3, Energías demoníacas 2/2, Sacrificio demoníaco 1/1, Maestro invocador 2/2, Exterminio 2/2, Marca demoníaca 3/3, Vínculo de alma 1/1, Conocimiento demoníaco 3/3, Maestro demonogista 5/5, Pacto demoníaco 1/1; Destrucción: Aterrar 5/5, Secuelas 5/5, Ruina 5/5, Llamas agonizantes 3/3. Sacrifica a la súcubo/íncubo y mantén al diablillo: Pacto demoníaco conserva el bonus de sacrificio mientras el demonio activo aporta daño de Fuego.","text_en":"Affliction: Suppression 1/5, Improved Corruption 1/5; Demonology: Improved Imp 3/3, Unholy Power 5/5, Fel Vitality 3/3, Demonic Energies 2/2, Demonic Sacrifice 1/1, Master Summoner 2/2, Decimation 2/2, Demonic Brand 3/3, Soul Link 1/1, Demonic Knowledge 3/3, Master Demonologist 5/5, Demonic Pact 1/1; Destruction: Bane 5/5, Aftermath 5/5, Ruin 5/5, Agonizing Flames 3/3. Sacrifice the Sayaad and keep the Imp: Demonic Pact preserves the sacrifice bonus while the active demon adds Fire damage.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Demonology Warlock Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Demonology Warlock PvE Raid Build > Fire or Shadow?","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/demonology/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:demonology:talents"],"source_hashes":["guide:81e15fe80d6f15039d1402fc8b5c9c586ce226fc"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-build-demonologia-sombras-raid","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build de banda de Demonología de Sombras","title_en":"Demonology Shadow Raid Build","summary_es":"Build de Sombras: súcubo activa, diablillo sacrificado y Descarga de las Sombras como relleno.","summary_en":"Shadow setup: Sayaad active, Imp sacrificed, with Shadow Bolt as filler.","keywords_es":["build Demonología Sombras","talentos Demonología Sombras","build súcubo brujo","Descarga de las Sombras Demonología"],"keywords_en":["Demonology Shadow build","Shadow Demonology talents","Warlock Sayaad build","Demonology Shadow Bolt"],"text_es":"Aflicción: Supresión 1/5, Corrupción mejorado 1/5; Demonología: Poder profano 5/5, Vitalidad vil 3/3, Energías demoníacas 2/2, Sayaad mejorado 3/3, Sacrificio demoníaco 1/1, Maestro invocador 2/2, Exterminio 2/2, Marca demoníaca 3/3, Vínculo de alma 1/1, Conocimiento demoníaco 3/3, Maestro demonogista 5/5, Pacto demoníaco 1/1; Destrucción: Descarga de Sombras mejorada 5/5, Aterrar 5/5, Ruina 5/5, Llamas agonizantes 3/3. Sacrifica al diablillo y mantén a la súcubo/íncubo; elige esta rama si el equipo favorece Sombras o los combates son cortos. Aterrar acelera Descarga de las Sombras.","text_en":"Affliction: Suppression 1/5, Improved Corruption 1/5; Demonology: Unholy Power 5/5, Fel Vitality 3/3, Demonic Energies 2/2, Improved Sayaad 3/3, Demonic Sacrifice 1/1, Master Summoner 2/2, Decimation 2/2, Demonic Brand 3/3, Soul Link 1/1, Demonic Knowledge 3/3, Master Demonologist 5/5, Demonic Pact 1/1; Destruction: Improved Shadow Bolt 5/5, Bane 5/5, Ruin 5/5, Agonizing Flames 3/3. Sacrifice the Imp and keep the Sayaad; choose this build when gear favors Shadow or fights are short. Bane shortens Shadow Bolt casts.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Demonology Warlock Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Demonology Warlock PvE Raid Build > Fire or Shadow?","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/demonology/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:demonology:talents"],"source_hashes":["guide:81e15fe80d6f15039d1402fc8b5c9c586ce226fc"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-build-demonologia-mazmorra","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build de mazmorra de Demonología","title_en":"Demonology Dungeon Build","summary_es":"Usa la build de banda de Fuego por su daño de área; mueve talentos para ganar habilidades instantáneas si hace falta.","summary_en":"Use the Fire raid build for AoE; trade talents for instant casts if needed.","keywords_es":["build Demonología mazmorra","talentos Demonología área","Demonología Fuego mazmorra","movilidad brujo mazmorra"],"keywords_en":["Demonology dungeon build","Demonology AoE talents","Demonology Fire dungeon","Warlock dungeon mobility"],"text_es":"Para mazmorras, usa la build de banda de Fuego: conserva exactamente Aflicción: Supresión 1/5, Corrupción mejorado 1/5; Demonología: Diablillo mejorado 3/3, Poder profano 5/5, Vitalidad vil 3/3, Energías demoníacas 2/2, Sacrificio demoníaco 1/1, Maestro invocador 2/2, Exterminio 2/2, Marca demoníaca 3/3, Vínculo de alma 1/1, Conocimiento demoníaco 3/3, Maestro demonogista 5/5, Pacto demoníaco 1/1; Destrucción: Aterrar 5/5, Secuelas 5/5, Ruina 5/5, Llamas agonizantes 3/3. Si necesitas movilidad, puedes cambiar puntos para Quemadura de las Sombras y Conflagrar, a costa de daño a un objetivo.","text_en":"For dungeons, use the Fire raid build unchanged: Affliction: Suppression 1/5, Improved Corruption 1/5; Demonology: Improved Imp 3/3, Unholy Power 5/5, Fel Vitality 3/3, Demonic Energies 2/2, Demonic Sacrifice 1/1, Master Summoner 2/2, Decimation 2/2, Demonic Brand 3/3, Soul Link 1/1, Demonic Knowledge 3/3, Master Demonologist 5/5, Demonic Pact 1/1; Destruction: Bane 5/5, Aftermath 5/5, Ruin 5/5, Agonizing Flames 3/3. You may trade points for Shadowburn and Conflagrate for mobility, at the cost of single-target damage.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Demonology Warlock Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Demonology Warlock PvE Dungeon Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/demonology/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:demonology:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:318126bb2d84e75cc44cc1c6fa690951d3d9fcaf"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-build-demonologia-pvp-pacto-afliccion-1","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build JcJ de drenajes (1/2)","title_en":"Demonology Drain PvP Build (1/2)","summary_es":"Primera parte de los talentos de la build de drenajes y Pacto demoníaco para JcJ.","summary_en":"First part of the drain and Demonic Pact PvP talent build.","keywords_es":["build Demonología drenajes JcJ","Pacto demoníaco PvP","Drenar maná brujo","talentos brujo duelos"],"keywords_en":["Demonology drain PvP build","Demonic Pact PvP","Warlock Drain Mana","Warlock duel talents"],"text_es":"Parte 1/2, Aflicción: Corrupción mejorado 5/5, Alcance macabro 2/2, Drenajes mejorados 3/3, Concentración vil 3/3, Amplificar maldición 1/1, Pandemia 3/3, Ocaso 2/2, Maldición de agotamiento 1/1. Esta parte recoge los talentos de Aflicción.","text_en":"Part 1/2, Affliction: Improved Corruption 5/5, Grim Reach 2/2, Improved Drains 3/3, Fel Concentration 3/3, Amplify Curse 1/1, Pandemic 3/3, Nightfall 2/2, Curse of Exhaustion 1/1. This part lists the Affliction talents.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Demonology Warlock Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Demonology Warlock PvP Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/demonology/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:demonology:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:5e26056bbefb1d9f5dd16ff8da5bed33715be91f"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-build-demonologia-pvp-pacto-afliccion-2","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build JcJ de drenajes (2/2)","title_en":"Demonology Drain PvP Build (2/2)","summary_es":"Talentos de Demonología y objetivo de la build de drenajes con Pacto demoníaco.","summary_en":"Demonology talents and purpose of the drain-focused Demonic Pact build.","keywords_es":["build Demonología drenajes JcJ","Pacto demoníaco PvP","Drenar maná brujo","talentos brujo duelos"],"keywords_en":["Demonology drain PvP build","Demonic Pact PvP","Warlock Drain Mana","Warlock duel talents"],"text_es":"Parte 2/2, Demonología: Abrazo demoníaco 5/5, Égida demoníaca 2/2, Abisario mejorado 3/3, Vitalidad vil 3/3, Energías demoníacas 2/2, Sacrificio demoníaco 1/1, Maestro invocador 2/2, Dominio de lo maldito 1/1, Marca demoníaca 1/3, Manáfago mejorado 3/3, Vínculo de alma 1/1, Conocimiento demoníaco 1/3, Maestro demonogista 5/5, Pacto demoníaco 1/1. Está pensada para duelos y JcJ de mundo: Drenajes mejorados también vacía maná y Pacto permite cambiar de demonio sin perder el bonus de sacrificio.","text_en":"Part 2/2, Demonology: Demonic Embrace 5/5, Demonic Aegis 2/2, Improved Voidwalker 3/3, Fel Vitality 3/3, Demonic Energies 2/2, Demonic Sacrifice 1/1, Master Summoner 2/2, Fel Domination 1/1, Demonic Brand 1/3, Improved Felhunter 3/3, Soul Link 1/1, Demonic Knowledge 1/3, Master Demonologist 5/5, Demonic Pact 1/1. It is aimed at duels and world PvP: Improved Drains also removes mana, and Pact lets you swap demons without losing the sacrifice bonus.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Demonology Warlock Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Demonology Warlock PvP Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/demonology/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:demonology:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:5e26056bbefb1d9f5dd16ff8da5bed33715be91f"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-build-demonologia-pvp-pacto-quemadura-1","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build JcJ con Quemadura (1/2)","title_en":"Demonology Shadowburn PvP Build (1/2)","summary_es":"Primera parte de los talentos de la build JcJ con Vínculo de alma y Quemadura de las Sombras.","summary_en":"First part of the Soul Link and Shadowburn PvP build talents.","keywords_es":["build Quemadura de las Sombras JcJ","Demonología Vínculo de alma","talentos brujo burst PvP","Pacto demoníaco JcJ"],"keywords_en":["Shadowburn PvP build","Demonology Soul Link","Warlock PvP burst talents","Demonic Pact PvP"],"text_es":"Parte 1/2, Aflicción: Corrupción mejorado 5/5, Alcance macabro 2/2; Demonología: Abrazo demoníaco 5/5, Égida demoníaca 2/2, Abisario mejorado 3/3, Vitalidad vil 3/3, Energías demoníacas 2/2, Sacrificio demoníaco 1/1, Maestro invocador 2/2, Dominio de lo maldito 1/1, Marca demoníaca 1/3, Manáfago mejorado 3/3, Vínculo de alma 1/1, Conocimiento demoníaco 3/3, Maestro demonogista 5/5, Pacto demoníaco 1/1. Esta parte reúne las ramas de Aflicción y Demonología.","text_en":"Part 1/2, Affliction: Improved Corruption 5/5, Grim Reach 2/2; Demonology: Demonic Embrace 5/5, Demonic Aegis 2/2, Improved Voidwalker 3/3, Fel Vitality 3/3, Demonic Energies 2/2, Demonic Sacrifice 1/1, Master Summoner 2/2, Fel Domination 1/1, Demonic Brand 1/3, Improved Felhunter 3/3, Soul Link 1/1, Demonic Knowledge 3/3, Master Demonologist 5/5, Demonic Pact 1/1. This part lists the Affliction and Demonology trees.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Demonology Warlock Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Demonology Warlock PvP Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/demonology/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:demonology:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:5e26056bbefb1d9f5dd16ff8da5bed33715be91f"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-build-demonologia-pvp-pacto-quemadura-2","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build JcJ con Quemadura (2/2)","title_en":"Demonology Shadowburn PvP Build (2/2)","summary_es":"Talentos de Destrucción y objetivo de la build JcJ con Quemadura de las Sombras.","summary_en":"Destruction talents and purpose of the Shadowburn PvP build.","keywords_es":["build Quemadura de las Sombras JcJ","Demonología Vínculo de alma","talentos brujo burst PvP","Pacto demoníaco JcJ"],"keywords_en":["Shadowburn PvP build","Demonology Soul Link","Warlock PvP burst talents","Demonic Pact PvP"],"text_es":"Parte 2/2, Destrucción: Aterrar 5/5, Piel de arrabio 5/5, Quemadura de las Sombras 1/1. Añade estallido y un remate instantáneo a Vínculo de alma; el daño del demonio y Piel de arrabio refuerzan el daño y la supervivencia.","text_en":"Part 2/2, Destruction: Bane 5/5, Molten Skin 5/5, Shadowburn 1/1. Adds burst and an instant finisher to Soul Link; demon damage and Molten Skin improve damage and survival.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Demonology Warlock Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Demonology Warlock PvP Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/demonology/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:demonology:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:5e26056bbefb1d9f5dd16ff8da5bed33715be91f"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-build-demonologia-pvp-trispec-1","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build JcJ trispec (1/2)","title_en":"Demonology Tri-Spec PvP Build (1/2)","summary_es":"Primera parte de los talentos de la build trispec para campos de batalla.","summary_en":"First part of the tri-spec Battleground talent build.","keywords_es":["build trispec brujo","build campos de batalla brujo","Maldición de agotamiento talentos","talentos Demonología JcJ"],"keywords_en":["Warlock tri-spec build","Warlock Battleground build","Curse of Exhaustion talents","Demonology PvP talents"],"text_es":"Parte 1/2, Aflicción: Transfusión de  vida mejorada 2/2, Supresión 2/5, Corrupción mejorado 5/5, Alcance macabro 2/2, Amplificar maldición 1/1, Pandemia 3/3, Maldición de agotamiento 1/1; Demonología: Abrazo demoníaco 5/5, Égida demoníaca 2/2, Vitalidad vil 3/3, Energías demoníacas 2/2, Sacrificio demoníaco 1/1, Maestro invocador 2/2, Exterminio 2/2, Dominio de lo maldito 1/1, Marca demoníaca 2/3, Manáfago mejorado 3/3, Vínculo de alma 1/1. Esta parte contiene las ramas de Aflicción y Demonología.","text_en":"Part 1/2, Affliction: Improved Life Tap 2/2, Suppression 2/5, Improved Corruption 5/5, Grim Reach 2/2, Amplify Curse 1/1, Pandemic 3/3, Curse of Exhaustion 1/1; Demonology: Demonic Embrace 5/5, Demonic Aegis 2/2, Fel Vitality 3/3, Demonic Energies 2/2, Demonic Sacrifice 1/1, Master Summoner 2/2, Decimation 2/2, Fel Domination 1/1, Demonic Brand 2/3, Improved Felhunter 3/3, Soul Link 1/1. This part lists the Affliction and Demonology trees.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Demonology Warlock Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Demonology Warlock PvP Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/demonology/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:demonology:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:5e26056bbefb1d9f5dd16ff8da5bed33715be91f"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-build-destruccion-sayaad-raid","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build de banda de Destrucción con súcubo","title_en":"Destruction Sayaad Raid Build","summary_es":"Build de banda de mayor daño con súcubo activa y talentos de golpe y efectos periódicos.","summary_en":"Highest-damage raid setup with an active Sayaad and hit and DoT talents.","keywords_es":["build Destrucción súcubo","talentos Destrucción banda","Incinerar Destrucción","talentos Brujo nivel 60"],"keywords_en":["Destruction Sayaad build","Destruction raid talents","Destruction Incinerate","level 60 Warlock talents"],"text_es":"Aflicción: Transfusión de  vida mejorada 2/2, Supresión 5/5, Corrupción mejorado 3/5, Amplificar maldición 1/1, Pandemia 3/3; Demonología: Poder profano 4/5; Destrucción: Aterrar 5/5, Cataclismo 3/3, Secuelas 5/5, Ruina 5/5, Quemadura de las Sombras 1/1, Llamas agonizantes 3/3, Conflagrar 1/1, Terror de caos 1/1, Fuego y azufre 3/3, Sombras y llamas 5/5, Incinerar 1/1. Mantén a la súcubo/íncubo: es la opción de más daño si sobrevive. Incinerar hace 25% más con Inmolar activo; Transfusión de vida ayuda con el maná.","text_en":"Affliction: Improved Life Tap 2/2, Suppression 5/5, Improved Corruption 3/5, Amplify Curse 1/1, Pandemic 3/3; Demonology: Unholy Power 4/5; Destruction: Bane 5/5, Cataclysm 3/3, Aftermath 5/5, Ruin 5/5, Shadowburn 1/1, Agonizing Flames 3/3, Conflagrate 1/1, Bane of Havoc 1/1, Fire and Brimstone 3/3, Shadow and Flame 5/5, Incinerate 1/1. Keep the Sayaad for highest damage when it survives; Incinerate deals 25% more while Immolate is active. Improved Life Tap helps manage mana.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Destruction Warlock Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Destruction Warlock PvE Raid Build > Which Build Should You Pick?","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:destruction:talents"],"source_hashes":["guide:29fabf304908242c5dd204bf19f845522e4813b1"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-build-destruccion-diablillo-raid","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build de banda de Destrucción con diablillo","title_en":"Destruction Imp Raid Build","summary_es":"Variante de banda a distancia: conserva el diablillo y le transfiere maná con Transfusión de vida.","summary_en":"Ranged raid variant: keep the Imp and feed it mana through Life Tap.","keywords_es":["build Destrucción diablillo","talentos Destrucción diablillo","Energías demoníacas","Descarga de Fuego brujo"],"keywords_en":["Destruction Imp build","Destruction Imp talents","Demonic Energies","Warlock Firebolt"],"text_es":"Aflicción: Transfusión de  vida mejorada 2/2, Supresión 5/5, Corrupción mejorado 3/5, Amplificar maldición 1/1, Pandemia 3/3; Demonología: Diablillo mejorado 3/3, Poder profano 2/5, Energías demoníacas 1/2; Destrucción: Aterrar 5/5, Cataclismo 3/3, Secuelas 3/5, Ruina 5/5, Quemadura de las Sombras 1/1, Llamas agonizantes 3/3, Conflagrar 1/1, Terror de caos 1/1, Fuego y azufre 3/3, Sombras y llamas 5/5, Incinerar 1/1. Frente a la variante de súcubo, el diablillo ataca a distancia y Pacto de sangre da aguante al grupo; Transfusión de vida sostiene sus lanzamientos.","text_en":"Affliction: Improved Life Tap 2/2, Suppression 5/5, Improved Corruption 3/5, Amplify Curse 1/1, Pandemic 3/3; Demonology: Improved Imp 3/3, Unholy Power 2/5, Demonic Energies 1/2; Destruction: Bane 5/5, Cataclysm 3/3, Aftermath 3/5, Ruin 5/5, Shadowburn 1/1, Agonizing Flames 3/3, Conflagrate 1/1, Bane of Havoc 1/1, Fire and Brimstone 3/3, Shadow and Flame 5/5, Incinerate 1/1. This ranged-pet variant uses the Imp, whose Blood Pact adds party Stamina; Life Tap sustains its casts.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Destruction Warlock Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Destruction Warlock PvE Raid Build > Which Build Should You Pick?","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:destruction:talents"],"source_hashes":["guide:29fabf304908242c5dd204bf19f845522e4813b1"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-build-destruccion-sacrificio-raid","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build de banda de Destrucción con sacrificio","title_en":"Destruction Demonic Sacrifice Raid Build","summary_es":"Build sin demonio activo: sacrifica a la súcubo por 15% de daño de Fuego.","summary_en":"No-pet setup: sacrifice the Sayaad for 15% Fire damage.","keywords_es":["build Destrucción sacrificio demoníaco","Destrucción sin demonio","sacrificar súcubo brujo","talentos Destrucción banda"],"keywords_en":["Destruction Demonic Sacrifice build","no-pet Destruction","sacrifice Sayaad","Destruction raid talents"],"text_es":"Aflicción: Transfusión de  vida mejorada 2/2, Corrupción mejorado 5/5; Demonología: Abrazo demoníaco 5/5, Égida demoníaca 2/2, Vitalidad vil 3/3, Sacrificio demoníaco 1/1; Destrucción: Aterrar 5/5, Cataclismo 3/3, Secuelas 5/5, Ruina 5/5, Quemadura de las Sombras 1/1, Llamas agonizantes 3/3, Conflagrar 1/1, Terror de caos 1/1, Fuego y azufre 3/3, Sombras y llamas 5/5, Incinerar 1/1. Sacrifica a la súcubo/íncubo por 15% de daño de Fuego y juega sin demonio. Transfusión de vida ayuda con el maná.","text_en":"Affliction: Improved Life Tap 2/2, Improved Corruption 5/5; Demonology: Demonic Embrace 5/5, Demonic Aegis 2/2, Fel Vitality 3/3, Demonic Sacrifice 1/1; Destruction: Bane 5/5, Cataclysm 3/3, Aftermath 5/5, Ruin 5/5, Shadowburn 1/1, Agonizing Flames 3/3, Conflagrate 1/1, Bane of Havoc 1/1, Fire and Brimstone 3/3, Shadow and Flame 5/5, Incinerate 1/1. Sacrifice the Sayaad for 15% Fire damage and play without a demon. Improved Life Tap helps manage mana.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Destruction Warlock Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Destruction Warlock PvE Raid Build > Which Build Should You Pick?","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:destruction:talents"],"source_hashes":["guide:29fabf304908242c5dd204bf19f845522e4813b1"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-build-destruccion-sayaad-sin-demonologia","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Variante de Destrucción sin Demonología (bandas)","title_en":"Destruction No-Demonology Variant (raids)","summary_es":"Alternativa a la build de súcubo: cambia Poder profano y Amplificar maldición por talentos de Aflicción.","summary_en":"Sayaad-build alternative: trade Unholy Power and Amplify Curse for Affliction talents.","keywords_es":["Destrucción sin Demonología","variante build súcubo","Malevolencia Destrucción","talentos Corrupción brujo"],"keywords_en":["Destruction no-Demonology build","Sayaad build alternative","Destruction Malevolence","Warlock Improved Corruption talents"],"text_es":"Aflicción: Transfusión de  vida mejorada 2/2, Supresión 5/5, Corrupción mejorado 5/5, Pandemia 3/3, Malevolencia 3/5; Destrucción: Aterrar 5/5, Cataclismo 3/3, Secuelas 5/5, Ruina 5/5, Quemadura de las Sombras 1/1, Llamas agonizantes 3/3, Conflagrar 1/1, Terror de caos 1/1, Fuego y azufre 3/3, Sombras y llamas 5/5, Incinerar 1/1. Omite Demonología para mejorar Corrupción y el crítico de Sombras; su rendimiento es parecido. Transfusión de vida también mejora el maná.","text_en":"Affliction: Improved Life Tap 2/2, Suppression 5/5, Improved Corruption 5/5, Pandemic 3/3, Malevolence 3/5; Destruction: Bane 5/5, Cataclysm 3/3, Aftermath 5/5, Ruin 5/5, Shadowburn 1/1, Agonizing Flames 3/3, Conflagrate 1/1, Bane of Havoc 1/1, Fire and Brimstone 3/3, Shadow and Flame 5/5, Incinerate 1/1. This version skips Demonology in favor of Corruption and Shadow crits; performance is similar. Improved Life Tap also supports mana.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Destruction Warlock Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Destruction Warlock PvE Raid Build > Which Build Should You Pick?","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:destruction:talents"],"source_hashes":["guide:29fabf304908242c5dd204bf19f845522e4813b1"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-build-destruccion-mazmorra","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build de mazmorra de Destrucción","title_en":"Destruction Dungeon Build","summary_es":"Versión de la build de súcubo con Corrupción instantánea y menos puntos en Supresión.","summary_en":"Sayaad build variant with instant Corruption and fewer Suppression points.","keywords_es":["build Destrucción mazmorra","Corrupción instantánea brujo","Supresión mazmorra brujo","talentos Destrucción PvE"],"keywords_en":["Destruction dungeon build","instant Warlock Corruption","Warlock dungeon Suppression","Destruction PvE talents"],"text_es":"Aflicción: Transfusión de  vida mejorada 2/2, Supresión 3/5, Corrupción mejorado 5/5, Amplificar maldición 1/1, Pandemia 3/3; Demonología: Poder profano 4/5; Destrucción: Aterrar 5/5, Cataclismo 3/3, Secuelas 5/5, Ruina 5/5, Quemadura de las Sombras 1/1, Llamas agonizantes 3/3, Conflagrar 1/1, Terror de caos 1/1, Fuego y azufre 3/3, Sombras y llamas 5/5, Incinerar 1/1. Respecto a la build de banda de súcubo, mueve 2 puntos de Supresión a Corrupción mejorado para volver Corrupción instantánea, útil al moverte y repartirla.","text_en":"Affliction: Improved Life Tap 2/2, Suppression 3/5, Improved Corruption 5/5, Amplify Curse 1/1, Pandemic 3/3; Demonology: Unholy Power 4/5; Destruction: Bane 5/5, Cataclysm 3/3, Aftermath 5/5, Ruin 5/5, Shadowburn 1/1, Agonizing Flames 3/3, Conflagrate 1/1, Bane of Havoc 1/1, Fire and Brimstone 3/3, Shadow and Flame 5/5, Incinerate 1/1. Compared with the Sayaad raid build, move 2 Suppression points to Improved Corruption for an instant Corruption that is useful while moving and spreading it.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Destruction Warlock Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Destruction Warlock PvE Dungeon Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:destruction:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:7cd758bfd4f0dd0e5f9584f5b5c37de026a9e892"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-build-destruccion-pvp-vinculo-conflagrar","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build JcJ de Destrucción SL/Conflagrar","title_en":"Destruction SL/Conflagrate PvP Build","summary_es":"Build de aguante y estallido que combina Vínculo de alma con Conflagrar.","summary_en":"Durable burst build combining Soul Link with Conflagrate.","keywords_es":["build SL Conflagrar brujo","Destrucción JcJ supervivencia","talentos Vínculo de alma","talentos brujo PvP"],"keywords_en":["Warlock SL Conflagrate build","Destruction PvP survival","Soul Link talents","Warlock PvP talents"],"text_es":"Demonología: Cauce de salud mejorado 1/2, Abrazo demoníaco 5/5, Égida demoníaca 2/2, Vitalidad vil 3/3, Energías demoníacas 2/2, Sacrificio demoníaco 1/1, Maestro invocador 2/2, Exterminio 2/2, Dominio de lo maldito 1/1, Marca demoníaca 1/3, Vínculo de alma 1/1; Destrucción: Alcance destructivo 2/2, Aterrar 5/5, Piel de arrabio 5/5, Secuelas 5/5, Ruina 5/5, Quemadura de las Sombras 1/1, Llamas agonizantes 3/3, Conflagrar 1/1, Fuego y azufre 3/3. Para aguantar y conservar estallido, en grupo o en solitario; Vínculo de alma y Piel de arrabio protegen, Conflagrar y Quemadura rematan.","text_en":"Demonology: Improved Health Funnel 1/2, Demonic Embrace 5/5, Demonic Aegis 2/2, Fel Vitality 3/3, Demonic Energies 2/2, Demonic Sacrifice 1/1, Master Summoner 2/2, Decimation 2/2, Fel Domination 1/1, Demonic Brand 1/3, Soul Link 1/1; Destruction: Destructive Reach 2/2, Bane 5/5, Molten Skin 5/5, Aftermath 5/5, Ruin 5/5, Shadowburn 1/1, Agonizing Flames 3/3, Conflagrate 1/1, Fire and Brimstone 3/3. Built for durability plus burst in groups or solo; Soul Link and Molten Skin protect while Conflagrate and Shadowburn finish targets.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Destruction Warlock Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Destruction Warlock PvP Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:destruction:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:753e4f7c8f8406ac78849cbeea8fdcae598a3f0c"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-build-destruccion-pvp-vinculo-conflagrar-alcance","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build JcJ SL/Conflagrar con Alcance macabro","title_en":"SL/Conflagrate PvP Build with Grim Reach","summary_es":"Variante de SL/Conflagrar con más alcance para los hechizos de Aflicción.","summary_en":"SL/Conflagrate variant with extra range on Affliction spells.","keywords_es":["build JcJ brujo Alcance macabro","Vínculo de alma Conflagrar alcance","variante SL/Conflagrar"],"keywords_en":["warlock PvP Grim Reach build","Soul Link Conflagrate range","SL/Conflagrate variant"],"text_es":"Aflicción: Corrupción mejorado 5/5, Alcance macabro 2/2; Demonología: Cauce de salud mejorado 1/2, Abrazo demoníaco 5/5, Égida demoníaca 2/2, Vitalidad vil 3/3, Energías demoníacas 2/2, Sacrificio demoníaco 1/1, Maestro invocador 2/2, Exterminio 2/2, Dominio de lo maldito 1/1, Marca demoníaca 1/3, Vínculo de alma 1/1; Destrucción: Alcance destructivo 2/2, Aterrar 5/5, Secuelas 5/5, Ruina 5/5, Quemadura de las Sombras 1/1, Llamas agonizantes 3/3, Conflagrar 1/1, Fuego y azufre 1/3. Cambia Piel de arrabio y 2 rangos de Fuego y azufre por más alcance.","text_en":"Affliction: Improved Corruption 5/5, Grim Reach 2/2; Demonology: Improved Health Funnel 1/2, Demonic Embrace 5/5, Demonic Aegis 2/2, Fel Vitality 3/3, Demonic Energies 2/2, Demonic Sacrifice 1/1, Master Summoner 2/2, Decimation 2/2, Fel Domination 1/1, Demonic Brand 1/3, Soul Link 1/1; Destruction: Destructive Reach 2/2, Bane 5/5, Aftermath 5/5, Ruin 5/5, Shadowburn 1/1, Agonizing Flames 3/3, Conflagrate 1/1, Fire and Brimstone 1/3. It gives up Molten Skin and 2 ranks of Fire and Brimstone for extra range.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Destruction Warlock Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Destruction Warlock PvP Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:destruction:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:753e4f7c8f8406ac78849cbeea8fdcae598a3f0c"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-build-destruccion-pvp-dominio","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build JcJ de Destrucción con Dominio","title_en":"Destruction Fel Domination PvP Build","summary_es":"Build de estallido máximo con Dominio de lo maldito para invocar de nuevo al demonio rápidamente.","summary_en":"Maximum-burst build with Fel Domination for a quick demon resummon.","keywords_es":["build Dominio de lo maldito JcJ","Destrucción burst PvP","talentos brujo control demonio","Conflagrar JcJ"],"keywords_en":["Fel Domination PvP build","Destruction PvP burst","Warlock demon control talents","Conflagrate PvP"],"text_es":"Demonología: Abrazo demoníaco 5/5, Égida demoníaca 2/2, Vitalidad vil 3/3, Energías demoníacas 2/2, Sacrificio demoníaco 1/1, Maestro invocador 2/2, Dominio de lo maldito 1/1; Destrucción: Alcance destructivo 2/2, Aterrar 5/5, Secuelas 5/5, Ruina 5/5, Quemadura de las Sombras 1/1, Intensidad 3/3, Llamas agonizantes 3/3, Conflagrar 1/1, Terror de caos 1/1, Fuego y azufre 3/3, Sombras y llamas 5/5, Incinerar 1/1. Elige esta build por su estallido y control: Dominio de lo maldito acelera la nueva invocación si muere el demonio, e Intensidad reduce las interrupciones al lanzar.","text_en":"Demonology: Demonic Embrace 5/5, Demonic Aegis 2/2, Fel Vitality 3/3, Demonic Energies 2/2, Demonic Sacrifice 1/1, Master Summoner 2/2, Fel Domination 1/1; Destruction: Destructive Reach 2/2, Bane 5/5, Aftermath 5/5, Ruin 5/5, Shadowburn 1/1, Intensity 3/3, Agonizing Flames 3/3, Conflagrate 1/1, Bane of Havoc 1/1, Fire and Brimstone 3/3, Shadow and Flame 5/5, Incinerate 1/1. Choose this for burst and control: Fel Domination speeds a resummon if your demon dies, while Intensity reduces cast pushback.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Destruction Warlock Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Destruction Warlock PvP Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:destruction:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:753e4f7c8f8406ac78849cbeea8fdcae598a3f0c"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-build-destruccion-pvp-agotamiento","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build JcJ de Destrucción con Agotamiento","title_en":"Destruction Curse of Exhaustion PvP Build","summary_es":"Build para mantener a los enemigos cuerpo a cuerpo a distancia con Maldición de agotamiento.","summary_en":"Kiting build that keeps melee enemies at range with Curse of Exhaustion.","keywords_es":["build Maldición de agotamiento brujo","Destrucción JcJ kite","Ocaso talentos brujo","build brujo contra cuerpo a cuerpo"],"keywords_en":["Warlock Curse of Exhaustion build","Destruction PvP kiting","Warlock Nightfall talents","Warlock anti-melee build"],"text_es":"Aflicción: Transfusión de  vida mejorada 2/2, Supresión 2/5, Corrupción mejorado 5/5, Alcance macabro 2/2, Amplificar maldición 1/1, Pandemia 3/3, Ocaso 2/2, Maldición de agotamiento 1/1; Destrucción: Alcance destructivo 2/2, Aterrar 5/5, Piel de arrabio 1/5, Secuelas 5/5, Ruina 5/5, Quemadura de las Sombras 1/1, Llamas agonizantes 3/3, Conflagrar 1/1, Terror de caos 1/1, Fuego y azufre 3/3, Sombras y llamas 5/5, Incinerar 1/1. Está pensada para mantener a raya a enemigos cuerpo a cuerpo: Maldición de agotamiento ralentiza mientras la rama de Destrucción aporta estallido.","text_en":"Affliction: Improved Life Tap 2/2, Suppression 2/5, Improved Corruption 5/5, Grim Reach 2/2, Amplify Curse 1/1, Pandemic 3/3, Nightfall 2/2, Curse of Exhaustion 1/1; Destruction: Destructive Reach 2/2, Bane 5/5, Molten Skin 1/5, Aftermath 5/5, Ruin 5/5, Shadowburn 1/1, Agonizing Flames 3/3, Conflagrate 1/1, Bane of Havoc 1/1, Fire and Brimstone 3/3, Shadow and Flame 5/5, Incinerate 1/1. Built to keep melee enemies at range: Curse of Exhaustion slows them while Destruction supplies burst.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Destruction Warlock Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Destruction Warlock PvP Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:destruction:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:753e4f7c8f8406ac78849cbeea8fdcae598a3f0c"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-build-demonologia-pvp-trispec-2","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build JcJ trispec (2/2)","title_en":"Demonology Tri-Spec PvP Build (2/2)","summary_es":"Talentos de Destrucción y objetivo de la build trispec de supervivencia para campos de batalla.","summary_en":"Destruction talents and purpose of the durable tri-spec Battleground build.","keywords_es":["build trispec brujo","build campos de batalla brujo","Maldición de agotamiento talentos","talentos Demonología JcJ"],"keywords_en":["Warlock tri-spec build","Warlock Battleground build","Curse of Exhaustion talents","Demonology PvP talents"],"text_es":"Parte 2/2, Destrucción: Alcance destructivo 2/2, Aterrar 5/5, Piel de arrabio 3/5, Quemadura de las Sombras 1/1. La build ralentiza grupos con Maldición de agotamiento y combina aguante con daño explosivo; Manáfago mejorado reduce 6 s el tiempo de reutilización de Bloqueo de hechizo.","text_en":"Part 2/2, Destruction: Destructive Reach 2/2, Bane 5/5, Molten Skin 3/5, Shadowburn 1/1. The build slows groups with Curse of Exhaustion and combines durability with burst; Improved Felhunter cuts the Spell Lock cooldown by 6 seconds.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Demonology Warlock Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Demonology Warlock PvP Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/demonology/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:demonology:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:5e26056bbefb1d9f5dd16ff8da5bed33715be91f"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-sistema-afliccion-arruinar","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Cómo funciona Arruinar en Aflicción","title_en":"How Affliction Wrack Works","summary_es":"Arruinar acelera tres efectos periódicos y Succión de alma escala con cada uno activo.","summary_en":"Wrack speeds up three DoTs, while Soul Siphon scales with each one active.","keywords_es":["Arruinar Aflicción","Succión de alma brujo","efectos periódicos Aflicción","mecánicas brujo nivel 60"],"keywords_en":["Affliction Wrack","Warlock Soul Siphon","Affliction DoTs","level 60 Warlock mechanics"],"text_es":"Arruinar tiene una canalización de 6 s e inflige daño de Sombras a intervalos de un segundo. Durante el canal, Corrupción, Succionar vida y Terror de agonía duplican su frecuencia de pulsos en el objetivo. Succión de alma añade 12% al daño de Arruinar y de los drenajes por cada uno de esos efectos activos, hasta 36%; aplica los tres antes de empezar. Terror de fatalidad y las maldiciones quedan fuera de este cálculo.","text_en":"Wrack channels for 6 seconds, dealing shadow damage at one-second intervals. During the channel, Corruption, Siphon Life, and Bane of Agony pulse twice as often on the target. Soul Siphon adds 12% to Wrack and drain damage for each of those effects present, up to 36%; get all three running first. Bane of Doom and curses are excluded from this calculation.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Affliction Warlock Specific Systems in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Affliction Warlock in WoW: Forever > New Abilities and Talents in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:overview"],"source_hashes":["guide:919fe2a12b2d2cbf596a42099800dba7eecba7b7","section:cef868b49045ced15dae7827f315484f5c42190e"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-sistema-demonologia-pacto","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Pacto demoníaco y sacrificios","title_en":"Demonic Pact and Sacrifice","summary_es":"Pacto demoníaco permite conservar el bonus de sacrificio con otro demonio activo.","summary_en":"Demonic Pact lets you keep a sacrifice bonus with another demon active.","keywords_es":["Pacto demoníaco","sacrificio demoníaco Demonología","bonus de daño brujo","demonio activo brujo"],"keywords_en":["Demonic Pact","Demonology Demonic Sacrifice","Warlock damage bonus","active Warlock demon"],"text_es":"Pacto demoníaco permite sacrificar un demonio y mantener otro activo con sus beneficios. Si sacrificas al diablillo y mantienes a la súcubo/íncubo, aumenta el daño de Sombras; si sacrificas a la súcubo/íncubo y mantienes al diablillo, aumenta el de Fuego: la combinación mejora cerca de 30% el daño de la escuela elegida. Volver a invocar al demonio sacrificado cancela el efecto.","text_en":"This talent lets you sacrifice one demon and keep another fighting with the bonus active. Giving up the Imp while keeping the Sayaad improves shadow damage; giving up the Sayaad and keeping the Imp instead improves fire damage, by about 30% overall. Resummoning the sacrificed demon ends the effect.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Demonology Warlock DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Demonology Warlock Specific Systems in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/demonology/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Demonology Warlock DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Demonology Warlock in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/demonology/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:demonology:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:08a8122db597212c503fb5cfa23838727425af7d","section:d3a5b6ab1fd735b5fb8e1fcd7aec8e6b231de92e"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-sistema-demonologia-exterminio","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Exterminio y Fuego de alma","title_en":"Decimation and Soul Fire","summary_es":"Por debajo de 35% de salud, Exterminio potencia Fuego de alma durante 10 segundos.","summary_en":"Below 35% health, Decimation empowers Soul Fire for 10 seconds.","keywords_es":["Exterminio brujo","Fuego de alma Demonología","fase de ejecución brujo","talento Exterminio"],"keywords_en":["Warlock Decimation","Demonology Soul Fire","Warlock execute phase","Decimation talent"],"text_es":"Con menos de 35% de salud en el objetivo, un impacto de Dolor abrasador activa Exterminio durante 10 s. Mientras dura, Fuego de alma se lanza 40% más rápido, no cuesta un fragmento de alma y tiene 6 s de reutilización. En la build de Fuego, lánzalo al estar disponible y usa Dolor abrasador entre lanzamientos para renovar Exterminio; en Sombras, sigue con Descarga de las Sombras, que iguala o supera su daño por segundo.","text_en":"Hitting an enemy under 35% health with Searing Pain grants 10 seconds of Decimation. While it lasts, Soul Fire casts 40% faster, consumes no Soul Shard, and can be cast every 6 seconds. Fire setups should use Soul Fire whenever available, with Searing Pain in between to renew Decimation; Shadow setups continue with Shadow Bolt, which deals at least as much damage per second.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Demonology Warlock DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › The Execute Phase (Fire Build)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/demonology/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-10-26"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:demonology:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:659b0887e2dd9fc021550b5dd856434c3a7079bf"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-sistema-destruccion-sombras-llamas","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Sombras y llamas en Destrucción","title_en":"Shadow and Flame in Destruction","summary_es":"Con 5/5, Conflagrar y Quemadura de las Sombras se potencian entre sí y conservan sus efectos.","summary_en":"At 5/5, Conflagrate and Shadowburn boost each other and preserve their effects.","keywords_es":["Sombras y llamas","Conflagrar brujo","Quemadura de las Sombras","mecánicas Destrucción"],"keywords_en":["Shadow and Flame","Warlock Conflagrate","Shadowburn","Destruction mechanics"],"text_es":"Al completar Sombras y llamas (5/5), Conflagrar deja Inmolar activo y concede 20% más de daño de Sombras durante 20 s; Quemadura de las Sombras devuelve el fragmento de alma y aumenta 20% el daño de Fuego durante el mismo tiempo. Cada hechizo activa la mejora del tipo de daño contrario, por lo que conviene lanzar ambos en cuanto estén disponibles. Cada punto del talento añade, además, 20% de probabilidad de conservar Inmolar y devolver el fragmento.","text_en":"At 5/5 Shadow and Flame, Conflagrate leaves Immolate active and grants 20% more Shadow damage for 20 seconds; Shadowburn returns its Soul Shard and raises Fire damage by 20% for the same duration. Each spell activates the opposite damage bonus, so cast both as soon as available. Each talent point also adds a 20% chance to preserve Immolate and return the shard.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Destruction Warlock DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Destruction Warlock Specific Systems in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:destruction:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:204cd5a2aa40c9a9e31a1c21d73a3e8f06489cf4"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-sistema-destruccion-terror-caos","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Terror de caos y daño a otro objetivo","title_en":"Bane of Havoc and Secondary-Target Damage","summary_es":"Terror de caos transfiere 15% del daño que haces a otros enemigos al objetivo marcado.","summary_en":"Bane of Havoc transfers 15% of damage dealt to other enemies to its marked target.","keywords_es":["Terror de caos brujo","daño a dos objetivos Destrucción","cleave Destrucción","talento Terror de caos"],"keywords_en":["Warlock Bane of Havoc","Destruction two-target damage","Destruction cleave","Bane of Havoc talent"],"text_es":"Aplica Terror de caos a un objetivo secundario: mientras esté activo, 15% del daño que infliges a otros objetivos también se le inflige a él. Contra dos enemigos, mantén la rotación de un solo objetivo en el principal; el secundario no puede recibir otro terror. Si vivirá al menos un minuto, añade allí tu maldición, Corrupción e Inmolar.","text_en":"Apply Bane of Havoc to a secondary target: while it is active, 15% of damage you deal to other targets is also dealt to it. Against two enemies, keep your single-target rotation on the main one; the secondary target cannot have another Bane. If it will live at least a minute, also apply your Curse, Corruption, and Immolate there.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Destruction Warlock DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › AoE DPS Rotation for Destruction Warlocks in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-03"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:destruction:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:29cd8c54a8c86337d11b7b247201e0032b7acaab"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-build-afliccion-subir-sin-reasignar","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build de subida de Aflicción sin cambios","title_en":"Affliction Leveling Build Without Respec","summary_es":"Distribución completa de talentos de Aflicción sin reasignar puntos al subir.","summary_en":"Complete Affliction talent allocation for leveling without respeccing.","keywords_es":["build Aflicción sin reasignar","talentos de brujo Aflicción","talentos de Aflicción para subir"],"keywords_en":["Affliction no-respec build","Affliction warlock talents","Affliction leveling talents"],"text_es":"Aflicción: Transfusión de  vida mejorada 2/2, Supresión 5/5, Corrupción mejorado 5/5, Drenajes mejorados 3/3, Terror de agonía mejorado 2/2, Concentración vil 3/3, Amplificar maldición 1/1, Pandemia 3/3, Malevolencia 5/5, Ocaso 2/2, Succionar vida 1/1, Succión de alma 3/3, Maestría de las Sombras 5/5, Arruinar 1/1; Demonología: Poder profano 5/5, Energías demoníacas 2/2; Destrucción: Descarga de Sombras mejorada 3/5.","text_en":"Affliction: Improved Life Tap 2/2, Suppression 5/5, Improved Corruption 5/5, Improved Drains 3/3, Improved Bane of Agony 2/2, Fel Concentration 3/3, Amplify Curse 1/1, Pandemic 3/3, Malevolence 5/5, Nightfall 2/2, Siphon Life 1/1, Soul Siphon 3/3, Shadow Mastery 5/5, Wrack 1/1; Demonology: Unholy Power 5/5, Demonic Energies 2/2; Destruction: Improved Shadow Bolt 3/5.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Affliction Warlock DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:ace72ab599c1d2952f57c6a945d66879bf8f831f"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-build-afliccion-subir-respec-40","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build de Aflicción tras reasignar a 40 (subida)","title_en":"Affliction Build After a Level-40 Respec","summary_es":"Build completa de Aflicción que adelanta Arruinar al reasignar talentos a 40.","summary_en":"Complete Affliction build that gets Wrack sooner after a level-40 respec.","keywords_es":["reasignar talentos brujo nivel 40","build Aflicción Arruinar temprano","talentos Aflicción respec"],"keywords_en":["warlock level 40 respec","early Wrack Affliction build","Affliction respec talents"],"text_es":"Aflicción: Transfusión de  vida mejorada 2/2, Supresión 5/5, Corrupción mejorado 5/5, Drenajes mejorados 3/3, Terror de agonía mejorado 2/2, Amplificar maldición 1/1, Pandemia 3/3, Succionar vida 1/1, Succión de alma 3/3, Maestría de las Sombras 5/5, Arruinar 1/1. Reasigna a nivel 40 para obtener Arruinar siete niveles antes; los puntos de Demonología quedan libres para gastar.","text_en":"Affliction: Improved Life Tap 2/2, Suppression 5/5, Improved Corruption 5/5, Improved Drains 3/3, Improved Bane of Agony 2/2, Amplify Curse 1/1, Pandemic 3/3, Siphon Life 1/1, Soul Siphon 3/3, Shadow Mastery 5/5, Wrack 1/1. Respec at level 40 to get Wrack seven levels earlier; the Demonology points are left free to spend.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Affliction Warlock DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:ace72ab599c1d2952f57c6a945d66879bf8f831f"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-build-demonologia-subir","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build de subida de Demonología","title_en":"Demonology Leveling Build","summary_es":"Distribución completa de talentos de Demonología para subir sin reasignar puntos.","summary_en":"Complete Demonology talent allocation for leveling without respeccing.","keywords_es":["build Demonología para subir","talentos brujo Demonología leveo","talentos Marca demoníaca"],"keywords_en":["Demonology leveling build","Demonology warlock leveling talents","Demonic Brand talents"],"text_es":"Aflicción: Transfusión de  vida mejorada 2/2, Supresión 5/5, Corrupción mejorado 5/5, Drenajes mejorados 3/3, Amplificar maldición 1/1, Pandemia 3/3, Malevolencia 1/5; Demonología: Abrazo demoníaco 1/5, Poder profano 5/5, Vitalidad vil 3/3, Energías demoníacas 2/2, Sayaad mejorado 3/3, Sacrificio demoníaco 1/1, Maestro invocador 2/2, Dominio de lo maldito 1/1, Marca demoníaca 3/3, Vínculo de alma 1/1, Conocimiento demoníaco 3/3, Maestro demonogista 5/5, Pacto demoníaco 1/1. Mejora Transfusión de vida.","text_en":"Affliction: Improved Life Tap 2/2, Suppression 5/5, Improved Corruption 5/5, Improved Drains 3/3, Amplify Curse 1/1, Pandemic 3/3, Malevolence 1/5; Demonology: Demonic Embrace 1/5, Unholy Power 5/5, Fel Vitality 3/3, Demonic Energies 2/2, Improved Sayaad 3/3, Demonic Sacrifice 1/1, Master Summoner 2/2, Fel Domination 1/1, Demonic Brand 3/3, Soul Link 1/1, Demonic Knowledge 3/3, Master Demonologist 5/5, Demonic Pact 1/1. This improves Life Tap.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Demonology Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Demonology Warlock DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/demonology/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:demonology:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:78fcf26e7bd6166d52aca9c362d101229fdad4ba"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-build-destruccion-solo-subir","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build de subida en solitario de Destrucción","title_en":"Destruction Solo Leveling Build","summary_es":"Distribución completa de talentos de Destrucción para misiones y combates en solitario.","summary_en":"Complete Destruction talent allocation for solo questing and leveling.","keywords_es":["build solo Destrucción para subir","talentos brujo Destrucción leveo","talentos Quemadura de las Sombras brujo"],"keywords_en":["Destruction solo leveling build","Destruction warlock leveling talents","Warlock Shadowburn talents"],"text_es":"Aflicción: Transfusión de  vida mejorada 2/2, Supresión 5/5, Drenajes mejorados 3/3, Terror de agonía mejorado 2/2, Amplificar maldición 1/1, Pandemia 3/3, Malevolencia 5/5, Succión de alma 2/3; Demonología: Poder profano 5/5; Destrucción: Aterrar 5/5, Piel de arrabio 2/5, Cataclismo 3/3, Secuelas 5/5, Quemadura de las Sombras 1/1, Llamas agonizantes 3/3, Conflagrar 1/1, Fuego y azufre 3/3. Mejora Transfusión de vida.","text_en":"Affliction: Improved Life Tap 2/2, Suppression 5/5, Improved Drains 3/3, Improved Bane of Agony 2/2, Amplify Curse 1/1, Pandemic 3/3, Malevolence 5/5, Soul Siphon 2/3; Demonology: Unholy Power 5/5; Destruction: Bane 5/5, Molten Skin 2/5, Cataclysm 3/3, Aftermath 5/5, Shadowburn 1/1, Agonizing Flames 3/3, Conflagrate 1/1, Fire and Brimstone 3/3. This improves Life Tap.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Destruction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Destruction Warlock DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:destruction:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:a41d84a98887df06285a814d449ad60b10a4cc3e"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-build-destruccion-mazmorra-subir","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build de mazmorra de Destrucción para subir","title_en":"Destruction Dungeon Leveling Build","summary_es":"Distribución completa para subir en mazmorras y llegar a Incinerar a 40.","summary_en":"Complete dungeon-leveling build that reaches Incinerate at 40.","keywords_es":["build de mazmorra Destrucción","talentos Destrucción para mazmorras","Incinerar nivel 40 brujo"],"keywords_en":["Destruction dungeon leveling build","Destruction dungeon talents","Warlock Incinerate level 40"],"text_es":"Aflicción: Transfusión de  vida mejorada 2/2, Supresión 5/5, Corrupción mejorado 5/5, Amplificar maldición 1/1, Pandemia 3/3, Malevolencia 1/5; Demonología: Diablillo mejorado 3/3; Destrucción: Aterrar 5/5, Cataclismo 3/3, Secuelas 5/5, Ruina 3/5, Quemadura de las Sombras 1/1, Llamas agonizantes 3/3, Conflagrar 1/1, Terror de caos 1/1, Fuego y azufre 3/3, Sombras y llamas 5/5, Incinerar 1/1. Mejora Transfusión de vida.","text_en":"Affliction: Improved Life Tap 2/2, Suppression 5/5, Improved Corruption 5/5, Amplify Curse 1/1, Pandemic 3/3, Malevolence 1/5; Demonology: Improved Imp 3/3; Destruction: Bane 5/5, Cataclysm 3/3, Aftermath 5/5, Ruin 3/5, Shadowburn 1/1, Agonizing Flames 3/3, Conflagrate 1/1, Bane of Havoc 1/1, Fire and Brimstone 3/3, Shadow and Flame 5/5, Incinerate 1/1.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Destruction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Destruction Warlock DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:destruction:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:a41d84a98887df06285a814d449ad60b10a4cc3e"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-talentos-demonologia-subir","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Ruta de talentos de Demonología para subir","title_en":"Demonology Leveling Talent Path","summary_es":"Prioriza el demonio y Marca demoníaca; después añade talentos de Aflicción para sostenerte.","summary_en":"Prioritize the demon and Demonic Brand, then add Affliction talents for sustain.","keywords_es":["ruta talentos Demonología leveo","Marca demoníaca talentos subir","Pacto demoníaco nivel 40"],"keywords_en":["Demonology leveling talent path","Demonic Brand leveling talents","Demonic Pact level 40"],"text_es":"Invierte primero en Poder profano 5/5, Energías demoníacas 2/2 y Vitalidad vil 3/3 para reforzar al demonio; avanza hasta Marca demoníaca 3/3 entre los niveles 25 y 27 y llega a Pacto demoníaco 1/1 a 40. Completa después Aflicción: Corrupción mejorado 5/5 vuelve instantánea Corrupción, Transfusión de  vida mejorada 2/2 mejora Transfusión de vida y Drenajes mejorados 3/3 potencia el daño y la curación de Drenar vida.","text_en":"Invest first in Unholy Power 5/5, Demonic Energies 2/2, and Fel Vitality 3/3 to strengthen your demon; work toward Demonic Brand 3/3 at levels 25–27 and Demonic Pact 1/1 at 40. Then finish Affliction: Improved Corruption 5/5 makes Corruption instant, Improved Life Tap 2/2 improves Life Tap, and Improved Drains 3/3 increases Drain Life damage and healing.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Demonology Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Demonology Warlock DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/demonology/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Demonology Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Core Talents","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/demonology/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:demonology:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:78fcf26e7bd6166d52aca9c362d101229fdad4ba","section:a2bc59d4855f5a559f8e2d98ad4860a1b9fa9eee"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-talentos-destruccion-solo-subir","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Ruta de Destrucción para subir en solitario","title_en":"Destruction Solo Leveling Talent Path","summary_es":"Prioriza remates de Destrucción, daño del demonio y después drenajes para sostenerte.","summary_en":"Prioritize Destruction finishers, demon damage, and then drains for sustain.","keywords_es":["ruta talentos Destrucción solo","talentos Conflagrar subir brujo","talentos brujo solo leveo"],"keywords_en":["Destruction solo leveling talent path","Conflagrate leveling talents","warlock solo leveling talents"],"text_es":"Empieza por Aterrar 5/5 y Cataclismo 3/3; sigue con Secuelas 5/5 y Quemadura de las Sombras 1/1 para obtener el remate instantáneo, y Conflagrar 1/1 para consumir Inmolar con un golpe fuerte. Luego toma Poder profano 5/5 para el demonio y talentos de Aflicción como Transfusión de  vida mejorada 2/2, Transfusión de vida, Supresión 5/5 y Drenajes mejorados 3/3, que favorecen el maná y la supervivencia.","text_en":"Start with Bane 5/5 and Cataclysm 3/3; continue with Aftermath 5/5 and Shadowburn 1/1 for an instant finisher, then Conflagrate 1/1 to consume Immolate for a heavy hit. Next take Unholy Power 5/5 for your demon and Affliction talents such as Improved Life Tap 2/2, Life Tap, Suppression 5/5, and Improved Drains 3/3 to support mana and sustain.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Destruction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Destruction Warlock DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Destruction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Core talents","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:destruction:leveling"],"source_hashes":["guide:06caefe3eaeafd39ddc3b82943318222c7b6f978","section:a41d84a98887df06285a814d449ad60b10a4cc3e"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-talentos-destruccion-mazmorra-subir","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Ruta de Destrucción para subir en mazmorras","title_en":"Destruction Dungeon Leveling Talent Path","summary_es":"En mazmorras, concentra los puntos en Destrucción hasta obtener Incinerar a 40.","summary_en":"For dungeon leveling, invest in Destruction until Incinerate at 40.","keywords_es":["ruta Destrucción mazmorras","Incinerar talentos nivel 40","talentos brujo subir en grupo"],"keywords_en":["Destruction dungeon talent path","Incinerate level 40 talents","warlock group leveling talents"],"text_es":"Si subes sobre todo en mazmorras con un tanque, dedica cada punto a Destrucción hasta Incinerar 1/1 a nivel 40. Prioriza Aterrar 5/5, Cataclismo 3/3, Secuelas 5/5, Ruina 3/5, Quemadura de las Sombras 1/1, Llamas agonizantes 3/3, Conflagrar 1/1, Terror de caos 1/1, Fuego y azufre 3/3 y Sombras y llamas 5/5; este último evita que Conflagrar consuma Inmolar al completarlo. Transfusión de  vida mejorada 2/2 mejora Transfusión de vida.","text_en":"If you mostly level in dungeons with a tank, put every point into Destruction until Incinerate 1/1 at level 40. Bane 5/5, Cataclysm 3/3, Aftermath 5/5, Ruin 3/5, Shadowburn 1/1, Agonizing Flames 3/3, Conflagrate 1/1, Bane of Havoc 1/1, Fire and Brimstone 3/3, and Shadow and Flame 5/5 form the core; at full rank, the latter stops Conflagrate from consuming Immolate. Improved Life Tap 2/2 improves Life Tap mana.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Destruction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Destruction Warlock DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:destruction:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:a41d84a98887df06285a814d449ad60b10a4cc3e"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-rotacion-destruccion-mazmorra-subir","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotación de Destrucción en mazmorras al subir","title_en":"Destruction Dungeon Leveling Rotation","summary_es":"Prioridad de daño de Destrucción en mazmorras, desde Descarga de las Sombras hasta Incinerar.","summary_en":"Destruction dungeon priority, from Shadow Bolt filler to Incinerate.","keywords_es":["rotación Destrucción mazmorras leveo","Incinerar rotación brujo","Terror de caos mazmorra"],"keywords_en":["Destruction dungeon leveling rotation","warlock Incinerate rotation","Bane of Havoc dungeon"],"text_es":"Con la build de mazmorra, invoca al diablillo. En jefes y enemigos duraderos, aplica Terror de agonía o Terror de caos a un segundo objetivo del grupo, Maldición de los Elementos desde 40 si otro Brujo no la mantiene, Inmolar y Corrupción; después Conflagrar y Quemadura de las Sombras, y rellena con Descarga de las Sombras hasta 40 o Incinerar desde entonces. Con Aterrar 5/5 y Sombras y llamas 5/5, Conflagrar no consume Inmolar; deja que el tanque genere amenaza antes de estallar.","text_en":"With the dungeon build, summon the Imp. On bosses and durable targets, apply Bane of Agony or Bane of Havoc to a second mob in the pack, Curse of the Elements from 40 if another Warlock is not maintaining it, Immolate, and Corruption; then use Conflagrate and Shadowburn, filling with Shadow Bolt until 40 or Incinerate afterward. Bane 5/5 plus Shadow and Flame 5/5 means Conflagrate does not consume Immolate; let the tank build threat before bursting.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Destruction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Dungeon Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Destruction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Core talents","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:destruction:leveling"],"source_hashes":["guide:06caefe3eaeafd39ddc3b82943318222c7b6f978"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-ventajas-limites-subida","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Ventajas y límites al subir","title_en":"Leveling Strengths and Tradeoffs","summary_es":"Compara el aguante, la dependencia del equipo y el daño de las tres ramas durante la subida.","summary_en":"Compare each spec's sustain, gear dependence, and damage while leveling.","keywords_es":["ventajas Aflicción leveo","desventajas Demonología brujo","Destrucción pros y contras leveo","comparar ramas brujo subir"],"keywords_en":["Affliction leveling pros and cons","Demonology warlock leveling weaknesses","Destruction leveling strengths and weaknesses","compare warlock leveling specs"],"text_es":"Aflicción descansa poco, resiste bien gracias al demonio y puede atender a varios enemigos, pero exige manejar Miedo y efectos periódicos y su daño depende del equipo. Demonología reduce la dependencia del equipo y genera mucha amenaza con el demonio desde Marca demoníaca, aunque tarda en arrancar y perder la mascota cuesta daño y tiempo. Destrucción remata al instante y destaca en mazmorras por su estallido, pero es la más lenta en solitario y Conflagrar consume Inmolar en la build individual.","text_en":"Affliction has little downtime, stays safe behind its demon, and can handle several enemies, but managing Fear and damage-over-time effects takes practice and its damage depends on gear. Demonology is less gear-dependent and its demon builds strong threat with Demonic Brand, but it starts slowly and losing the pet costs damage and time. Destruction has an instant finisher and strong dungeon burst, but levels slowest solo, and Conflagrate consumes Immolate in the solo build.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Pros","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Cons","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Demonology Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Pros","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/demonology/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Demonology Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Cons","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/demonology/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Destruction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Pros","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Destruction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Cons","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:leveling","class:warlock:demonology:leveling","class:warlock:destruction:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:1fd813698db91b3c574e8c0e2a23e65200da4f29","section:22e54acd4ccf47f910aa893925c606ac8b761d17","section:32d9f19f2afd10bd65c043644e6f85554b73b3fa","section:95090a3611a5ecfd15a311af75356522f3b882e1","section:ad387259f2abc78e6f718ae78d72c3859bb46f74","section:eb898b3d29358f0af7e4320583d8af78d3fcffc3"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-mejoras-campamento-subir","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Mejoras del campamento para subir","title_en":"Leveling Camp Buffs","summary_es":"Prioriza la tienda para experiencia de descanso y usa otras mejoras según tus necesidades.","summary_en":"Prioritize the tent for rested experience and choose other buffs for your needs.","keywords_es":["mejoras campamento leveo","tienda campamento experiencia descanso","pozo de maná Brujo","mejoras intelecto brujo"],"keywords_en":["leveling camp buffs","camp tent rested experience","warlock mana well","warlock intellect camp buff"],"text_es":"La Tienda de campamento aporta la mejora más importante para subir: más experiencia de descanso. Como apoyos opcionales, el Pozo de maná restaura maná cada 5 s, la Vela de incienso aumenta el Intelecto y el Equipo de primeros auxilios da Aguante para gastar más salud con Transfusión de vida; la Silla de campamento aporta Golpe crítico con hechizos, útil para los efectos periódicos.","text_en":"Camp Tent is the most important leveling camp feature because it increases rested experience. Optional support includes Mana Well, which restores mana every 5 seconds; Incense Candle, which adds Intellect; and First Aid Kit, which grants Stamina so you can spend more health on Life Tap. Camp Chair adds spell crit, which benefits damage-over-time effects.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Camping Buffs for Affliction Warlock DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:0ff0ca66bcb4231400cfcb8f42f50a6558078a1d"]}]},"04-clase-warrior.json":{"description":"Capítulo 4: Clases. Guerrero. Secciones editoriales redactadas desde guías de terceros.","sections":[{"id":"clase-warrior-que-hace","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Qué hace un Guerrero","title_en":"What a Warrior Does","summary_es":"El Guerrero combate cuerpo a cuerpo, gasta furia y puede hacer daño o tanquear.","summary_en":"Warrior fights in melee, spends Rage, and can deal damage or tank.","keywords_es":["qué hace un guerrero","guerrero daño o tanque","cómo funciona el guerrero","guerrero cuerpo a cuerpo","grito de guerra"],"keywords_en":["what does a warrior do","warrior damage or tank","how does warrior work","warrior melee class","battle shout"],"text_es":"El Guerrero combate cuerpo a cuerpo y usa furia para ejecutar sus facultades. Puede especializarse en hacer daño o tanquear; Grito de guerra y Hender armadura ayudan al daño físico del grupo. Sus tres especializaciones cubren el arma a dos manos, la doble empuñadura y el tanque con escudo.","text_en":"Warrior fights in melee and spends Rage on its abilities. It can specialize in dealing damage or tanking; Battle Shout and Sunder Armor support the group's physical damage. Its three specializations cover two-handed weapons, dual wielding, and shield tanking.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Warrior Class Guide › Comprehensive Guide to Warrior in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/warrior-class-overview","date":"2026-10-29"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:general:warrior-class-overview"],"source_hashes":["section:e6f2064724d7c518d632e82dea9d11d4281d5b56"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-especializaciones","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Especializaciones del Guerrero","title_en":"Warrior Specializations","summary_es":"Armas lucha con dos manos; Furia empuña dos armas; Protección tanquea con escudo.","summary_en":"Arms fights two-handed; Fury dual-wields; Protection tanks with a shield.","keywords_es":["especializaciones del guerrero","guerrero armas furia protección","guerrero con escudo","guerrero dos armas","qué especialización elegir"],"keywords_en":["warrior specializations","warrior arms fury protection","warrior with shield","warrior dual wield","which warrior spec"],"text_es":"Armas pelea con un arma a dos manos y combina golpes potentes con hemorragias y activaciones de Abrumar; Golpes de barrido favorece los combates contra dos enemigos. Furia empuña dos armas y destaca contra pocos objetivos con Mellar y Huracán, aunque sufre en combates prolongados contra uno. Protección usa espada y escudo para tanquear y aplicar potentes perjuicios.","text_en":"Arms fights with a two-handed weapon, combining heavy attacks with bleeds and Overpower procs; Sweeping Strikes helps against two enemies. Fury dual-wields and excels against a few targets with Cleave and Whirlwind, but struggles in prolonged single-target fights. Protection uses sword and shield to tank and apply powerful debuffs.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Warrior Class Guide › Comprehensive Guide to Warrior in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/warrior-class-overview","date":"2026-10-29"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Arms Warrior in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Strengths and Weaknesses of Arms Warrior in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fury Warrior DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Strengths and Weaknesses of Fury Warriors in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/fury/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Tank Guide - WoW: Forever › Viability of Protection Warrior Tank in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/overview-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:arms:overview","class:warrior:fury:overview","class:warrior:general:warrior-class-overview","class:warrior:protection:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:45f42514601b5b2f27a9cbe823095945f92d0a75","section:4c249d48afa3e1ebfaf913f80a148d06d0ca8685","section:7c4a5a6fdfe1f929e9ba564eff3004e1bf543f92","section:b601b7a7c59b51284dbe2bc25a9030cbf6800a01","section:e6f2064724d7c518d632e82dea9d11d4281d5b56"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-cambios-forever","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Furia y autoataques en Forever","title_en":"Rage and Auto-attacks in Forever","summary_es":"Los críticos dan furia adicional y los fallos no generan furia.","summary_en":"Critical hits generate extra Rage, while misses generate none.","keywords_es":["furia del guerrero","furia por autoataques","crítico y furia","fallo de ataque","furia al recibir daño"],"keywords_en":["warrior rage","auto-attack rage","critical hit rage","missed attack","rage from damage taken"],"text_es":"En Forever, la furia de los autoataques está normalizada: hacer más daño con un golpe no aumenta por sí solo la furia que genera. Los autoataques críticos generan el doble y los fallidos no generan nada. Mantén entrenada la habilidad del arma para reducir fallos; la furia por daño recibido no disminuye por llevar equipo que lo mitigue o absorba.","text_en":"Auto-attack Rage is normalized: dealing more damage with a swing does not by itself increase the Rage it generates. Critical auto-attacks generate double Rage, while misses generate none. Keep your weapon skill trained to reduce misses; Rage from incoming damage is not reduced by gear that mitigates or absorbs it.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Arms Warrior Leveling Guide › Arms Warrior Leveling Rotation","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/arms-warrior-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Arms Warrior Leveling Guide › Leveling Tips","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/arms-warrior-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Protection Warrior Leveling Guide › Protection Warrior Leveling Rotation","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/protection-warrior-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:arms:leveling","class:warrior:protection:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:013a89de454282218e0589804a7d6057e60b2459","section:0775d05837dca6535518349d4ee13f453a6c86b8","section:e995767953b72c764ea6dd9e79cc923aacb64134"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-armas-armadura","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Armas y equipo al subir","title_en":"Weapons and Gear While Leveling","summary_es":"Armas usa un arma a dos manos; Furia necesita dos y Protección aprovecha el escudo.","summary_en":"Arms uses a two-hander, Fury needs two weapons, and Protection benefits from a shield.","keywords_es":["armas del guerrero","arma a dos manos","doble empuñadura guerrero","escudo para protección","mejorar arma al subir"],"keywords_en":["warrior weapons","two-handed weapon","warrior dual wield","protection shield","weapon upgrades while leveling"],"text_es":"Armas se centra en un arma a dos manos; Maestro de armas permite aprovechar hachas, espadas, mazas, armas de asta y bastones. Depende mucho del daño del arma, así que busca mejoras con frecuencia. Furia desbloquea la doble empuñadura a nivel 20 y depende de actualizar ambas armas. Protección pelea con escudo y usa facultades defensivas; el entrenamiento con placas llega a nivel 40.","text_en":"Arms focuses on a two-handed weapon; Weaponmaster can benefit from axes, swords, maces, polearms, and staves. It relies heavily on weapon damage, so look for upgrades often. Fury unlocks dual wield at level 20 and depends on keeping both weapons current. Protection fights with a shield and uses defensive abilities; Plate Armor training becomes available at level 40.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior Leveling Guide  - WoW: Forever › Leveling Viability for Arms Warrior DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Fury Warrior Leveling Guide › Leveling Milestones > Important Unlocks","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/fury-warrior-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Rotation for Protection Warrior in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Arms Warrior Leveling Guide › Leveling Milestones > Important Unlocks","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/arms-warrior-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Arms Warrior Leveling Guide › Leveling Talent Build","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/arms-warrior-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["class:warrior:arms:leveling","class:warrior:fury:leveling","class:warrior:protection:leveling"],"source_hashes":["guide:7e76df9ec6765aca0de4cb9efcdd8cbfa15cc14f","guide:baf6ab9f1243adfa8aac49ced45104e22290f803","section:914fe68c6a13605373012e0c0071db0725195aab","section:b85595a9798bbd357d92bde3973597e58262b7c4","section:cd2bb478ad28c47ef109a76e587c4be7f3eb8ce3"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-subir-espec","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Especialización para subir","title_en":"Specialization for Leveling","summary_es":"Protección destaca por su aguante; Armas depende del equipo y Furia requiere dos armas.","summary_en":"Protection stands out for durability; Arms relies on gear and Fury needs two weapons.","keywords_es":["mejor especialización para subir guerrero","protección para subir","armas para subir","furia para subir","elegir especialización guerrero"],"keywords_en":["best warrior leveling spec","protection leveling","arms leveling","fury leveling","choose warrior specialization"],"text_es":"Protección es la opción más llevadera para muchos: escudo y Revancha ayudan contra varios enemigos; sus talentos también generan furia al bloquear, esquivar o parar. La ruta profunda de Protección ofrece un estilo relajado. Armas es buena alternativa si prefieres un arma a dos manos y destaca en grupo, aunque depende del equipo y sufre contra varios enemigos. Furia da buen daño a dos objetivos, aunque necesita dos armas y los fallos pueden dejarla sin furia.","text_en":"Protection is the more manageable choice for many: its shield and Revenge help against several enemies, and its talents also generate Rage when blocking, dodging, or parrying. Deep Protection offers a more relaxed style. Arms is a good alternative if you prefer a two-handed weapon and excels in groups, though it relies on gear and struggles against several enemies. Fury deals good two-target damage but needs two weapons, and misses can leave it short on Rage.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior Leveling Guide  - WoW: Forever › Leveling Viability for Arms Warrior DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fury Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Viability for Fury Warrior DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/fury/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-07"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fury Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Pros","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/fury/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-07"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fury Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Cons","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/fury/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-07"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling as a Protection Warrior Tank in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Pros","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Cons","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Protection Warrior Tank in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Protection Warrior Leveling Guide › Leveling Talent Build","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/protection-warrior-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Arms Warrior Leveling Guide › Arms Warrior Leveling Guide","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/arms-warrior-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:arms:leveling","class:warrior:fury:leveling","class:warrior:protection:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:15c6fc0284f09ccbd836683986e81dee9e9c5977","section:19250d3558329b68117fd796f4a08b24e8c224e8","section:341d8ea89c1c009dd102d64ca06b19952aac0795","section:84fe82acf132633997a33a0a47596e096cd9a780","section:8b8bef9304c8d146945b3cd66c7ed0f61e9eb46e","section:a131ffc0286822744e43f8d04950e1295481c5a3","section:af995e062014605042edf9e56de75be041d3d1fe","section:b85595a9798bbd357d92bde3973597e58262b7c4","section:ee48a1345e67bf2a6c80b1d1c0cb273a6e721914","section:f36370189c35ee9903e9c97168482bbcc22d5a3d"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-talentos-subida","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Prioridad de talentos al subir","title_en":"Leveling Talent Priorities","summary_es":"Protección prioriza Especialización en escudos, Revancha mejorada y Maestro de defensa.","summary_en":"Protection prioritizes Shield Specialization, Improved Revenge, and Master of Defense.","keywords_es":["talentos para subir guerrero","ruta de talentos protección","especialización en escudos","revancha mejorada","maestro de defensa"],"keywords_en":["warrior leveling talents","protection talent path","shield specialization","improved revenge","master of defense"],"text_es":"Protección: 10-14 Especialización en escudos 5/5; 15-17 Revancha mejorada 3/3; 20-21 Maestro de defensa 2/2; 23 Última posición 1/1; 24, 29 y 34 Desafío 3/3 para mazmorras; 25 Vanguardia 1/1 permite Embestir sin cambiar de actitud; 30-32 Ira enfocada 3/3; 33 Golpe de concusión 1/1. Sin mazmorras, cambia Desafío por Sanguinario mejorado 2/2 y Muro de escudo mejorado 2/2.","text_en":"Protection: 10-14 Shield Specialization 5/5; 15-17 Improved Revenge 3/3; 20-21 Master of Defense 2/2; 23 Last Stand 1/1; 24, 29, and 34 Defiance 3/3 for dungeons; 25 Vanguard 1/1 lets you Charge without changing stances; 30-32 Focused Rage 3/3; 33 Concussion Blow 1/1. If you skip dungeons, swap Defiance for Improved Bloodrage 2/2 and Improved Shield Wall 2/2.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Protection Warrior Tank in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Rotation for Protection Warrior in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Protection Warrior Leveling Guide › Leveling Talent Build","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/protection-warrior-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:protection:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:af995e062014605042edf9e56de75be041d3d1fe","section:cd2bb478ad28c47ef109a76e587c4be7f3eb8ce3","section:f36370189c35ee9903e9c97168482bbcc22d5a3d"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-hitos","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Hitos de habilidades al subir","title_en":"Leveling Ability Milestones","summary_es":"A nivel 20 llegan Embate y Ataque de la victoria; a 30, Actitud rabiosa; a 40, ataques clave.","summary_en":"Slam and Victory Rush arrive at 20; Berserker Stance at 30; key attacks at 40.","keywords_es":["hitos del guerrero","habilidades por nivel guerrero","nivel de Revancha","nivel de Huracán","nivel de Golpe mortal"],"keywords_en":["warrior milestones","warrior abilities by level","Revenge level","Whirlwind level","Mortal Strike level"],"text_es":"A nivel 10, la misión de clase da Actitud defensiva, Irritar y Hender armadura; a 12, Abrumar y Azote de escudo; a 14, Revancha y Maestría táctica; a 16, Bloquear con escudo. A 20 llegan Embate, Ataque de la victoria y Represalias; Furia desbloquea la doble empuñadura. A 30, la misión da Actitud rabiosa y se obtienen Interceptar e Ira rabiosa; Armas puede tener Golpes de barrido con su build. Huracán llega a 36, Zurrar a 38 y, a 40, Armas aprende Golpe mortal, Furia Sed de sangre y Protección Embate con escudo; también se entrenan placas.","text_en":"At level 10, the class quest grants Defensive Stance, Taunt, and Sunder Armor; at 12, Overpower and Shield Bash; at 14, Revenge and Tactical Mastery; at 16, Shield Block. Slam, Victory Rush, and Retaliation arrive at 20; Fury unlocks dual wield. At 30, the class quest grants Berserker Stance, alongside Intercept and Berserker Rage; the Arms build can have Sweeping Strikes. Whirlwind comes at 36, Pummel at 38, and at 40 Arms learns Mortal Strike, Fury learns Bloodthirst, and Protection learns Shield Slam; Plate Armor training is also available.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior Leveling Guide  - WoW: Forever › Mandatory Abilities to Train for Arms Warrior","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Abilities to Train for Protection Warrior in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Arms Warrior Leveling Guide › Leveling Milestones > Important Unlocks","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/arms-warrior-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Fury Warrior Leveling Guide › Leveling Milestones > Important Unlocks","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/fury-warrior-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Protection Warrior Leveling Guide › Leveling Milestones > Important Unlocks","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/protection-warrior-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Mandatory Abilities to Train for Protection Warrior","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["class:warrior:arms:leveling","class:warrior:fury:leveling","class:warrior:protection:leveling"],"source_hashes":["guide:5ce00d93595f1847fe9bc8701d47bbb805d3e581","guide:7e76df9ec6765aca0de4cb9efcdd8cbfa15cc14f","guide:baf6ab9f1243adfa8aac49ced45104e22290f803","section:2c64089c5c27f6503e330b5d26e9956ec7aa80cb","section:48ce2da4d26adbe9f5e2474761e99d0cff01d95c","section:91e6054df3a6e6bb797bc953f8dc6aea6292b7ee"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-mision-clase","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"La misión de clase de nivel 10","title_en":"The Level 10 Class Quest","summary_es":"A nivel 10, la misión de clase desbloquea Actitud defensiva, Irritar y Hender armadura.","summary_en":"At level 10, the class quest unlocks Defensive Stance, Taunt, and Sunder Armor.","keywords_es":["misión de clase guerrero","misión de nivel 10 guerrero","actitud defensiva","desbloquear irritar","hender armadura"],"keywords_en":["warrior class quest","level 10 warrior quest","defensive stance","unlock taunt","sunder armor"],"text_es":"Las misiones de Guerrero de nivel 10 varían según la raza. Entre ellas están Bartleby, el borracho, Vence a Bartleby y La jarra de Bartleby; también Camino de defensa. En la mayoría se obtienen Actitud defensiva, Irritar y Hender armadura, herramientas para empezar a tanquear; la recompensa del Cielonato es distinta. Completa la misión antes de ir a una mazmorra para tener tu postura defensiva.","text_en":"Level 10 Warrior quests vary by race. They include Bartleby the Drunk, Beat Bartleby, and Bartleby's Mug; Path of Defense is another. Most grant Defensive Stance, Taunt, and Sunder Armor, tools for beginning to tank; the Skyborne reward differs. Complete the quest before entering a dungeon so you have your defensive stance.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Warrior Class Quests Guide › Warrior Class Quest Guide for World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/warrior-class-quests","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Warrior Class Quests Guide › Human Warrior Class Quests","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/warrior-class-quests","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Warrior Class Quests Guide › Dwarf and Gnome Warrior Class Quests","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/warrior-class-quests","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Warrior Class Quests Guide › Night Elf Warrior Class Quests","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/warrior-class-quests","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Warrior Class Quests Guide › Orc, Troll and Tauren Warrior Class Quests","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/warrior-class-quests","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Warrior Class Quests Guide › Undead Warrior Class Quests","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/warrior-class-quests","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Warrior Class Quests Guide › Skyborne Warrior Class Quests","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/warrior-class-quests","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:general:warrior-class-quests"],"source_hashes":["section:30482ad54cb34be7a694c19ce95893be9cc967c8","section:51857bde8e99e4f74153998c0818f9ab397b6abe","section:a520c5c6a0e6bd11cb495b4bf5bbfab4daf3d014","section:ceee286bb7d13fb1731f6eedd34f658f5a43f123","section:cf04eca6554699ceaa657e09d3299029db8c0460","section:d9dc740b72050adf1c947476c3d8cba4145261f8","section:ebf1a34cd2e26c2f6773904572dae61c652a571a"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-misiones-nivel-20","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Misiones de armadura de nivel 20","title_en":"Level 20 Armor Quests","summary_es":"Las cadenas de nivel 20 dan escudo y piezas de armadura; la malla completa pide una mazmorra.","summary_en":"The level 20 chains give a shield and armor pieces; the full chestpiece needs a dungeon.","keywords_es":["misiones de armadura guerrero","misión de nivel 20 guerrero","armadura de mallas endurecida con fuego","armadura brutal","escudo de misión"],"keywords_en":["warrior armor quests","level 20 warrior quest","fire hardened mail","brutal armor","quest shield"],"text_es":"A nivel 20, las cadenas de la Alianza y la Horda entregan un escudo al principio: Favor de Furen y Bastión de Ruga, respectivamente. Las misiones Armadura de mallas endurecida con fuego y Armadura brutal requieren materiales y una mazmorra; puedes reunirlos mientras subes y terminar la cadena con un grupo más adelante. También hay encargos opcionales para piezas de cabeza, manos y piernas.","text_en":"At level 20, the Alliance and Horde chains give a shield near the start: Furen's Favor and Ruga's Bulwark, respectively. The quests Fire Hardened Mail and Brutal Armor require materials and a dungeon; you can gather them while leveling and finish the chain with a group later. Optional follow-ups also offer head, hand, and leg pieces.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Warrior Class Quests Guide › Shared Warrior Class Quests","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/warrior-class-quests","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:general:warrior-class-quests"],"source_hashes":["section:1080ed6271ea0c6efdc91a2d171c39fe0ce28cd1"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-misiones-nivel-30","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Misiones de nivel 30: actitud y arma","title_en":"Level 30 Quests: Stance and Weapon","summary_es":"La misión de arena da Actitud rabiosa; la cadena opcional ofrece un arma de dos manos.","summary_en":"The arena quest grants Berserker Stance; the optional chain offers a two-handed weapon.","keywords_es":["misión de nivel 30 guerrero","actitud rabiosa","misión de arena guerrero","cadena de arma de dos manos","misiones de clase nivel 30"],"keywords_en":["level 30 warrior quest","berserker stance","the affray","whirlwind weapon","warrior class quests"],"text_es":"A nivel 30, La Reyerta desbloquea Actitud rabiosa. Después, El Cazavientos abre la cadena opcional del arma torbellino, que termina con un élite de nivel 40 y permite elegir Hacha espirálica, Espada espirálica o Martillo de guerra espirálico. Puedes pedir ayuda para el combate final o esperar a tener más nivel.","text_en":"At level 30, The Affray unlocks Berserker Stance. The Windwatcher then opens the optional Whirlwind weapon questline, which ends with a level 40 elite and lets you choose Whirlwind Axe, Whirlwind Sword, or Whirlwind Warhammer. Bring help for the final fight or wait until you are a higher level.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Warrior Class Quests Guide › Shared Warrior Class Quests","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/warrior-class-quests","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:general:warrior-class-quests"],"source_hashes":["section:1080ed6271ea0c6efdc91a2d171c39fe0ce28cd1"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-gestion-furia","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Generar y reservar furia","title_en":"Generate and Pool Rage","summary_es":"Reserva furia para el siguiente combate; Golpe heroico y Mellar sacrifican la furia del autoataque.","summary_en":"Save Rage for the next fight; Heroic Strike and Cleave forfeit auto-attack Rage.","keywords_es":["cómo generar furia","reservar furia guerrero","furia entre combates","golpe heroico furia","mellar furia"],"keywords_en":["generate Rage","pool warrior Rage","Rage between fights","Heroic Strike Rage","Cleave Rage"],"text_es":"La furia va de 0 a 100: autoataques, daño recibido, Embestir y Sanguinario la generan. No se rellena esperando y empieza a decaer al terminar el combate. Reserva parte para abrir el siguiente o pagar una facultad importante. Golpe heroico y Mellar reemplazan el siguiente autoataque, que así no genera su furia habitual; úsalos cuando sobre recurso. Control de furia ralentiza el decaimiento, e Ira persistente lo retrasa si la build la incluye.","text_en":"Rage ranges from 0 to 100: auto-attacks, incoming damage, Charge, and Bloodrage generate it. It does not refill while waiting and starts to decay after combat. Save some for the next pull or an important ability. Heroic Strike and Cleave replace the next auto-attack, so that swing generates no normal Rage; use them when you have extra. Anger Management slows decay, and Lingering Rage delays it if your build includes the talent.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Arms Warrior Leveling Guide › Arms Warrior Leveling Rotation","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/arms-warrior-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Arms Warrior Leveling Guide › Arms Warrior Leveling Rotation > Single-Target Rotation","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/arms-warrior-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior Leveling Guide  - WoW: Forever › Leveling Rotation for Arms Warrior DPS in Burning Crusade","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fury Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Rotation for Fury Warrior DPS in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/fury/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Protection Warrior Leveling Guide › Protection Warrior Leveling Rotation","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/protection-warrior-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["class:warrior:arms:leveling","class:warrior:fury:leveling","class:warrior:protection:leveling"],"source_hashes":["guide:7e76df9ec6765aca0de4cb9efcdd8cbfa15cc14f","section:013a89de454282218e0589804a7d6057e60b2459","section:11f3d5bcbe6b40ef73886ccc0c7b8535f00a20d2","section:71c80ce73e7da9c3913b8f0970220892c41b1479","section:e995767953b72c764ea6dd9e79cc923aacb64134"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-actitudes","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Actitudes del Guerrero","title_en":"Warrior Stances","summary_es":"Batalla sirve a Armas; Rabiosa habilita facultades ofensivas y Defensiva ayuda a sobrevivir.","summary_en":"Battle supports Arms; Berserker enables offensive abilities, while Defensive helps you survive.","keywords_es":["actitudes del guerrero","actitud de batalla","actitud rabiosa","actitud defensiva","cambiar de actitud"],"keywords_en":["warrior stances","Battle Stance","Berserker Stance","Defensive Stance","stance swapping"],"text_es":"Armas pelea sobre todo en Actitud de batalla, necesaria para Embestir, Desgarrar, Abrumar, Golpes de barrido, Lanzazo, Golpe mortal y Embate. Actitud rabiosa suma un 3% de golpe crítico, pero aumenta un 10% el daño recibido; permite Interceptar, Ira rabiosa, Huracán y Zurrar. Actitud defensiva reduce un 10% el daño infligido y recibido, aumenta la amenaza y habilita Irritar y Desactivar. Cambiar de actitud descarta la furia por encima del límite de Maestría táctica.","text_en":"Arms mostly fights in Battle Stance, required for Charge, Rend, Overpower, Sweeping Strikes, Spearing Strike, Mortal Strike, and Slam. Berserker Stance adds 3% Critical Strike Chance but increases damage taken by 10%; it enables Intercept, Berserker Rage, Whirlwind, and Pummel. Defensive Stance reduces damage dealt and taken by 10%, increases threat, and enables Taunt and Disarm. Changing stances discards Rage above the Tactical Mastery limit.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Arms Warrior Leveling Guide › Arms Warrior Leveling Rotation","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/arms-warrior-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Arms Warrior Leveling Guide › Arms Warrior Leveling Rotation > FAQ How Do Warrior Stances Work?","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/arms-warrior-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Protection Warrior Leveling Guide › Protection Warrior Leveling Rotation","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/protection-warrior-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:arms:leveling","class:warrior:protection:leveling"],"source_hashes":["guide:7e76df9ec6765aca0de4cb9efcdd8cbfa15cc14f","section:013a89de454282218e0589804a7d6057e60b2459","section:e995767953b72c764ea6dd9e79cc923aacb64134"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-rotacion","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Prioridades de combate al subir","title_en":"Leveling Combat Priorities","summary_es":"Prioriza ataques según la especialización y guarda furia para las facultades principales.","summary_en":"Prioritize attacks by specialization and save Rage for core abilities.","keywords_es":["rotación de guerrero para subir","prioridad de habilidades","rotación Armas","rotación Furia","rotación Protección"],"keywords_en":["warrior leveling rotation","ability priority","Arms rotation","Fury rotation","Protection rotation"],"text_es":"Armas (Embate mejorado 2/2, Golpe mortal 1/1): Embestir, Grito de guerra; Ataque de la victoria si falta salud; Grito desmoralizador pronto; Desgarrar si el enemigo vivirá, Abrumar al activarse y luego Golpe mortal (desde 40) y Embate (desde 20); prioriza Lanzazo contra gigantes y dragonantes. Furia (Sed de sangre 1/1): Golpes temerarios si superas el 30% de salud, Sed de sangre, Ataque de la victoria y Abrumar; Huracán en grupos. Protección (Embate con escudo 1/1): Bloquear con escudo, Revancha y Embate con escudo; mantén Trueno y gritos en grupo.","text_en":"Arms (Improved Slam 2/2, Mortal Strike 1/1): Charge, Battle Shout; Victory Rush if health is missing; Demoralizing Shout early; Rend if the enemy will live, Overpower when it activates, then Mortal Strike (from 40) and Slam (from 20); prioritize Spearing Strike against Giants and Dragonkin. Fury (Bloodthirst 1/1): use Reckless Swings above 30% health, then Bloodthirst, Victory Rush, and Overpower; Whirlwind on packs. Protection (Shield Slam 1/1): Shield Block, Revenge, and Shield Slam; maintain Thunder Clap and Shouts in groups.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior Leveling Guide  - WoW: Forever › Leveling Rotation for Arms Warrior DPS in Burning Crusade","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fury Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Rotation for Fury Warrior DPS in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/fury/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Rotation for Protection Warrior in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Arms Warrior Leveling Guide › Arms Warrior Leveling Rotation > Single-Target Rotation","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/arms-warrior-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Single Target Priority","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › AoE Rotation","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior Leveling Guide  - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Arms Warrior DPS in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fury Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Fury Warrior DPS in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/fury/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Protection Warrior Tank in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["class:warrior:arms:leveling","class:warrior:fury:leveling","class:warrior:protection:leveling"],"source_hashes":["guide:7e76df9ec6765aca0de4cb9efcdd8cbfa15cc14f","guide:969650dd594ecf165b52b59987abf4407320f7da","section:11f3d5bcbe6b40ef73886ccc0c7b8535f00a20d2","section:173e0f59a81fa77a5e06fcf57a33d6f5baab9c23","section:60912d4380d6d5944b83c7f828b03ad767e7af08","section:71c80ce73e7da9c3913b8f0970220892c41b1479","section:af995e062014605042edf9e56de75be041d3d1fe","section:cd2bb478ad28c47ef109a76e587c4be7f3eb8ce3","section:dd7ba003c5e6818f2bde2adf5fc132f4f296978c"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-area","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Daño contra varios enemigos","title_en":"Damage Against Multiple Enemies","summary_es":"Armas aprovecha Golpes de barrido; Furia usa Huracán y Protección empieza con Trueno.","summary_en":"Arms uses Sweeping Strikes; Fury uses Whirlwind and Protection opens with Thunder Clap.","keywords_es":["guerrero daño en área","varios enemigos guerrero","golpes de barrido","Mellar y Huracán","Trueno protección"],"keywords_en":["warrior area damage","multiple enemies warrior","Sweeping Strikes","Cleave and Whirlwind","Protection Thunder Clap"],"text_es":"Armas puede guardar furia y combinar Golpes de barrido 1/1 para alcanzar a un segundo enemigo con Golpe mortal y Mellar; el daño a varios enemigos cuesta mucha furia. Furia usa Golpes temerarios si supera el 30% de salud, Huracán y añade Mellar cuando puede pagarlo. Protección usa Trueno para ralentizar los ataques, activa Bloquear con escudo y luego usa Revancha; Embate con escudo 1/1 también es prioritario si se ha aprendido, y Represalias ayuda contra varios atacantes.","text_en":"Arms can pool Rage and use Sweeping Strikes 1/1 to hit a second enemy with Mortal Strike and Cleave; its multi-target damage costs a lot of Rage. Fury uses Reckless Swings above 30% health, Whirlwind, and adds Cleave when affordable. Protection uses Thunder Clap to slow enemy attacks, then Shield Block and Revenge; Shield Slam 1/1 is also a priority if learned, and Retaliation helps against several attackers.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior Leveling Guide  - WoW: Forever › Leveling Rotation for Arms Warrior DPS in Burning Crusade","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fury Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Rotation for Fury Warrior DPS in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/fury/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Rotation for Protection Warrior in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Tips for Protection Warrior Tank in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › AoE Rotation","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Protection Warrior Leveling Guide › Protection Warrior Leveling Rotation > AoE Rotation","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/protection-warrior-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior Leveling Guide  - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Arms Warrior DPS in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Protection Warrior Tank in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["class:warrior:arms:leveling","class:warrior:fury:leveling","class:warrior:protection:leveling"],"source_hashes":["guide:5ce00d93595f1847fe9bc8701d47bbb805d3e581","guide:969650dd594ecf165b52b59987abf4407320f7da","section:11f3d5bcbe6b40ef73886ccc0c7b8535f00a20d2","section:65cdbc0282a9e192365c4bb6f95957447ac8e5af","section:71c80ce73e7da9c3913b8f0970220892c41b1479","section:af995e062014605042edf9e56de75be041d3d1fe","section:cd2bb478ad28c47ef109a76e587c4be7f3eb8ce3","section:dd7ba003c5e6818f2bde2adf5fc132f4f296978c"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-control","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Interrumpir y controlar enemigos","title_en":"Interrupt and Control Enemies","summary_es":"Azote de escudo interrumpe desde 12; Zurrar llega a 38 y requiere Actitud rabiosa.","summary_en":"Shield Bash interrupts from 12; Pummel arrives at 38 and requires Berserker Stance.","keywords_es":["interrumpir con guerrero","Azote de escudo","Zurrar nivel 38","Seccionar","Grito intimidador"],"keywords_en":["Warrior interrupt","Shield Bash","Pummel level 38","Hamstring","Intimidating Shout"],"text_es":"Azote de escudo, disponible a nivel 12, necesita escudo y sirve en Actitud de batalla o Actitud defensiva; conserva furia para interrumpir antes de gastarla. Zurrar, disponible a 38, cuesta 10 de furia y exige Actitud rabiosa. Seccionar ralentiza a quien huye, Desactivar reduce el daño de algunos enemigos armados y Grito intimidador puede abrir una oportunidad para escapar; el daño puede romper su efecto sobre el objetivo principal.","text_en":"Shield Bash, available at level 12, requires a shield and works in Battle or Defensive Stance; save Rage for an interrupt before spending it. Pummel, available at 38, costs 10 Rage and requires Berserker Stance. Hamstring slows a fleeing enemy, Disarm reduces the damage of some armed enemies, and Intimidating Shout can create a chance to escape; damage can break its effect on the main target.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior Leveling Guide  - WoW: Forever › Mandatory Abilities to Train for Arms Warrior","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior Leveling Guide  - WoW: Forever › Optional Abilities to Train for Arms Warrior","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Abilities to Train for Protection Warrior in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Arms Warrior Leveling Guide › Important Abilities > Utility and Crowd Control","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/arms-warrior-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:arms:leveling","class:warrior:protection:leveling"],"source_hashes":["guide:7e76df9ec6765aca0de4cb9efcdd8cbfa15cc14f","section:1c25e003ba1bffe75d7fee38f86dd473b2f6a332","section:48ce2da4d26adbe9f5e2474761e99d0cff01d95c","section:91e6054df3a6e6bb797bc953f8dc6aea6292b7ee"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-tips-subir","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Consejos para subir","title_en":"Leveling Tips","summary_es":"Prioriza armas actualizadas, comida con experiencia extra y profesiones que aporten recursos.","summary_en":"Prioritize current weapons, food with bonus experience, and useful gathering or crafting professions.","keywords_es":["consejos para subir guerrero","comida para experiencia","profesiones del guerrero","mejorar armas","consumibles para subir"],"keywords_en":["warrior leveling tips","experience food","warrior professions","weapon upgrades","leveling consumables"],"text_es":"Mejora el arma y entrena su habilidad y los nuevos rangos de Grito de guerra, Desgarrar, Revancha y Golpe mortal. La comida de Forever da un 5% de experiencia por muertes; Ataque de la victoria y las vendas ayudan a recuperarte, y lleva pociones de curación para emergencias. Minería combina con Herrería para fabricar equipo; Botánica con Alquimia surte consumibles y Primeros auxilios permite usar vendas y pociones. Descansa en una posada al cerrar sesión y recupérate antes de otro combate. En grupo, recoge las misiones de mazmorra: la experiencia está en ellas, no en sus enemigos.","text_en":"Upgrade your weapon, train its skill, and learn new ranks of Battle Shout, Rend, Revenge, and Mortal Strike. Forever food gives 5% experience from kills; Victory Rush and bandages help you recover, and carry healing potions for emergencies. Mining pairs with Blacksmithing for gear; Herbalism and Alchemy supply consumables, while First Aid provides bandages and potions. Log out in an inn and recover before another fight. In groups, collect dungeon quests: experience comes from those quests, not the dungeon mobs.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior Leveling Guide  - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Professions for Arms Warrior DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior Leveling Guide  - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Consumables for Arms Warrior DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior Leveling Guide  - WoW: Forever › Leveling Tips for Arms Warrior in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fury Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Consumables for Fury Warrior DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/fury/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-07"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Tips for Protection Warrior Tank in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Arms Warrior Leveling Guide › Leveling Tips","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/arms-warrior-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Arms Warrior Leveling Guide › Professions","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/arms-warrior-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Fury Warrior Leveling Guide › Professions","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/fury-warrior-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Fury Warrior Leveling Guide › Leveling Tips","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/fury-warrior-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Protection Warrior Leveling Guide › Leveling Milestones > Important Unlocks","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/protection-warrior-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:arms:leveling","class:warrior:fury:leveling","class:warrior:protection:leveling"],"source_hashes":["guide:5ce00d93595f1847fe9bc8701d47bbb805d3e581","section:0775d05837dca6535518349d4ee13f453a6c86b8","section:1a716c4566656006960e01f51bc5699dd9310cfa","section:27e90d55933440b4e9b3bb6d36b9d24ef6249359","section:2be53e9134d496ec923f26ce2c14265f594f7397","section:65cdbc0282a9e192365c4bb6f95957447ac8e5af","section:99d78fd7d07e34e28aebc61d0b756e12f1414bb0","section:9c4abde0ae7ee8a3e6258cb6391a461987773f71","section:e08f7247b85ce6c3d15263348a981da09455f27b","section:f2dc3dd24950c1a7f8f919b2f0563c5006720044"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-grupo","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"El Guerrero en grupo y mazmorras","title_en":"Warrior in Groups and Dungeons","summary_es":"Apoya con Grito de guerra y Hender armadura, interrumpe y, si hace falta, cambia a escudo.","summary_en":"Support with Battle Shout and Sunder Armor, interrupt, and switch to a shield if needed.","keywords_es":["guerrero en grupo","guerrero en mazmorras","apoyo del guerrero","guerrero tanque de emergencia","amenaza en grupo"],"keywords_en":["warrior in groups","warrior in dungeons","warrior group support","emergency tank warrior","group threat"],"text_es":"Grito de guerra y Hender armadura apoyan el daño físico del grupo. Protección destaca como tanque principal, con perjuicios potentes como Trueno y Grito desmoralizador, y mucha amenaza inicial de Embate con escudo. Azote de escudo interrumpe sin salir de Actitud defensiva; Irritar y Grito desafiante ayudan a recuperar enemigos si el combate se desordena. Armas y Furia pueden equipar un escudo para cubrir a un enemigo en una emergencia, aunque carecen de las herramientas de amenaza y furia de Protección.","text_en":"Battle Shout and Sunder Armor support the group's physical damage. Protection excels as a main tank, with powerful debuffs such as Thunder Clap and Demoralizing Shout, plus high snap threat from Shield Slam. Shield Bash interrupts without leaving Defensive Stance; Taunt and Challenging Shout help recover enemies when a fight goes wrong. Arms and Fury can equip a shield to cover an enemy in an emergency, but lack Protection's threat and Rage tools.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Warrior Class Guide › Comprehensive Guide to Warrior in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/warrior-class-overview","date":"2026-10-29"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Arms Warrior Guide › Arms Warrior Guide for World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/arms-warrior-melee-dps-pve-guide","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Fury Warrior Guide › Fury Warrior Guide for World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/fury-warrior-melee-dps-pve-guide","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Protection Warrior Guide › Protection Warrior Guide for World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/protection-warrior-tank-pve-guide","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Tank Guide - WoW: Forever › Viability of Protection Warrior Tank in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/overview-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:arms:overview","class:warrior:fury:overview","class:warrior:general:warrior-class-overview","class:warrior:protection:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:11eb2cbc57cacd353c1c0f6d757414126745a6bc","section:6617c74babb4ae1d4c935cf916c5adf5b020009d","section:b601b7a7c59b51284dbe2bc25a9030cbf6800a01","section:e6f2064724d7c518d632e82dea9d11d4281d5b56","section:f7711b113329381caf8bf53cbeb12a5e154c2d10"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-armas","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Armas: daño con arma a dos manos","title_en":"Arms: Two-Handed Damage","summary_es":"Armas combina Golpe mortal, Embate y Abrumar; destaca contra dos enemigos con Golpes de barrido.","summary_en":"Arms combines Mortal Strike, Slam, and Overpower; it excels against two enemies with Sweeping Strikes.","keywords_es":["guerrero armas","guerrero arma a dos manos","golpe mortal","golpes de barrido","daño con armas"],"keywords_en":["arms warrior","warrior two handed","mortal strike","sweeping strikes","arms damage"],"text_es":"Armas pelea con un arma a dos manos. Mantén Desgarrar y organiza Golpe mortal, Abrumar y Embate según estén disponibles; Golpe heroico sirve de relleno si sobra furia. Para el daño en área, guarda furia y combina Golpes de barrido con los ataques principales; Mellar y Huracán añaden daño contra grupos mayores. Destaca contra dos enemigos, pero puede quedarse sin furia si sus golpes fallan o los paran.","text_en":"Arms fights with a two-handed weapon. Keep Rend active and fit Mortal Strike, Overpower, and Slam around their availability; Heroic Strike is a filler when Rage allows. For area damage, pool Rage and combine Sweeping Strikes with your main attacks; Cleave and Whirlwind add damage against larger groups. Arms excels against two enemies, but can run short on Rage when attacks miss or are parried.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Single Target DPS Rotation for Arms Warrior in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › AoE DPS Rotation for Arms Warrior  in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Strengths and Weaknesses of Arms Warrior in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:arms:overview","class:warrior:arms:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:0c70116265461cda8340e2ffb2c8b3f769e409c9","section:45f42514601b5b2f27a9cbe823095945f92d0a75","section:532975479cc58ee984311a2f966d8e5fa76013bc"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-furia","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Furia: daño con dos armas","title_en":"Fury: Dual-Wield Damage","summary_es":"Furia usa Sed de sangre y Huracán, acelera sus golpes con críticos y sufre más fallos con dos armas.","summary_en":"Fury uses Bloodthirst and Whirlwind, speeds up with critical hits, and suffers more misses with two weapons.","keywords_es":["guerrero furia","guerrero dos armas","sed de sangre","huracán furia","daño furia"],"keywords_en":["fury warrior","warrior dual wield","bloodthirst","fury whirlwind","fury damage"],"text_es":"Furia empuña dos armas y centra su daño en Sed de sangre y Huracán; Mellar ayuda contra grupos pequeños. Los críticos activan Aluvión y aceleran los ataques, pero no dan furia adicional: esta se normaliza y ya no escala con el daño del arma. Deseo de la Muerte da una ventana de daño alto a cambio de recibir más daño. Los fallos de la doble empuñadura pueden dejarte esperando furia; sufre en combates largos contra uno si recibes pocos golpes.","text_en":"Fury dual-wields and builds its damage around Bloodthirst and Whirlwind; Cleave helps against small groups. Critical hits activate Flurry and speed up attacks, but grant no extra Rage: Rage is normalized and no longer scales with weapon damage. Death Wish provides a burst window at the cost of taking more damage. Dual-wield misses can leave you waiting for Rage; Fury struggles in long single-target fights when little damage is incoming.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fury Warrior DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Fury Warrior in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/fury/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fury Warrior DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Best PvE Rotation for Fury Warrior DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/fury/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-10-29"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fury Warrior DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Best Fury Warrior Cooldown Usage in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/fury/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-10-29"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Fury Warrior - Spec, Builds, and Talents › Bloodthirst Dual Wield Build","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/fury-warrior-melee-dps-pve-spec-builds-talents","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fury Warrior DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Strengths and Weaknesses of Fury Warriors in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/fury/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:fury:overview","class:warrior:fury:rotation","class:warrior:fury:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:4df882c92a2e87e0bd554ee080418c8cf0409ea6","section:525edb75d9da8ac214dddf6ad77a7bfda9ef3b57","section:6e3ca74abc16c1df80663f7ba1fd31a8167f9d4d","section:7c4a5a6fdfe1f929e9ba564eff3004e1bf543f92","section:b7bca2ae0c7f74df9db2d5d801391942976b4ae4"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-proteccion","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Protección: tanque con escudo","title_en":"Protection: Shield Tank","summary_es":"Protección genera amenaza con Embate con escudo y Revancha, y convierte bloqueos, esquivas y paradas en furia.","summary_en":"Protection builds threat with Shield Slam and Revenge, and turns blocks, dodges, and parries into Rage.","keywords_es":["guerrero protección","guerrero tanque","embate con escudo","revancha","tanque con escudo"],"keywords_en":["protection warrior","warrior tank","shield slam","revenge","shield tank"],"text_es":"Protección tanquea con escudo: Embate con escudo genera mucha amenaza inicial y Revancha combina daño y amenaza; Bloquear con escudo reduce el daño recibido y los bloqueos, esquivas y paradas generan furia. Trueno se puede usar en Actitud defensiva, afecta hasta 4 enemigos, reduce su velocidad de ataque un 20% y tiene 6 s de reutilización. Desafío y la actitud defensiva refuerzan la amenaza; Irritar y Grito desafiante ayudan a recuperar enemigos. Sin ataques recibidos, escasean la furia y la amenaza.","text_en":"Protection tanks with a shield: Shield Slam creates high snap threat, while Revenge deals damage and builds threat; Shield Block reduces incoming damage, and blocks, dodges, and parries generate Rage. Thunder Clap can be used in Defensive Stance, affects up to 4 enemies, slows their attack speed by 20%, and has a 6-second cooldown. Defiance and Defensive Stance boost threat; Taunt and Challenging Shout help recover enemies. Without incoming attacks, Rage and threat run short.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Tank Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Existing Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/overview-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Tank Guide - WoW: Forever › Protection Warrior Specific Systems in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/overview-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Protection Warrior Guide › Protection Warrior Guide for World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/protection-warrior-tank-pve-guide","date":"2026-11-09"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:protection:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:6ab3846bb01dd45fc7a7179ccbf05954caa4f41d","section:ed18dc14ad220dad5d4e9b5e30bd9c617535799c","section:f7711b113329381caf8bf53cbeb12a5e154c2d10"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-armas-stats","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Prioridad de estadísticas de Armas","title_en":"Arms Stat Priority","summary_es":"Armas prioriza golpe hasta 8%, pericia hasta 6,5% y después crítico y atributos.","summary_en":"Arms prioritizes hit to 8%, expertise to 6.5%, then crit and attributes.","keywords_es":["estadísticas de Armas","prioridad de estadísticas guerrero","golpe 8% Armas","pericia Armas","crítico de Armas"],"keywords_en":["Arms stats","warrior stat priority","Arms 8% hit","Arms expertise","Arms crit"],"text_es":"Prioriza probabilidad de golpe hasta 8%, pericia hasta 6,5%, golpe crítico, fuerza, agilidad, celeridad y, por último, más golpe. Recomendación provisional hasta que se pruebe a nivel 60.","text_en":"Prioritize hit chance to 8%, expertise to 6.5%, critical strike, Strength, Agility, Haste, and finally additional Hit. Provisional recommendation until tested at level 60.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior Stat Priority & Attributes - WoW: Forever › Arms Warrior Stat Priority in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/stat-priority-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:arms:stats"],"source_hashes":["section:3ed6c034ea262b0996b6e976e399412e433f47fb"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-furia-stats","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Prioridad de estadísticas de Furia","title_en":"Fury Stat Priority","summary_es":"Furia prioriza habilidad con armas hasta 305, golpe hasta 9% y crítico.","summary_en":"Fury prioritizes weapon skill to 305, hit to 9%, and critical strike.","keywords_es":["estadísticas de Furia","prioridad de estadísticas guerrero","habilidad con armas 305","golpe 9% Furia","aguante Furia"],"keywords_en":["Fury stats","warrior stat priority","weapon skill 305","Fury 9% hit","Fury stamina"],"text_es":"Prioriza habilidad con armas hasta 305, probabilidad de golpe hasta 9%, golpe crítico, fuerza, agilidad y aguante. Recomendación provisional hasta que se pruebe a nivel 60.","text_en":"Prioritize weapon skill to 305, hit chance to 9%, critical strike, Strength, Agility, and Stamina. Provisional recommendation until tested at level 60.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fury Warrior Stat Priority & Attributes - WoW: Forever › Fury Warrior Stat Priority in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/fury/stat-priority-pve-dps","date":"2026-10-29"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:fury:stats"],"source_hashes":["section:4c3b204d4bbfdf55456789f44584c4d46b7f9cac"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-proteccion-stats","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Prioridad de estadísticas de Protección","title_en":"Protection Stat Priority","summary_es":"Protección puede priorizar defensa, equilibrio o amenaza según el contenido.","summary_en":"Protection can prioritize defense, balance, or threat depending on content.","keywords_es":["estadísticas de Protección","prioridad defensiva guerrero","prioridad equilibrada tanque","prioridad ofensiva Protección","defensa 440"],"keywords_en":["Protection stats","defensive warrior priority","balanced tank priority","offensive Protection priority","440 defense"],"text_es":"Defensiva: aguante, defensa hasta 440, armadura, agilidad, defensa por encima de 440, parada, esquiva, pericia (6,5%), bloqueo, poder de ataque/fuerza, golpe (8%), crítico, pericia (14%) y celeridad. Equilibrada: aguante, pericia (6,5%), golpe (8%), defensa hasta 440, pericia (14%), armadura, poder de ataque/fuerza, agilidad, defensa por encima de 440, parada, esquiva, crítico, bloqueo y celeridad. Ofensiva: pericia (6,5%), golpe (8%), pericia (14%), crítico, poder de ataque/fuerza, aguante, celeridad, agilidad, defensa hasta 440, armadura, defensa por encima de 440, parada, esquiva y bloqueo.","text_en":"Defensive priority: Stamina, Defense to 440, Armor, Agility, Defense above 440, Parry, Dodge, Expertise (6.5%), Block, Attack Power/Strength, Hit (8%), Crit, Expertise (14%), Haste. Balanced: Stamina, Expertise (6.5%), Hit (8%), Defense to 440, Expertise (14%), Armor, Attack Power/Strength, Agility, Defense above 440, Parry, Dodge, Crit, Block, Haste. Offensive: Expertise (6.5%), Hit (8%), Expertise (14%), Crit, Attack Power/Strength, Stamina, Haste, Agility, Defense to 440, Armor, Defense above 440, Parry, Dodge, Block.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Tank Attribute and Stat Guide - WoW: Forever › Defensive Priority","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/stat-priority-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-03"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Tank Attribute and Stat Guide - WoW: Forever › Balanced Priority","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/stat-priority-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-03"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Tank Attribute and Stat Guide - WoW: Forever › Offensive Priority","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/stat-priority-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-03"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:protection:stats"],"source_hashes":["section:08d41dbf9a45cb10c735308c5f7cd8edb73320d5","section:9c558038c02f90c314b38b031c6915b4d6378ce5","section:a29e9d1087c5328cfd3a328b9baad88bc72fb9da"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-armas-rotacion-single","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotación de Armas contra un objetivo","title_en":"Arms Single-Target Rotation","summary_es":"Mantén Desgarrar y prioriza Golpe mortal, Abrumar y Embate sin quedarte sin furia.","summary_en":"Maintain Rend and prioritize Mortal Strike, Overpower, and Slam without running out of Rage.","keywords_es":["rotación Armas un objetivo","prioridad Armas nivel 60","Desgarrar y Golpe mortal","Golpe heroico 40 furia","Ejecutar Armas"],"keywords_en":["Arms single target rotation","level 60 Arms priority","Rend and Mortal Strike","Heroic Strike 40 Rage","Arms Execute"],"text_es":"Mantén Desgarrar. Prioriza Golpe mortal, Abrumar cuando esté disponible y Lanzazo antes de Embate contra gigantes o dragonantes, después Embate; mantén 5 acumulaciones de Hender armadura. Usa Golpe heroico por encima de 40 de furia y Trueno y Grito desmoralizador para mantener sus perjuicios. Desde el 20% de salud del enemigo, intercala Ejecutar y conserva furia para Golpe mortal.","text_en":"Maintain Rend. Use Mortal Strike, Overpower when available, and Spearing Strike before Slam against giants or Dragonkin, then Slam; keep 5 Sunder Armor stacks. Use Heroic Strike above 40 Rage, and maintain Thunder Clap and Demoralizing Shout debuffs. Below 20% enemy health, weave in Execute and save Rage for Mortal Strike.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Single Target DPS Rotation for Arms Warrior in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-15"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:arms:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:532975479cc58ee984311a2f966d8e5fa76013bc"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-armas-rotacion-area","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotación de Armas en área","title_en":"Arms AoE Rotation","summary_es":"Guarda furia para Golpes de barrido y combina los ataques prioritarios.","summary_en":"Pool Rage for Sweeping Strikes and combine it with priority attacks.","keywords_es":["rotación Armas área","Armas varios objetivos","Golpes de barrido rotación","Mellar más de 45 furia","Huracán Armas"],"keywords_en":["Arms AoE rotation","Arms multiple targets","Sweeping Strikes rotation","Cleave above 45 Rage","Arms Whirlwind"],"text_es":"Mantén Desgarrar en el objetivo principal y guarda furia antes de Golpes de barrido; combínalo con Golpe mortal y Abrumar cuando esté disponible. Usa Mellar por encima de 45 de furia si faltan más de 5 s para que vuelva Golpes de barrido, y luego Huracán. Contra gigantes o dragonantes, usa Lanzazo antes de Embate; mantén 5 acumulaciones de Hender armadura en el objetivo prioritario y los perjuicios de Trueno y Grito desmoralizador.","text_en":"Maintain Rend on the primary target and pool Rage before Sweeping Strikes; combine it with Mortal Strike and Overpower when available. Use Cleave above 45 Rage if Sweeping Strikes has more than 5 seconds left, then Whirlwind. Against giants or Dragonkin, use Spearing Strike before Slam; keep 5 Sunder Armor stacks on the priority target and maintain Thunder Clap and Demoralizing Shout debuffs.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › AoE DPS Rotation for Arms Warrior  in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-15"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:arms:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:0c70116265461cda8340e2ffb2c8b3f769e409c9"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-furia-rotacion-single","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotación de Furia contra un objetivo","title_en":"Fury Single-Target Rotation","summary_es":"Mantén Grito de guerra y ordena los ataques según la furia disponible.","summary_en":"Maintain Battle Shout and order attacks around available Rage.","keywords_es":["rotación Furia un objetivo","prioridad Furia nivel 60","Sed de sangre y Huracán","Golpe heroico 65 furia","Seccionar 85 furia"],"keywords_en":["Fury single target rotation","level 60 Fury priority","Bloodthirst and Whirlwind","Heroic Strike 65 Rage","Hamstring 85 Rage"],"text_es":"Mantén Grito de guerra y, si el grupo lo aplica, Hender armadura. Prioriza Ejecutar, Sed de sangre y Huracán; usa Abrumar por debajo de 30 de furia, Golpe heroico por encima de 65 y Seccionar por encima de 85.","text_en":"Maintain Battle Shout and, if your party uses it, Sunder Armor. Prioritize Execute, Bloodthirst, and Whirlwind; use Overpower below 30 Rage, Heroic Strike above 65, and Hamstring above 85.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fury Warrior DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Single Target DPS Rotation for Fury Warrior in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/fury/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-10-29"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:fury:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:7a15b9090ffd3175f3b9dd6346b6944f21b4b687"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-furia-rotacion-area","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotación de Furia en área","title_en":"Fury AoE Rotation","summary_es":"Huracán encabeza el área; reserva Mellar para más de 60 de furia.","summary_en":"Whirlwind leads the AoE priority; save Cleave for above 60 Rage.","keywords_es":["rotación Furia área","Furia varios objetivos","Huracán en área","Mellar 60 furia","Ejecutar objetivo prioritario"],"keywords_en":["Fury AoE rotation","Fury multiple targets","Whirlwind AoE","Cleave 60 Rage","Execute priority target"],"text_es":"Mantén Grito de guerra y, si el grupo lo usa, Hender armadura en el objetivo principal. Prioriza Huracán; usa Ejecutar si hay un objetivo prioritario, después Sed de sangre y Abrumar por debajo de 30 de furia. Mellar se usa por encima de 60 de furia.","text_en":"Maintain Battle Shout and, if your party uses it, Sunder Armor on the primary target. Prioritize Whirlwind; use Execute if there is a priority target, then Bloodthirst and Overpower below 30 Rage. Use Cleave above 60 Rage.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fury Warrior DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › AoE DPS Rotation for Fury Warrior in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/fury/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-10-29"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:fury:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:f6ca9739f660e472addc67a9bb4230b70ab9ee11"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-proteccion-rotacion-single","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Prioridad de Protección contra un objetivo","title_en":"Protection Single-Target Priority","summary_es":"Bloquear con escudo y Revancha encabezan la prioridad, con perjuicios de grupo.","summary_en":"Shield Block and Revenge lead the priority, alongside group debuffs.","keywords_es":["rotación Protección un objetivo","prioridad tanque guerrero","Bloquear con escudo Revancha","Hender armadura tanque","Golpe heroico 30 furia"],"keywords_en":["Protection single target rotation","warrior tank priority","Shield Block Revenge","tank Sunder Armor","Heroic Strike 30 Rage"],"text_es":"Es una prioridad adaptable: usa Bloquear con escudo, Revancha y Embate con escudo si tienes el talento; Sed de sangre también si está aprendida. En grupo, mantén 5 acumulaciones de Hender armadura, Trueno, Grito de guerra y Grito desmoralizador. Usa Desgarrar si ya tienes mucha amenaza, rellena con Hender armadura si sobra furia y acciones, y Golpe heroico por encima de 30 de furia. A menos del 20% de salud, Ejecutar exige salir de Actitud defensiva.","text_en":"Treat this as an adaptable priority: use Shield Block, Revenge, and Shield Slam if talented; Bloodthirst too if learned. In a group, maintain 5 Sunder Armor stacks, Thunder Clap, Battle Shout, and Demoralizing Shout. Use Rend when threat is already high, fill with Sunder Armor if Rage and globals allow, and Heroic Strike above 30 Rage. Below 20% health, Execute requires leaving Defensive Stance.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Best Protection Warrior Tank Rotations in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/rotation-cooldowns-pve-tank","date":"2026-10-29"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:protection:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:8851f1cc060989d5f47e83645a5062f52fac0924"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-proteccion-rotacion-area","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Prioridad de Protección en área","title_en":"Protection AoE Priority","summary_es":"Trueno abre la prioridad de área; Bloquear con escudo y Revancha siguen.","summary_en":"Thunder Clap starts the AoE priority, followed by Shield Block and Revenge.","keywords_es":["rotación Protección área","tanquear varios enemigos","Trueno Protección","Mellar 30 furia","Represalias con dos manos"],"keywords_en":["Protection AoE rotation","tank multiple enemies","Protection Thunder Clap","Cleave 30 Rage","two-handed Retaliation"],"text_es":"Usa Trueno, Bloquear con escudo, Revancha y Embate con escudo si tienes el talento; Sed de sangre también si está aprendida. Mantén 5 acumulaciones de Hender armadura en un objetivo prioritario si estás en grupo, además de Grito de guerra y Grito desmoralizador. Mellar se usa por encima de 30 de furia. Represalias causa mucho daño contra varios enemigos; cambiar a un arma de dos manos durante el efecto aumenta su daño.","text_en":"Use Thunder Clap, Shield Block, Revenge, and Shield Slam if talented; Bloodthirst too if learned. In a group, maintain 5 Sunder Armor stacks on a priority target, plus Battle Shout and Demoralizing Shout. Use Cleave above 30 Rage. Retaliation deals high damage against several enemies; switching to a two-handed weapon during the effect increases its damage.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Best Protection Warrior Tank Rotations in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/rotation-cooldowns-pve-tank","date":"2026-10-29"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:protection:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:8851f1cc060989d5f47e83645a5062f52fac0924"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-armas-cambios-forever","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Cambios de Armas en Forever","title_en":"Arms Changes in Forever","summary_es":"Desgarrar escala con poder de ataque y puede dar críticos y activar Abrumar.","summary_en":"Rend scales with Attack Power, can crit, and can trigger Overpower.","keywords_es":["cambios Armas Forever","Desgarrar crítico","Fragor de la sangre","activar Abrumar","Heridas profundas crítico"],"keywords_en":["Arms Forever changes","Rend crit","Bloodthrill","trigger Overpower","Deep Wounds crit"],"text_es":"En Armas, Desgarrar ahora escala mejor con el poder de ataque y puede asestar críticos; Heridas profundas también puede hacerlo. Con puntos en Fragor de la sangre, Desgarrar tiene la posibilidad de activar Abrumar durante 6 s; más puntos aumentan esa posibilidad.","text_en":"Rend now scales better with Attack Power for Arms and can critically strike; Deep Wounds can also crit. With points in Bloodthrill, Rend can activate Overpower for 6 seconds, and additional points increase the chance.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Arms Warrior in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:arms:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:4c249d48afa3e1ebfaf913f80a148d06d0ca8685"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-armas-lanzazo-embate","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Lanzazo y Embate mejorado","title_en":"Spearing Strike and Improved Slam","summary_es":"Lanzazo desmonta; Embate mejorado reduce su lanzamiento y evita reiniciar el golpe.","summary_en":"Spearing Strike dismounts; Improved Slam shortens its cast and avoids resetting the swing.","keywords_es":["Lanzazo desmontar","daño de Lanzazo","Embate mejorado","tiempo de lanzamiento Embate","reiniciar golpe cuerpo a cuerpo"],"keywords_en":["Spearing Strike dismount","Spearing Strike damage","Improved Slam","Slam cast time","melee swing reset"],"text_es":"Lanzazo, exclusivo de Armas, desmonta y causa un 40% del daño del arma; contra gigantes, dragonantes y objetivos montados añade daño equivalente al 80% del daño del arma. Embate tiene 15 s de reutilización, reducidos a 10 s con 2 puntos en Embate mejorado; el talento también hace que lanzarlo ya no interrumpa el tiempo entre golpes cuerpo a cuerpo.","text_en":"Arms-only Spearing Strike dismounts and deals 40% weapon damage; against Giants, Dragonkin, and mounted targets, it adds damage equal to 80% of weapon damage. Slam has a 15-second cooldown, reduced to 10 seconds with 2 points in Improved Slam; the talent also makes casting it no longer interrupt melee swing time.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › New Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Existing Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:arms:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:6ebba8e13a11e6a4374f526e70415b6dad7b4772","section:9ff89aea476a4470ebe9817cf1b5ad906c38856b"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-maestro-armas","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Especialización Maestro de armas","title_en":"Weaponmaster Specialization","summary_es":"Maestro de armas unifica especializaciones y permite cambiar de tipo de arma con más libertad.","summary_en":"Weaponmaster combines weapon specializations and allows more freedom to change weapon types.","keywords_es":["Maestro de armas guerrero","especialización de armas","mazas ignoran armadura","bastones guerrero","cambiar tipo de arma"],"keywords_en":["warrior Weaponmaster","weapon specialization","maces ignore armor","warrior staves","change weapon type"],"text_es":"Maestro de armas combina las especializaciones de hachas, espadas, armas de asta y mazas, e incluye bastones. Las mazas y los bastones ignoran armadura. Al concentrar esos efectos en un solo talento, puedes cambiar de tipo de arma con más libertad mientras subes de nivel.","text_en":"Weaponmaster combines specializations for axes, swords, polearms, and maces, and includes staves. Maces and staves ignore armor. Combining these effects in one talent lets you switch weapon types more freely while leveling.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › New Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:arms:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:6ebba8e13a11e6a4374f526e70415b6dad7b4772"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-furia-furia-normalizada","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Furia normalizada en Furia","title_en":"Normalized Rage for Fury","summary_es":"El daño del arma y los críticos ya no aumentan la furia generada por Furia.","summary_en":"Weapon damage and critical hits no longer increase Fury's Rage generation.","keywords_es":["furia normalizada Furia","generación de furia guerrero","críticos no dan furia","furia del arma","Furia Forever cambios"],"keywords_en":["Fury normalized Rage","warrior Rage generation","crit gives no Rage","weapon Rage","Fury Forever changes"],"text_es":"En Furia, la generación de furia está normalizada: los ataques dan una cantidad fija dentro de un intervalo calculado, no según el daño del arma. Los críticos no generan furia adicional y el equipo no aumenta la furia obtenida; para generar más, hay que recibir daño.","text_en":"Rage generation for Fury is normalized: attacks grant a fixed amount within a calculated range, not based on weapon damage. Critical hits grant no extra Rage, and gear does not increase Rage gained; taking damage is the way to generate more.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fury Warrior DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Fury Warrior in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/fury/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:fury:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:b7bca2ae0c7f74df9db2d5d801391942976b4ae4"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-proteccion-muro-escudo","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Cambios de Muro de escudo y Represalias","title_en":"Shield Wall and Retaliation Changes","summary_es":"Muro de escudo dura 12 s y reduce 60% el daño; las reutilizaciones ya no se comparten.","summary_en":"Shield Wall lasts 12 seconds and reduces damage by 60%; cooldowns are no longer shared.","keywords_es":["Muro de escudo cambios","reutilización Represalias","Muro de escudo 60%","reducción de daño guerrero","reutilizaciones separadas"],"keywords_en":["Shield Wall changes","Retaliation cooldown","Shield Wall 60%","warrior damage reduction","separate cooldowns"],"text_es":"Muro de escudo ahora reduce un 60% el daño recibido durante 12 s y tiene 15 min de reutilización base, reducible con talentos. Represalias tiene 15 min de reutilización. Temeridad, Represalias y Muro de escudo dejaron de compartir reutilización; Temeridad conserva 30 min.","text_en":"Shield Wall now reduces damage taken by 60% for 12 seconds and has a 15-minute base cooldown, reducible with talents. Retaliation has a 15-minute cooldown. Recklessness, Retaliation, and Shield Wall no longer share cooldowns; Recklessness remains at 30 minutes.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Tank Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Existing Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/overview-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Best Protection Warrior Cooldown Usage in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/rotation-cooldowns-pve-tank","date":"2026-10-29"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:protection:overview","class:warrior:protection:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:c8ff2acd84722e39fa2c1ae6985614ff2a651913","section:ed18dc14ad220dad5d4e9b5e30bd9c617535799c"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-cambio-actitudes-combate","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Cambiar de actitud durante el combate","title_en":"Stance Dancing in Combat","summary_es":"Cambia brevemente a otra actitud para usar una facultad y vuelve a la anterior.","summary_en":"Briefly switch stances to use an ability, then return to the previous stance.","keywords_es":["cambiar actitud combate","cambio rápido de actitud","usar Abrumar","Actitud rabiosa y batalla","furia al cambiar actitud"],"keywords_en":["stance dancing","switch stance in combat","use Overpower","Berserker and Battle Stance","Rage stance change"],"text_es":"Cambiar de actitud durante el combate permite usar una facultad restringida y volver enseguida a la actitud anterior. Por ejemplo, pasa de Actitud rabiosa a Actitud de batalla para lanzar Abrumar cuando esté disponible y regresa después. Si necesitas reducir el daño recibido al tanquear un enemigo en una mazmorra, puedes cambiar a Actitud defensiva.","text_en":"Stance dancing lets you use an ability restricted to another stance and quickly return to the previous one. For example, switch from Berserker Stance to Battle Stance to cast Overpower when available, then switch back. To reduce incoming damage while tanking an enemy in a dungeon, you can switch to Defensive Stance.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Arms Warrior Specific Systems in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:arms:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:082f291835995244fcef68e69006f4fd916c5ebb"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-ataque-victoria","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Ataque de la victoria","title_en":"Victory Rush","summary_es":"Tras matar a un enemigo no trivial, Ataque de la victoria inflige daño y cura un 10% de salud máxima.","summary_en":"After killing a non-trivial enemy, Victory Rush deals damage and heals 10% of maximum health.","keywords_es":["Ataque de la victoria Guerrero","curación Ataque de la victoria","activar Ataque de la victoria","curarse tras matar","facultad nueva Guerrero"],"keywords_en":["Warrior Victory Rush","Victory Rush healing","activate Victory Rush","heal after a kill","new Warrior ability"],"text_es":"Ataque de la victoria está disponible para las tres especializaciones. Puedes usarlo tras matar a un enemigo no trivial; inflige daño y restaura un 10% de tu salud máxima.","text_en":"Victory Rush is available to all three specializations. You can use it after killing a non-trivial enemy; it deals damage and restores 10% of your maximum health.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › New Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Tank Guide - WoW: Forever › New Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/overview-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:arms:overview","class:warrior:protection:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:6ebba8e13a11e6a4374f526e70415b6dad7b4772","section:ac4ce0b3e17e24a7f6d6341bd70ec2b76caa77c8"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-gritos-duracion","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Duración de los gritos del Guerrero","title_en":"Warrior Shout Durations","summary_es":"Grito de guerra dura 3 minutos y Grito desmoralizador, 45 segundos.","summary_en":"Battle Shout lasts 3 minutes and Demoralizing Shout lasts 45 seconds.","keywords_es":["duración Grito de guerra","duración Grito desmoralizador","gritos Guerrero Forever","Grito de guerra 3 minutos","Grito desmoralizador 45 segundos"],"keywords_en":["Battle Shout duration","Demoralizing Shout duration","Forever Warrior shouts","Battle Shout 3 minutes","Demoralizing Shout 45 seconds"],"text_es":"En Forever, Grito de guerra dura 3 minutos en vez de 2, y Grito desmoralizador dura 45 segundos en vez de 30. Esto alarga el tiempo entre renovaciones de ambos efectos.","text_en":"In Forever, Battle Shout lasts 3 minutes instead of 2, and Demoralizing Shout lasts 45 seconds instead of 30. This lengthens the time between refreshing either effect.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Existing Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:arms:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:9ff89aea476a4470ebe9817cf1b5ad906c38856b"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-furia-otros-cambios","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Otros cambios de Furia","title_en":"Other Fury Changes","summary_es":"Enfurecer se activa con daño directo y Sed de sangre gana daño fijo por rango.","summary_en":"Enrage activates from direct damage, and Bloodthirst gains flat damage per rank.","keywords_es":["cambios habilidades Furia","Enfurecer daño directo","Sed de sangre daño fijo","Especialización en doble empuñadura furia","armadura jefes Furia"],"keywords_en":["Fury ability changes","Enrage direct damage","Bloodthirst flat damage","Fury Dual Wield Specialization","Fury boss armor"],"text_es":"Enfurecer ahora se activa con cualquier instancia de daño directo recibido, no solo con críticos. Sed de sangre añade daño fijo que aumenta con cada rango, y Especialización en doble empuñadura aumenta ligeramente la furia generada por el arma secundaria. Además, Fuego feérico y Maldición de Temeridad ya no acumulan sus efectos de reducción de armadura en los enemigos.","text_en":"Enrage now activates from any instance of direct damage taken, not only critical hits. Bloodthirst adds flat damage that increases with each rank, and Dual Wield Specialization slightly increases Rage generated by the off-hand weapon. Also, Faerie Fire and Curse of Recklessness no longer stack their armor-reduction effects on enemies.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fury Warrior DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Fury Warrior in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/fury/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fury Warrior DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Existing Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/fury/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:fury:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:b7bca2ae0c7f74df9db2d5d801391942976b4ae4","section:e48d63f79fa1907b0e696fc9a928601c50eeb1b0"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-proteccion-bloquear-cambios","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Cambios de Bloquear con escudo","title_en":"Shield Block Changes","summary_es":"Bloquear con escudo dura 7 segundos y puede bloquear dos ataques por uso.","summary_en":"Shield Block lasts 7 seconds and can block two attacks per use.","keywords_es":["Bloquear con escudo cambios","duración Bloquear con escudo","dos bloqueos","habilidades Protección Forever","bloquear ataques Guerrero"],"keywords_en":["Shield Block changes","Shield Block duration","two blocks","Forever Protection abilities","Warrior block attacks"],"text_es":"En Forever, Bloquear con escudo aumenta un 75% la probabilidad de bloqueo durante 7 s y puede bloquear 2 ataques, en vez de durar 5 s y bloquear solo 1. Úsalo para reducir el daño y activar efectos que dependen de bloquear.","text_en":"In Forever, Shield Block increases block chance by 75% for 7 seconds and can block 2 attacks, rather than lasting 5 seconds and blocking only 1. Use it to reduce damage and trigger effects that depend on blocking.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Tank Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Existing Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/overview-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:protection:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:ed18dc14ad220dad5d4e9b5e30bd9c617535799c"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-armas-trueno","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Cambio de Trueno en Armas","title_en":"Arms Thunder Clap Change","summary_es":"Trueno reduce un 20% la velocidad de ataque, frente al 10% anterior.","summary_en":"Thunder Clap slows attack speed by 20%, up from 10%.","keywords_es":["Trueno Armas Forever","reducción de velocidad Trueno","Trueno 20 por ciento","cambios Guerrero Armas"],"keywords_en":["Arms Thunder Clap Forever","Thunder Clap attack speed reduction","20 percent Thunder Clap","Arms Warrior changes"],"text_es":"En Forever, Trueno reduce un 20% la velocidad de ataque de los enemigos, en vez del 10% anterior.","text_en":"In Forever, Thunder Clap reduces enemies' attack speed by 20%, up from 10% previously.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Existing Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:arms:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:9ff89aea476a4470ebe9817cf1b5ad906c38856b"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-furia-precision-furiosa","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Precisión furiosa","title_en":"Furious Precision","summary_es":"Precisión furiosa aumenta el golpe de los ataques del arma secundaria.","summary_en":"Furious Precision increases hit chance for off-hand attacks.","keywords_es":["Precisión furiosa Guerrero","golpe arma secundaria","acierto doble empuñadura","cambios Furia Forever"],"keywords_en":["Warrior Furious Precision","off-hand hit chance","dual-wield hit","Fury Forever changes"],"text_es":"Precisión furiosa aumenta el golpe de los ataques con el arma secundaria; esta facultad compensa la retirada de la cola de Golpe heroico.","text_en":"Furious Precision increases hit chance for off-hand attacks; the ability compensates for the removal of the Heroic Strike queue.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fury Warrior DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › New Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/fury/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:fury:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:e8123f5c62b4208e1a01cf77ca355b993a1a94f4"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-maestria-tactica","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Maestría táctica básica","title_en":"Baseline Tactical Mastery","summary_es":"Maestría táctica permite conservar hasta 10 puntos de furia al cambiar de actitud.","summary_en":"Tactical Mastery lets Warriors retain up to 10 Rage when changing stances.","keywords_es":["Maestría táctica Guerrero","furia al cambiar de actitud","retener furia Guerrero","Maestría táctica básica"],"keywords_en":["Warrior Tactical Mastery","Rage when changing stances","retain Warrior Rage","baseline Tactical Mastery"],"text_es":"Maestría táctica es una facultad básica del Guerrero en Forever: al cambiar de actitud, permite conservar hasta 10 puntos de furia.","text_en":"Tactical Mastery is a baseline Warrior ability in Forever: when changing stances, it lets you retain up to 10 Rage.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Tank Guide - WoW: Forever › Protection Warrior Specific Systems in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/overview-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:protection:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:6ab3846bb01dd45fc7a7179ccbf05954caa4f41d"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-proteccion-nuevas-herramientas","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Nuevas herramientas de Protección","title_en":"New Protection Tools","summary_es":"Cuatro talentos amplían la movilidad, el daño, la furia y la defensa con escudo.","summary_en":"Four talents expand mobility, damage, Rage, and shield-based defense.","keywords_es":["nuevos talentos Protección Forever","Vanguardia Guerrero","Bastión Guerrero","Maestro de defensa Guerrero","Ira enfocada Guerrero"],"keywords_en":["new Protection talents Forever","Warrior Vanguard talent","Warrior Bastion talent","Warrior Master of Defense","Warrior Focused Rage"],"text_es":"Vanguardia habilita Embestir desde Actitud defensiva. Bastión eleva una décima parte el daño que infliges al llevar escudo; Maestro de defensa te da 5 de furia si esquivas o paras en esas condiciones. Ira enfocada resta 3 puntos de furia al coste de tus facultades ofensivas.","text_en":"Vanguard enables Charge from Defensive Stance. With a shield on, Bastion raises your damage dealt by one tenth; a successful dodge or parry then yields 5 Rage through Master of Defense. Focused Rage subtracts 3 Rage from offensive ability costs.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Tank Guide - WoW: Forever › New Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/overview-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:protection:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:ac4ce0b3e17e24a7f6d6341bd70ec2b76caa77c8"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-proteccion-cambios-talentos","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Cambios en talentos de Protección","title_en":"Protection Talent Changes","summary_es":"Especialización en escudos, Anticipación, Revancha mejorada y Desafío cambian en Forever.","summary_en":"Shield Specialization, Anticipation, Improved Revenge, and Defiance change in Forever.","keywords_es":["cambios talentos Protección","furia por bloquear Guerrero","Anticipación defensa","Revancha mejorada daño","Desafío con escudo"],"keywords_en":["Protection talent changes","Rage from blocking Warrior","Anticipation Defense","Improved Revenge damage","Defiance with shield"],"text_es":"En Forever, Especialización en escudos genera 5 de furia al bloquear; Anticipación aporta 20 de defensa. Revancha mejorada aumenta un 60% el daño de Revancha en vez de dar una posibilidad de aturdir, y Desafío añade un 15% de amenaza en Actitud defensiva mientras llevas escudo.","text_en":"In Forever, Shield Specialization grants 5 Rage when you block, and Anticipation adds 20 Defense. Improved Revenge increases Revenge damage by 60% instead of adding a stun chance, while Defiance adds 15% threat in Defensive Stance when a shield is equipped.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Tank Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Existing Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/overview-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:protection:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:ed18dc14ad220dad5d4e9b5e30bd9c617535799c"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-armas-talentos-pve-1","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Armas: talentos PvE (1/2)","title_en":"Arms: PvE talents (1/2)","summary_es":"Build de daño PvE que conserva Golpe mortal.","summary_en":"PvE damage build that keeps Mortal Strike.","keywords_es":["talentos Armas PvE","build Guerrero Armas","Golpe mortal Armas"],"keywords_en":["Arms PvE talents","Arms Warrior build","Arms Mortal Strike"],"text_es":"Armas: Golpe heroico mejorado 3/3, Desgarrar mejorado 3/3, Maestría táctica mejorada 3/3, Abrumar mejorado 2/2, Control de furia 1/1, Heridas profundas 3/3, Lanzazo 1/1, Especialización en armas de dos manos 3/3, Clavar 2/2, Fragor de la sangre 2/2, Golpes de barrido 1/1, Maestro de armas 5/5, Embate mejorado 2/2, Golpe mortal 1/1.","text_en":"Arms: Improved Heroic Strike 3/3, Improved Rend 3/3, Improved Tactical Mastery 3/3, Improved Overpower 2/2, Anger Management 1/1, Deep Wounds 3/3, Spearing Strike 1/1, Two-Handed Weapon Specialization 3/3, Impale 2/2, Bloodthrill 2/2, Sweeping Strikes 1/1, Weaponmaster 5/5, Improved Slam 2/2, Mortal Strike 1/1.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Arms Warrior Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Arms Warrior PVE Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:arms:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:cc3795f907595a5f68dbd003bf8acdb1b8eb71c8"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-armas-talentos-pve-2","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Armas: talentos PvE (2/2)","title_en":"Arms: PvE talents (2/2)","summary_es":"Build de daño PvE que conserva Golpe mortal.","summary_en":"PvE damage build that keeps Mortal Strike.","keywords_es":["talentos Armas PvE","build Guerrero Armas","Golpe mortal Armas"],"keywords_en":["Arms PvE talents","Arms Warrior build","Arms Mortal Strike"],"text_es":"Furia: Crueldad 5/5, Ira persistente 5/5, Enfurecer 5/5, Ejecutar mejorado 2/2. Protección: Sanguinario mejorado 2/2. La build invierte mucho en Armas para conservar Golpe mortal; Deseo de la Muerte exigiría renunciar a él. Enfurecer es flexible: si no recibes ataques, Voz retumbante ayuda a mantener gritos o Cólera desbocada a generar furia.","text_en":"Fury: Cruelty 5/5, Lingering Rage 5/5, Enrage 5/5, Improved Execute 2/2. Protection: Improved Bloodrage 2/2. The build invests heavily in Arms to keep Mortal Strike; Death Wish would require giving it up. Enrage is flexible: if you will not take attacks, Booming Voice supports shouts or Unbridled Wrath adds Rage.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Arms Warrior Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Arms Warrior PVE Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:arms:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:cc3795f907595a5f68dbd003bf8acdb1b8eb71c8"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-armas-talentos-pvp-1","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Armas: talentos JcJ (1/2)","title_en":"Arms: PvP talents (1/2)","summary_es":"Build JcJ de Armas que cambia mejora de Golpe heroico por supervivencia.","summary_en":"Arms PvP build that trades Heroic Strike improvements for survivability.","keywords_es":["talentos Armas JcJ","build PvP Guerrero Armas","Desvío Guerrero"],"keywords_en":["Arms PvP talents","Arms Warrior PvP build","Warrior Deflection"],"text_es":"Armas: Desvío 3/5, Desgarrar mejorado 3/3, Maestría táctica mejorada 3/3, Abrumar mejorado 2/2, Control de furia 1/1, Heridas profundas 3/3, Lanzazo 1/1, Especialización en armas de dos manos 3/3, Clavar 2/2, Fragor de la sangre 2/2, Golpes de barrido 1/1, Maestro de armas 5/5, Embate mejorado 2/2, Seccionar mejorado 3/3.","text_en":"Arms: Deflection 3/5, Improved Rend 3/3, Improved Tactical Mastery 3/3, Improved Overpower 2/2, Anger Management 1/1, Deep Wounds 3/3, Spearing Strike 1/1, Two-Handed Weapon Specialization 3/3, Impale 2/2, Bloodthrill 2/2, Sweeping Strikes 1/1, Weaponmaster 5/5, Improved Slam 2/2, Improved Hamstring 3/3.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Arms Warrior Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Arms Warrior PVP Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:arms:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:d0e1a506b0a8e6ad9bf7433f7696f730bfb09fe7"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-armas-talentos-pvp-2","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Armas: talentos JcJ (2/2)","title_en":"Arms: PvP talents (2/2)","summary_es":"Build JcJ de Armas que cambia mejora de Golpe heroico por supervivencia.","summary_en":"Arms PvP build that trades Heroic Strike improvements for survivability.","keywords_es":["talentos Armas JcJ","build PvP Guerrero Armas","Desvío Guerrero"],"keywords_en":["Arms PvP talents","Arms Warrior PvP build","Warrior Deflection"],"text_es":"Armas: Golpe mortal 1/1. Furia: Voz retumbante 5/5, Crueldad 5/5, Aullido penetrante 1/1, Enfurecer 5/5. La furia escasea en JcJ, así que Golpe heroico se usa poco y sus puntos pasan a Desvío. Lanzazo puede omitirse en campos de batalla; Enfurecer rinde más contra cuerpo a cuerpo que contra lanzadores.","text_en":"Arms: Mortal Strike 1/1. Fury: Booming Voice 5/5, Cruelty 5/5, Piercing Howl 1/1, Enrage 5/5. Rage is scarce in PvP, so Heroic Strike is rarely used and its points move to Deflection. Spearing Strike can be dropped for battlegrounds; Enrage is stronger against melee than casters.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Arms Warrior Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Arms Warrior PVP Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:arms:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:d0e1a506b0a8e6ad9bf7433f7696f730bfb09fe7"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-furia-talentos-raid","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Furia: talentos de banda","title_en":"Fury: Raid talents","summary_es":"Build de banda con Sed de sangre, Aluvión y Deseo de la Muerte.","summary_en":"Raid build with Bloodthirst, Flurry, and Death Wish.","keywords_es":["talentos Furia banda","build Guerrero Furia PvE","Deseo de la Muerte"],"keywords_en":["Fury raid talents","Fury Warrior PvE build","Fury Death Wish"],"text_es":"Armas: Golpe heroico mejorado 3/3, Desgarrar mejorado 3/3, Maestría táctica mejorada 3/3, Abrumar mejorado 2/2, Control de furia 1/1, Heridas profundas 3/3, Clavar 2/2. Furia: Crueldad 5/5, Cólera desbocada 5/5, Precisión furiosa 3/3, Enfurecer 4/5, Especialización en doble empuñadura 5/5, Golpes temerarios 1/1, Ejecutar mejorado 2/2, Ira rabiosa mejorada 2/2, Deseo de la Muerte 1/1, Torbellino mejorado 2/2, Aluvión 3/3, Sed de sangre 1/1. Maestría táctica mejorada y Abrumar mejorado aprovechan mejor la furia limitada; Clavar potencia los críticos.","text_en":"Arms: Improved Heroic Strike 3/3, Improved Rend 3/3, Improved Tactical Mastery 3/3, Improved Overpower 2/2, Anger Management 1/1, Deep Wounds 3/3, Impale 2/2. Fury: Cruelty 5/5, Unbridled Wrath 5/5, Furious Precision 3/3, Enrage 4/5, Dual Wield Specialization 5/5, Reckless Swings 1/1, Improved Execute 2/2, Improved Berserker Rage 2/2, Death Wish 1/1, Improved Whirlwind 2/2, Flurry 3/3, Bloodthirst 1/1. Improved Tactical Mastery and Improved Overpower make limited Rage go further; Impale boosts critical strikes.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Fury Warrior Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Fury Warrior PvE Raid Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/fury/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:fury:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:20d126321f16ce0eeb33fb5eb813f3ba5149b749"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-furia-talentos-mazmorra-1","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Furia: talentos de mazmorra (1/2)","title_en":"Fury: Dungeon talents (1/2)","summary_es":"Build de mazmorra que refuerza Enfurecer ante daño frecuente.","summary_en":"Dungeon build that strengthens Enrage against frequent damage.","keywords_es":["talentos Furia mazmorra","build Furia dungeons","Ira persistente Furia"],"keywords_en":["Fury dungeon talents","Fury dungeon build","Fury Lingering Rage"],"text_es":"Armas: Golpe heroico mejorado 3/3, Desgarrar mejorado 3/3, Maestría táctica mejorada 3/3, Abrumar mejorado 2/2, Control de furia 1/1, Heridas profundas 3/3, Clavar 2/2. Furia: Crueldad 5/5, Ira persistente 1/5, Cólera desbocada 5/5, Precisión furiosa 3/3, Enfurecer 5/5, Especialización en doble empuñadura 5/5.","text_en":"Arms: Improved Heroic Strike 3/3, Improved Rend 3/3, Improved Tactical Mastery 3/3, Improved Overpower 2/2, Anger Management 1/1, Deep Wounds 3/3, Impale 2/2. Fury: Cruelty 5/5, Lingering Rage 1/5, Unbridled Wrath 5/5, Furious Precision 3/3, Enrage 5/5, Dual Wield Specialization 5/5.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Fury Warrior Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Fury Warrior PvE Dungeon Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/fury/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:fury:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:8dd9ac0843806c40e574fd87a7a1d64a5f41c73e"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-furia-talentos-mazmorra-2","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Furia: talentos de mazmorra (2/2)","title_en":"Fury: Dungeon talents (2/2)","summary_es":"Build de mazmorra que refuerza Enfurecer ante daño frecuente.","summary_en":"Dungeon build that strengthens Enrage against frequent damage.","keywords_es":["talentos Furia mazmorra","build Furia dungeons","Ira persistente Furia"],"keywords_en":["Fury dungeon talents","Fury dungeon build","Fury Lingering Rage"],"text_es":"Furia: Golpes temerarios 1/1, Ejecutar mejorado 2/2, Deseo de la Muerte 1/1, Torbellino mejorado 2/2, Aluvión 3/3, Sed de sangre 1/1. Omite Ira rabiosa mejorada, menos útil ante enemigos de nivel bajo y al guardar furia entre grupos; maximiza Enfurecer para aprovechar el daño frecuente en mazmorras.","text_en":"Fury: Reckless Swings 1/1, Improved Execute 2/2, Death Wish 1/1, Improved Whirlwind 2/2, Flurry 3/3, Bloodthirst 1/1. It skips Improved Berserker Rage, less useful against lower-level mobs and when saving Rage between packs; it maximizes Enrage for frequent dungeon damage.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Fury Warrior Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Fury Warrior PvE Dungeon Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/fury/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:fury:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:8dd9ac0843806c40e574fd87a7a1d64a5f41c73e"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-furia-talentos-pvp-1","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Furia: talentos JcJ (1/2)","title_en":"Fury: PvP talents (1/2)","summary_es":"Build JcJ de Furia con aguante, movilidad y control.","summary_en":"Fury PvP build with sustain, mobility, and control.","keywords_es":["talentos Furia JcJ","build PvP Guerrero Furia","Intercepción mejorada"],"keywords_en":["Fury PvP talents","Fury Warrior PvP build","Improved Intercept"],"text_es":"Armas: Desvío 3/5, Desgarrar mejorado 3/3, Maestría táctica mejorada 3/3, Abrumar mejorado 2/2, Control de furia 1/1, Heridas profundas 3/3, Clavar 2/2. Furia: Voz retumbante 5/5, Crueldad 5/5, Precisión furiosa 1/3, Aullido penetrante 1/1, Manía sangrienta 3/3, Enfurecer 5/5, Golpes temerarios 1/1, Ira rabiosa mejorada 2/2.","text_en":"Arms: Deflection 3/5, Improved Rend 3/3, Improved Tactical Mastery 3/3, Improved Overpower 2/2, Anger Management 1/1, Deep Wounds 3/3, Impale 2/2. Fury: Booming Voice 5/5, Cruelty 5/5, Furious Precision 1/3, Piercing Howl 1/1, Blood Craze 3/3, Enrage 5/5, Reckless Swings 1/1, Improved Berserker Rage 2/2.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Fury Warrior Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Fury Warrior PvP Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/fury/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:fury:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:30926ec8c1fd5fc1e111d0dc61ea65449911a4eb"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-furia-talentos-pvp-2","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Furia: talentos JcJ (2/2)","title_en":"Fury: PvP talents (2/2)","summary_es":"Build JcJ de Furia con aguante, movilidad y control.","summary_en":"Fury PvP build with sustain, mobility, and control.","keywords_es":["talentos Furia JcJ","build PvP Guerrero Furia","Intercepción mejorada"],"keywords_en":["Fury PvP talents","Fury Warrior PvP build","Improved Intercept"],"text_es":"Furia: Deseo de la Muerte 1/1, Bebedor de entrañas 2/2, Intercepción mejorada 2/2, Torbellino mejorado 2/2, Aluvión 3/3, Sed de sangre 1/1. Aunque Furia es más débil que Armas en JcJ, la build añade aguante, permite quitar raíces y ralentizaciones con Ira rabiosa mejorada y acorta la reutilización de Interceptar.","text_en":"Fury: Death Wish 1/1, Gore Drinker 2/2, Improved Intercept 2/2, Improved Whirlwind 2/2, Flurry 3/3, Bloodthirst 1/1. In PvP, this build is weaker than Arms but adds sustain, removes roots and slows with Improved Berserker Rage, and reduces Intercept cooldown.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Fury Warrior Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Fury Warrior PvP Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/fury/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:fury:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:30926ec8c1fd5fc1e111d0dc61ea65449911a4eb"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-proteccion-talentos-raid-estandar","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Protección: talentos de banda estándar","title_en":"Protection: Standard raid talents","summary_es":"Build estándar que equilibra defensa y amenaza.","summary_en":"Standard build balancing defense and threat.","keywords_es":["talentos Protección banda","build tanque Guerrero","amenaza y defensa Protección"],"keywords_en":["Protection raid talents","Warrior tank build","Protection threat and defense"],"text_es":"Armas: Desvío 4/5. Furia: Crueldad 5/5, Cólera desbocada 5/5, Enfurecer 5/5. Protección: Especialización en escudos 5/5, Anticipación 5/5, Revancha mejorada 3/3, Última posición 1/1, Maestro de defensa 2/2, Desafío 3/3, Vanguardia 1/1, Muro de escudo mejorado 2/2, Golpe de concusión 1/1, Ira enfocada 3/3, Bastión 5/5, Embate con escudo 1/1. Es la opción general equilibrada entre defensa y amenaza. Ira enfocada mejora daño y amenaza; Desvío y Golpe heroico mejorado compiten por preferencia.","text_en":"Arms: Deflection 4/5. Fury: Cruelty 5/5, Unbridled Wrath 5/5, Enrage 5/5. Protection: Shield Specialization 5/5, Anticipation 5/5, Improved Revenge 3/3, Last Stand 1/1, Master of Defense 2/2, Defiance 3/3, Vanguard 1/1, Improved Shield Wall 2/2, Concussion Blow 1/1, Focused Rage 3/3, Bastion 5/5, Shield Slam 1/1. This is the general balanced option for defense and threat. Focused Rage improves damage and threat; Deflection and Improved Heroic Strike compete as a matter of preference.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Protection Warrior Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Standard Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/talent-builds-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topic