rotection/talent-builds-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:protection:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:e5d76a7ca689aee3281877fcc7b08504de22aa85"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-proteccion-talentos-raid-fury-prot-1","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Protección: talentos Furia-Protección (1/2) (bandas)","title_en":"Protection: Fury-Prot talents (1/2) (raids)","summary_es":"Variante que sacrifica algo de defensa a cambio de daño.","summary_en":"Variant trading some defense for damage.","keywords_es":["Furia Protección banda","build fury prot Guerrero","tanque más ofensivo"],"keywords_en":["Fury-Prot raid build","Warrior fury prot build","offensive tank"],"text_es":"Armas: Golpe heroico mejorado 3/3. Furia: Crueldad 5/5, Cólera desbocada 5/5, Aullido penetrante 1/1, Manía sangrienta 3/3, Enfurecer 5/5, Golpes temerarios 1/1, Ejecutar mejorado 2/2, Ira rabiosa mejorada 2/2, Deseo de la Muerte 1/1, Bebedor de entrañas 2/2, Aluvión 3/3, Sed de sangre 1/1. Protección: Especialización en escudos 5/5.","text_en":"Arms: Improved Heroic Strike 3/3. Fury: Cruelty 5/5, Unbridled Wrath 5/5, Piercing Howl 1/1, Blood Craze 3/3, Enrage 5/5, Reckless Swings 1/1, Improved Execute 2/2, Improved Berserker Rage 2/2, Death Wish 1/1, Gore Drinker 2/2, Flurry 3/3, Bloodthirst 1/1. Protection: Shield Specialization 5/5.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Protection Warrior Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Fury-prot Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/talent-builds-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:protection:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:3e4f0c7fc199f2edc54bac93a8f0801ee2e68736"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-proteccion-talentos-raid-fury-prot-2","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Protección: talentos Furia-Protección (2/2) (bandas)","title_en":"Protection: Fury-Prot talents (2/2) (raids)","summary_es":"Variante que sacrifica algo de defensa a cambio de daño.","summary_en":"Variant trading some defense for damage.","keywords_es":["Furia Protección banda","build fury prot Guerrero","tanque más ofensivo"],"keywords_en":["Fury-Prot raid build","Warrior fury prot build","offensive tank"],"text_es":"Protección: Anticipación 2/5, Revancha mejorada 3/3, Última posición 1/1, Maestro de defensa 2/2, Desafío 3/3, Vanguardia 1/1. Hace más daño y escala mejor con Aluvión a costa de algo de supervivencia; es más adecuada con equipo superior. En mazmorras se puede incluir Bebedor de entrañas quitando puntos de Ira rabiosa mejorada o Ejecutar mejorado.","text_en":"Protection: Anticipation 2/5, Improved Revenge 3/3, Last Stand 1/1, Master of Defense 2/2, Defiance 3/3, Vanguard 1/1. It deals more damage and scales better with Flurry at the cost of survivability; it suits a somewhat overgeared character. In dungeons, Gore Drinker can replace Improved Berserker Rage or Improved Execute.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Protection Warrior Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Fury-prot Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/talent-builds-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:protection:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:3e4f0c7fc199f2edc54bac93a8f0801ee2e68736"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-proteccion-talentos-raid-doble-arma","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Protección: talentos de banda con doble empuñadura","title_en":"Protection: Dual-Wield raid talents","summary_es":"Variante con dos armas para enemigos con ataques no bloqueables.","summary_en":"Dual-wield variant for enemies with unblockable attacks.","keywords_es":["Protección doble empuñadura","tanque dos armas Guerrero","ataques no bloqueables"],"keywords_en":["Protection dual wield","Warrior dual-wield tank","unblockable attacks"],"text_es":"Armas: Golpe heroico mejorado 3/3, Desvío 5/5, Desgarrar mejorado 3/3, Maestría táctica mejorada 3/3, Control de furia 1/1, Heridas profundas 3/3, Clavar 2/2. Furia: Crueldad 5/5, Cólera desbocada 5/5, Precisión furiosa 3/3, Enfurecer 5/5, Especialización en doble empuñadura 5/5, Golpes temerarios 1/1, Ejecutar mejorado 2/2, Deseo de la Muerte 1/1, Aluvión 3/3, Sed de sangre 1/1. Solo sirve contra enemigos con ataques no bloqueables. En un jefe normal aumenta un 50% el daño recibido y reduce la amenaza, a cambio de alrededor de un 15% más de daño infligido.","text_en":"Arms: Improved Heroic Strike 3/3, Deflection 5/5, Improved Rend 3/3, Improved Tactical Mastery 3/3, Anger Management 1/1, Deep Wounds 3/3, Impale 2/2. Fury: Cruelty 5/5, Unbridled Wrath 5/5, Furious Precision 3/3, Enrage 5/5, Dual Wield Specialization 5/5, Reckless Swings 1/1, Improved Execute 2/2, Death Wish 1/1, Flurry 3/3, Bloodthirst 1/1. It is only for enemies with unblockable attacks. Against a normal boss it increases damage taken by 50% and lowers threat in exchange for about 15% more damage dealt.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Protection Warrior Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Dual Wield Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/talent-builds-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:protection:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:c4ab3e82e109253f40107d580110cb028040a952"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-proteccion-talentos-mazmorra-estandar","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Protección: talentos de mazmorra estándar","title_en":"Protection: Standard dungeon talents","summary_es":"Build profunda para tanquear en actitud defensiva en mazmorras.","summary_en":"Deep build for dungeon tanking in Defensive Stance.","keywords_es":["Protección talentos mazmorra","build tanque mazmorra","Protección actitud defensiva"],"keywords_en":["Protection dungeon talents","dungeon tank build","Protection Defensive Stance"],"text_es":"Armas: Desvío 4/5. Furia: Crueldad 5/5, Cólera desbocada 5/5, Enfurecer 5/5. Protección: Especialización en escudos 5/5, Anticipación 2/5, Revancha mejorada 3/3, Trueno mejorado 3/3, Última posición 1/1, Maestro de defensa 2/2, Desafío 3/3, Vanguardia 1/1, Muro de escudo mejorado 2/2, Golpe de concusión 1/1, Ira enfocada 3/3, Bastión 5/5, Embate con escudo 1/1. Facilita permanecer en Actitud defensiva y mantener Enfurecer contra varios enemigos. Para ralentizar en área mientras huyes, puedes mover un punto de Desvío a Aullido penetrante.","text_en":"Arms: Deflection 4/5. Fury: Cruelty 5/5, Unbridled Wrath 5/5, Enrage 5/5. Protection: Shield Specialization 5/5, Anticipation 2/5, Improved Revenge 3/3, Improved Thunder Clap 3/3, Last Stand 1/1, Master of Defense 2/2, Defiance 3/3, Vanguard 1/1, Improved Shield Wall 2/2, Concussion Blow 1/1, Focused Rage 3/3, Bastion 5/5, Shield Slam 1/1. It supports staying in Defensive Stance and maintaining Enrage against several enemies. For an area slow while kiting, move one Deflection point to Piercing Howl.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Protection Warrior Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Protection Warrior PvE Dungeon Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/talent-builds-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:protection:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:1ad251111b57b621f1e1ef5ce8801606eb82e4fc"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-proteccion-talentos-mazmorra-area-1","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Protección: talentos de mazmorra de área (1/2)","title_en":"Protection: AoE dungeon talents (1/2)","summary_es":"Build de tanque con Golpes de barrido para extender Revancha y Mellar.","summary_en":"Tank build using Sweeping Strikes to spread Revenge and Cleave.","keywords_es":["Protección daño en área","Golpes de barrido tanque","Mellar Revancha Guerrero"],"keywords_en":["Protection AoE damage","tank Sweeping Strikes","Warrior Cleave Revenge"],"text_es":"Armas: Golpe heroico mejorado 3/3, Desvío 5/5, Desgarrar mejorado 3/3, Maestría táctica mejorada 3/3, Control de furia 1/1, Heridas profundas 3/3, Clavar 2/2, Golpes de barrido 1/1, Maestro de armas 5/5, Embate mejorado 2/2. Furia: Crueldad 5/5. Protección: Especialización en escudos 5/5, Revancha mejorada 3/3.","text_en":"Arms: Improved Heroic Strike 3/3, Deflection 5/5, Improved Rend 3/3, Improved Tactical Mastery 3/3, Anger Management 1/1, Deep Wounds 3/3, Impale 2/2, Sweeping Strikes 1/1, Weaponmaster 5/5, Improved Slam 2/2. Fury: Cruelty 5/5. Protection: Shield Specialization 5/5, Improved Revenge 3/3.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Protection Warrior Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Protection Warrior PvE Dungeon Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/talent-builds-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:protection:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:1ad251111b57b621f1e1ef5ce8801606eb82e4fc"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-proteccion-talentos-mazmorra-area-2","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Protección: talentos de mazmorra de área (2/2)","title_en":"Protection: AoE dungeon talents (2/2)","summary_es":"Build de tanque con Golpes de barrido para extender Revancha y Mellar.","summary_en":"Tank build using Sweeping Strikes to spread Revenge and Cleave.","keywords_es":["Protección daño en área","Golpes de barrido tanque","Mellar Revancha Guerrero"],"keywords_en":["Protection AoE damage","tank Sweeping Strikes","Warrior Cleave Revenge"],"text_es":"Protección: Trueno mejorado 3/3, Última posición 1/1, Maestro de defensa 2/2, Desafío 3/3, Vanguardia 1/1. Golpes de barrido extiende Revancha y Mellar: un Mellar puede golpear cuatro veces en total, no dos. Requiere cambiar de actitud, pero es la build de tanque con más daño y se beneficia de un arma lenta.","text_en":"Protection: Improved Thunder Clap 3/3, Last Stand 1/1, Master of Defense 2/2, Defiance 3/3, Vanguard 1/1. Sweeping Strikes spreads Revenge and Cleave: one Cleave can hit four times total, not two. It requires stance dancing, but is the highest-damage tank build and benefits from a slow weapon.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Protection Warrior Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Protection Warrior PvE Dungeon Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/talent-builds-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:protection:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:1ad251111b57b621f1e1ef5ce8801606eb82e4fc"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-proteccion-talentos-pvp","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Protección: talentos JcJ","title_en":"Protection: PvP talents","summary_es":"Build JcJ con aturdimiento, silencio, desarme y aguante.","summary_en":"PvP build with stun, silence, disarm, and sustain.","keywords_es":["talentos Protección JcJ","build PvP Guerrero tanque","Desarmar mejorado Protección"],"keywords_en":["Protection PvP talents","Warrior tank PvP build","Protection Improved Disarm"],"text_es":"Furia: Crueldad 5/5, Cólera desbocada 5/5, Aullido penetrante 1/1, Manía sangrienta 3/3, Enfurecer 5/5. Protección: Especialización en escudos 5/5, Voluntad férrea 5/5, Revancha mejorada 3/3, Última posición 1/1, Maestro de defensa 2/2, Desarmar mejorado 3/3, Vanguardia 1/1, Azote de escudo mejorado 2/2, Golpe de concusión 1/1, Ira enfocada 3/3, Bastión 5/5, Embate con escudo 1/1. Destaca en duelos contra cuerpo a cuerpo; controla con aturdimiento de 5 s, silencio de 3 s y Desactivar cada 40 s. Embate con escudo disipa magia y Manía sangrienta aporta autocuración.","text_en":"Fury: Cruelty 5/5, Unbridled Wrath 5/5, Piercing Howl 1/1, Blood Craze 3/3, Enrage 5/5. Protection: Shield Specialization 5/5, Iron Will 5/5, Improved Revenge 3/3, Last Stand 1/1, Master of Defense 2/2, Improved Disarm 3/3, Vanguard 1/1, Improved Shield Bash 2/2, Concussion Blow 1/1, Focused Rage 3/3, Bastion 5/5, Shield Slam 1/1. It excels in duels against melee; it controls with a 5-second stun, 3-second silence, and Disarm every 40 seconds. Shield Slam dispels magic, and Blood Craze provides self-healing.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Protection Warrior Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Protection Warrior PvP Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/talent-builds-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:protection:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:4b1b8219a698e5db02374eb1808b71dabb1b6434"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-armas-talentos-subida","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Armas: talentos para subir de nivel","title_en":"Arms: leveling talents","summary_es":"Build de 51 puntos de Armas para subir de nivel.","summary_en":"51-point Arms build for leveling.","keywords_es":["talentos Armas para subir","build Guerrero leveo Armas","Embestir mejorado Guerrero"],"keywords_en":["Arms leveling talents","Arms leveling build","Improved Charge Warrior"],"text_es":"Armas: Desvío 5/5, Desgarrar mejorado 3/3, Embestir mejorado 2/2, Maestría táctica mejorada 3/3, Abrumar mejorado 2/2, Control de furia 1/1, Heridas profundas 3/3, Especialización en armas de dos manos 3/3, Clavar 2/2, Fragor de la sangre 2/2, Golpes de barrido 1/1, Maestro de armas 5/5, Embate mejorado 2/2, Golpe mortal 1/1. Furia: Crueldad 5/5, Ira persistente 5/5, Aullido penetrante 1/1, Enfurecer 5/5. Para subir, omite Sanguinario mejorado y Golpe heroico mejorado: Golpe heroico gasta y frena la furia, mientras Sanguinario convierte furia en salud de forma ineficiente.","text_en":"Arms: Deflection 5/5, Improved Rend 3/3, Improved Charge 2/2, Improved Tactical Mastery 3/3, Improved Overpower 2/2, Anger Management 1/1, Deep Wounds 3/3, Two-Handed Weapon Specialization 3/3, Impale 2/2, Bloodthrill 2/2, Sweeping Strikes 1/1, Weaponmaster 5/5, Improved Slam 2/2, Mortal Strike 1/1. Fury: Cruelty 5/5, Lingering Rage 5/5, Piercing Howl 1/1, Enrage 5/5. For leveling, skip Improved Bloodrage and Improved Heroic Strike: Heroic Strike spends and stops Rage generation, while Bloodrage converts Rage to health inefficiently.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Arms Warrior Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Arms Warrior Leveling Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:arms:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:effba622a066684f324b0597eef88936f72d40d4"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-armas-build-subir-wowhead","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build de subida de Armas","title_en":"Arms Leveling Build","summary_es":"Build de subida de Armas con talentos de las ramas Armas y Furia.","summary_en":"Arms leveling build with talents from the Arms and Fury trees.","keywords_es":["build de subida Armas","talentos Armas 1-60","build Guerrero para subir"],"keywords_en":["Arms leveling build","Arms talents 1-60","Warrior leveling build"],"text_es":"Armas: Desvío 5/5, Desgarrar mejorado 3/3, Embestir mejorado 2/2, Maestría táctica mejorada 3/3, Abrumar mejorado 2/2, Control de furia 1/1, Heridas profundas 3/3, Lanzazo 1/1, Especialización en armas de dos manos 3/3, Clavar 2/2, Fragor de la sangre 2/2, Golpes de barrido 1/1, Maestro de armas 5/5, Embate mejorado 2/2 y Golpe mortal 1/1. Furia: Crueldad 5/5, Ira persistente 5/5 y Enfurecer 5/5.","text_en":"Arms: Deflection 5/5, Improved Rend 3/3, Improved Charge 2/2, Improved Tactical Mastery 3/3, Improved Overpower 2/2, Anger Management 1/1, Deep Wounds 3/3, Spearing Strike 1/1, Two-Handed Weapon Specialization 3/3, Impale 2/2, Bloodthrill 2/2, Sweeping Strikes 1/1, Weaponmaster 5/5, Improved Slam 2/2, and Mortal Strike 1/1. Fury: Cruelty 5/5, Lingering Rage 5/5, and Enrage 5/5.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior Leveling Guide  - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Arms Warrior DPS in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-15"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:arms:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:dd7ba003c5e6818f2bde2adf5fc132f4f296978c"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-furia-build-subir-pve-armas","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build de subida de Furia (Armas)","title_en":"Fury Leveling Build (Arms)","summary_es":"Talentos de Armas para la build de subida de Furia de 16/35/0.","summary_en":"Arms talents for the 16/35/0 Fury leveling build.","keywords_es":["build subida Furia rama Armas","talentos Armas Furia leveo","Furia 16 35 0"],"keywords_en":["Fury leveling Arms build","Fury Arms talents leveling","Fury 16 35 0"],"text_es":"Armas: Golpe heroico mejorado 2/3, Desgarrar mejorado 3/3, Maestría táctica mejorada 3/3, Abrumar mejorado 2/2, Control de furia 1/1 y Heridas profundas 3/3.","text_en":"Arms: Improved Heroic Strike 2/3, Improved Rend 3/3, Improved Tactical Mastery 3/3, Improved Overpower 2/2, Anger Management 1/1, and Deep Wounds 3/3.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: WoW: Forever Fury Warrior Leveling and PvE Guide › The build: Fury Leveling and PvE (16/35/0)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/wow-forever-fury-warrior-leveling-and-pve-guide-35029","date":"2026-10-20"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:extra:wow-forever-fury-warrior-leveling-and-pve-guide"],"source_hashes":["section:a25783a78348023d064550f019a484b59cd79c18"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-furia-build-subir-pve-furia","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build de subida de Furia (Furia)","title_en":"Fury Leveling Build (Fury)","summary_es":"Talentos de Furia para la build de subida 16/35/0.","summary_en":"Fury talents for the 16/35/0 leveling build.","keywords_es":