proved Thunder Clap 3/3, Last Stand 1/1, Master of Defense 2/2, Defiance 3/3, Vanguard 1/1, Improved Shield Wall 2/2, Concussion Blow 1/1, Focused Rage 3/3, Bastion 5/5, and Shield Slam 1/1.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Protection Warrior Tank in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:protection:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:af995e062014605042edf9e56de75be041d3d1fe"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-proteccion-build-subir-alternativa-armas","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build de subida de Protección: Armas","title_en":"Protection Leveling Build: Arms","summary_es":"Talentos de Armas de la alternativa de Protección centrada en cleave.","summary_en":"Arms talents in the cleave-focused Protection alternative.","keywords_es":["Protección build subida Armas","talentos Armas tanque leveo","Golpes de barrido Protección"],"keywords_en":["Protection Arms leveling build","Arms talents tank leveling","Protection Sweeping Strikes"],"text_es":"Armas: Golpe heroico mejorado 3/3, Desvío 5/5, Desgarrar mejorado 3/3, Maestría táctica mejorada 3/3, Control de furia 1/1, Heridas profundas 3/3, Clavar 2/2, Golpes de barrido 1/1, Maestro de armas 5/5 y Embate mejorado 2/2.","text_en":"Arms: Improved Heroic Strike 3/3, Deflection 5/5, Improved Rend 3/3, Improved Tactical Mastery 3/3, Anger Management 1/1, Deep Wounds 3/3, Impale 2/2, Sweeping Strikes 1/1, Weaponmaster 5/5, and Improved Slam 2/2.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Protection Warrior Tank in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:protection:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:af995e062014605042edf9e56de75be041d3d1fe"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-proteccion-build-subir-alternativa-furia","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build de subida de Protección: Furia y Protección","title_en":"Protection Leveling Build: Fury and Protection","summary_es":"Talentos de Furia y Protección de la alternativa de cleave.","summary_en":"Fury and Protection talents in the cleave-focused alternative.","keywords_es":["build Protección Furia","talentos Protección subida alternativa","Crueldad tanque Guerrero"],"keywords_en":["Protection Fury build","Protection alternative leveling talents","Warrior tank Cruelty"],"text_es":"Furia: Crueldad 5/5. Protección: Especialización en escudos 5/5, Revancha mejorada 3/3, Trueno mejorado 3/3, Última posición 1/1, Maestro de defensa 2/2, Desafío 3/3 y Vanguardia 1/1.","text_en":"Fury: Cruelty 5/5. Protection: Shield Specialization 5/5, Improved Revenge 3/3, Improved Thunder Clap 3/3, Last Stand 1/1, Master of Defense 2/2, Defiance 3/3, and Vanguard 1/1.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Protection Warrior Tank in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:protection:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:af995e062014605042edf9e56de75be041d3d1fe"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-habilidades-entrenar-armas","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Habilidades que entrenar: Armas","title_en":"Abilities to Train: Arms","summary_es":"Prioriza los rangos esenciales de Armas y ahorra en facultades opcionales.","summary_en":"Prioritize essential Arms ranks and save gold on optional abilities.","keywords_es":["habilidades entrenar Armas","rangos Armas Guerrero","ahorrar oro entrenador Armas"],"keywords_en":["Arms abilities to train","Warrior Arms ranks","save gold Arms trainer"],"text_es":"Entrena los rangos de Golpe heroico, Grito de guerra, Embestir, Desgarrar, Hender armadura, Abrumar, Mellar y Golpe mortal; aprende Ataque de la victoria y Temeridad. Trueno, Seccionar, Grito desmoralizador y Falsa arremetida son opcionales y puedes saltarte sus rangos para ahorrar oro.","text_en":"Train the ranks of Heroic Strike, Battle Shout, Charge, Rend, Sunder Armor, Overpower, Cleave, and Mortal Strike; learn Victory Rush and Recklessness. Thunder Clap, Hamstring, Demoralizing Shout, and Mocking Blow are optional, and you can skip their ranks to save gold.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior Leveling Guide  - WoW: Forever › Mandatory Abilities to Train for Arms Warrior","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior Leveling Guide  - WoW: Forever › Optional Abilities to Train for Arms Warrior","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-15"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:arms:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:1c25e003ba1bffe75d7fee38f86dd473b2f6a332","section:91e6054df3a6e6bb797bc953f8dc6aea6292b7ee"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-habilidades-entrenar-furia","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Habilidades que entrenar: Furia","title_en":"Abilities to Train: Fury","summary_es":"Furia prioriza Desgarrar, Abrumar, Grito de guerra y Zurrar.","summary_en":"Fury prioritizes Rend, Overpower, Battle Shout, and Pummel.","keywords_es":["habilidades entrenar Furia","rangos Guerrero Furia","entrenar Zurrar Guerrero"],"keywords_en":["Fury abilities to train","Fury Warrior ranks","train Warrior Pummel"],"text_es":"Como esenciales, entrena Desgarrar, Abrumar, Grito de guerra y Zurrar (un rango). Falsa arremetida, Mellar, Embate y Trueno son opcionales; puedes prescindir de algunos rangos según tu estilo y ahorrar oro.","text_en":"Train Rend, Overpower, Battle Shout, and one rank of Pummel as core abilities. Mocking Blow, Cleave, Slam, and Thunder Clap are optional; skip some ranks depending on your playstyle to save gold.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fury Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Mandatory Abilities to Train for Fury Warrior","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/fury/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-07"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fury Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Optional Abilities to Train for Fury Warrior","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/fury/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-07"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:fury:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:4fbdda66e2c1f4c4395c8dbfabc49559c8396b44","section:9896b463388e4a01390a80f605d8ab1a8ce8afe8"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-habilidades-entrenar-proteccion","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Habilidades que entrenar: Protección","title_en":"Abilities to Train: Protection","summary_es":"Protección prioriza los gritos, Revancha, Bloquear con escudo y Embate con escudo.","summary_en":"Protection prioritizes Shouts, Revenge, Shield Block, and Shield Slam.","keywords_es":["habilidades entrenar Protección","rangos tanque Guerrero","entrenar Revancha escudo"],"keywords_en":["Protection abilities to train","Warrior tank ranks","train Revenge Shield Block"],"text_es":"Entrena Golpe heroico, Grito de guerra, Embestir, Desgarrar, Trueno, Hender armadura, Revancha, Grito desmoralizador, Bloquear con escudo, Mellar, Ataque de la victoria y Embate con escudo. Desactivar, Embate, Grito intimidador, Abrumar, Huracán y Zurrar son opcionales y sus rangos se pueden omitir para ahorrar.","text_en":"Train Heroic Strike, Battle Shout, Charge, Rend, Thunder Clap, Sunder Armor, Revenge, Demoralizing Shout, Shield Block, Cleave, Victory Rush, and Shield Slam. Disarm, Slam, Intimidating Shout, Overpower, Whirlwind, and Pummel are optional, and their ranks can be skipped to save gold.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Mandatory Abilities to Train for Protection Warrior","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Optional Abilities to Train for Protection Warrior","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:protection:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:2c64089c5c27f6503e330b5d26e9956ec7aa80cb","section:e6d673cb048ff24093997836994c87b743d5dbae"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-profesiones-subida-forever","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Profesiones útiles al subir","title_en":"Useful Leveling Professions","summary_es":"Minería, Herrería, Peletería y Desollar ofrecen distintas ventajas durante la subida.","summary_en":"Mining, Blacksmithing, Leatherworking, and Skinning offer different leveling benefits.","keywords_es":["profesiones Guerrero subida","Peletería Tienda de campamento","Desollar oro subir","Minería y Herrería Guerrero"],"keywords_en":["Warrior leveling professions","Leatherworking Camp Tent","Skinning leveling gold","Warrior Mining Blacksmithing"],"text_es":"Minería y Herrería combinan: los materiales permiten fabricar mejoras de equipo y vender armas. Para acelerar la subida, Peletería a nivel 20 habilita Tienda de campamento, que aporta experiencia descansada; no hace falta subirla más si no te interesa. Desollar también da oro pronto con poco esfuerzo.","text_en":"Mining pairs with Blacksmithing: gathered materials can become gear upgrades, and crafted weapons can be sold. To level faster, Leatherworking at skill 20 unlocks Camp Tent for rested experience; there is little reason to level it further if that is your only goal. Skinning also provides early gold with little effort.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior Leveling Guide  - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Professions for Arms Warrior DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fury Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Professions for Fury Warrior DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/fury/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-07"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:arms:leveling","class:warrior:fury:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:02bf871bca6a297024033b4df7710517e23c8634","section:99d78fd7d07e34e28aebc61d0b756e12f1414bb0"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-consumibles-subida-comida","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Comida y consumibles para subir","title_en":"Food and Consumables for Leveling","summary_es":"La comida aporta experiencia por muertes; las pociones y piedras ayudan en combate.","summary_en":"Food grants kill experience; potions and sharpening stones help in combat.","keywords_es":["comida Guerrero experiencia","consumibles de subida Guerrero","Pargo de lodo boquilargo","piedra de afilar Guerrero"],"keywords_en":["Warrior food experience","Warrior leveling consumables","Longjaw Mud Snapper","Warrior sharpening stone"],"text_es":"Mantén un beneficio de comida: la comida otorga un 5% más de experiencia al matar enemigos. Pargo de lodo boquilargo es una opción barata y temprana que además da 10 de poder de ataque. En tu primer personaje, prioriza pociones de curación para emergencias; las piedras de afilar o de peso también aumentan el daño.","text_en":"Keep a food buff active: food grants 5% more experience from kills. Longjaw Mud Snapper is an inexpensive early option that also gives 10 Attack Power. On your first character, prioritize Healing Potions for emergencies; sharpening or weightstones also increase damage.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fury Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Consumables for Fury Warrior DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/fury/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-07"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Consumables for Protection Warrior Tank in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:fury:leveling","class:warrior:protection:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:27e90d55933440b4e9b3bb6d36b9d24ef6249359","section:3b42332d7eb3f16b1b3a348e27b7ed13458597c3"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-armas-ruta-talentos-subida","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Prioridad de talentos de Armas al subir","title_en":"Arms Talent Priorities While Leveling","summary_es":"La build de subida potencia la furia, la supervivencia y sus ataques clave.","summary_en":"The leveling build improves Rage, survivability, and key attacks.","keywords_es":["ruta talentos Armas subir","prioridad de talentos Armas","Embate mejorado build subir"],"keywords_en":["Arms leveling talent path","Arms talent priorities","Improved Slam leveling build"],"text_es":"La build de subida prioriza Desvío 5/5 para aguantar, Abrumar mejorado 2/2, Fragor de la sangre 2/2 y Embate mejorado 2/2 para elevar el daño; Golpe mortal 1/1 es otro salto importante. No uses Embate hasta tener Embate mejorado, que lo incorpora a la rotación.","text_en":"The leveling build prioritizes Deflection 5/5 for survivability, Improved Overpower 2/2, Bloodthrill 2/2, and Improved Slam 2/2 for damage; Mortal Strike 1/1 is another major spike. Avoid Slam until you have Improved Slam, which brings it into the rotation.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior Leveling Guide  - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Arms Warrior DPS in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-15"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:arms:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:dd7ba003c5e6818f2bde2adf5fc132f4f296978c"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-furia-ruta-talentos-subida","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Prioridad de talentos de Furia al subir","title_en":"Fury Talent Priorities While Leveling","summary_es":"Sed de sangre y Bebedor de entrañas reducen el tiempo de inactividad.","summary_en":"Bloodthirst and Gore Drinker reduce downtime.","keywords_es":["ruta talentos Furia subir","prioridad de talentos Furia","Bebedor de entrañas y Sed de sangre"],"keywords_en":["Fury leveling talent path","Fury talent priorities","Gore Drinker and Bloodthirst"],"text_es":"Avanza pronto por Furia para obtener Bebedor de entrañas 2/2 y Sed de sangre 1/1, talentos centrales para reducir las pausas. Después completa Aluvión 3/3 para aprovechar los críticos; luego pasa a Armas por Desvío 5/5, Desgarrar mejorado 3/3 y Abrumar mejorado 2/2.","text_en":"Move quickly through Fury to reach Gore Drinker 2/2 and Bloodthirst 1/1, core talents for reducing downtime. Then complete Flurry 3/3 to benefit from critical strikes, before moving into Arms for Deflection 5/5, Improved Rend 3/3, and Improved Overpower 2/2.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fury Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Fury Warrior DPS in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/fury/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-07"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:fury:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:60912d4380d6d5944b83c7f828b03ad767e7af08"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-proteccion-rutas-talentos-subida","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rutas de talentos de Protección al subir","title_en":"Protection Leveling Talent Routes","summary_es":"Protección profunda es más relajada; Armas añade complejidad y Furia, autosuficiencia.","summary_en":"Deep Protection is more relaxed; Arms adds complexity and Fury adds self-sufficiency.","keywords_es":["rutas talentos Protección leveo","Protección profunda subir","build Armas Protección experto","talentos Furia Protección"],"keywords_en":["Protection leveling talent routes","deep Protection leveling","experienced Arms Protection build","Fury Protection talents"],"text_es":"La ruta profunda de Protección es la recomendada para la mayoría por su estilo más relajado. La alternativa de Armas añade daño contra varios enemigos y cambios de actitud, con más complejidad para guerreros experimentados. También puedes elegir Furia para sumar daño y autosuficiencia más adelante.","text_en":"The deep Protection route is recommended for most players because it offers a more relaxed style. The Arms alternative adds cleave and stance switching, making it more complex and suited to experienced Warriors. Fury is another option for adding damage and self-sufficiency later on.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Protection Warrior Tank in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:protection:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:af995e062014605042edf9e56de75be041d3d1fe"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-furia-hitos-subida","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Hitos de subida de Furia","title_en":"Fury Leveling Milestones","summary_es":"Actitud rabiosa llega a 30; Huracán a 36 y Sed de sangre a 40.","summary_en":"Berserker Stance arrives at 30; Whirlwind at 36 and Bloodthirst at 40.","keywords_es":["hitos Furia subir","nivel Huracán Guerrero","nivel Sed de sangre Furia","Golpes temerarios nivel 31"],"keywords_en":["Fury leveling milestones","Warrior Whirlwind level","Fury Bloodthirst level","Reckless Swings level 31"],"text_es":"A nivel 30, completa la misión de clase para Actitud rabiosa y alcanza Deseo de la Muerte; a 36 aprende Huracán, y a 40, Sed de sangre. Temeridad se entrena a 50.","text_en":"At level 30, complete the class quest for Berserker Stance and reach Death Wish; learn Whirlwind at 36 and Bloodthirst at 40. Train Recklessness at 50.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: WoW: Forever Fury Warrior Leveling and PvE Guide › Leveling playstyle","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/wow-forever-fury-warrior-leveling-and-pve-guide-35029","date":"2026-10-20"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: WoW: Forever Fury Warrior Leveling and PvE Guide › Toolkit","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/wow-forever-fury-warrior-leveling-and-pve-guide-35029","date":"2026-10-20"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Fury Warrior Leveling Guide › Leveling Milestones > Important Unlocks","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/fury-warrior-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:extra:wow-forever-fury-warrior-leveling-and-pve-guide","class:warrior:fury:leveling"],"source_hashes":["guide:baf6ab9f1243adfa8aac49ced45104e22290f803","section:72e2b8d0788e2809d2b9de2a8ec4ed5efd153a1f","section:ee54209c7f2dc45a83973674d89ad8a567e23705"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-campamento-subida","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Beneficios de campamento al subir","title_en":"Camp Buffs While Leveling","summary_es":"Tienda de campamento da experiencia descansada; otras mejoras aportan ataque o crítico.","summary_en":"Camp Tent grants rested experience; other buffs add Attack Power or crit.","keywords_es":["beneficio de campamento Guerrero","Tienda de campamento experiencia","Magnetita Poderío","Silla de campamento crítico"],"keywords_en":["Warrior camp buff","Camp Tent rested experience","Lodestone Attack Power","Camp Chair crit"],"text_es":"Si solo eliges un beneficio para subir, Tienda de campamento aporta hasta un 5% de experiencia descansada; requiere Peletería 20 y no sirve si ya superas ese límite de descanso. Magnetita suma poder de ataque cuerpo a cuerpo, y Silla de campamento otorga un 2% de crítico; elige según los beneficios que ya recibas.","text_en":"If you choose only one leveling camp buff, Camp Tent grants up to 5% rested experience; it requires Leatherworking 20 and has no effect once you exceed that rested amount. Lodestone adds melee Attack Power, while Camp Chair grants 2% crit; choose based on buffs you already have.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior Leveling Guide  - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Camping Buffs for Arms Warrior DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior Leveling Guide  - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Professions for Arms Warrior DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fury Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Camping Buffs for Fury Warrior DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/fury/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-07"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:arms:leveling","class:warrior:fury:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:4d5800361970694b00f44fdffec84b47eb3a0f33","section:99d78fd7d07e34e28aebc61d0b756e12f1414bb0","section:d936d2284a3f840ab2c1e6ef0b2e6d6819d088ae"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-furia-orden-talentos-1-52","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Furia: orden de talentos hasta nivel 52 (subida)","title_en":"Fury: Talent Order Through Level 52","summary_es":"Orden de talentos de Furia desde los primeros puntos hasta Maestría táctica mejorada.","summary_en":"Fury talent order from its early points through Improved Tactical Mastery.","keywords_es":["orden talentos Furia","ruta Furia nivel 52","talentos Guerrero nivel por nivel"],"keywords_en":["Fury talent order","Fury level 52 path","Warrior talents by level"],"text_es":"10-14: Crueldad 5/5; 15-19: Cólera desbocada 5/5; 20-22: Precisión furiosa 3/3; 25-29: Especialización en doble empuñadura 5/5; 30: Deseo de la Muerte 1/1; 31: Golpes temerarios 1/1; 32-33: Ira rabiosa mejorada 2/2; 35-36: Huracán mejorado 2/2; 37-39: Aluvión 3/3; 40: Sed de sangre 1/1; 50-52: Maestría táctica mejorada 3/3. Entrena doble empuñadura a nivel 20.","text_en":"Levels 10-14: Cruelty 5/5; 15-19: Unbridled Wrath 5/5; 20-22: Furious Precision 3/3; 25-29: Dual Wield Specialization 5/5; 30: Death Wish 1/1; 31: Reckless Swings 1/1; 32-33: Improved Berserker Rage 2/2; 35-36: Improved Whirlwind 2/2; 37-39: Flurry 3/3; 40: Bloodthirst 1/1; 50-52: Improved Tactical Mastery 3/3. Train dual wield at level 20.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Fury Warrior Leveling Guide › Leveling Talent Build","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/fury-warrior-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fury Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Fury Warrior DPS in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/fury/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-07"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:fury:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:60912d4380d6d5944b83c7f828b03ad767e7af08","section:dd91363c3dfc033c1a7f4fafcfae70faeba7e950"]}]},"05-profesiones.json":{"description":"Capítulo 5: Profesiones. Secciones editoriales redactadas desde guías de terceros.","sections":[{"id":"prof-cuantas-profesiones","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Cuántas profesiones puedes tener","title_en":"How Many Professions You Can Have","summary_es":"Nueve primarias y tres secundarias: dos primarias y todas las secundarias por personaje.","summary_en":"Nine primary and three secondary professions: two primary and every secondary per character.","keywords_es":["cuántas profesiones puedo tener","dos profesiones primarias","profesiones secundarias","nueve profesiones","límite de profesiones"],"keywords_en":["how many professions","two primary professions","secondary professions","nine professions","profession limit"],"text_es":"En total, Forever ofrece nueve oficios primarios y tres secundarios. Un personaje puede llevar dos de los primarios, mientras que los secundarios no tienen tope. Los primarios se dividen en recolección y artesanía; los secundarios son Cocina, Primeros auxilios y Pesca.","text_en":"All told, Forever offers nine primary trades and three secondary ones. A character can carry two of the primary trades, while the secondary ones have no cap. Primary trades split into gathering and crafting; the secondary ones are Cooking, First Aid, and Fishing.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Profession Guide › What Are Professions?","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/professions-overview","date":"2026-11-03"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["profession:_all:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:7493349a100772d00e3bd12aae9821b8f638d4f9"]},{"id":"prof-profesiones-recoleccion","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Profesiones de recolección","title_en":"Gathering Professions","summary_es":"Herboristería, Minería y Desuello recogen materiales para las profesiones de artesanía.","summary_en":"Herbalism, Mining, and Skinning gather materials for the crafting professions.","keywords_es":["profesiones de recolección","herboristería","minería","desuello","recoger materiales"],"keywords_en":["gathering professions","herbalism","mining","skinning","gather materials"],"text_es":"Las tres profesiones de recolección son Herboristería, Minería y Desuello. Herboristería recoge hierbas, Minería extrae mineral y piedra, y Desuello obtiene cuero y pieles de bestias derrotadas. Sus materiales son la base de muchas recetas de artesanía, y también se pueden vender a otros jugadores.","text_en":"The three gathering professions are Herbalism, Mining, and Skinning. Herbalism collects herbs, Mining extracts ore and stone, and Skinning takes leather and hides from defeated beasts. Their materials are the basis of many crafting recipes, and they can also be sold to other players.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Profession Guide › What Are Professions?","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/professions-overview","date":"2026-11-03"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["profession:_all:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:7493349a100772d00e3bd12aae9821b8f638d4f9"]},{"id":"prof-profesiones-artesania","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Profesiones de artesanía","title_en":"Crafting Professions","summary_es":"Alquimia, Herrería, Encantamiento, Ingeniería, Peletería y Sastrería transforman materiales en equipo y consumibles.","summary_en":"Alchemy, Blacksmithing, Enchanting, Engineering, Leatherworking, and Tailoring turn materials into gear and consumables.","keywords_es":["profesiones de artesanía","alquimia","herreria","encantamiento","ingenieria","peleteria","sastreria"],"keywords_en":["crafting professions","alchemy","blacksmithing","enchanting","engineering","leatherworking","tailoring"],"text_es":"Las profesiones primarias de artesanía son Alquimia, Herrería, Encantamiento, Ingeniería, Peletería y Sastrería. Usan materiales recogidos para crear equipo, consumibles, mejoras y herramientas. Alquimia prepara pociones y frascos; Herrería forja armas y armaduras; Encantamiento mejora equipo; Ingeniería crea artefactos; Peletería y Sastrería fabrican armaduras y bolsas.","text_en":"The primary crafting professions are Alchemy, Blacksmithing, Enchanting, Engineering, Leatherworking, and Tailoring. They use gathered materials to create gear, consumables, enhancements, and tools. Alchemy makes potions and flasks; Blacksmithing forges weapons and armor; Enchanting improves gear; Engineering creates devices; Leatherworking and Tailoring make armor and bags.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Profession Guide › What Are Professions?","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/professions-overview","date":"2026-11-03"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["profession:_all:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:7493349a100772d00e3bd12aae9821b8f638d4f9"]},{"id":"prof-combinaciones","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Profesiones que combinan bien","title_en":"Professions That Pair Well","summary_es":"Minería con Herrería o Ingeniería, Herboristería con Alquimia, Desuello con Peletería y Sastrería con Encantamiento.","summary_en":"Mining with Blacksmithing/Engineering, Herbalism with Alchemy, Skinning with Leatherworking, Tailoring/Enchanting.","keywords_es":["profesiones que combinan bien","minería y herrería","herboristería y alquimia","desuello y peletería","sastrería y encantamiento"],"keywords_en":["professions that pair well","mining and blacksmithing","herbalism and alchemy","skinning and leatherworking","tailoring and enchanting"],"text_es":"Minería alimenta a Herrería e Ingeniería, Herboristería surte a Alquimia y Desuello aporta cuero a Peletería. Sastrería no necesita una profesión de recolección porque la tela sale de humanoides, y combina con Encantamiento para desencantar el equipo fabricado. Llevar una profesión de recolección junto a una de artesanía reduce el gasto en materiales; también puedes llevar dos de recolección y vender lo que encuentres.","text_en":"Mining feeds Blacksmithing and Engineering, Herbalism supplies Alchemy, and Skinning provides leather for Leatherworking. Tailoring does not need a gathering profession because cloth comes from humanoids, and it pairs with Enchanting to disenchant crafted gear. Taking a gathering profession with a crafting one reduces material costs; two gathering professions are also an option if you want to sell the materials you collect.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Profession Guide › What Are Professions?","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/professions-overview","date":"2026-11-03"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["profession:_all:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:7493349a100772d00e3bd12aae9821b8f638d4f9"]},{"id":"prof-cambiar-profesion","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Cambiar o abandonar una profesión","title_en":"Changing or Dropping a Profession","summary_es":"Puedes sustituir una primaria, pero perderás su habilidad y sus recetas; las secundarias no ocupan espacio.","summary_en":"You can replace a primary profession, but you lose its skill and recipes; secondary professions take no primary slot.","keywords_es":["cambiar profesión","abandonar profesión","perder recetas","volver a subir profesión","profesión primaria"],"keywords_en":["change profession","drop profession","lose recipes","relevel profession","primary profession"],"text_es":"Puedes cambiar una profesión primaria cuando quieras. Al abandonarla pierdes toda la habilidad y las recetas aprendidas, así que tendrás que subirla de nuevo si vuelves a ella. Las profesiones secundarias no compiten por las dos plazas primarias y no hace falta abandonarlas para probar otra.","text_en":"A primary profession can be swapped whenever you like. Dropping it removes all of its skill and learned recipes, so returning later means starting its progress again. Secondary professions do not compete for the two primary slots, and you never need to drop them to try another profession.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Profession Guide › Choosing and Changing Professions","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/professions-overview","date":"2026-11-03"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["profession:_all:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:854c8bfa49fabb8cdb3ba79996870cceba973307"]},{"id":"prof-aprender-profesion","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Dónde aprender una profesión","title_en":"Where to Learn a Profession","summary_es":"Se aprende con un instructor; las zonas iniciales también dan un objeto para una profesión de recolección.","summary_en":"You learn from a trainer; starting zones also have a quest item for one gathering profession.","keywords_es":["dónde aprender profesión","instructor de profesión","objeto de misión inicial","ventana de profesión","recetas de vendedor"],"keywords_en":["where to learn profession","profession trainer","starting zone quest item","profession window","vendor recipes"],"text_es":"Para aprender una profesión visita a su instructor, que también enseña las primeras recetas. En cada zona inicial aparece un objeto de misión que permite empezar una de las tres profesiones de recolección sin ir a la ciudad. La ventana de profesión, con la tecla K por defecto, muestra las recetas y los materiales. Además de los instructores, hay recetas en vendedores, misiones y botín, y algunas tareas exigen una herramienta o un puesto de trabajo cercano.","text_en":"To learn a profession, visit its trainer, who also teaches the first recipes. Every starting zone has a quest item that lets you begin one of the three gathering professions without going to the city. The profession window, bound to K by default, shows recipes and materials. Besides trainers, recipes come from vendors, quests, and loot, and some tasks require a tool or a nearby workstation.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Profession Guide › How to Learn a Profession","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/professions-overview","date":"2026-11-03"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["profession:_all:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:cb06e7b570d821973b4188030d9b587c8ce9a9e8"]},{"id":"prof-subir-rango","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rangos y habilidad de profesión","title_en":"Profession Ranks and Skill","summary_es":"La habilidad es independiente del nivel; cada rango sube el tope y exige más habilidad y nivel de personaje.","summary_en":"Skill is separate from character level; each rank raises the cap and requires more skill and character level.","keywords_es":["subir profesión","rangos de profesión","tope de habilidad","aprendiz oficial experto artesano","color de receta"],"keywords_en":["level profession","profession ranks","skill cap","apprentice journeyman expert artisan","recipe color"],"text_es":"La habilidad de una profesión es independiente del nivel de personaje. Los rangos son Aprendiz (tope 75), Oficial (150; 50 de habilidad; nivel 10 si es artesanía), Experto (225; 125; nivel 20 de artesanía o 10 de recolección) y Artesano (300; 200; nivel 35 de artesanía o 25 de recolección). El color de la receta indica la probabilidad de subir: naranja la garantiza, amarillo suele darla, verde la da menos y gris no la da. Aprende el siguiente rango al llegar al tope para no quedarte bloqueado.","text_en":"Profession skill is separate from character level. The ranks are Apprentice (cap 75), Journeyman (150; 50 skill; level 10 for crafting), Expert (225; 125; level 20 for crafting or 10 for gathering), and Artisan (300; 200; level 35 for crafting or 25 for gathering). Recipe color shows the chance of a skill point: orange guarantees it, yellow usually gives it, green gives it less often, and gray gives none. Learn the next rank when you reach the cap so you do not get stuck.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Profession Guide › How to Level a Profession","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/professions-overview","date":"2026-11-03"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["profession:_all:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:966af58f8ea300502e2f550ebb5a25bc87987126"]},{"id":"prof-puntos-legado","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Puntos Legacy por profesiones","title_en":"Legacy Points from Professions","summary_es":"La primera vez que llegas a 150, 225 y 300 de habilidad en una profesión ganas puntos Legacy.","summary_en":"The first time you reach 150, 225, and 300 skill in a profession, you earn Legacy Points.","keywords_es":["puntos legacy profesiones","legacy 150 225 300","árbol legacy profesiones","puntos por profesión"],"keywords_en":["profession legacy points","legacy 150 225 300","profession legacy tree","points per profession"],"text_es":"Alcanzar por primera vez 150, 225 y 300 de habilidad en una profesión otorga puntos Legacy. Su árbol Legacy ofrece ventajas para mejorar la habilidad y la recolección.","text_en":"Reaching 150, 225, and 300 skill with a profession for the first time awards Legacy Points. Its Legacy tree offers perks for improving skills and gathering.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Profession Guide › What's New for Professions in WoW Forever?","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/professions-overview","date":"2026-11-03"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["profession:_all:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:f1c4ab71829391b5f6b34bbd881b73ac5ef11082"]},{"id":"prof-novedades-forever","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Novedades de profesiones en Forever","title_en":"Profession Changes in Forever","summary_es":"Forever conserva el sistema de recetas y añade recetas nuevas y bonificaciones poderosas a las profesiones principales.","summary_en":"Forever keeps the recipe system and adds new recipes and powerful bonuses to the main professions.","keywords_es":["novedades profesiones forever","recetas nuevas","bonificaciones de profesión","sistema de recetas","profesiones principales"],"keywords_en":["profession changes forever","new recipes","profession bonuses","recipe system","main professions"],"text_es":"Forever mantiene el sistema de recetas con costes de materiales y resultados fijos. Añade recetas nuevas y bonificaciones poderosas a las profesiones principales, algunas con beneficios directos y otras con objetos o herramientas especiales. Las profesiones también aportan características a los campamentos.","text_en":"Forever keeps the recipe system with set material costs and fixed results. It adds new recipes and powerful bonuses to the main professions, some with direct benefits and others with special items or tools. Professions also contribute features to campsites.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Profession Guide › What's New for Professions in WoW Forever?","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/professions-overview","date":"2026-11-03"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["profession:_all:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:f1c4ab71829391b5f6b34bbd881b73ac5ef11082"]},{"id":"prof-alquimia","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Alquimia: pociones, elixires y frascos","title_en":"Alchemy: Potions, Elixirs, and Flasks","summary_es":"Convierte hierbas en pociones, elixires, frascos, aceites y reactivos; combina con Herboristería.","summary_en":"Turns herbs into potions, elixirs, flasks, oils, and reagents; pairs with Herbalism.","keywords_es":["alquimia","pociones","elixires","frascos","piedra filosofal","alquimia y herboristería"],"keywords_en":["alchemy","potions","elixirs","flasks","philosopher's stone","alchemy and herbalism"],"text_es":"Los alquimistas transforman hierbas y componentes en brebajes útiles: pociones, elixires, frascos, aceites, tintes y reactivos. Puedes mantener varios elixires activos y cada uno dura como máximo una hora. Forever deja en Primeros auxilios las pociones de curación habituales; las de Alquimia son descoloridas: curan de golpe y luego restan salud. Con una Piedra de filósofo, el alquimista convierte torio y cristales arcanos en arcanita. Lo más práctico es acompañarla de Herboristería.","text_en":"Alchemists transform herbs and components into useful brews: potions, elixirs, flasks, oils, dyes, and reagents. You can keep several elixirs active, each lasting at most an hour. Forever leaves the usual healing potions to First Aid; Alchemy's are discolored: they heal at once and then drain health. With a Philosopher's Stone, the alchemist turns thorium and arcane crystals into arcanite. Herbalism is the practical partner.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Alchemy Guide › What Is Alchemy?","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/alchemy","date":"2026-11-03"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Profession Guide › Alchemy","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/professions-overview","date":"2026-11-03"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["profession:_all:overview","profession:alchemy:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:1aeefa43753ea121a20724d0db7ea7424d608556","section:c86415ca4577d5e8c429888d9efcd31a3d799ed9"]},{"id":"prof-herreria","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Herrería: armas y armaduras pesadas","title_en":"Blacksmithing: Weapons and Heavy Armor","summary_es":"Fabrica armas, escudos, malla y placas, mejoras de arma y objetos útiles; combina con Minería.","summary_en":"Makes weapons, shields, mail and plate armor, weapon upgrades, and useful items; pairs with Mining.","keywords_es":["herreria","armas","armaduras de placas","yunque","especialización en armas","herreria y minería"],"keywords_en":["blacksmithing","weapons","plate armor","anvil","weaponsmithing","blacksmithing and mining"],"text_es":"Los herreros forjan armas, escudos, malla y placas, además de piedras de afilar, contrapesos, púas de escudo, cadenas de arma, llaves esqueleto y varas para Encantamiento. Las piedras y contrapesos mejoran el daño de forma temporal; púas y cadenas quedan fijas. También salen de su yunque las espuelas de mitril, que aceleran la montura. Para casi todo necesitan martillo y yunque, y ciertas recetas piden una forja. Al subir habilidad se elige especialidad de Armaduras o de Armas; Minería es su pareja natural.","text_en":"Blacksmiths forge weapons, shields, mail and plate, plus sharpening stones and weightstones, shield spikes, skeleton keys, weapon chains, and rods for Enchanting. Stones and weights boost damage for a time; spikes and chains stay fixed. Mithril Spurs, which speed up mounted travel, also come from their anvil. They need a hammer and anvil for almost everything, and some recipes call for a forge. Higher skill lets them pick Armorsmithing or Weaponsmithing; Mining is the natural partner.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Blacksmithing Guide › What Is Blacksmithing?","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/blacksmithing","date":"2026-11-03"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["profession:blacksmithing:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:d8cc68aa35d154a6f5cb8f7666082b1027f621bb"]},{"id":"prof-encantamiento","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Encantamiento: mejoras permanentes","title_en":"Enchanting: Permanent Enhancements","summary_es":"Desencanta equipo para obtener materiales y añade mejoras permanentes a armas y armadura; combina con Sastrería.","summary_en":"Disenchants gear for materials and adds permanent enhancements to weapons and armor; pairs with Tailoring.","keywords_es":["encantamiento","desencantar","mejoras permanentes","varita","vara rúnica","encantamiento y sastrería"],"keywords_en":["enchanting","disenchant","permanent enchants","wand","runed rod","enchanting and tailoring"],"text_es":"Encantamiento desencanta equipo poco común o mejor para obtener polvo, esencias y fragmentos. Con esos materiales añade bonificaciones permanentes a armas y armaduras, como aguante en brazales o agilidad en botas. También fabrica varitas, bastones, objetos de mano secundaria, reliquias de clase y aceites de arma. Muchos encantamientos necesitan una vara rúnica; la primera, la Vara de cobre rúnico, se hace con materiales de vendedor, y las varas superiores vienen de Herrería. Combina con Sastrería y resulta útil a Magos, Sacerdotes y Brujos.","text_en":"Enchanting disenchants uncommon or better gear into dust, essences, and shards. With those materials it adds permanent bonuses to weapons and armor, such as Stamina on bracers or Agility on boots. It also makes wands, staves, off-hand items, class relics, and weapon oils. Many enchants need a runed rod; the first, a Runed Copper Rod, is made from vendor materials, and later rods come from Blacksmithing. It pairs with Tailoring and suits Mages, Priests, and Warlocks.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Enchanting Guide › What Is Enchanting?","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/enchanting","date":"2026-11-03"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["profession:enchanting:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:188160cad5bd40e46fdd5e4fe0c5bd604f07ecc2"]},{"id":"prof-ingenieria","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Ingeniería: bombas, armas y artilugios","title_en":"Engineering: Bombs, Guns, and Gadgets","summary_es":"Crea explosivos, armas de fuego, miras, gafas y herramientas; combina con Minería y tiene dos especializaciones.","summary_en":"Makes explosives, guns, scopes, goggles, and tools; pairs with Mining and has two specializations.","keywords_es":["ingenieria","bombas","granadas","gafas","ingeniería goblin","ingeniería gnómica","ingeniería y minería"],"keywords_en":["engineering","bombs","grenades","goggles","goblin engineering","gnomish engineering","engineering and mining"],"text_es":"Los ingenieros montan explosivos, armas de fuego, munición, miras, gafas y toda clase de aparatos. La Granada de hierro causa fuego y deja aturdidos hasta tres segundos a los enemigos cercanos; la Capa paracaídas frena una caída. Los Pinzas de batería goblin dan una oportunidad de reanimar a un aliado fuera de combate. Con nivel 30 y 200 de habilidad se escoge la escuela Goblin o la Gnómica, con recetas distintas. Minería la abastece; también sirve para JcJ, para huir al subir solo y a los Cazadores que fabrican armas.","text_en":"Engineers assemble explosives, firearms, ammunition, scopes, goggles, and all sorts of devices. The Iron Grenade deals Fire damage and leaves nearby enemies stunned for up to three seconds; the Parachute Cloak slows a fall. Goblin Jumper Cables offer a chance to revive an ally out of combat. At level 30 and 200 skill you pick the Goblin or Gnomish school, with different recipes. Mining supplies it; it also helps in PvP, when escaping while soloing, and for Hunters who make weapons.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Engineering Guide › What Is Engineering?","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/engineering","date":"2026-11-03"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["profession:engineering:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:9bbed3c91fa48e86a80574c35454f4743f0d9aec"]},{"id":"prof-peleteria","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Peletería: cuero, malla y bolsas","title_en":"Leatherworking: Leather, Mail, and Bags","summary_es":"Fabrica armaduras de cuero y malla, capas, bolsas y kits de armadura; combina con Desuello.","summary_en":"Makes leather and mail armor, cloaks, bags, and armor kits; pairs with Skinning.","keywords_es":["peleteria","armadura de cuero","armadura de malla","kits de armadura","carcaj","peleteria y desuello"],"keywords_en":["leatherworking","leather armor","mail armor","armor kits","quiver","leatherworking and skinning"],"text_es":"Los peleteros producen armaduras de cuero y malla, capas y bolsas. Ciertas recetas aprovechan el cuero tal cual sale del Desuello; otras piden pieles curadas antes con sal. Los kits de armadura refuerzan de forma permanente pecho, piernas, manos o pies, y los carcajes y bolsas de munición aceleran el ataque a distancia. Con más habilidad se abre una especialidad: Escamas de dragón, Elemental o Tribal, cada una con patrones distintos. Desuello es su pareja y encaja con Druidas, Pícaros, Cazadores y Chamanes.","text_en":"Leatherworkers create armor in leather and mail, along with cloaks and bags. Some recipes use hides exactly as Skinning leaves them; others need pelts cured with Salt first. Armor kits permanently reinforce chest, legs, hands, or feet, and quivers and ammo pouches speed up ranged attacks. More skill opens a specialty: Dragonscale, Elemental, or Tribal, each with different patterns. Skinning is the partner, and it suits Druids, Rogues, Hunters, and Shamans.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Leatherworking Guide › What Is Leatherworking?","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/leatherworking","date":"2026-11-03"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["profession:leatherworking:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:86e384a82c9f2fc23475d6baf7d72bbb76a71f98"]},{"id":"prof-sastreria","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Sastrería: tela, bolsas y bolsa de reactivos","title_en":"Tailoring: Cloth, Bags, and Reagent Bag","summary_es":"Fabrica armaduras de tela, capas, camisas y bolsas; Forever añade una bolsa de reactivos aparte.","summary_en":"Makes cloth armor, cloaks, shirts, and bags; Forever adds a separate reagent bag.","keywords_es":["sastreria","armadura de tela","bolsas","bolsa de reactivos","tela","sastreria y encantamiento"],"keywords_en":["tailoring","cloth armor","bags","reagent bag","cloth","tailoring and enchanting"],"text_es":"Los sastres cortan y cosen la tela para hacer armaduras, capas, camisas y bolsas. La mayor parte de esa tela llega de humanoides, por lo que no hace falta una profesión recolectora. Forever reserva una ranura propia para la bolsa de reactivos: la de lino admite seis montones y la de tejido mágico doce, sin quitar espacio a las bolsas normales. La Bolsa de lino ofrece seis huecos y la Bolsa de paño rúnico catorce. Encantamiento es su mejor compañero, y el oficio encaja con Magos, Sacerdotes y Brujos.","text_en":"Tailors sew armor, cloaks, shirts, and bags from cloth. Most of that cloth arrives from humanoids, so no gathering profession is required. Forever sets aside a dedicated reagent-bag slot: the linen version accepts six stacks and the mageweave one twelve, without taking regular bag space. A Linen Bag offers six slots and a Runecloth Bag fourteen. Enchanting is the best companion, and the trade suits Mages, Priests, and Warlocks.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Tailoring Guide › What Is Tailoring?","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/tailoring","date":"2026-11-03"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["profession:tailoring:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:e0e2dc1f3cdc8873cd0c3df065ab70f1d15c19a8"]},{"id":"prof-herboristeria","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Herboristería: hierbas y materiales raros","title_en":"Herbalism: Herbs and Scarce Materials","summary_es":"Recoge hierbas para Alquimia y Primeros auxilios, y puede encontrar materiales raros para tintes y recetas nuevas.","summary_en":"Gathers herbs for Alchemy and First Aid, and can find scarce materials for dyes and new recipes.","keywords_es":["herboristeria","recoger hierbas","buscar hierbas","materiales raros","marefoil","demonsage","death lotus"],"keywords_en":["herbalism","gather herbs","find herbs","scarce materials","marefoil","demonsage","death lotus"],"text_es":"Herboristería recoge hierbas por todo Azeroth y enseña a ver nodos cercanos en el minimapa con Buscar hierbas. No necesita herramienta: basta con interactuar con la planta si la habilidad alcanza. Las hierbas sirven a Alquimia y, en Forever, también a Primeros auxilios para pociones de curación. Al recoger puedes encontrar materiales raros para tintes, y Forever añade Marefoil, Demonsage y Death Lotus para recetas de nivel máximo. Combina con Alquimia.","text_en":"Herbalism gathers herbs across Azeroth and teaches Find Herbs to show nearby nodes on the minimap. It needs no tool: you simply interact with the plant if your skill is high enough. Herbs are used by Alchemy and, in Forever, also by First Aid for healing potions. Gathering can also yield scarce materials for dyes, and Forever adds Marefoil, Demonsage, and Death Lotus for endgame recipes. It pairs with Alchemy.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Herbalism Guide › What Is Herbalism?","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/herbalism","date":"2026-11-03"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["profession:herbalism:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:c5c0e734d0e045de51055de230fdaba23dc2cd66"]},{"id":"prof-mineria","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Minería: menas, piedra y gemas","title_en":"Mining: Ore, Stone, and Gems","summary_es":"Extrae menas, piedra y gemas, y las funde en barras; alimenta Herrería e Ingeniería.","summary_en":"Extracts ore, stone, and gems and smelts them into bars; feeds Blacksmithing and Engineering.","keywords_es":["mineria","menas","fundir","barras","gemas","mineria y herreria","mineria e ingenieria"],"keywords_en":["mining","ore","smelting","bars","gems","mining and blacksmithing","mining and engineering"],"text_es":"Minería extrae menas, piedra y gemas de los depósitos y enseña Fundir para convertirlas en barras junto a una forja. Necesita un pico y permite ver los depósitos en el minimapa con Buscar minerales. Alimenta sobre todo a Herrería e Ingeniería, y sus gemas y materiales raros también sirven a otras profesiones. Forever añade Heavy Thorium Bar, Azerothium Bar y Legionite Bar, además de materiales raros como Pyrite, Bauxite y Pitchblende. Combina con Herrería o Ingeniería.","text_en":"Mining extracts ore, stone, and gems from deposits and teaches Smelting to turn them into bars at a forge. It needs a pick and shows deposits on the minimap with Find Minerals. It mainly feeds Blacksmithing and Engineering, and its gems and scarce materials also serve other professions. Forever adds Heavy Thorium Bar, Azerothium Bar, and Legionite Bar, plus scarce materials such as Pyrite, Bauxite, and Pitchblende. It pairs with Blacksmithing or Engineering.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Mining Guide › What Is Mining?","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/mining","date":"2026-11-03"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["profession:mining:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:7397ce6f8b27273c0c4ad827df0fbd0d66cd121f"]},{"id":"prof-desuello","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Desuello: cuero, pieles y escamas","title_en":"Skinning: Leather, Hides, and Scales","summary_es":"Saca cuero, pieles y escamas de bestias muertas; Forever suaviza los requisitos y añade materiales nuevos.","summary_en":"Takes leather, hides, and scales from dead beasts; Forever eases requirements and adds new materials.","keywords_es":["desuello","cuero","pieles","escamas","cuchillo de desuello","requisito de desuello","desuello y peleteria"],"keywords_en":["skinning","leather","hides","scales","skinning knife","skinning requirement","skinning and leatherworking"],"text_es":"Desuello obtiene cuero, pieles y escamas de bestias ya saqueadas. Hace falta un Cuchillo para desollar y la habilidad suficiente; en criaturas de nivel 20 o superior suele pedirse cinco veces ese nivel. Un cadáver solo se desuella una vez, aunque haya varios profesionales en el grupo. Forever ha suavizado estos requisitos y suma Fel Leather, Fel Hide y materiales Pristine a las recetas de nivel máximo. Peletería es su compañera.","text_en":"Skinning obtains leather, hides, and scales from beasts that have already been looted. It requires a skinning knife and enough skill; creatures level 20 or higher usually ask for five times their level. A corpse can be skinned once, even if several professionals are in the group. Forever has eased these requirements and adds Fel Leather, Fel Hide, and Pristine materials to endgame recipes. Leatherworking is its partner.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Skinning Guide › How to Skin Creatures","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/skinning","date":"2026-11-03"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["profession:skinning:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:fc8126ea46958bdc40f94a89c81ec6dded6332bc"]},{"id":"prof-cocina","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Cocina: comida, buffs y experiencia","title_en":"Cooking: Food, Buffs, and Experience","summary_es":"Prepara comida que cura y da buffs; muchos platos añaden un 5% de experiencia por muertes.","summary_en":"Prepares food that heals and grants buffs; many dishes add 5% experience from kills.","keywords_es":["cocina","comida","buffs de comida","experiencia por muertes","well fed","master chef","cocina y pesca"],"keywords_en":["cooking","food","food buffs","experience from kills","well fed","master chef","cooking and fishing"],"text_es":"Cocina pertenece al grupo de las secundarias y transforma carne, pescado y otros ingredientes en platos y bebidas. Esos alimentos devuelven salud o maná y algunos aportan bonificaciones temporales; hay que permanecer sentado unos 10 segundos para recibir el efecto, que suele durar 15 minutos. Muchos platos de Forever incluyen Well Fed XP Boost, un 5% más de experiencia por muertes que no cuenta en las misiones. Master Chef puede generar raciones adicionales hasta un 50%, y Gourmand estira los buffs hasta el 100%. Pesca es su compañera.","text_en":"Cooking belongs to the secondary group and transforms meat, fish, and other ingredients into dishes and drinks. Those foods restore health or mana, and some grant temporary bonuses; you must remain seated for about 10 seconds to receive the effect, which usually lasts 15 minutes. Many Forever dishes include Well Fed XP Boost, 5% more experience from kills that does not count for quests. Master Chef can generate extra servings up to 50%, and Gourmand stretches buffs up to 100%. Fishing is its partner.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Cooking Guide › Food Buffs and How They Work","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/cooking","date":"2026-11-03"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["profession:cooking:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:fb50e1fc32313e5b04eb835a3df7d014c315b507"]},{"id":"prof-primeros-auxilios","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Primeros auxilios: vendas y remedios","title_en":"First Aid: Bandages and Remedies","summary_es":"Convierte tela en vendas y hierbas en pociones; Forever traslada las pociones de curación estándar desde Alquimia.","summary_en":"Turns cloth into bandages and herbs into potions; Forever moves the standard healing potions from Alchemy.","keywords_es":["primeros auxilios","vendas","pociones de curación","antitoxina","cataplasma","torniquete","recién vendado"],"keywords_en":["first aid","bandages","healing potions","anti-venom","poultice","tourniquet","recently bandaged"],"text_es":"Primeros auxilios es secundaria y trabaja la tela para vendas y las hierbas para pociones curativas. Forever traslada a este oficio las seis recetas de poción de curación habituales, que antes eran de Alquimia. También prepara antitoxinas contra venenos, cataplasmas contra enfermedades y torniquetes contra sangrados; la antitoxina vale en combate, las otras dos solo fuera, y las tres comparten un minuto de espera. Vendar exige canalizar sin moverse ni recibir golpes y aplica Vendado recientemente durante un minuto, lo que impide otra venda. No consume plaza primaria.","text_en":"First Aid is secondary: cloth becomes bandages, and herbs become healing potions. Forever moves the six usual healing-potion recipes into this trade; they used to belong to Alchemy. It also prepares anti-venoms for poisons, poultices for diseases, and tourniquets for bleeds; anti-venom works in combat, the other two only outside it, and all three share a one-minute wait. Bandaging requires channeling without moving or taking hits and applies Recently Bandaged for a minute, which blocks another bandage. It uses no primary slot.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever First Aid Guide › What Is First Aid?","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/first-aid","date":"2026-11-03"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["profession:first-aid:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:915feb449029dab1b9f107165c51d84067f817e8"]},{"id":"prof-pesca","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Pesca: peces para Cocina y Alquimia","title_en":"Fishing: Fish for Cooking and Alchemy","summary_es":"Pesca peces para comer, para aceites de Alquimia y para recompensas; combina con Cocina.","summary_en":"Catches fish for food, Alchemy oils, and rewards; pairs with Cooking.","keywords_es":["pesca","pescar","peces","escuelas de peces","cebos","pesca y cocina","pesca y alquimia"],"keywords_en":["fishing","catch fish","fish","fishing schools","lures","fishing and cooking","fishing and alchemy"],"text_es":"Pesca es una profesión secundaria que recoge peces para comida, aceites y otras recetas. Lo que sacas depende del lugar: aguas iniciales dan peces pequeños y otras zonas peces para recetas superiores. Las escuelas de peces y los restos flotantes permiten buscar capturas concretas, y puedes seguir subiendo habilidad en aguas iniciales hasta 300. Los anzuelos, cañas y cebos mejoran la habilidad efectiva, y la ventaja Legacy Luremaster puede dar peces extra con un cebo activo. Combina con Cocina.","text_en":"Fishing is a secondary profession that gathers fish for food, oils, and other recipes. Your catch depends on the location: early waters give small fish and other areas give fish for higher recipes. Fishing schools and floating wreckage let you target specific catches, and you can keep gaining skill in starting waters all the way to 300. Lures, poles, and other bonuses improve effective skill, and the Luremaster Legacy perk can give extra fish while a lure is active. It pairs with Cooking.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Fishing Guide › What Is Fishing?","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/fishing","date":"2026-11-03"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["profession:fishing:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:702611c693f14dd11307f4db3c7806a366a6d8d3"]},{"id":"prof-secundarias-sin-slots","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Profesiones secundarias y las dos plazas","title_en":"Secondary Professions and the Two Slots","summary_es":"Cocina, Primeros auxilios y Pesca se aprenden sin gastar ninguna de las dos plazas primarias.","summary_en":"Cooking, First Aid, and Fishing take none of the two primary profession slots.","keywords_es":["profesiones secundarias","dos plazas primarias","cocina primeros auxilios pesca","aprender todas las secundarias"],"keywords_en":["secondary professions","two primary slots","cooking first aid fishing","learn all secondary professions"],"text_es":"Cocina, Primeros auxilios y Pesca son secundarias y no compiten por las dos plazas de profesión primaria. Puedes aprender las tres en el mismo personaje y seguir llevando dos primarias. Sus recetas sirven para curar, comer, preparar buffs y conseguir materiales, y no hace falta abandonar una secundaria para cambiar de primaria.","text_en":"Cooking, First Aid, and Fishing are secondary professions and do not compete for the two primary profession slots. You can learn all three on the same character and still keep two primary professions. Their recipes help you heal, eat, prepare buffs, and obtain materials, and you never need to drop a secondary profession to change a primary one.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Profession Guide › Secondary Professions","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/professions-overview","date":"2026-11-03"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["profession:_all:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:26037c1fef6d7f900acaa4d5975f806d9b94f3d0"]},{"id":"prof-campamento-cocina","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Campamentos: cocina y tamaño de la hoguera","title_en":"Campsites: Cooking and Campfire Size","summary_es":"Cocina crea la hoguera; el tamaño del campamento limita cuántas características pueden añadirse.","summary_en":"Cooking creates the campfire; campsite size limits how many features can be added.","keywords_es":["campamento","hoguera","cocina y campamento","características del campamento","tamaño de hoguera","descansar en campamento"],"keywords_en":["campsite","campfire","cooking and camping","campsite features","campfire size","rest at camp"],"text_es":"Cocina crea la hoguera que sirve de centro al campamento. El kit de hoguera básica se hace con una Madera simple y un Sílex y Yesca reutilizable; la hoguera deja espacio para tres características y los kits superiores amplían el espacio hasta diez. Las características de profesión aparecen a 20, 140 y 300 de habilidad, y los niveles altos conservan los beneficios anteriores. Hay que sentarse o fabricar cerca durante un minuto para recibir los buffs, que duran una hora. Los campamentos se colocan al aire libre, no en ciudades principales, y cada jugador solo puede aportar una característica.","text_en":"Cooking creates the campfire at the center of a campsite. The Basic Campfire Kit is made with one Simple Wood and a reusable Flint and Tinder; the campfire leaves room for three features and larger kits expand the space up to ten. Profession features appear at 20, 140, and 300 skill, and higher tiers keep the earlier benefits. You must sit or craft nearby for one minute to receive the buffs, which last one hour. Campsites go outdoors, not in major cities, and each player can contribute only one feature.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Warcraft Forever Camping System Guide › Campfire Basics in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/camping","date":"2026-11-13"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Cooking Guide › Cooking Campfire Items and Buffs","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/cooking","date":"2026-11-03"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["general:camping","profession:cooking:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:c9b783787b269a1f3695609c03a7422ebb62edd7","section:c9e921fa9128343e5d3099c5ded02abc1c4c8d9b"]},{"id":"prof-campamento-profesiones","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Campamentos: qué aporta cada profesión","title_en":"Campsites: What Each Profession Adds","summary_es":"Cada profesión añade buffs, vendedores, reparación o estaciones de trabajo al campamento.","summary_en":"Each profession adds buffs, vendors, repairs, or crafting stations to a campsite.","keywords_es":["características de profesión en campamento","pozo de maná","rueda de afilar","robot de reactivos","tienda de campaña","estación de trabajo"],"keywords_en":["profession campsite features","mana well","sharpening wheel","reagent bot","camp tent","crafting station"],"text_es":"Cada profesión aporta características al campamento a 20, 140 y 300 de habilidad. La primera suele ser un buff o una ventaja, y las siguientes conservan ese beneficio y añaden vendedores, reparación o estaciones de trabajo. Por ejemplo, Alquimia pone un Pozo de maná, Herrería una Rueda de afilar e Ingeniería un Robot de componentes. Algunas características sirven como estación para recetas que la necesitan. Puedes usar la característica de otro jugador sin tener esa profesión, y los objetos se pueden comerciar o vender, aunque colocarlos exige la habilidad correspondiente.","text_en":"Each profession adds campsite features at 20, 140, and 300 skill. The first is usually a buff or benefit, and later ones keep that benefit and add vendors, repairs, or crafting stations. For example, Alchemy brings a Mana Well, Blacksmithing a Sharpening Wheel, and Engineering a Reagent Bot. Some features act as stations for recipes that need them. You can use another player's feature without having that profession, and the items can be traded or sold, though placing them requires the right skill.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Warcraft Forever Camping System Guide › Professions and Camping in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/camping","date":"2026-11-13"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["general:camping"],"source_hashes":["section:030fb5b5deec1b20f31ec84690bd8c749ec090ea"]},{"id":"prof-campamento-legado","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Campamentos y ventajas Legacy","title_en":"Campsites and Legacy Perks","summary_es":"Field Guide acorta la reutilización, Permanence alarga buffs y Reagent Economy quita reactivos al nivel 1.","summary_en":"Field Guide lowers the cooldown, Permanence extends buffs, and Reagent Economy removes reagents from the first feature.","keywords_es":["field guide campamento","permanence campamento","reagent economy","ventajas legacy campamento","reutilización de características"],"keywords_en":["field guide camping","permanence camping","reagent economy","campsite legacy perks","feature cooldown"],"text_es":"El sistema Legacy mejora los campamentos con varias ventajas. Field Guide reduce la reutilización para añadir características, hasta un 25% y de una hora a 45 minutos en el rango máximo. Permanence alarga hasta un 100% la duración de los beneficios de descansar en el campamento. Reagent Economy hace que las características de nivel 1 ya no necesiten reactivos para fabricarse.","text_en":"The Legacy system improves campsites with several perks. Field Guide reduces the cooldown for adding features, up to 25% and from one hour to 45 minutes at maximum rank. Permanence extends the duration of benefits from resting at a campsite by up to 100%. Reagent Economy means tier 1 features no longer need reagents to craft.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Warcraft Forever Camping System Guide › Camping and the Legacy System","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/camping","date":"2026-11-13"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Cooking Guide › Cooking Campfire Items and Buffs","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/cooking","date":"2026-11-03"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["general:camping","profession:cooking:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:12c6385d6fc27e9e8a72ecaf22365be355bd7143","section:c9b783787b269a1f3695609c03a7422ebb62edd7"]},{"id":"prof-recetas","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"De dónde salen las recetas","title_en":"Where Recipes Come From","summary_es":"Los instructores enseñan muchas, pero otras vienen de vendedores, misiones, reputación, botín y planos de mazmorra.","summary_en":"Trainers teach many, but others come from vendors, quests, reputation, loot, and dungeon blueprints.","keywords_es":["recetas de profesión","dónde conseguir recetas","recetas de vendedor","recetas de misión","planos de campamento","planos de mazmorra"],"keywords_en":["profession recipes","where to get recipes","vendor recipes","quest recipes","campsite blueprints","dungeon blueprints"],"text_es":"Los instructores enseñan muchas recetas de profesión. Otras se compran a vendedores, se obtienen en misiones o recompensas de reputación, o salen como botín de enemigos. Las recetas avanzadas de campamento no las entregan todos los instructores: la mayoría de planos de 140 y 300 son botín de mazmorras u otras fuentes del mundo. Tener la habilidad necesaria permite aprender la receta cuando la consigues, y algunas recetas exigen una herramienta o estación concreta.","text_en":"Trainers teach many profession recipes. Others are bought from vendors, earned from quests or reputation rewards, or drop from enemies. Advanced campsite recipes are not all taught by trainers: most 140 and 300 blueprints are dungeon drops or come from other world sources. Once you have the needed skill and the recipe, you can learn it; some recipes also need a specific tool or station.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Profession Guide › How to Learn a Profession","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/professions-overview","date":"2026-11-03"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Warcraft Forever Camping System Guide › Advanced Camping Blueprints","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/camping","date":"2026-11-13"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["general:camping","profession:_all:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:cb06e7b570d821973b4188030d9b587c8ce9a9e8","section:d388c3829bc2471177722e77cbabb03a4e2d65bc"]},{"id":"prof-ventajas-recoleccion","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Ventajas Legacy de recolección","title_en":"Gathering Legacy Perks","summary_es":"Bountiful Harvest aumenta los materiales raros que obtienen Herboristería, Minería y Desuello.","summary_en":"Bountiful Harvest increases the scarce materials from Herbalism, Mining, and Skinning.","keywords_es":["bountiful harvest","ventajas de recolección","materiales raros de hierbas","materiales raros de minería","materiales raros de desuello"],"keywords_en":["bountiful harvest","gathering perks","scarce herb materials","scarce mining materials","scarce skinning materials"],"text_es":"La ventaja Legacy Bountiful Harvest mejora las tres profesiones de recolección. En Herboristería aumenta los materiales raros que salen de los nodos de hierbas. En Minería incrementa lo que se recoge de las vetas, y en Desuello permite obtener más materiales raros de las criaturas. Sirve para reunir reactivos que usan otras profesiones además de venderlos.","text_en":"The Bountiful Harvest Legacy perk improves all three gathering professions. In Herbalism it increases the scarce materials from herb nodes. In Mining it increases what you gather from veins, and in Skinning it gives more scarce materials from creatures. It helps collect reagents used by other professions as well as materials to sell.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Herbalism Guide › New Scarce Herbalism Materials","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/herbalism","date":"2026-11-03"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Mining Guide › New Scarce Mining Materials","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/mining","date":"2026-11-03"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Skinning Guide › New Scarce Skinning Materials","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/skinning","date":"2026-11-03"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["profession:herbalism:overview","profession:mining:overview","profession:skinning:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:29fe4e512dc4036933875aab022d5ee76c6c12a5","section:41ee3c837192408b9a55a18c999b1bdedde3a000","section:76eae348981b5c6305d2d534b6d6adf803f49697"]},{"id":"prof-ventajas-artesania","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Ventajas Legacy de artesanía","title_en":"Crafting Legacy Perks","summary_es":"Master Chef, Luremaster, Working Overtime, Dedicated Study, Gourmand y Field Medicine mejoran oficios concretos.","summary_en":"Master Chef, Luremaster, Working Overtime, Dedicated Study, Gourmand, and Field Medicine improve specific trades.","keywords_es":["master chef","luremaster","working overtime","dedicated study","gourmand","field medicine"],"keywords_en":["master chef","luremaster","working overtime","dedicated study","gourmand","field medicine"],"text_es":"Varias ventajas Legacy mejoran profesiones de artesanía y secundarias. Master Chef da a Cocina una probabilidad de raciones extra, hasta el 50% en el rango máximo. Luremaster permite pescar un pez adicional con un cebo activo. Working Overtime sube hasta un 20% la probabilidad de ganar un punto de habilidad, y Dedicated Study da un punto cada 23 horas a la profesión más baja. Gourmand alarga los buffs de comida hasta el 100%, y Field Medicine acorta Vendado recientemente hasta 10 segundos fuera de mazmorras, bandas y campos de batalla.","text_en":"Several Legacy perks improve crafting and secondary professions. Master Chef gives Cooking a chance for extra servings, up to 50% at maximum rank. Luremaster lets you catch an extra fish while a lure is active. Working Overtime increases the chance of a skill point by up to 20%, and Dedicated Study gives one point every 23 hours to your lowest profession. Gourmand extends food buffs up to 100%, and Field Medicine shortens Recently Bandaged by up to 10 seconds outside dungeons, raids, and battlegrounds.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Cooking Guide › Cooking Speed and Legacy Perks","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/cooking","date":"2026-11-03"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Fishing Guide › Fishing Lures","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/fishing","date":"2026-11-03"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever First Aid Guide › Bandages","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/first-aid","date":"2026-11-03"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["profession:cooking:overview","profession:first-aid:overview","profession:fishing:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:5c71cd4eea732083207dba8dca155e9f4cc0a024","section:8bb86bf3ff4096e786c9e53db463c4b559dd2f6e","section:cd69f812a3ae2ac59f44c344c87723e6a6dcb89c"]},{"id":"prof-clases-armadura","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Profesiones según la armadura de tu clase","title_en":"Professions by Your Class Armor","summary_es":"Herrería encaja con placas, Peletería con cuero y malla, Sastrería con tela; Encantamiento e Ingeniería tienen público.","summary_en":"Blacksmithing fits plate, Leatherworking leather and mail, Tailoring cloth; Enchanting and Engineering have clear users.","keywords_es":["profesión según clase","profesión para guerrero","profesión para druida","profesión para mago","armadura de clase"],"keywords_en":["profession by class","profession for warrior","profession for druid","profession for mage","class armor"],"text_es":"Tu clase no te obliga a elegir una profesión, pero algunas combinaciones encajan mejor. Herrería resulta útil a Guerreros y Paladines que llevan malla o placas y quieren fabricar sus armas y escudos. Peletería encaja con Druidas y Pícaros por el cuero, y con Cazadores y Chamanes que pasan a malla. Sastrería sirve a Magos, Sacerdotes y Brujos por la armadura de tela, Encantamiento también les resulta útil, e Ingeniería permite a los Cazadores fabricar armas de fuego y munición.","text_en":"Your class does not force a profession, but some combinations fit better. Blacksmithing suits Warriors and Paladins who wear mail or plate and want to make their own weapons and shields. Leatherworking fits Druids and Rogues for leather, and Hunters and Shamans who move to mail. Tailoring serves Mages, Priests, and Warlocks for cloth armor, Enchanting is also useful to them, and Engineering lets Hunters make guns and ammunition.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Blacksmithing Guide › Who Should Pick Blacksmithing?","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/blacksmithing","date":"2026-11-03"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Leatherworking Guide › Who Should Pick Leatherworking?","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/leatherworking","date":"2026-11-03"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Tailoring Guide › Who Should Pick Tailoring?","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/tailoring","date":"2026-11-03"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Enchanting Guide › Who Should Pick Enchanting?","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/enchanting","date":"2026-11-03"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Engineering Guide › Who Should Pick Engineering?","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/engineering","date":"2026-11-03"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["profession:blacksmithing:overview","profession:enchanting:overview","profession:engineering:overview","profession:leatherworking:overview","profession:tailoring:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:0975884f443d8117de463b717dd4d8f54af051c4","section:14950165a5bde07e142afd9ac2a894db71d17da0","section:3090895d83e59c89cf5b56fe75bf311b0b058bcf","section:6b42ad67fd238b74019e20c4b3f5377640c11f72","section:c64a47a0abb3a552836a97273fb783a6a8ddeba2"]},{"id":"prof-herramientas-estaciones","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Herramientas y estaciones de trabajo","title_en":"Tools and Workstations","summary_es":"Muchas recetas piden martillo, pico, vara rúnica, yunque, forja u horno; los campamentos aportan algunas estaciones.","summary_en":"Many recipes need a hammer, pick, runed rod, anvil, forge, oven, or laboratory; campsites provide some stations.","keywords_es":["herramientas de profesión","estaciones de trabajo","yunque","forja","horno de hierro","laboratorio de alquimia"],"keywords_en":["profession tools","workstations","anvil","forge","iron oven","alchemy laboratory"],"text_es":"Muchas recetas de profesión necesitan una herramienta o una estación de trabajo. Herrería usa martillo y yunque, y algunas recetas una forja; Minería necesita pico y una forja para fundir; Encantamiento requiere varas rúnicas; Ingeniería usa herramientas propias. Cocina necesita una fuente de calor y algunas recetas un Horno de hierro, mientras que Alquimia tiene recetas que piden un Laboratorio de alquimia. Los campamentos pueden aportar estaciones como el yunque, la forja, el laboratorio o el horno para trabajar lejos de la ciudad.","text_en":"Many profession recipes need a tool or a workstation. Blacksmithing uses a hammer and anvil, and some recipes a forge; Mining needs a pick and a forge to smelt; Enchanting requires runed rods; Engineering uses its own tools. Cooking needs a heat source and some recipes an Iron Oven, while Alchemy has recipes that require an Alchemy Laboratory. Campsites can provide stations such as the anvil, forge, laboratory, or oven so you can work away from the city.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Profession Guide › How to Learn a Profession","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/professions-overview","date":"2026-11-03"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Warcraft Forever Camping System Guide › Profession Features for the Camping System","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/camping","date":"2026-11-13"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["general:camping","profession:_all:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:8bcd49188e86bbb05caeed69998128193d8105ef","section:cb06e7b570d821973b4188030d9b587c8ce9a9e8"]}]},"07-mazmorras.json":{"description":"Capítulo 7: Mazmorras. Secciones editoriales redactadas desde guías de terceros.","sections":[{"id":"mazmorra-general","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Las mazmorras de Forever","title_en":"Dungeons in Forever","summary_es":"Hay 35 mazmorras en 28 instancias, de nivel 13 a 60; el botín y las misiones de las altas se descubren jugando.","summary_en":"There are 35 dungeons across 28 instances, levels 13 to 60; loot and quests for higher ones are discovered by playing.","keywords_es":["mazmorras de forever","cuántas mazmorras hay","niveles de mazmorras","mazmorras nuevas","botín de mazmorra"],"keywords_en":["wow forever dungeons","how many dungeons","dungeon levels","new dungeons","dungeon loot"],"text_es":"En Forever hay 35 mazmorras repartidas en 28 instancias, desde nivel 13 hasta 60, con clásicas y nuevas. El botín y las misiones de las mazmorras de nivel alto se van descubriendo al jugarlas. Cada mazmorra tiene un rango de nivel y varias misiones; los jefes y el botín exacto salen de la base de datos.","text_en":"Forever has 35 dungeons across 28 instances, from level 13 to 60, mixing classic and new ones. Loot and quests for higher-level dungeons are being discovered as people play them. Each dungeon has a level range and several quests; exact bosses and loot come from the game database.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: All Available Dungeons in WoW Forever › WoW Forever Dungeons Overview","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/dungeons-overview","date":"2026-11-11"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["general:dungeons-overview"],"source_hashes":["section:1af863846ee4e5073a1a5c8fcfdb1da5df54711e"]},{"id":"mazmorra-preparacion","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Preparar una mazmorra","title_en":"Preparing for a Dungeon","summary_es":"Recoge las misiones, comprueba la facción y reparte tanque, sanador y DPS; el control ayuda con patrullas y adds.","summary_en":"Pick up quests, check faction, and bring tank, healer, and DPS; control helps with patrols and adds.","keywords_es":["preparar mazmorra","misiones antes de la mazmorra","grupo de mazmorra","tanque sanador dps","control de masas mazmorra"],"keywords_en":["dungeon preparation","dungeon quests","dungeon group","tank healer dps","dungeon crowd control"],"text_es":"Antes de entrar, recoge las misiones: cada mazmorra tiene varias y algunas dan equipo o experiencia. No todas son para las dos facciones: varias son solo Horda o solo Alianza. Las páginas no fijan un tamaño de grupo; las estrategias reparten tanque, sanador y DPS, y piden control para patrullas y adds. Lleva al sanador con maná y enfoca a los adds peligrosos antes que al jefe.","text_en":"Before entering, pick up the quests: each dungeon has several, and some give gear or experience. Not all are for both factions: several are Horde-only or Alliance-only. The pages do not fix a group size; the strategies use a tank, healer, and DPS, and ask for control on patrols and adds. Keep the healer supplied with mana and focus dangerous adds before the boss.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: All Available Dungeons in WoW Forever › WoW Forever Dungeons Overview","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/dungeons-overview","date":"2026-11-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: All Available Quests for Ragefire Chasm › Ragefire Chasm Dungeon Quests","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/ragefire-chasm-quests","date":"2026-09-29"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["dungeon:_all:quests","general:dungeons-overview"],"source_hashes":["section:1af863846ee4e5073a1a5c8fcfdb1da5df54711e","section:e76f11c30e94831320711c72cc9d99bffddac614"]},{"id":"mazmorra-nuevas","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Las nuevas mazmorras de Forever","title_en":"Forever's New Dungeons","summary_es":"Salón de los Feudales, Ruinas de Lordaeron, Excavación: Los Humedales y Ciudad de Dalaran son nuevas.","summary_en":"Hall of Thanes, Ruins of Lordaeron, Excavation: Wetlands and City of Dalaran are new.","keywords_es":["mazmorras nuevas forever","salón de los feudales","ruinas de lordaeron","excavación los humedales","ciudad de dalaran"],"keywords_en":["new forever dungeons","hall of thanes","ruins of lordaeron","excavation wetlands","city of dalaran"],"text_es":"Las nuevas son Salón de los Feudales (13-18, Forjaz), Ruinas de Lordaeron (15-20, Entrañas), Excavación: Los Humedales (26-33, Los Humedales) y Ciudad de Dalaran (28-35, Montañas de Alterac). Son exclusivas de Forever y tienen guía completa. Dalaran exige una llave a la Horda para entrar por las cloacas, y el Salón está bajo la Sala del Trono de Forjaz. El resto de mazmorras de esta guía son clásicas.","text_en":"The new ones are Hall of Thanes (13-18, Ironforge), Ruins of Lordaeron (15-20, Undercity), Excavation: Wetlands (26-33, Wetlands), and City of Dalaran (28-35, Alterac Mountains). They are exclusive to Forever and have full guides. Dalaran requires a key for Horde groups entering through the sewers, and the Hall lies under Ironforge's throne room. The other dungeons in this guide are classic.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: All Available Dungeons in WoW Forever › WoW Forever Dungeons Overview","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/dungeons-overview","date":"2026-11-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Hall of Thanes Dungeon Guide › Hall of Thanes Dungeon Entrance and Basics","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/hall-of-thanes-guide","date":"2026-10-19"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Ruins of Lordaeron Dungeon Guide › Ruins of Lordaeron Dungeon Entrance and Basics","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/ruins-of-lordaeron-guide","date":"2026-10-19"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Excavation Site: Wetlands Dungeon Guide › Excavation Site: Wetlands Dungeon Entrance and Basics","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/excavation-site-wetlands-guide","date":"2026-10-18"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: City of Dalaran Dungeon Guide › City of Dalaran Dungeon Entrance and Basics","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/city-of-dalaran-guide","date":"2026-10-18"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["dungeon:city-of-dalaran","dungeon:excavation-site-wetlands","dungeon:hall-of-thanes","dungeon:ruins-of-lordaeron","general:dungeons-overview"],"source_hashes":["section:0c7a211d76d1a1446a621ab4018ce536ed112140","section:1af863846ee4e5073a1a5c8fcfdb1da5df54711e","section:7a47df7d0060d3601a6b5005bff48a17aaffeeea","section:910464856e8952d442ccfa0678f13b02c1384434","section:99bc604b3049eba46b7d0de7d49c07f9d50b60f4"]},{"id":"mazmorra-ragefire-entrada","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Sima Ígnea: entrada y qué esperar","title_en":"Ragefire Chasm: Entrance and What to Expect","summary_es":"Sima Ígnea está en Orgrimmar, es 13-18 y solo tiene misiones de Horda; cuidado con lava y patrullas.","summary_en":"Ragefire Chasm is in Orgrimmar, level 13-18, and has Horde-only quests; watch the lava and patrols.","keywords_es":["sima ígnea","ragefire chasm","cómo llegar a sima ígnea","sima ígnea misiones","sima ígnea jefes"],"keywords_en":["ragefire chasm","ragefire chasm entrance","ragefire chasm quests","ragefire chasm bosses","orgrimmar dungeon"],"text_es":"Sima Ígnea está en Orgrimmar, en el nivel más bajo del Risco de las Sombras. Es de nivel 13-18 y es una mazmorra de Horda: sus cinco misiones son de Horda y la Alianza no tiene ninguna. En Taragaman, el tanque no debe pelear junto al borde porque un empuje puede tirarlo a la lava; Jergosh y Bazzalan salen con patrullas, así que lleva control y mata primero a los adds de Bazzalan. Oggleflint comparte sala con troggs: límpiala antes de tirar.","text_en":"Ragefire Chasm is in Orgrimmar, on the lowest level of the Cleft of Shadow. It is level 13-18 and a Horde dungeon: its five quests are Horde-only and Alliance has none. Against Taragaman, the tank should not fight near the edge because a knockback can throw them into the lava; Jergosh and Bazzalan come with patrols, so bring control and kill Bazzalan's adds first. Oggleflint shares a room with troggs: clear it before pulling.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Ragefire Chasm Dungeon Guide › Ragefire Chasm Dungeon Entrance and Basics","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/ragefire-chasm-guide","date":"2026-10-19"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["dungeon:ragefire-chasm"],"source_hashes":["section:9c67f2c650b13ca2301a2257dad3123941718c02"]},{"id":"mazmorra-ragefire-misiones","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Misiones de Sima Ígnea","title_en":"Ragefire Chasm Quests","summary_es":"Cinco misiones de Horda: Cima del Trueno, Entrañas y Orgrimmar; la Alianza no tiene ninguna.","summary_en":"Five Horde quests from Thunder Bluff, Undercity, and Orgrimmar; Alliance has none.","keywords_es":["misiones de sima ígnea","midiendo fuerzas con el enemigo","enemigos ocultos","matar a la bestia","misiones horda sima ígnea"],"keywords_en":["ragefire chasm quests","testing an enemy's strength","hidden enemies","slaying the beast","horde ragefire quests"],"text_es":"Sima Ígnea tiene cinco misiones, todas de Horda: Midiendo fuerzas con el enemigo, Buscando la cartera perdida y su seguimiento La vuelta de la cartera perdida (Cima del Trueno, Rahauro); Poder destructivo (Entrañas, Varimathras); Enemigos ocultos (Orgrimmar, Thrall); Matar a la bestia (Orgrimmar, Neeru Fireblade). La Alianza no tiene misiones y no se recomienda correrla.","text_en":"Ragefire Chasm has five quests, all Horde: Testing an Enemy's Strength, Searching for the Lost Satchel, and its follow-up Returning the Lost Satchel (Thunder Bluff, Rahauro); The Power to Destroy... (Undercity, Varimathras); Hidden Enemies (Orgrimmar, Thrall); Slaying the Beast (Orgrimmar, Neeru Fireblade). Alliance has no quests and is not recommended to run it.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: All Available Quests for Ragefire Chasm › Ragefire Chasm Dungeon Quests","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/ragefire-chasm-quests","date":"2026-09-29"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["dungeon:_all:quests"],"source_hashes":["section:e76f11c30e94831320711c72cc9d99bffddac614"]},{"id":"mazmorra-hall-entrada","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Salón de los Feudales: entrada y qué esperar","title_en":"Hall of Thanes: Entrance and What to Expect","summary_es":"Nueva mazmorra 13-18 bajo Forjaz; tres misiones de Alianza y jefes con adds, empujes y miedo.","summary_en":"New level 13-18 dungeon under Ironforge; three Alliance quests and bosses with adds, knockbacks, and fear.","keywords_es":["salón de los feudales","hall of thanes","cómo llegar al salón de los feudales","salón de los feudales jefes","mazmorra nueva forjaz"],"keywords_en":["hall of thanes","hall of thanes entrance","hall of thanes bosses","new ironforge dungeon","hall of thanes quests"],"text_es":"El Salón de los Feudales es nuevo, de nivel 13-20, y está en Forjaz, bajo la Sala del Trono, en la Vieja Forjaz. La Alianza tiene tres de sus cinco misiones y un acceso cómodo; la Horda puede entrar, pero llega peor. En Faldrim limpia las apariciones antes; con Magmatus mata primero al summoner y aparta al jefe del grupo; con Durgen ocupa a los gólems y limpia la sala antes. Plunder empuja: llévalo a la sala anterior para no atraer más mobs.","text_en":"Hall of Thanes is new, level 13-20, and lies in Ironforge under the throne room, in Old Ironforge. Alliance has three of its five quests and an easy approach; Horde can enter but has a harder trip. Clear the apparitions before Faldrim; with Magmatus kill the summoner first and keep the boss away from the group; with Durgen handle the golems and clear the room first. Plunder knocks back: pull him to the previous room so you do not attract more mobs.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Hall of Thanes Dungeon Guide › Hall of Thanes Dungeon Entrance and Basics","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/hall-of-thanes-guide","date":"2026-10-19"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["dungeon:hall-of-thanes"],"source_hashes":["section:910464856e8952d442ccfa0678f13b02c1384434"]},{"id":"mazmorra-hall-misiones","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Misiones del Salón de los Feudales","title_en":"Hall of Thanes Quests","summary_es":"Cinco misiones, tres de Alianza; se cogen dentro del Salón, en Forjaz y en Dun Morogh.","summary_en":"Five quests, three Alliance-only; they start inside the Hall, in Ironforge, and in Dun Morogh.","keywords_es":["misiones del salón de los feudales","un agravio antiguo","reliquias importantes","incursión en la antigua forjaz","misiones alianza salón"],"keywords_en":["hall of thanes quests","an ancient grudge","important heirlooms","old ironforge incursion","alliance hall of thanes"],"text_es":"El Salón de los Feudales tiene cinco misiones; tres son solo de Alianza. Un agravio antiguo y El tratado de entendimiento se cogen dentro; Reliquias importantes y Los muertos sin descanso en Forjaz (Thom Filch y Afadra Dunwall), e Incursión en la Antigua Forjaz en Dun Morogh (Earthseer Farsen). Tres de las cinco son solo de Alianza; las otras dos están abiertas a las dos facciones.","text_en":"Hall of Thanes has five quests; three are Alliance-only. An Ancient Grudge and The Treaty of Understanding start inside; Important Heirlooms and The Restless Dead in Ironforge (Thom Filch and Afadra Dunwall), and Old Ironforge Incursion in Dun Morogh (Earthseer Farsen). The names are the same for both factions, but the Alliance quests are not available to Horde.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: All Available Quests for Hall of Thanes › Hall of Thanes Dungeon Quests","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/hall-of-thanes-quests","date":"2026-09-30"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["dungeon:_all:quests"],"source_hashes":["section:8e8c09d8bbef981b9a17dea1fabb25c2a1984084"]},{"id":"mazmorra-ruinas-entrada","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Ruinas de Lordaeron: entrada y qué esperar","title_en":"Ruins of Lordaeron: Entrance and What to Expect","summary_es":"Nueva mazmorra 15-20 en Entrañas; seis jefes, oleadas y un raro que solo puede matar la Horda.","summary_en":"New level 15-20 dungeon in Undercity; six bosses, waves, and a rare only Horde can kill.","keywords_es":["ruinas de lordaeron","ruins of lordaeron","cómo llegar a las ruinas de lordaeron","ruinas de lordaeron jefes","mazmorra nueva entrañas"],"keywords_en":["ruins of lordaeron","ruins of lordaeron entrance","ruins of lordaeron bosses","new undercity dungeon","ruins of lordaeron quests"],"text_es":"Las Ruinas de Lordaeron son nuevas, de nivel 15-22, y están en Entrañas, a la izquierda de la entrada a las Ruinas. Tiene seis jefes y un raro; las misiones se reparten entre seis de Horda y cuatro de Alianza. El Barón empuja y reduce la amenaza del tanque, que debe volver a provocarlo; Viktor y The Abandoned invocan oleadas, así que guarda curación; Rath'mael exige interrumpir su golpe de llamas. El Lordaeron Captain es raro, amistoso para la Alianza y solo lo puede matar la Horda.","text_en":"Ruins of Lordaeron is new, level 15-22, and sits in Undercity, left of the entrance to the Ruins. It has six bosses and a rare; quests split into six Horde and four Alliance. The Baron knocks back and lowers the tank's threat, so the tank must taunt him back; Viktor and The Abandoned summon waves, so save healing; Rath'mael requires interrupting his flame strike. The Lordaeron Captain is a rare, friendly to Alliance, and only Horde can kill him.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Ruins of Lordaeron Dungeon Guide › Ruins of Lordaeron Dungeon Entrance and Basics","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/ruins-of-lordaeron-guide","date":"2026-10-19"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["dungeon:ruins-of-lordaeron"],"source_hashes":["section:7a47df7d0060d3601a6b5005bff48a17aaffeeea"]},{"id":"mazmorra-ruinas-misiones","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Misiones de las Ruinas de Lordaeron","title_en":"Ruins of Lordaeron Quests","summary_es":"Diez misiones, seis de Horda y cuatro de Alianza; muchas empiezan dentro o en Entrañas.","summary_en":"Ten quests, six Horde and four Alliance; many start inside or in Undercity.","keywords_es":["misiones de las ruinas de lordaeron","abominable creatures","justicia de la luz","la cólera de rath'mael","el blasón de lordaeron"],"keywords_en":["ruins of lordaeron quests","abominable creatures","light's justice","wrath of rath'mael","crest of lordaeron"],"text_es":"Hay diez misiones: seis de Horda y cuatro de Alianza. Dentro empiezan Abominable Creatures (Captain Truman), La insignia ensangrentada, Recuerda el amor que te tengo y Unending Torment; El blasón de Lordaeron tiene versión de Alianza (Ventormenta, Lady Dena) y de Horda (Entrañas, Oran). Fuera: Una petición aterradora (Bosque de Argénteos, Tabitha), Justicia de la Luz y The New Plague (Entrañas), y La cólera de Rath'mael (Claros de Tirisfal, Deathguard Kristof).","text_en":"There are ten quests: six Horde and four Alliance. Inside start Abominable Creatures (Captain Truman), Bloodied Insignia, Remember That I Love You, and Unending Torment; Crest of Lordaeron has an Alliance version (Stormwind, Lady Dena) and a Horde one (Undercity, Oran). Outside: A Frightened Request (Silverpine Forest, Tabitha), Light's Justice and The New Plague (Undercity), and The Wrath of Rath'mael (Tirisfal Glades, Deathguard Kristof).","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: All Available Quests for Ruins of Lordaeron › Ruins of Lordaeron Dungeon Quests","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/ruins-of-lordaeron-quests","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["dungeon:_all:quests"],"source_hashes":["section:cd9b53916ba75af46f743780d88d7562b3e2b5ba"]},{"id":"mazmorra-wailing-entrada","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Cuevas de los Lamentos: entrada y qué esperar","title_en":"Wailing Caverns: Entrance and What to Expect","summary_es":"Cuevas de los Lamentos está en Los Baldíos, es 15-24 y mezcla druidas, agua y un jefe final invocado.","summary_en":"Wailing Caverns is in the Barrens, level 15-24, mixing druids, water, and a summoned final boss.","keywords_es":["cuevas de los lamentos","wailing caverns","cómo llegar a cuevas de los lamentos","cuevas de los lamentos jefes","mutanus"],"keywords_en":["wailing caverns","wailing caverns entrance","wailing caverns bosses","mutanus","wailing caverns quests"],"text_es":"Las Cuevas de los Lamentos están en Los Baldíos, junto al oasis Lushwater y al suroeste del Cruce. Son de nivel 15-24; la Horda llega fácil y la Alianza debe venir desde Bahía del Botín o Vallefresno. Los druidas enemigos duermen y lanzan rayos: interrumpe el sueño y separa patrullas. En Verdan, aléjate de su cuerpo si no necesitas melé; Mutanus se invoca tras matar a los cuatro líderes y escoltar al discípulo de Naralex, con oleadas, miedo y sueño.","text_en":"Wailing Caverns is in the Barrens by Lushwater Oasis, southwest of the Crossroads. It is level 15-24; Horde reaches it easily and Alliance comes from Booty Bay or Ashenvale. The enemy druids sleep and cast lightning: interrupt the sleep and split patrols. Against Verdan, stay away from his body if you do not need melee; Mutanus is summoned after killing the four leaders and escorting the Disciple of Naralex, with waves, fear, and sleep.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Wailing Caverns Dungeon Guide › Wailing Caverns Dungeon Entrance and Basics","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/wailing-caverns-guide","date":"2026-10-19"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["dungeon:wailing-caverns"],"source_hashes":["section:5699976e263c00974d32b423df210676029c50f2"]},{"id":"mazmorra-wailing-misiones","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Misiones de las Cuevas de los Lamentos","title_en":"Wailing Caverns Quests","summary_es":"Siete misiones, dos solo de Horda; varias empiezan en Los Baldíos y dos en Cima del Trueno.","summary_en":"Seven quests, two Horde-only; several start in the Barrens and two in Thunder Bluff.","keywords_es":["misiones de cuevas de los lamentos","pellejo de los descarriados","líderes del colmillo","erradicación de descarriados","repitilia"],"keywords_en":["wailing caverns quests","deviate hides","leaders of the fang","deviate eradication","serpentbloom"],"text_es":"Hay siete misiones; dos son solo de Horda: Repitilia (Cima del Trueno, Apothecary Zamah) y Líderes del Colmillo (Cima del Trueno, Nara Wildmane). En Los Baldíos empiezan Pellejo de los descarriados (Nalpak), ¡A por la botella! (Crane Operator Bigglefuzz), Las bebidas astutas (Mebok Mizzyrix) y Erradicación de descarriados (Ebru). El fragmento brillante empieza con el Fragmento resplandeciente de Mutanus.","text_en":"There are seven quests; two are Horde-only: Serpentbloom (Thunder Bluff, Apothecary Zamah) and Leaders of the Fang (Thunder Bluff, Nara Wildmane). In the Barrens start Deviate Hides (Nalpak), Trouble at the Docks (Crane Operator Bigglefuzz), Smart Drinks (Mebok Mizzyrix), and Deviate Eradication (Ebru). The Glowing Shard starts from Mutanus's loot.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: All Available Quests for Wailing Caverns › Wailing Caverns Dungeon Quests","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/wailing-caverns-quests","date":"2026-09-30"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["dungeon:_all:quests"],"source_hashes":["section:a520f9e50ef23b46492e773bcda2e3fa2fc88a73"]},{"id":"mazmorra-deadmines-entrada","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Minas de la Muerte: entrada y qué esperar","title_en":"Deadmines: Entrance and What to Expect","summary_es":"Minas de la Muerte está en Páramos de Poniente, es 17-26 y sus siete misiones son de Alianza.","summary_en":"Deadmines is in Westfall, level 17-26, and its seven quests are Alliance-only.","keywords_es":["minas de la muerte","deadmines","cómo llegar a minas de la muerte","minas de la muerte jefes","van cleef"],"keywords_en":["deadmines","deadmines entrance","deadmines bosses","van cleef","deadmines quests"],"text_es":"Las Minas de la Muerte están en Páramos de Poniente, en una casa de Moonbrook, al sur de la zona. Son de nivel 17-26; la Alianza llega fácil y la Horda debe venir en barco desde Trinquete. Rhahk'Zor comparte sala con dos guardias: sepáralos; Sneed's Shredder tiene miedo en área, así que limpia goblins; Mr. Smite aturde a todos al 66% y 33% y trae guardias, y VanCleef invoca más adds al 50%. Cookie se kitéa y se le interrumpe la curación.","text_en":"Deadmines is in Westfall, inside a house in Moonbrook at the south of the zone. It is level 17-26; Alliance reaches it easily and Horde must take the boat from Ratchet. Rhahk'Zor shares a room with two guards: separate them; Sneed's Shredder has area fear, so clear goblins; Mr. Smite stuns everyone at 66% and 33% and brings guards, and VanCleef summons more adds at 50%. Kite Cookie and interrupt his healing.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Deadmines Dungeon Guide › Deadmines Dungeon Entrance and Basics","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/deadmines-guide","date":"2026-10-18"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["dungeon:deadmines"],"source_hashes":["section:2aef6de33e03777d9a196558589e0b281d8c4f34"]},{"id":"mazmorra-deadmines-misiones","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Misiones de las Minas de la Muerte","title_en":"Deadmines Quests","summary_es":"Siete misiones solo de Alianza; empiezan en Páramos de Poniente y Ventormenta, y una con el botín de VanCleef.","summary_en":"Seven Alliance-only quests; they start in Westfall and Stormwind, and one from VanCleef's loot.","keywords_es":["misiones de minas de la muerte","la hermandad de los defias","pañuelos rojos de seda","la carta sin enviar","misiones alianza deadmines"],"keywords_en":["deadmines quests","the defias brotherhood","red silk bandanas","the unsent letter","alliance deadmines quests"],"text_es":"Las siete misiones son solo de Alianza. En Páramos de Poniente empiezan Destrucción en las Minas de la Muerte (Alba Fairmoon), Pañuelos rojos de seda (Scout Riell) y La hermandad de los Defias (Gryan Stoutmantle); en Ventormenta, La recolección de Tarjetas del Sindicato Minero y Oh hermano... (Wilder Thistlenettle) y Asalto subterráneo (Shoni). La carta sin enviar empieza con el botín de VanCleef y se entrega en Ventormenta a Baros Alexston.","text_en":"All seven quests are Alliance-only. In Westfall start Destruction in Deadmines (Alba Fairmoon), Red Silk Bandanas (Scout Riell), and The Defias Brotherhood (Gryan Stoutmantle); in Stormwind, Collecting Memories and Oh Brother... (Wilder Thistlenettle) and Underground Assault (Shoni). The Unsent Letter starts from VanCleef's loot and is turned in to Baros Alexston in Stormwind.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: All Available Quests for Deadmines › Deadmines Dungeon Quests","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/deadmines-quests","date":"2026-09-30"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["dungeon:_all:quests"],"source_hashes":["section:46f766d3428620720471d43436b3af78b45347d8"]},{"id":"mazmorra-shadowfang-entrada","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Castillo de Colmillo Oscuro: entrada y qué esperar","title_en":"Shadowfang Keep: Entrance and What to Expect","summary_es":"Castillo de Colmillo Oscuro está en Bosque de Argénteos, es 20-30 y castiga con salas estrechas y maldiciones.","summary_en":"Shadowfang Keep is in Silverpine Forest, level 20-30, and punishes with tight rooms and curses.","keywords_es":["castillo de colmillo oscuro","shadowfang keep","cómo llegar a colmillo oscuro","colmillos oscuro jefes","arugal"],"keywords_en":["shadowfang keep","shadowfang keep entrance","shadowfang keep bosses","arugal","shadowfang keep quests"],"text_es":"El Castillo de Colmillo Oscuro está en Bosque de Argénteos, subiendo la rampa cerca del Muro de Greymane. Es de nivel 20-30; la Horda llega fácil y la Alianza desde Puerto de Menethil y Costasur. Las salas son estrechas: limpia patrullas y lleva control. Baron Silverlaine aplica una maldición que reduce la curación un 75%, así que disípala; Commander Springvale trae un guardia con silencio y se cura; Arugal se teletransporta y baja la amenaza del tanque: usa esquinas para cortar la línea de visión.","text_en":"Shadowfang Keep is in Silverpine Forest, up the ramp near the Greymane Wall. It is level 20-30; Horde reaches it easily and Alliance comes from Menethil Harbor and Southshore. Rooms are tight: clear patrols and bring control. Baron Silverlaine applies a curse that cuts healing by 75%, so dispel it; Commander Springvale brings a guard with silence and heals himself; Arugal teleports and drops the tank's threat: use corners to break line of sight.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Shadowfang Keep Dungeon Guide › Shadowfang Keep Dungeon Entrance and Basics","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/shadowfang-keep-guide","date":"2026-10-19"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["dungeon:shadowfang-keep"],"source_hashes":["section:78fb4d87065f974a19cf22d7b670fe1c29d31f72"]},{"id":"mazmorra-shadowfang-misiones","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Misiones del Castillo de Colmillo Oscuro","title_en":"Shadowfang Keep Quests","summary_es":"Seis misiones: tres de clase y tres de Horda; incluyen Brujo, Pícaro y Paladín.","summary_en":"Six quests: three class-specific and three Horde; they include Warlock, Rogue, and Paladin.","keywords_es":["misiones de colmillo oscuro","el orbe de soran'ruk","the horn of xelthos","la prueba de rectitud","arugal debe morir"],"keywords_en":["shadowfang keep quests","orb of soran'ruk","horn of xelthos","test of righteousness","arugal must die"],"text_es":"Hay seis misiones: tres de clase y tres de Horda. El orbe de Soran'ruk es de Brujo (Los Baldíos, Doan Karhan); The Horn of Xelthos es de Pícaro y obliga a hacerla en solitario (Bosque de Argénteos); La prueba de rectitud es de Paladín (Dun Morogh, Jordan Stilwell). Para la Horda: Mortacechadores en Colmillo Oscuro (Bosque de Argénteos, High Executor Hadrec), El Libro de Ur (Entrañas, Keeper Bel'dugur) y Arugal debe morir (Bosque de Argénteos, Dalar Dawnweaver).","text_en":"There are six quests: three class-specific and three Horde. The Orb of Soran'ruk is for Warlock (Barrens, Doan Karhan); The Horn of Xelthos is for Rogue and must be done solo (Silverpine Forest); The Test of Righteousness is for Paladin (Dun Morogh, Jordan Stilwell). For Horde: Deathstalkers in Shadowfang (Silverpine Forest, High Executor Hadrec), The Book of Ur (Undercity, Keeper Bel'dugur), and Arugal Must Die (Silverpine Forest, Dalar Dawnweaver).","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: All Available Quests for Shadowfang Keep › Shadowfang Keep Dungeon Quests","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/shadowfang-keep-quests","date":"2026-10-02"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["dungeon:_all:quests"],"source_hashes":["section:920cd23e3b796719874ffc64809d0f6e9a18976a"]},{"id":"mazmorra-blackfathom-entrada","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Cavernas de Brazanegra: entrada y qué esperar","title_en":"Blackfathom Deeps: Entrance and What to Expect","summary_es":"Cavernas de Brazanegra está en Vallefresno, es 24-32 y combina agua, patrullas y cuatro braseros.","summary_en":"Blackfathom Deeps is in Ashenvale, level 24-32, and mixes water, patrols, and four braziers.","keywords_es":["cavernas de brazanegra","blackfathom deeps","cómo llegar a brazanegra","brazanegra jefes","kelris"],"keywords_en":["blackfathom deeps","blackfathom deeps entrance","blackfathom bosses","kelris","blackfathom quests"],"text_es":"Las Cavernas de Brazanegra están en Vallefresno, al norte de la costa de Zoram, bajo tierra. Son de nivel 24-32 y tienen partes bajo el agua: lleva respiración acuática o pociones. Lady Sarevess y Gelihast castigan a los cuerpos a cuerpo; Lorgus tiene un Escudo de relámpagos que conviene disipar; Kelris duerme a los cercanos y hay que encender cuatro braseros uno a uno; Aku'mai pega fuerte al tanque y deja nubes de veneno. Un sanador atento y control para patrullas marcan la diferencia.","text_en":"Blackfathom Deeps is in Ashenvale, north of the Zoram Strand, underground. It is level 24-32 and has underwater sections: bring water breathing or potions. Lady Sarevess and Gelihast punish melee; Lorgus has a lightning shield worth dispelling; Kelris sleeps nearby players and you must light four braziers one at a time; Aku'mai hits the tank hard and leaves poison clouds. An attentive healer and control for patrols make the difference.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Blackfathom Deeps Dungeon Guide › Blackfathom Deeps Dungeon Entrance and Basics","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/blackfathom-deeps-guide","date":"2026-10-19"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["dungeon:blackfathom-deeps"],"source_hashes":["section:7d62d853de7a16590e58d90b21873016cc86c174"]},{"id":"mazmorra-blackfathom-misiones","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Misiones de las Cavernas de Brazanegra","title_en":"Blackfathom Deeps Quests","summary_es":"Trece misiones, seis de Alianza y seis de Horda, más la de Brujo; muchas empiezan en Darnassus y Vallefresno.","summary_en":"Thirteen quests, six Alliance and six Horde, plus the Warlock one; many start in Darnassus and Ashenvale.","keywords_es":["misiones de brazanegra","la vileza de brazanegra","la esencia de aku'mai","lealtad a los dioses antiguos","el orbe de soran'ruk"],"keywords_en":["blackfathom deeps quests","blackfathom villainy","essence of aku'mai","allegiance to the old gods","orb of soran'ruk"],"text_es":"Hay trece misiones: seis de Alianza, seis de Horda y la de Brujo El orbe de Soran'ruk (Los Baldíos, Doan Karhan). En Forjaz: El conocimiento de las profundidades; en Darnassus: Buscando a Thaelrid y Cascada del Crepúsculo; dentro: La vileza de Brazanegra; en Costa Oscura: Investigaciones acerca de la corrupción; en Vallefresno: La esencia de Aku'Mai, Lealtad a los dioses antiguos y Entre ruinas. Barón Aquanis empieza con un objeto y se entrega en Vallefresno a Je'neu; La búsqueda de la gema Kor es de Paladín y tiene versión de cada facción.","text_en":"There are thirteen quests: six Alliance, six Horde, and the Warlock quest The Orb of Soran'ruk (Barrens, Doan Karhan). In Ironforge: Knowledge in the Deeps; in Darnassus: In Search of Thaelrid and Twilight Falls; inside: Blackfathom Villainy; in Darkshore: Researching the Corruption; in Ashenvale: The Essence of Aku'Mai, Allegiance to the Old Gods, and Amongst the Ruins. Baron Aquanis starts from an item and is turned in at Ashenvale to Je'neu; Seeking the Kor Gem is for Paladin and has a version for each faction.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: All Available Quests for Blackfathom Deeps › Blackfathom Deeps Dungeon Quests","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/blackfathom-deeps-quests","date":"2026-09-30"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["dungeon:_all:quests"],"source_hashes":["section:273e71abd4bd1a9c4222125fcd1d51570d0532d8"]},{"id":"mazmorra-stockade-entrada","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Mazmorras de Ventormenta: entrada y qué esperar","title_en":"Stormwind Stockade: Entrance and What to Expect","summary_es":"Mazmorras de Ventormenta es 24-32, casi solo de Alianza, y sus jefes vienen con guardias Defias.","summary_en":"Stormwind Stockade is 24-32, effectively Alliance-only, and its bosses come with Defias guards.","keywords_es":["mazmorras de ventormenta","stockade","cómo llegar a las mazmorras de ventormenta","mazmorras de ventormenta jefes","bazil thredd"],"keywords_en":["stormwind stockade","stockade entrance","stockade bosses","bazil thredd","stockade quests"],"text_es":"Las Mazmorras de Ventormenta están en Ventormenta, en un edificio al norte del Barrio de los Magos. Son de nivel 24-32 y son prácticamente de Alianza: sus seis misiones son de Alianza y no se recomienda a la Horda. Los jefes vienen con guardias Defias: usa control y mata los adds primero. Targorr pega rápido y se enfurece al 30%; Bazil aturde con una bomba de humo y Dextren tiene miedo en área, así que limpia las salas antes. Un sanador atento al tanque durante los aturdimientos ayuda mucho.","text_en":"Stormwind Stockade is in Stormwind, in a building north of the Mage Quarter. It is level 24-32 and effectively Alliance-only: its six quests are Alliance and Horde is not recommended. Bosses come with Defias guards: use control and kill adds first. Targorr attacks fast and enrages at 30%; Bazil stuns with a smoke bomb and Dextren has area fear, so clear the rooms first. A healer watching the tank during stuns helps a lot.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: The Stockade Dungeon Guide › The Stockade Dungeon Entrance and Basics","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/the-stockade-guide","date":"2026-10-19"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["dungeon:stockade"],"source_hashes":["section:82f87eb291c49c70aaa917e96ae12e3baebaac03"]},{"id":"mazmorra-stockade-misiones","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Misiones de las Mazmorras de Ventormenta","title_en":"Stormwind Stockade Quests","summary_es":"Seis misiones solo de Alianza; empiezan en Ventormenta, Crestagrana, Bosque Crepúsculo y Los Humedales.","summary_en":"Six Alliance-only quests; they start in Stormwind, Redridge, Duskwood, and the Wetlands.","keywords_es":["misiones de las mazmorras de ventormenta","detener el motín","crimen y castigo","el color de la sangre","la furia mora en las profundidades"],"keywords_en":["stockade quests","quell the uprising","crime and punishment","the color of blood","the fury runs deep"],"text_es":"Las seis misiones son solo de Alianza. En Ventormenta empiezan Detener el motín y El motín de las Mazmorras (Warden Thelwater) y El color de la sangre (Nikova Raskol); en Montañas Crestagrana, Lo que sucede alrededor... (Guard Berton); en Bosque Crepúsculo, Crimen y castigo (Councilman Millstipe); y en Los Humedales, La furia mora en las profundidades (Motley Garmason). La Horda no tiene misiones y no se recomienda entrar.","text_en":"All six quests are Alliance-only. In Stormwind start Quell the Uprising and The Stockade Riots (Warden Thelwater) and The Color of Blood (Nikova Raskol); in Redridge Mountains, What Comes Around... (Guard Berton); in Duskwood, Crime and Punishment (Councilman Millstipe); and in the Wetlands, The Fury Runs Deep (Motley Garmason). Horde has no quests and is not recommended to enter.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: All Available Quests for The Stockade › The Stockades Dungeon Quests","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/the-stockade-quests","date":"2026-09-30"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["dungeon:_all:quests"],"source_hashes":["section:3ceb3d06a3118887f13334a0cca4d91d2887af98"]},{"id":"mazmorra-excavation-entrada","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Excavación: Los Humedales, entrada y qué esperar","title_en":"Excavation: Wetlands, Entrance and What to Expect","summary_es":"Nueva mazmorra 26-33 en Los Humedales; raptores, miedo y un guardián que empuja y aturde.","summary_en":"New level 26-33 dungeon in the Wetlands; raptors, fear, and a guardian that knocks back and stuns.","keywords_es":["excavación los humedales","excavation site wetlands","cómo llegar a la excavación","excavación humedales jefes","shadetooth"],"keywords_en":["excavation site wetlands","excavation wetlands entrance","excavation wetlands bosses","shadetooth","excavation quests"],"text_es":"Excavación: Los Humedales es nueva, de nivel 26-33, y está en Los Humedales, por un camino al sur de la cueva de Thelgen. Tiene cinco misiones de Alianza y tres de Horda. Saltspine reduce la precisión en melé y frena al tanque; Shadetooth es el más duro: trae dos raptores que reducen la curación del tanque, tiene miedo y se enfurece; el Relic Guardian empuja, aturde y ralentiza, y se activa con el panel. Lleva control y limpia los raptores escondidos antes del jefe.","text_en":"Excavation: Wetlands is new, level 26-33, and lies in the Wetlands on a path south of Thelgen Rock cavern. It has five Alliance quests and three Horde. Saltspine lowers melee accuracy and slows the tank; Shadetooth is the hardest: he brings two raptors that reduce tank healing, has fear, and enrages; the Relic Guardian knocks back, stuns, and slows, and is activated by the panel. Bring control and clear the hidden raptors before the boss.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Excavation Site: Wetlands Dungeon Guide › Excavation Site: Wetlands Dungeon Entrance and Basics","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/excavation-site-wetlands-guide","date":"2026-10-18"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["dungeon:excavation-site-wetlands"],"source_hashes":["section:0c7a211d76d1a1446a621ab4018ce536ed112140"]},{"id":"mazmorra-excavation-misiones","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Misiones de Excavación: Los Humedales","title_en":"Excavation: Wetlands Quests","summary_es":"Ocho misiones, cinco de Alianza y tres de Horda; varias empiezan en Los Humedales.","summary_en":"Eight quests, five Alliance and three Horde; several start in the Wetlands.","keywords_es":["misiones de la excavación","en busca de filosón","horrors in the highland","changing tastes","dragonmaw rumors"],"keywords_en":["excavation wetlands quests","songblade search","horrors in the highland","changing tastes","dragonmaw rumors"],"text_es":"Hay ocho misiones: cinco de Alianza y tres de Horda. En Los Humedales empiezan Highland Hides (James Halloran), Horrors in the Highland (Rethiel) y Lost Relic Carry (botín del Guardián, se entrega a Prospector Whelgar); en Montañas Crestagrana, En busca de Filosón (Dorin); en Vallefresno, Seeking Caitlin (Llana). De Horda: Changing Tastes (Orgrimmar, Borstan), Dragonmaw Rumors (Tierras Altas de Arathi, Zaruk) y Elder Knowledge (botín, se entrega en Cima del Trueno a Bashana).","text_en":"There are eight quests: five Alliance and three Horde. In the Wetlands start Highland Hides (James Halloran), Horrors in the Highland (Rethiel), and Lost Relic Carry (Guardian loot, turned in to Prospector Whelgar); in Redridge Mountains, Songblade Search (Dorin); in Ashenvale, Seeking Caitlin (Llana). For Horde: Changing Tastes (Orgrimmar, Borstan), Dragonmaw Rumors (Arathi Highlands, Zaruk), and Elder Knowledge (loot, turned in at Thunder Bluff to Bashana).","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: All Available Quests for Excavation Site: Wetlands › Excavation Site: Wetlands Dungeon Quests","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/excavation-site-wetlands-quests","date":"2026-10-02"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["dungeon:_all:quests"],"source_hashes":["section:00080caba9ca5d1e436d22bd5ed3f98ca7c6849e"]},{"id":"mazmorra-dalaran-entrada","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Ciudad de Dalaran: entrada y qué esperar","title_en":"City of Dalaran: Entrance and What to Expect","summary_es":"Nueva mazmorra 28-35 en Alterac; la Horda necesita llave y varios jefes tienen mecánicas letales.","summary_en":"New level 28-35 dungeon in Alterac; Horde needs a key and several bosses have lethal mechanics.","keywords_es":["ciudad de dalaran","city of dalaran","cómo llegar a dalaran","dalaran mazmorra jefes","llave cloacas dalaran"],"keywords_en":["city of dalaran","dalaran dungeon entrance","dalaran dungeon bosses","dalaran sewer key","city of dalaran quests"],"text_es":"La Ciudad de Dalaran es nueva, de nivel 28-35, y está en Montañas de Alterac, con la entrada en las cloacas. La Alianza entra desde la ciudad; la Horda necesita la llave de las cloacas, que sale de una cadena en Trabalomas, o sufrirá. Arcane Anomaly tiene un cortador que mata, Mana Devourer drena maná y hay que matarlo rápido, Unstable Sentinel castiga a quien esté a 25 yardas y Shade of the Archmage hace polimorfia masiva si se queda sin maná. Lyn the Ignored se invoca con un objeto de Castillo de Colmillo Oscuro.","text_en":"City of Dalaran is new, level 28-35, and lies in the Alterac Mountains, with its entrance in the sewers. Alliance enters from the city; Horde needs the sewer key from a Hillsbrad chain or will struggle. Arcane Anomaly has a lethal cutter, Mana Devourer drains mana and must die quickly, Unstable Sentinel punishes anyone within 25 yards, and Shade of the Archmage mass polymorphs if he runs out of mana. Lyn the Ignored is summoned with an item from Shadowfang Keep.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: City of Dalaran Dungeon Guide › City of Dalaran Dungeon Entrance and Basics","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/city-of-dalaran-guide","date":"2026-10-18"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["dungeon:city-of-dalaran"],"source_hashes":["section:99bc604b3049eba46b7d0de7d49c07f9d50b60f4"]},{"id":"mazmorra-dalaran-misiones","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Misiones de la Ciudad de Dalaran","title_en":"City of Dalaran Quests","summary_es":"Ocho misiones, cuatro de Alianza y cuatro de Horda; Heart of Disruption da la llave de las cloacas.","summary_en":"Eight quests, four Alliance and four Horde; Heart of Disruption gives the sewer key.","keywords_es":["misiones de dalaran","heart of disruption","starving arcane","the grave knight","source of power"],"keywords_en":["city of dalaran quests","heart of disruption","starving arcane","the grave knight","source of power"],"text_es":"Hay ocho misiones: cuatro de Alianza y cuatro de Horda; Heart of Disruption existe para las dos y da la llave de las cloacas. En Bosque de Argénteos empiezan Heart of Disruption y Starving Arcane (Image of Archmage Modera); en Ventormenta, A Green Sample (Shylamiir) y Power Overwhelming (Andromath); dentro, Opportunistic Education (Rexxie); en Trabalomas, The Grave Knight (Melisara); y en Entrañas, Source of Power (Doctor Martin Felben).","text_en":"There are eight quests: four Alliance and four Horde; Heart of Disruption exists for both and gives the sewer key. In Silverpine Forest start Heart of Disruption and Starving Arcane (Image of Archmage Modera); in Stormwind, A Green Sample (Shylamiir) and Power Overwhelming (Andromath); inside, Opportunistic Education (Rexxie); in Hillsbrad, The Grave Knight (Melisara); and in Undercity, Source of Power (Doctor Martin Felben).","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: All Available Quests for City of Dalaran › City of Dalaran Dungeon Quests","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/city-of-dalaran-quests","date":"2026-09-30"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["dungeon:_all:quests"],"source_hashes":["section:7b2852ae83e9174d0e8da57a2be14a9a9d2c1133"]},{"id":"mazmorra-gnomeregan-entrada","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Gnomeregan: entrada y qué esperar","title_en":"Gnomeregan: Entrance and What to Expect","summary_es":"Gnomeregan está en Dun Morogh, es 29-38 y la Horda puede teletransportarse con una cadena de attunement.","summary_en":"Gnomeregan is in Dun Morogh, level 29-38, and Horde can teleport in with an attunement chain.","keywords_es":["gnomeregan","cómo llegar a gnomeregan","gnomeregan jefes","gnomeregan attunement","thermaplugg"],"keywords_en":["gnomeregan","gnomeregan entrance","gnomeregan bosses","gnomeregan attunement","thermaplugg"],"text_es":"Gnomeregan está en Dun Morogh, al noroeste, tras la aldea Brewnall. Es de nivel 29-38; la Alianza llega fácil y la Horda usa una cadena de attunement para teletransportarse desde Bahía del Botín. La Llave de taller sale de Electrocutioner 6000 y abre la entrada del taller. Grubbis empieza con un evento; Electrocutioner castiga si el grupo se apila; Crowd Pummeler golpea en cono e interrumpe; Thermaplugg invoca bombas andantes, así que apaga dispensadores o mátalas. Lleva sanador y control para las oleadas.","text_en":"Gnomeregan is in Dun Morogh, northwest, past Brewnall Village. It is level 29-38; Alliance reaches it easily and Horde uses an attunement chain to teleport from Booty Bay. The workshop key drops from Electrocutioner 6000 and opens the workshop entrance. Grubbis starts with an event; Electrocutioner punishes stacking; Crowd Pummeler hits in a cone and interrupts; Thermaplugg summons walking bombs, so turn off dispensers or kill them. Bring a healer and control for the waves.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Gnomeregan Dungeon Guide › Gnomeregan Dungeon Entrance and Basics","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/gnomeregan-guide","date":"2026-10-18"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["dungeon:gnomeregan"],"source_hashes":["section:2f47cca8938f89bad3e7c7179864c2b4add0d591"]},{"id":"mazmorra-gnomeregan-misiones","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Misiones de Gnomeregan","title_en":"Gnomeregan Quests","summary_es":"Once misiones, siete de Alianza y una de Horda, más la cadena de teletransporte de Horda.","summary_en":"Eleven quests, seven Alliance and one Horde, plus the Horde teleport chain.","keywords_es":["misiones de gnomeregan","un buen lío","la gran traición","las guerras de la plataforma","gnomer-gooooone"],"keywords_en":["gnomeregan quests","a fine mess","the grand betrayal","rig wars","gnomer-gooooone"],"text_es":"Hay once misiones (siete de Alianza y una de Horda) y una cadena de attunement. En Forjaz: Rescatar los datos, Esencias artificiales, ¡Salva el cerebro de Techrobot! y La gran traición; en Dun Morogh: Gnogaine y Necesitamos más material verdoso; en Ventormenta: Gyrodrillmatic Excavationators; dentro: Un buen lío, ¡El Destellamatic 5200! y Un anillo sucio, que empieza con el Anillo con mugre incrustada; en Orgrimmar: Las guerras de la plataforma. Las guerras de la plataforma, Chief Engineer Scooty y Gnomer-gooooone! abren el teletransporte de Horda en Bahía del Botín.","text_en":"There are eleven quests (seven Alliance and one Horde) and an attunement chain. In Ironforge: Data Rescue, Essential Artificials, Save Techbot's Brain!, and The Grand Betrayal; in Dun Morogh: Gnogaine and The Only Cure is More Green Glow; in Stormwind: Gyrodrillmatic Excavationators; inside: A Fine Mess, The Sparklematic 5200!, and Grime-Encrusted Ring; in Orgrimmar: Rig Wars. Rig Wars, Chief Engineer Scooty, and Gnomer-gooooone! open the Horde teleporter in Booty Bay.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: All Available Quests for Gnomeregan › Gnomeregan Dungeon Quests","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/gnomeregan-quests","date":"2026-09-30"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["dungeon:_all:quests"],"source_hashes":["section:4c025b642cf46c466ca7d5e2e3a6c19a3ac4ace9"]},{"id":"mazmorra-razorfen-entrada","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Horado Rajacieno: entrada y qué esperar","title_en":"Razorfen Kraul: Entrance and What to Expect","summary_es":"Horado Rajacieno está en Los Baldíos, es 29-38 y tiene jefes con elementales,control mental y adds.","summary_en":"Razorfen Kraul is in the Barrens, level 29-38, with bosses using elementals, mind control, and adds.","keywords_es":["horado rajacieno","razorfen kraul","cómo llegar a horado rajacieno","horado rajacieno jefes","charlga"],"keywords_en":["razorfen kraul","razorfen kraul entrance","razorfen kraul bosses","charlga","razorfen kraul quests"],"text_es":"Horado Rajacieno está en Los Baldíos, al sur, en la zona de Rajacieno. Es de nivel 29-38; tiene dos misiones de Alianza y tres de Horda, además de neutrales. Roogug es opcional y trae un elemental; Jargba trae dos casters y control mental; Ramtusk pega fuerte y trae dos spearhide; Charlga se tanquea fuera de la plataforma y hay que interrumpir sus hechizos. Los jefes raros no salen siempre, así que no cuentes con su botín.","text_en":"Razorfen Kraul is in the Barrens, far south, in the Razorfen area. It is level 29-38; it has two Alliance quests and three Horde, plus neutral ones. Roogug is optional and brings an elemental; Jargba brings two casters and mind control; Ramtusk hits hard and brings two spearhides; Charlga is tanked off her platform and her casts must be interrupted. Rare bosses do not always spawn, so do not count on their loot.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Razorfen Kraul Dungeon Guide › Razorfen Kraul Dungeon Entrance and Basics","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/razorfen-kraul-guide","date":"2026-10-18"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["dungeon:razorfen-kraul"],"source_hashes":["section:5dd1536f0b6776d0e2e4a3a19699804104e13890"]},{"id":"mazmorra-razorfen-misiones","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Misiones de Horado Rajacieno","title_en":"Razorfen Kraul Quests","summary_es":"Siete misiones, dos de Alianza y tres de Horda; varias empiezan en Los Baldíos y Cima del Trueno.","summary_en":"Seven quests, two Alliance and three Horde; several start in the Barrens and Thunder Bluff.","keywords_es":["misiones de horado rajacieno","los tubérculos hojazul","willix el importador","la bruja del horado","guano del horado"],"keywords_en":["razorfen kraul quests","blueleaf tubers","willix the importer","crone of the kraul","going going guano"],"text_es":"Hay siete misiones: dos de Alianza y tres de Horda. En Los Baldíos empieza Los tubérculos hojazul (Mebok Mizzyrix); dentro, Willix el Importador y Decaída mortal (Heralath); en Feralas, La bruja del Horado (Falfindel, Alianza); en Cima del Trueno, Un destino vengador (Auld Stonespire, Horda). De Horda también: Guano del Horado (Entrañas, Faranell) y Una alianza nefasta (botín de Charlga, se entrega a Varimathras).","text_en":"There are seven quests: two Alliance and three Horde. In the Barrens starts Blueleaf Tubers (Mebok Mizzyrix); inside, Willix the Importer and Mortality Wanes (Heralath); in Feralas, The Crone of the Kraul (Falfindel, Alliance); in Thunder Bluff, A Vengeful Fate (Auld Stonespire, Horde). Also Horde: Going, Going, Guano! (Undercity, Faranell) and An Unholy Alliance (Charlga's loot, turned in to Varimathras).","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: All Available Quests for Razorfen Kraul › Razorfen Kraul Dungeon Quests","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/razorfen-kraul-quests","date":"2026-11-10"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["dungeon:_all:quests"],"source_hashes":["section:604c1e4af80cbb4f09685094098e97175388a6be"]},{"id":"mazmorra-scarlet-graveyard-entrada","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Monasterio Escarlata: Cementerio","title_en":"Scarlet Monastery: Graveyard","summary_es":"Ala 30-38 en Claros de Tirisfal, sin llave; dos misiones de Horda y tres jefes raros.","summary_en":"Level 30-38 wing in Tirisfal Glades, no key; two Horde quests and three rare bosses.","keywords_es":["monasterio escarlata cementerio","scarlet monastery graveyard","cómo llegar al monasterio escarlata","monasterio escarlata jefes","bloodmage thalnos"],"keywords_en":["scarlet monastery graveyard","scarlet monastery entrance","scarlet monastery bosses","bloodmage thalnos","scarlet monastery quests"],"text_es":"El Cementerio es la primera ala del Monasterio Escarlata, de nivel 30-38, en Claros de Tirisfal, al noreste. Es la entrada de la izquierda y no pide la Llave Escarlata. Sus dos misiones son de Horda. Vishas es sencillo; los raros Azshir, Fallen Champion e Ironspine añaden miedo, golpe en abanico o veneno; Thalnos lanza dos áreas de fuego y una Descarga de las Sombras que se interrumpe. Limpia la zona antes de tirar a los raros y lleva un sanador atento.","text_en":"The Graveyard is the first Scarlet Monastery wing, level 30-38, in Tirisfal Glades to the northeast. It is the left entrance and does not require the Scarlet Key. Its two quests are Horde-only. Vishas is simple; the rares Azshir, Fallen Champion, and Ironspine add fear, cleave, or poison; Thalnos casts two fire areas and a Shadow bolt that can be interrupted. Clear the area before pulling rares and bring an attentive healer.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Scarlet Monastery - Graveyard Dungeon Guide › Scarlet Monastery: Graveyard Dungeon Entrance and Basics","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/scarlet-monastery-graveyard-guide","date":"2026-10-18"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["dungeon:scarlet-monastery-graveyard"],"source_hashes":["section:b8fcaaee44a6af56564b637893f88dd3da149db7"]},{"id":"mazmorra-scarlet-graveyard-misiones","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Misiones del Cementerio Escarlata","title_en":"Scarlet Monastery Graveyard Quests","summary_es":"Dos misiones de Horda: Corazones de fervor en Entrañas y La venganza de Vorrel dentro.","summary_en":"Two Horde quests: Hearts of Zeal in Undercity and Vorrel's Revenge inside.","keywords_es":["misiones del cementerio escarlata","corazones de fervor","la venganza de vorrel","misiones horda monasterio","vorrel sengutz"],"keywords_en":["scarlet monastery graveyard quests","hearts of zeal","vorrel's revenge","horde scarlet monastery","vorrel sengutz"],"text_es":"El Cementerio tiene dos misiones, ambas de Horda. Corazones de fervor empieza en Entrañas con Master Apothecary Faranell y es la continuación de Guano del Horado, de Horado Rajacieno. La venganza de Vorrel empieza dentro con Vorrel Sengutz, al que tortura Vishas; el anillo que pide está en una casa de Montañas de Alterac, frente al lago Lordamere, y Nancy Vishas es élite. No hay misiones de Alianza en esta ala.","text_en":"The Graveyard has two quests, both Horde. Hearts of Zeal starts in Undercity with Master Apothecary Faranell and follows Going, Going, Guano! from Razorfen Kraul. Vorrel's Revenge starts inside with Vorrel Sengutz, tortured by Vishas; the ring it needs is in a house in the Alterac Mountains overlooking Lordamere Lake, and Nancy Vishas is elite. There are no Alliance quests in this wing.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: All Available Quests for Scarlet Monastery - Graveyard › Scarlet Monastery - Graveyard Dungeon Quests","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/scarlet-monastery-graveyard-quests","date":"2026-09-30"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["dungeon:_all:quests"],"source_hashes":["section:4daca165d5b097ced37e3ac7153bf3133ed8f365"]},{"id":"mazmorra-scarlet-library-entrada","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Monasterio Escarlata: Biblioteca","title_en":"Scarlet Monastery: Library","summary_es":"Ala 33-41 en Claros de Tirisfal; no pide llave y aquí sale la Llave Escarlata; Doan es el jefe final.","summary_en":"Level 33-41 wing in Tirisfal Glades; no key needed and the Scarlet Key drops here; Doan is the final boss.","keywords_es":["monasterio escarlata biblioteca","scarlet monastery library","cómo llegar a la biblioteca escarlata","arcanist doan","llave escarlata"],"keywords_en":["scarlet monastery library","scarlet monastery library entrance","arcanist doan","scarlet key","scarlet monastery quests"],"text_es":"La Biblioteca es la segunda ala del Monasterio Escarlata, de nivel 33-41, en Claros de Tirisfal, al noreste. Es la entrada de la derecha y no pide la Llave Escarlata: de hecho, la llave sale del cofre detrás de Doan. Tiene tres misiones de Alianza y cuatro de Horda. Loksey trae tres sabuesos que hay que matar primero; Doan es caster: tanque en el centro, ranged en los bordes, huye de Detonación y disipa polimorfia y silencio. Un sanador con disipación mágica ayuda.","text_en":"The Library is the second Scarlet Monastery wing, level 33-41, in Tirisfal Glades to the northeast. It is the right entrance and does not require the Scarlet Key: the key drops from the chest behind Doan. It has three Alliance quests and four Horde. Loksey brings three hounds that must die first; Doan is a caster: tank in the center, ranged at the edges, run from Detonation, and dispel polymorph and silence. A healer with magic dispels helps.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Scarlet Monastery - Library Dungeon Guide › Scarlet Monastery: Library Dungeon Entrance and Basics","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/scarlet-monastery-library-guide","date":"2026-10-18"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["dungeon:scarlet-monastery-library"],"source_hashes":["section:3e863a27c7c9eff614079a602427e05968dc18b1"]},{"id":"mazmorra-scarlet-library-misiones","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Misiones de la Biblioteca Escarlata","title_en":"Scarlet Monastery Library Quests","summary_es":"Siete misiones, tres de Alianza y cuatro de Horda; varias empiezan en Forjaz, Entrañas y Cima del Trueno.","summary_en":"Seven quests, three Alliance and four Horde; several start in Ironforge, Undercity, and Thunder Bluff.","keywords_es":["misiones de la biblioteca escarlata","mitología de los titanes","el compendio de los caídos","prueba de conocimiento","en el monasterio escarlata"],"keywords_en":["scarlet monastery library quests","mythology of the titans","compendium of the fallen","test of lore","into the scarlet monastery"],"text_es":"Hay siete misiones: tres de Alianza y cuatro de Horda. In the Name of the Light (Trabalomas, Raleigh), Mitología de los Titanes (Forjaz, Mae Paledust) y Past Due (Montañas de Alterac, Magus Olvek) son de Alianza. De Horda: El Compendio de los Caídos (Cima del Trueno, Sage Truthseeker; los no-muertos no pueden cogerla), Corazones de fervor (Entrañas, Faranell), En el Monasterio Escarlata (Entrañas, Varimathras) y Test de conocimiento (Entrañas, Parqual Fintallas).","text_en":"There are seven quests: three Alliance and four Horde. In the Name of the Light (Hillsbrad, Raleigh), Mythology of the Titans (Ironforge, Mae Paledust), and Past Due (Alterac Mountains, Magus Olvek) are Alliance. For Horde: Compendium of the Fallen (Thunder Bluff, Sage Truthseeker; Undead cannot take it), Hearts of Zeal (Undercity, Faranell), Into The Scarlet Monastery (Undercity, Varimathras), and Test of Lore (Undercity, Parqual Fintallas).","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: All Available Quests for Scarlet Monastery - Library › Scarlet Monastery - Library Dungeon Quests","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/scarlet-monastery-library-quests","date":"2026-09-30"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["dungeon:_all:quests"],"source_hashes":["section:78ae037b33a39bb97952123ea28ddc10be79cd04"]}]},"09-viajes-monturas.json":{"description":"Capítulo 9: Viajes y monturas. Secciones editoriales redactadas desde guías de terceros.","sections":[{"id":"viaje-monturas","chapter":9,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Cómo conseguir monturas","title_en":"Ways to Obtain Mounts","summary_es":"Las monturas se obtienen mediante misiones, reputación, el sistema Legacy y paquetes de la tienda.","summary_en":"Mounts come from quests, reputation, the Legacy system and store packs.","keywords_es":["conseguir monturas","monturas de reputación","monturas de misiones","monturas de Legacy"],"keywords_en":["get mounts","reputation mounts","quest mounts","Legacy mounts"],"text_es":"En Forever hay monturas ligadas a misiones, vendedores de reputación, puntos de Legacy y paquetes de la tienda. Algunas monturas de reputación cuestan oro; otras se desbloquean con una moneda de comerciante o con progreso de Legacy.","text_en":"In Forever, mounts are tied to quests, reputation vendors, Legacy Points and store packs. Some reputation mounts cost gold; others unlock through a merchant currency or Legacy progress.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: All Mounts in World of Warcraft: Forever - Models and Locations › Mounts Quick Reference for WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/collections/mounts-locations-appearances","date":"2026-11-17"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["collection:mounts-locations-appearances"],"source_hashes":["section:7e3c0d24ed1fcc0a5a273cc508322c9711f091a1"]},{"id":"viaje-monturas-nivel","chapter":9,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Aprendiz y Oficial jinete: niveles y coste","title_en":"Apprentice and Journeyman Riding: Levels and Cost","summary_es":"Aprendiz jinete se aprende al 40; Oficial jinete, al 60, con descuentos por reputación.","summary_en":"Apprentice Riding is learned at 40; Journeyman Riding at 60, with reputation discounts.","keywords_es":["nivel para montar","coste de equitación","montura de nivel 40","montura épica nivel 60"],"keywords_en":["riding level requirement","riding training cost","level 40 mount","level 60 epic mount"],"text_es":"Aprendiz jinete requiere nivel 40 y da acceso a monturas que aumentan un 60% la velocidad: entrenar cuesta 100 de oro y la montura 20, aunque la primera es gratis. Oficial jinete requiere nivel 60; cuesta 1000 de oro y su montura de 200 también es gratis la primera vez. Con reputación Honorable obtienes un 10% de descuento.","text_en":"Apprentice Riding requires level 40 and unlocks mounts that increase speed by 60%: training costs 100 gold and a mount 20, although the first is free. Journeyman Riding requires level 60; training costs 1000 gold and its 200-gold mount is also free the first time. Honored reputation gives a 10% discount.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Learning to Ride and Getting Your First Mount: Costs and Location - WoW: Forever › Learning to Ride Mounts in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/unlocking-riding-skill-mounts","date":"2026-11-17"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:unlocking-riding-skill-mounts"],"source_hashes":["section:f4820ee6eb966cece1aedfa9c61bcd5c4bec0b8b"]},{"id":"viaje-monturas-coleccion","chapter":9,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Monturas de ediciones","title_en":"Edition Mounts","summary_es":"Algunos paquetes de Forever incluyen monturas exclusivas de colección.","summary_en":"Some Forever packs include collectible mounts.","keywords_es":["monturas de edición","Garramanada cerúleo","Compañero fiel de aventurero veterano","montura de paquete"],"keywords_en":["edition mounts","Cerulean Prideclaw","Veteran Adventurer's Loyal Companion","pack mount"],"text_es":"La Garramanada cerúleo se incluye al comprar cualquier paquete de Forever. El Compañero fiel de aventurero veterano viene con una edición épica o con la colección de Forever.","text_en":"Forever packs include Cerulean Prideclaw. Veteran Adventurer's Loyal Companion comes with a Skyborne Epic Pack or Warcraft Forever Collection.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: All Mounts in World of Warcraft: Forever - Models and Locations › Mounts Quick Reference for WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/collections/mounts-locations-appearances","date":"2026-11-17"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["collection:mounts-locations-appearances"],"source_hashes":["section:7e3c0d24ed1fcc0a5a273cc508322c9711f091a1"]},{"id":"viaje-barcos-zeppelin-tranvia","chapter":9,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Barcos, zepelines y tranvía","title_en":"Ships, Zeppelins and Tram","summary_es":"Barcos, zepelines y el tranvía son transportes gratuitos con horarios y accesos distintos.","summary_en":"Ships, zeppelins and the tram are free transport with different schedules and access.","keywords_es":["barcos gratis","usar zepelín","tranvía de Forjaz","transporte entre ciudades"],"keywords_en":["free ships","ride a zeppelin","Deeprun Tram","city transport"],"text_es":"Los barcos y zepelines son gratuitos y suelen llegar cada 3–5 minutos, con cerca de un minuto para subir. Los barcos están pensados sobre todo para la Alianza y los zepelines para la Horda; la facción contraria puede sufrir ataques de guardias. El tranvía entre Forjaz y Ventormenta también es gratis: llega cada minuto y espera 10 segundos.","text_en":"Ships and zeppelins are free and usually arrive every 3–5 minutes, with about a minute to board. Ships are mainly intended for the Alliance and zeppelins for the Horde; guards may attack members of the opposing faction. The tram between Ironforge and Stormwind is also free: it arrives every minute and waits 10 seconds.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Flight Points, Zeppelins, and Ships - WoW: Forever › Ships and Airships in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/flight-points-zeppelins-and-ships","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Flight Points, Zeppelins, and Ships - WoW: Forever › Zeppelins in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/flight-points-zeppelins-and-ships","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Flight Points, Zeppelins, and Ships - WoW: Forever › Deeprun Tram in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/flight-points-zeppelins-and-ships","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:flight-points-zeppelins-and-ships"],"source_hashes":["section:29652c9ee07944238a8f7fda614df3e756ed9b78","section:8ce9649fd4ec1f403b2230e2f133bb92df85183b","section:b039ba53f4d9fa08735bfb9bd1ad592284dc3b20"]},{"id":"viaje-monturas-clases","chapter":9,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Monturas de misión para Paladines y Brujos","title_en":"Paladin and Warlock Class Mounts","summary_es":"Las misiones de clase de Paladín y Brujo otorgan monturas y la habilidad necesaria para usarlas.","summary_en":"Paladin and Warlock class quests grant mounts and the riding skill needed to use them.","keywords_es":["montura de paladín","montura de brujo","misión de montura","habilidad de equitación de clase"],"keywords_en":["Paladin mount","Warlock mount","class mount quest","class riding skill"],"text_es":"A nivel 40 y 60, las misiones de clase de Paladín y Brujo recompensan, respectivamente, una montura que aumenta la velocidad un 60% y otra un 100%. Cada una incluye la habilidad de equitación necesaria para montar esa recompensa.","text_en":"At levels 40 and 60, Paladin and Warlock class quests respectively reward a mount that increases speed by 60% and one that increases it by 100%. Each quest also grants the riding skill needed for its mount.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Learning to Ride and Getting Your First Mount: Costs and Location - WoW: Forever › Learning to Ride Mounts in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/unlocking-riding-skill-mounts","date":"2026-11-17"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:unlocking-riding-skill-mounts"],"source_hashes":["section:f4820ee6eb966cece1aedfa9c61bcd5c4bec0b8b"]},{"id":"viaje-mascotas-coleccion","chapter":9,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Cómo conseguir mascotas de compañía","title_en":"How to Obtain Companion Pets","summary_es":"Las mascotas de compañía son cosméticas y se consiguen mediante varias actividades y vendedores.","summary_en":"Companion pets are cosmetic and come from several activities and vendors.","keywords_es":["conseguir mascotas de compañía","mascotas cosméticas","mascotas de misión","mascotas de vendedor"],"keywords_en":["obtain companion pets","cosmetic pets","quest pets","vendor pets"],"text_es":"Las mascotas de compañía no participan en combate: son cosméticas. Se obtienen, entre otras formas, en la tienda, con puntos de Legacy, como botín, mediante misiones o vendedores, y por pesca, profesiones o reputación.","text_en":"Companion pets do not take part in combat; they are cosmetic. Sources include the store, Legacy Points, drops, quests or vendors, as well as fishing, professions and reputation.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: All Companions in World of Warcraft: Forever - Models and Locations › (intro)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/collections/pets-locations-sources","date":"2026-11-05"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: All Companions in World of Warcraft: Forever - Models and Locations › Companions Quick Reference for WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/collections/pets-locations-sources","date":"2026-11-05"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["collection:pets-locations-sources"],"source_hashes":["guide:31f23925ab44cf5818689e2cec92af47c2bbda42","section:eddb674c13a76d6fd015c8928e6c8a6f1d46b609"]},{"id":"viaje-riverglades","chapter":9,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Clarofluvial: nivel y cómo llegar","title_en":"Riverglades: Level Range and Access","summary_es":"Clarofluvial es una zona disputada de nivel 36–44, accesible a pie o en barco desde Tanaris.","summary_en":"Riverglades is a contested level 36–44 zone, reachable on foot or by boat from Tanaris.","keywords_es":["Clarofluvial","nivel de Clarofluvial","llegar a Clarofluvial","barco desde Tanaris"],"keywords_en":["Riverglades","Riverglades level range","reach Riverglades","boat from Tanaris"],"text_es":"Clarofluvial es una zona disputada para niveles 36–44. Puedes llegar por el camino al norte de Montañas Crestagrana o al sur de Tierras Inhóspitas; también hay conexión marítima con Tanaris.","text_en":"Riverglades is a contested zone for levels 36–44. Reach it by road north of Redridge Mountains or south of Badlands, or take the boat connection to Tanaris.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Riverglades Zone Overview - Maps, Factions, and Transport › Overview of Riverglades","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/riverglades-zone-overview","date":"2026-11-07"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Riverglades Zone Overview - Maps, Factions, and Transport › How to get to Riverglades","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/riverglades-zone-overview","date":"2026-11-07"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:riverglades-zone-overview"],"source_hashes":["section:28d0dc3a5891132b3bd68dd0df4ca35c3d43b6ad","section:f29b1f9a2e2738e4772783e1b76c71f5dfc0c780"]},{"id":"viaje-zephras-isle","chapter":9,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Isla de Zephras: zona inicial de los Cielonatos","title_en":"Zephras Isle: Skyborne Starting Zone","summary_es":"La zona inicial de los Cielonatos abarca los niveles 1–12 y se puede visitar sin comprar un paquete.","summary_en":"The Skyborne starting zone spans levels 1–12 and can be visited without buying a pack.","keywords_es":["zona inicial Cielonato","niveles de Isla de Zephras","acceso a Cielonatos","paquete Cielonato"],"keywords_en":["Skyborne starting zone","Zephras Isle level range","Skyborne access","Skyborne pack"],"text_es":"La Isla de Zephras es la zona inicial de los Cielonatos y está pensada para niveles 1–12. Puedes visitar la isla sin comprar nada, pero para crear un Cielonato y jugar su experiencia de inicio necesitas una edición Heroica o superior.","text_en":"Zephras Isle is the Skyborne starting zone, intended for levels 1–12. You can visit the island without a purchase, but creating a Skyborne character and playing its starting experience requires the Skyborne Heroic Pack or a higher edition.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Zephras Isle Zone Overview - Maps, Locations, and Trainers › Overview of Zephras Isle","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/zephras-isle-zone-overview","date":"2026-10-22"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:zephras-isle-zone-overview"],"source_hashes":["section:39b5735cc3fbc7ac9bb591fe9dc7574a016772a6"]},{"id":"viaje-barcos-zephras","chapter":9,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Barcos a Zephras Isle","title_en":"Boats to Zephras Isle","summary_es":"Dos barcos aéreos enlazan Valanaar con Dalaran y con las cercanías de Cima del Trueno.","summary_en":"Two skyboats connect Valanaar with Dalaran and the area near Thunder Bluff.","keywords_es":["barco a Zephras Isle","llegar desde Dalaran","llegar desde Cima del Trueno","barco aéreo Cielonato"],"keywords_en":["boat to Zephras Isle","travel from Dalaran","travel from Thunder Bluff","Skyborne skyboat"],"text_es":"Dos barcos aéreos pasan aproximadamente cada 5 minutos entre Valanaar y el exterior: uno va a Dalaran y el otro a un punto al norte de Cima del Trueno. Ambas facciones pueden usar cualquiera de las rutas, aunque suelen estar pensadas para la Alianza y la Horda, respectivamente.","text_en":"Two skyboats arrive about every 5 minutes between Valanaar and the outside world: one goes to Dalaran and the other to a point north of Thunder Bluff. Both factions can use either route, though they are generally intended for the Alliance and Horde, respectively.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Zephras Isle Zone Overview - Maps, Locations, and Trainers › How to get to and From Zephras Isle","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/zephras-isle-zone-overview","date":"2026-10-22"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:zephras-isle-zone-overview"],"source_hashes":["section:57c9dce99023ca0af358563496bbbfd15a8871a5"]},{"id":"viaje-monturas-coleccion-ventana","chapter":9,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Dónde ver las monturas obtenidas","title_en":"Where to View Collected Mounts","summary_es":"La ventana de colecciones de cuenta reúne las monturas que ya has obtenido.","summary_en":"The Account Collections window gathers the mounts you have obtained.","keywords_es":["ver mis monturas","colección de monturas","monturas obtenidas","ventana de colecciones"],"keywords_en":["view my mounts","mount collection","collected mounts","collections window"],"text_es":"La ventana de colecciones de cuenta se abre con Mayús+P. Desde allí puedes encontrar y usar las monturas obtenidas.","text_en":"Open the Account Collections window with Shift+P. From there, you can find and use the mounts you have obtained.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Learning to Ride and Getting Your First Mount: Costs and Location - WoW: Forever › Learning to Ride Mounts in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/unlocking-riding-skill-mounts","date":"2026-11-17"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:unlocking-riding-skill-mounts"],"source_hashes":["section:f4820ee6eb966cece1aedfa9c61bcd5c4bec0b8b"]},{"id":"viaje-forma-viaje-druida","chapter":9,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Forma de viaje del Druida","title_en":"Druid Travel Form","summary_es":"La Forma de viaje del Druida aumenta mucho la velocidad, solo funciona al aire libre y sirve antes de tener montura.","summary_en":"Druid Travel Form greatly increases speed, only works outdoors and serves before you get a mount.","keywords_es":["forma de viaje druida","viajar como druida","velocidad druida","druida sin montura","forma de viaje"],"keywords_en":["druid travel form","travel as druid","druid speed","druid without mount","travel form"],"text_es":"La Forma de viaje del Druida aumenta mucho la velocidad de movimiento, pero solo puede usarse al aire libre. Antes de tener montura es el medio de desplazamiento principal del Druida, y después sigue siendo útil porque es instantánea y se puede usar en combate. Los Cielonatos tienen una apariencia propia para esta forma.","text_en":"Druid Travel Form greatly increases movement speed, but it can only be used outdoors. Before you get a mount it is the Druid's main way to travel, and afterwards it remains useful because it is instant and can be used in combat. Skyborne have their own appearance for this form.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Druid Shapeshift Forms Guide › Travel Form","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/druid-shapeshift-forms","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["class:druid:general:druid-shapeshift-forms"],"source_hashes":["section:bf7368cd5b7349bb6823a504314fd65375a63f20"]},{"id":"viaje-puntos-vuelo","chapter":9,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Cómo funcionan los puntos de vuelo","title_en":"How Flight Points Work","summary_es":"Desbloquea maestros de vuelo y conecta puntos intermedios para recorrer rutas largas.","summary_en":"Unlock flight masters and connect intermediate points to travel long routes.","keywords_es":["desbloquear punto de vuelo","rutas de vuelo","coste de vuelo","parar durante un vuelo"],"keywords_en":["unlock flight point","flight routes","flight cost","stop during a flight"],"text_es":"Habla con un maestro de vuelo para habilitar su punto. Las rutas enlazan puntos cercanos: para llegar lejos debes haber desbloqueado los tramos intermedios. Volar cuesta plata y el precio aumenta con la distancia; durante el trayecto puedes pedir que te dejen en el siguiente punto intermedio.","text_en":"Talk to a Flight Master to unlock that flight point. Routes connect nearby points, so a long trip requires the intermediate stops to be unlocked. Flights cost silver and become more expensive with distance; while travelling, you can request a drop-off at the next intermediate point.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Flight Points, Zeppelins, and Ships - WoW: Forever › Flight Points in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/flight-points-zeppelins-and-ships","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:flight-points-zeppelins-and-ships"],"source_hashes":["section:8330235adff2e80958435979ec427edec9ad8151"]}]},"10-jcj.json":{"description":"Capítulo 10: JcJ. Secciones editoriales redactadas desde guías de terceros.","sections":[{"id":"jcj-que-cambia","chapter":10,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Qué cambia en el JcJ de Forever","title_en":"What Changes in Forever PvP","summary_es":"El rango ya no depende del reino ni decae cada semana; hay 14 rangos por temporada y un campo nuevo.","summary_en":"Rank no longer depends on the realm or decays weekly; there are 14 ranks per season and a new battleground.","keywords_es":["cambios jcj forever","rangos jcj forever","campo nuevo jcj","temporadas jcj","sistema de honor forever"],"keywords_en":["wow forever pvp changes","forever pvp ranks","new pvp battleground","pvp seasons","forever honor system"],"text_es":"Forever cambia el sistema clásico: ya no te comparan con el reino ni pierdes progreso cada semana; subes una barra de Puntos de Rango por temporada. Hay 14 rangos, con títulos y compras desbloqueadas por rango, y el JcJ se reparte entre mundo y campos. El campo nuevo es Islas Lanza Negra, de 15 contra 15. Al cambiar de temporada el rango se reinicia, pero los desafíos Legacy no.","text_en":"Forever changes the classic system: you are no longer compared with the realm and do not lose progress every week; you fill a Rank Points bar per season. There are 14 ranks, with titles and purchases unlocked by rank, and PvP is split between the world and battlegrounds. The new battleground is Darkspear Islands, 15v15. Rank resets between seasons, but Legacy challenges do not.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Everything You Need to Know About PvP in World of Warcraft: Forever › What Changed from Classic","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/pvp-overview","date":"2026-09-19"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: WoW Forever - PvP Rank System Explained › What Is The PvP Rank System?","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/pvp-rank-system","date":"2026-09-19"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["general:pvp"],"source_hashes":["section:984ff0277c99fd047fe00775b54dc47ddd0e217c","section:99517154cf03d7df90139d64adef3bc3db920cf0"]},{"id":"jcj-honor-puntos","chapter":10,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Honor y Puntos de Rango","title_en":"Honor and Rank Points","summary_es":"El Honor compra equipo y los Puntos de Rango suben el rango; son independientes y no se convierten.","summary_en":"Honor buys gear and Rank Points raise your rank; they are independent and cannot be converted.","keywords_es":["honor y puntos de rango","para qué sirve el honor","cómo subir de rango jcj","límite de honor","monedas jcj forever"],"keywords_en":["honor and rank points","what is honor for","how to raise pvp rank","honor cap","wow forever pvp currencies"],"text_es":"El JcJ da dos monedas separadas: Honor y Puntos de Rango. El Honor compra objetos y no sube el rango; los Puntos de Rango llenan la barra y no se gastan. No se convierten entre sí y comprar equipo no frena la subida. Puedes llevar hasta 15.000 de Honor; los Puntos de Rango no bajan durante la temporada. Se ganan en campos, tareas JcJ y JcJ de mundo.","text_en":"PvP gives two separate currencies: Honor and Rank Points. Honor buys items and does not raise your rank; Rank Points fill the bar and are never spent. They cannot be converted into each other, and buying gear does not slow ranking. You can hold up to 15,000 Honor; Rank Points do not fall during the season. They come from battlegrounds, PvP tasks, and world PvP.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: WoW Forever - PvP Rank System Explained › How PvP Rank Works","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/pvp-rank-system","date":"2026-09-19"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["general:pvp"],"source_hashes":["section:03085d174c3727847bd3b31eb21125356a687a11"]},{"id":"jcj-rangos","chapter":10,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Los 14 rangos de JcJ","title_en":"The 14 PvP Ranks","summary_es":"Cada rango pide más puntos y el 14 necesita 24.750; la barra no decae ni depende de otros jugadores.","summary_en":"Each rank needs more points and rank 14 needs 24,750; the bar does not decay or depend on other players.","keywords_es":["rangos de jcj","cuántos rangos hay","puntos para rango 14","rango jcj sin decadencia","progreso de rango forever"],"keywords_en":["pvp ranks","how many pvp ranks","rank 14 points","pvp rank no decay","forever rank progress"],"text_es":"Hay 14 rangos y cada uno pide más Puntos de Rango que el anterior; el 14 necesita 24.750 en total. La barra no decae y no depende de cuántos puntos tengan otros jugadores. Los Puntos de Rango no se gastan: solo se acumulan hasta el siguiente rango. Al cerrar la temporada, el rango se reinicia y hay que volver a subir.","text_en":"There are 14 ranks, and each needs more Rank Points than the last; rank 14 needs 24,750 in total. The bar does not decay and does not depend on how many points other players have. Rank Points are never spent: they only accumulate toward the next rank. When the season ends, rank resets and must be earned again.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: WoW Forever - PvP Rank System Explained › Rank Points Needed for Every Rank","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/pvp-rank-system","date":"2026-09-19"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["general:pvp"],"source_hashes":["section:03e59c9051a43a44dc1b7c8c8f640e1fcd88ec64"]},{"id":"jcj-recompensas","chapter":10,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Recompensas por rango","title_en":"Rewards by Rank","summary_es":"Cada rango da un título y desbloquea compras; el 13 completa la transfiguración y el 14 añade las armas.","summary_en":"Each rank gives a title and unlocks purchases; rank 13 completes the transmog and rank 14 adds weapons.","keywords_es":["recompensas por rango jcj","qué da cada rango","montura de guerra negra","transfiguración jcj","armas rango 14"],"keywords_en":["pvp rank rewards","what each rank gives","black war mount","pvp transmog","rank 14 weapons"],"text_es":"Los rangos dan títulos de facción y desbloquean compras: 1 tabardo, 2 insignia, 3 capa, 4 collar, 5 pociones de combate, 6 tabardo élite, 7 estandarte de batalla, 8 muñequeras y cintura, 9 botas, 10 guantes, 11 monturas de guerra negras, 12 piernas y hombros, 13 pecho y casco, 14 armas. El 13 completa la transfiguración; el 14 solo añade el arsenal. Los rangos 3, 7, 10, 13 y 14 dan un punto Legacy.","text_en":"Ranks give faction titles and unlock purchases: 1 tabard, 2 insignia, 3 cloak, 4 necklace, 5 combat potions, 6 elite tabard, 7 battle standard, 8 wrists and waist, 9 boots, 10 gloves, 11 black war mounts, 12 legs and shoulders, 13 chest and helm, 14 weapons. Rank 13 completes the transmog; rank 14 only adds the weapon arsenal. Ranks 3, 7, 10, 13, and 14 each give a Legacy point.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: WoW Forever - PvP Rank System Explained › PvP Rank Rewards in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/pvp-rank-system","date":"2026-09-19"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: WoW Forever - PvP Rank System Explained › Legacy Challenges from PvP Ranks","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/pvp-rank-system","date":"2026-09-19"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["general:pvp"],"source_hashes":["section:339d2bb8f0c88b91219501ade0a629b984077528","section:5650189e54f4cfbc28e504cc474e17b22768bdbd"]},{"id":"jcj-honor-equipo","chapter":10,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Equipo de JcJ y Honor","title_en":"PvP Gear and Honor","summary_es":"El Honor compra pociones, insignias y equipo; las piezas raras piden nivel 55 y las armas son de rango 14.","summary_en":"Honor buys potions, insignias, and gear; rare pieces need level 55 and weapons are rank 14.","keywords_es":["equipo de jcj","comprar equipo jcj","honor para equipo","equipo jcj en pve","armas de rango 14"],"keywords_en":["pvp gear","buy pvp gear","honor gear","pvp gear in pve","rank 14 weapons"],"text_es":"El Honor compra desde pociones e insignias hasta armas; las piezas mejores también piden marcas de campo. Las piezas raras de JcJ se compran sin rango y piden nivel 55, y las armas están en el rango 14. El equipo de JcJ compite con mazmorra y banda, pero en PvE rinde algo peor por sus estadísticas y bonificaciones. No recibes equipo gratis: todo sale de vendedores.","text_en":"Honor buys anything from potions and insignias to weapons; the best pieces also cost battleground marks. Rare PvP pieces can be bought without rank and require level 55, while weapons are at rank 14. PvP gear is competitive with dungeon and raid gear, but performs slightly worse in PvE because of its stats and bonuses. You do not get gear for free: it all comes from vendors.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: WoW Forever - PvP Rank System Explained › PvP Gear in Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/pvp-rank-system","date":"2026-09-19"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Everything You Need to Know About PvP in World of Warcraft: Forever › PvP Gear","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/pvp-overview","date":"2026-09-19"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["general:pvp"],"source_hashes":["section:0b052b440b62b0ed69c256135a0bacefaeefaf89","section:559fb7e41795f5edadf783975817f3578a5c97eb"]},{"id":"jcj-vendedores-colas","chapter":10,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Vendedores y maestros de batalla","title_en":"Vendors and Battlemasters","summary_es":"Los vendedores están en Ventormenta, Orgrimmar y las cloacas de Dalaran; las colas se abren en las capitales.","summary_en":"Vendors are in Stormwind, Orgrimmar, and the Dalaran sewers; queues open in the capitals.","keywords_es":["vendedores jcj","dónde comprar equipo jcj","maestros de batalla","colas de campos de batalla","salón de los campeones"],"keywords_en":["pvp vendors","where to buy pvp gear","battlemasters","battleground queues","champions hall"],"text_es":"Los vendedores de JcJ están en el Salón de los Campeones de Ventormenta y el Salón de las Leyendas de Orgrimmar; la Alianza también tiene vendedores en las cloacas de Dalaran. Para entrar en un campo, habla con los maestros de batalla del Castillo de Ventormenta o del Valle del Honor de Orgrimmar. Allí puedes colar solo o con tu grupo y elegir el campo que quieras jugar.","text_en":"PvP vendors are in Stormwind's Champions' Hall and Orgrimmar's Hall of Legends; Alliance also has vendors in the Dalaran sewers. To enter a battleground, talk to the battlemasters at Stormwind Keep or Orgrimmar's Valley of Honor. There you can queue alone or with your group and choose the battleground you want to play.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: WoW Forever - PvP Rank System Explained › PvP Vendor Locations","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/pvp-rank-system","date":"2026-09-19"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Everything You Need to Know About PvP in World of Warcraft: Forever › Queues","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/pvp-overview","date":"2026-09-19"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["general:pvp"],"source_hashes":["section:cbaab0da3b5c4524ebd872353bd63b32c38bfad6","section:f9da479258408ccfe740d838e1ce29069aebac15"]},{"id":"jcj-temporadas","chapter":10,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Temporadas y reinicios","title_en":"Seasons and Resets","summary_es":"El rango se reinicia al cerrar temporada, las recompensas cambian y los desafíos Legacy permanecen.","summary_en":"Rank resets when a season ends, rewards change, and Legacy challenges remain.","keywords_es":["temporadas de jcj","reinicio de rango","recompensas de temporada","desafíos legacy jcj","progreso de temporada"],"keywords_en":["pvp seasons","rank reset","season rewards","pvp legacy challenges","season progress"],"text_es":"Al terminar una temporada, el rango se reinicia y hay que empezar de nuevo; cada temporada trae recompensas nuevas y las de temporadas pasadas ya no se pueden conseguir. El progreso de los desafíos Legacy no se reinicia, así que completar el de rango 14 una vez basta. Los Puntos de Rango no se pierden dentro de la temporada, solo al cerrarla.","text_en":"When a season ends, rank resets and must be earned again; each season brings new rewards, and past-season rewards can no longer be obtained. Legacy challenge progress does not reset, so completing the rank 14 one once is enough. Rank Points are not lost within a season, only when it closes.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: WoW Forever - PvP Rank System Explained › Seasons and Resets","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/pvp-rank-system","date":"2026-09-19"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["general:pvp"],"source_hashes":["section:ad95b47570f7ee7580c2e294c651b2d452245f62"]},{"id":"jcj-darkspear","chapter":10,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Islas Lanza Negra","title_en":"Darkspear Islands","summary_es":"El campo nuevo es 15v15: cuatro bases, una bandera central y puntos por control; tramos de 30 a 60.","summary_en":"The new battleground is 15v15: four bases, a central flag, and points from control; brackets 30 to 60.","keywords_es":["islas lanza negra","darkspear islands","campo nuevo jcj","cuatro bases","bandera central"],"keywords_en":["darkspear islands","new pvp battleground","four bases","central flag","darkspear brackets"],"text_es":"Islas Lanza Negra es el campo nuevo, de 15 contra 15. Tiene cuatro bases que hay que controlar y una bandera en el centro que se lleva a una base controlada. Las bases suman puntos con el tiempo y capturar la bandera da puntos según cuántas bases tengas; se parece a Ojo de la Tormenta. Sus tramos son 30-39, 40-49, 50-59 y 60.","text_en":"Darkspear Islands is the new 15v15 battleground. It has four bases to control and a central flag that must be carried to a controlled base. Bases generate points over time, and capturing the flag gives points based on how many bases you hold; it is similar to Eye of the Storm. Its brackets are 30-39, 40-49, 50-59, and 60.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Everything You Need to Know About PvP in World of Warcraft: Forever › Darkspear Islands","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/pvp-overview","date":"2026-09-19"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["general:pvp"],"source_hashes":["section:06227c0fa6107945e885a80c69b570dc7fb95ad3"]},{"id":"jcj-arena","chapter":10,"status":"editorial","title_es":"No hay arena en Forever","title_en":"There Is No Arena in Forever","summary_es":"Forever no tiene arena: el JcJ se juega en el mundo y en los campos de batalla.","summary_en":"Forever has no arena: PvP takes place in the world and in battlegrounds.","keywords_es":["arena en forever","hay arena jcj","modos de jcj","campos de batalla","jcj de mundo"],"keywords_en":["arena in forever","is there arena","pvp modes","battlegrounds","world pvp"],"text_es":"No hay arena en Forever: el JcJ se limita al mundo y a los campos de batalla. La arena llegó con una expansión posterior y no forma parte de esta versión, así que no hay colas de arena ni brackets de arena. Si quieres medirte en grupos pequeños, tendrás que hacerlo en el mundo o en un campo.","text_en":"There is no arena in Forever: PvP is limited to the world and battlegrounds. Arena arrived with a later expansion and is not part of this version, so there are no arena queues or arena brackets. If you want small-group fights, you will have to do them in the world or in a battleground.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Everything You Need to Know About PvP in World of Warcraft: Forever › Is there Arena in Forever?","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/pvp-overview","date":"2026-09-19"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["general:pvp"],"source_hashes":["guide:e7a20ea7f73bc87b0a71b116bf47306198a01bfa"]},{"id":"jcj-primeras-partidas","chapter":10,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Tus primeras partidas de JcJ","title_en":"Your First PvP Matches","summary_es":"Morir mucho al empezar es normal; juega en grupo, practica y prioriza objetivos antes que bajas.","summary_en":"Dying a lot at first is normal; play in a group, practice, and prioritize objectives over kills.","keywords_es":["empezar en jcj","primeras partidas jcj","consejos jcj","objetivos de campo","morir en jcj"],"keywords_en":["start pvp","first pvp matches","pvp tips","battleground objectives","dying in pvp"],"text_es":"Al empezar, es normal morir mucho: el JcJ se juega distinto a misiones o mazmorras. Juega en grupo, practica y prioriza los objetivos; matar enemigos no gana por sí solo. Usa control y defensas para sobrevivir y no persigas una baja lejos del objetivo. Aprende a cambiar de objetivo y a retirarte cuando tus reutilizaciones estén gastadas.","text_en":"At first, dying a lot is normal: PvP plays differently from questing or dungeons. Play in a group, practice, and prioritize objectives; killing enemies does not win by itself. Use control and defensives to survive, and do not chase one kill far from the objective. Learn to switch targets and to retreat when your cooldowns are spent.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Everything You Need to Know About PvP in World of Warcraft: Forever › How to Start PvPing","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/pvp-overview","date":"2026-09-19"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["general:pvp"],"source_hashes":["section:0fe37440ca1da6e0a95740a302073c100082a07c"]},{"id":"jcj-clasificaciones","chapter":10,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Las clasificaciones aún no son finales","title_en":"Rankings Are Not Final Yet","summary_es":"La beta tenía nivel 30 y no hay puestos definitivos; se valoran daño, control, defensas y utilidad.","summary_en":"The beta was level 30 and there are no final placements; damage, control, defense, and utility are weighed.","keywords_es":["clasificación jcj","tier list jcj","especializaciones fuertes jcj","criterios jcj","beta nivel 30"],"keywords_en":["pvp rankings","pvp tier list","strong pvp specs","pvp criteria","level 30 beta"],"text_es":"Las clasificaciones de JcJ no están cerradas: la beta tenía nivel 30 y la lista sigue sin puestos definitivos, así que pueden cambiar con ajustes, conjuntos y estadísticas. Para valorar una especialización se mira el daño sostenido y el estallido, el control, las defensas y la utilidad; en sanadores, la curación, el maná, el control y las defensas. Las menciones siguientes son herramientas fuertes, no un orden definitivo.","text_en":"PvP rankings are not closed: the beta was level 30 and the list still has no final placements, so it can change with tuning, sets, and stats. A spec is judged on sustained and burst damage, control, defense, and utility; healers are judged on healing, mana, control, and defense. The mentions below are strong toolkits, not a definitive order.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: PvP DPS Spec Rankings › About the Tier List","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/pvp-tier-list-dps-specs","date":"2026-10-26"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: PvP Healer Spec Rankings › About the Tier List","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/pvp-tier-list-healer-specs","date":"2026-10-26"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["tierlist:pvp-tier-list-dps-specs","tierlist:pvp-tier-list-healer-specs"],"source_hashes":["section:3ff8d31a22b97c005c4d959787fe5f1f4759920e"]},{"id":"jcj-dps-cuerpo","chapter":10,"status":"editorial","title_es":"DPS de cuerpo a cuerpo fuertes","title_en":"Strong Melee DPS","summary_es":"Guerrero Armas y Furia, Paladín Reprensión y Pícaro Sutileza, Combate y Asesinato destacan por presión y control.","summary_en":"Arms and Fury Warrior, Retribution Paladin, and all three Rogue specs stand out for pressure and control.","keywords_es":["dps cuerpo a cuerpo jcj","guerrero armas jcj","paladín reprensión jcj","pícaro sutileza jcj","guerrero furia jcj"],"keywords_en":["melee pvp dps","arms warrior pvp","retribution paladin pvp","subtlety rogue pvp","fury warrior pvp"],"text_es":"Se consideran entre las opciones más fuertes de cuerpo a cuerpo Guerrero Armas, Guerrero Furia, Paladín Reprensión y Pícaro Sutileza, Combate y Asesinato. Armas destaca por presión sostenida, control y reducción de curación; Furia por daño en área y aguante; Reprensión por utilidad, control, inmunidad y apoyo de curación; Sutileza por estallido y control, y los otros Pícaros por control y reinicios. Los Pícaros son difíciles de atrapar y pueden encadenar control.","text_en":"Arms Warrior, Fury Warrior, Retribution Paladin, and Subtlety, Combat, and Assassination Rogue are considered among the strongest melee options. Arms stands out for sustained pressure, control, and healing reduction; Fury for area damage and durability; Retribution for utility, control, immunity, and off-healing; Subtlety for burst and control, and the other Rogues for control and resets. Rogues are hard to catch and can chain control.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: PvP DPS Spec Rankings › PvP DPS Tier List for World of Warcraft Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/pvp-tier-list-dps-specs","date":"2026-10-26"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["tierlist:pvp-tier-list-dps-specs"],"source_hashes":["section:e9abe25a91961bbe87fc139976d7bbae374c8199"]},{"id":"jcj-dps-distancia","chapter":10,"status":"editorial","title_es":"DPS a distancia fuertes","title_en":"Strong Ranged DPS","summary_es":"Brujo Demonología y Aflicción, Mago Escarcha, Sacerdote Sombra y los Cazadores destacan por control y aguante.","summary_en":"Demonology and Affliction Warlock, Frost Mage, Shadow Priest, and Hunters stand out for control and durability.","keywords_es":["dps a distancia jcj","brujo demonología jcj","mago escarcha jcj","sacerdote sombra jcj","cazador jcj"],"keywords_en":["ranged pvp dps","demonology warlock pvp","frost mage pvp","shadow priest pvp","hunter pvp"],"text_es":"Se consideran entre las opciones más fuertes a distancia Brujo Demonología, Brujo Aflicción, Mago Escarcha, Sacerdote Sombra y los Cazadores. Demonología aguanta mucho en 1v1 con su demonio, maldiciones y control; Aflicción castiga a varios con daño en el tiempo y se sostiene; Escarcha frena, mantiene la distancia y tiene defensas; Sombra aporta daño, ejecución, control y apoyo de curación; Dominio de bestias y Puntería aportan daño a distancia y control, y Supervivencia aporta daño cuerpo a cuerpo y control. Otras ramas también tienen herramientas, pero estas destacan por su conjunto.","text_en":"Demonology Warlock, Affliction Warlock, Frost Mage, Shadow Priest, and Hunters are considered among the strongest ranged options. Demonology endures a lot in 1v1 with its demon, curses, and control; Affliction punishes several enemies with damage over time and sustains itself; Frost slows, keeps distance, and has defenses; Shadow brings damage, execute, control, and off-healing; Beast Mastery and Marksmanship bring ranged damage and control, and Survival brings melee damage and control. Other trees have tools too, but these stand out for their package.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: PvP DPS Spec Rankings › PvP DPS Tier List for World of Warcraft Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/pvp-tier-list-dps-specs","date":"2026-10-26"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["tierlist:pvp-tier-list-dps-specs"],"source_hashes":["section:e9abe25a91961bbe87fc139976d7bbae374c8199"]},{"id":"jcj-sanadores","chapter":10,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Sanadores fuertes para JcJ","title_en":"Strong PvP Healers","summary_es":"Disciplina, Paladín Sagrado, Sacerdote Sagrado, Chamán y Druida de Recuperación destacan por su kit.","summary_en":"Discipline, Holy Paladin, Holy Priest, and Restoration Shaman and Druid stand out for their kits.","keywords_es":["sanadores jcj","sacerdote disciplina jcj","paladín sagrado jcj","chamán recuperación jcj","druida recuperación jcj"],"keywords_en":["pvp healers","discipline priest pvp","holy paladin pvp","restoration shaman pvp","restoration druid pvp"],"text_es":"Se consideran entre los sanadores más fuertes Sacerdote Disciplina, Paladín Sagrado, Sacerdote Sagrado, Chamán Recuperación y Druida Recuperación. Disciplina cura con escudos y una cura rápida y aporta una gran mejora ofensiva; Paladín Sagrado es muy duradero, mezcla curas instantáneas y casteadas y tiene mucha utilidad; Sacerdote Sagrado se centra en curación directa y tiene una segunda vida; Chamán Recuperación cubre tanque y grupo con tótems y es el único sanador con interrupción base; Druida Recuperación usa curas en el tiempo, control y puede hacer daño.","text_en":"Discipline Priest, Holy Paladin, Holy Priest, Restoration Shaman, and Restoration Druid are considered among the strongest healers. Discipline heals with shields and a fast heal and brings a strong offensive buff; Holy Paladin is very durable, mixes instant and cast heals, and has great utility; Holy Priest focuses on direct healing and has a second life; Restoration Shaman covers tank and group with totems and is the only healer with a baseline interrupt; Restoration Druid uses heal-over-time effects, control, and can deal damage. The list has no final order; these are complete toolkits.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: PvP Healer Spec Rankings › Healer DPS Tier List for World of Warcraft Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/pvp-tier-list-healer-specs","date":"2026-10-26"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["tierlist:pvp-tier-list-healer-specs"],"source_hashes":["section:cd7686951162acbb672b793e452f22975e2cb660"]}]}}}
]==]
